ct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14","text":"Die Trennung von Münzfunktion und Metallgehalt ermöglicht Geldzeichen, deren Geltung lokal erzwungen und durch die repräsentierbare Geldmenge begrenzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0132","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15","text":"Die Unterbrechung der Metamorphose nach dem Verkauf immobilisiert Geld als Schatz und selbständige Reichtumsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0152","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","text":"Die zeitliche Trennung von Warenübergabe und Preisrealisierung verwandelt Geld in Zahlungsmittel und Käufer sowie Verkäufer in Schuldner und Gläubiger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0170","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17","text":"Zahlungsketten können sich ideell ausgleichen; nicht ausgeglichene Verpflichtungen verlangen reales Geld und können bei Störung in die Geldkrise umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0180","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18","text":"Auf dem Weltmarkt streift Geld seine lokalen Formen ab und fungiert als leibhaftiges allgemeines Zahlungsmittel, Kaufmittel und gesellschaftliche Materiatur des Reichtums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0204","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX1","text":"Geld macht Waren nicht kommensurabel; ihre Kommensurabilität geht aus ihrer gemeinsamen Wertsubstanz hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX2","text":"Arbeitsgeld ist auf Grundlage der Warenproduktion kein Geld, weil es unmittelbar gesellschaftliche Arbeit voraussetzen müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX3","text":"Geld besitzt keinen eigenen Preis, da dieser eine Relation des Geldes auf sich selbst als sein eigenes Äquivalent voraussetzte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX4","text":"Maß der Werte und Maßstab der Preise sind keine identische Funktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX5","text":"Preis ist weder notwendig adäquater Ausdruck der Wertgröße noch notwendig Ausdruck eines vorhandenen Werts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX6","text":"Warenzirkulation ist kein unmittelbarer Produktenaustausch zwischen denselben Beteiligten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0075","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX7","text":"Die Identität jedes Verkaufs mit einem Kauf begründet kein notwendiges Gleichgewicht zwischen dem Verkauf und dem späteren Kauf derselben Person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0079","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX8","text":"Die einfache Warenzirkulation erklärt nicht die Wirklichkeit der Krise, sondern nur deren formale Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX9","text":"Die Masse der Zirkulationsmittel bestimmt nicht vorgängig die Warenpreise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0120","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX10","text":"Staatliche Benennung, Münzprägung oder Papierausgabe erzeugt weder Wert noch beliebig vermehrbaren gesellschaftlichen Reichtum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0141","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX11","text":"Stockende Verkäufe beweisen nicht notwendig einen Mangel an Zirkulationsmitteln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0109","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0110","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX12","text":"Der Gegensatz von Gläubiger und Schuldner ist nicht stets aus einfacher Warenzirkulation erklärbar; er kann tiefer liegende Produktionsverhältnisse nur in Geldform spiegeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0173","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0174","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D1","text":"Die Preisform verwandelt stofflich verschiedene Warenwerte in vergleichbare, gleichnamige Geldgrößen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A1","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A3","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D2","text":"Ein Wertwechsel des Geldmaterials verändert die allgemeinen Preisausdrücke, ohne den Preismaßstab oder notwendig die relativen Warenwerte zu verändern.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A1","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A4","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D3","text":"Gesetzliche Geldnamen ermöglichen gesellschaftlich gültige Wertrechnung und verdecken zugleich das zugrunde liegende Verhältnis von Warenwert und Metallgewicht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A4","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D4","text":"Der Markt realisiert Wert nicht bloß, sondern entscheidet nachträglich, ob und in welchem Umfang die verausgabte Privatarbeit gesellschaftlich zählt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A2","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A7","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D5","text":"Die persönliche Unabhängigkeit der Warenproduzenten erzeugt ein System allseitiger sachlicher Abhängigkeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A2","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A9","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D6","text":"Die Zirkulation überschreitet die lokalen und individuellen Schranken des direkten Austauschs, weil Verkauf und Kauf verschiedene Warenketten verbinden.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A10","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D7","text":"Die Verselbständigung von Verkauf und Kauf erzeugt die Möglichkeit, dass ihre innere Einheit sich gewaltsam als Krise geltend macht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A8","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A10","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0081","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D8","text":"Weil die Kontinuität der Metamorphosen äußerlich auf der Seite des Geldes erscheint, scheint Geld die Waren zu bewegen, obwohl seine Bewegung von ihnen erzeugt wird.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A8","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D9","text":"Steigende Umlaufsgeschwindigkeit vermindert bei gegebener Preissumme die erforderliche Geldmasse; sinkende Umlaufsgeschwindigkeit vermehrt sie.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0107","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D10","text":"Überschreitet die Papierausgabe die repräsentierbare Metallmenge, repräsentiert jedes Zeichen einen geringeren Metallanteil und die Preise steigen nominell.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0141","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D11","text":"Schatzreservoirs ermöglichen die Kontraktion und Expansion der umlaufenden Metallgeldmenge entsprechend den Schwankungen der Zirkulation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A13","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0165","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0166","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D12","text":"Die erforderliche Geldmasse wird durch fällige Zahlungen erweitert, durch gegenseitige Verrechnung vermindert und durch die Umlaufsgeschwindigkeit der Zahlungsmittel modifiziert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A13","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0178","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0180","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0187","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D13","text":"Kreditgeld entsteht aus übertragbaren Zahlungsversprechen und damit aus der Zahlungsmittelfunktion, nicht aus der bloßen Münzfunktion.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0137","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0191","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D14","text":"Internationale Metallbewegungen folgen der Produktion der Edelmetalle, den Schwankungen der Wechselkurse, den Zahlungsbilanzen und dem Reservebedarf nationaler Zirkulationssphären.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0204","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0208","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0209","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0210","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD1","text":"Die Verselbständigung des Geldes ist kein Gegenprinzip zur Warenwelt, sondern ein von deren eigener Wertform erzeugtes Resultat.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A2","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A3","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A8","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A12","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD2","text":"Preisabweichung, nachträgliche Marktvalidierung und Krisenmöglichkeit sind adäquate Formen einer Produktionsweise, deren gesellschaftliche Regelung sich als blindes Durchschnittsgesetz durchsetzt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A6","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A9","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A10","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD3","text":"Die Erweiterung des gesellschaftlichen Stoffwechsels über unmittelbare Austauschbeziehungen hinaus steigert zugleich die Unkontrollierbarkeit der vermittelnden Gesamtbewegung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A10","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0076","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD4","text":"Die Geldform durchläuft eine systematische Folge von Idealisierung, Symbolisierung und Rematerialisierung: ideelles Wertmaß, funktionelles Zeichen, hartes Zahlungsmittel und leibhaftiges Weltgeld.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A4","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0136","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0176","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD5","text":"Staatliche Geldmacht reicht bis zur Normierung von Gewicht, Namen, Münze und lokaler Zeichengeltung, nicht bis zur freien Bestimmung von Wertrelationen oder Weltgeldbedarf.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A1","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A5","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD6","text":"Kredit und Verrechnung vermindern im normalen Verlauf den Bedarf an realem Geld, steigern aber bei gestörter Zahlungskette die Abhängigkeit von sofort verfügbarer allgemeiner Wertgestalt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0180","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0191","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD7","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Macht allgemeiner Austauschbarkeit erscheint als private Macht desjenigen, der die verselbständigte Wertgestalt besitzt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A3","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0159","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD8","text":"Die Einheit des Geldbegriffs erzeugt funktionsspezifisch gegensätzliche Daseinsweisen; die Reduktion aller Funktionen auf eine einzige Erscheinungsform erzeugt systematische Kausalitätsfehler.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A5","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A12","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0137","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0120","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Privatarbeit nicht unmittelbar als gesellschaftliche Arbeit gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt eine bewusste vorgängige Koordination der gesellschaftlichen Arbeitsteilung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX3","text":"Wert, Wertgröße, Preis und realisiertes Geld dürfen nicht als unmittelbar identische Größen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0059","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX4","text":"Die Verwandlung jeder Ware in Geld und jedes Geldanspruchs in Zahlung ist nicht garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0176","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX5","text":"Persönliche Unabhängigkeit bedeutet innerhalb der Warenproduktion keine Unabhängigkeit vom gesellschaftlichen Gesamtzusammenhang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX6","text":"Gesetzliche Denomination und Zwangskurs können die durch Wert, Warenmasse und Zirkulation gesetzten Grenzen nicht suspendieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0141","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX7","text":"Nationale Geldformen bilden kein geschlossenes oder universell selbstgenügsames System.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0128","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX8","text":"Die abstrakten Kategorien der Warenzirkulation reichen nicht aus, um eine bestimmte Produktionsweise oder die aktualisierte Krise zu erklären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0083","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SNX1","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine Gesellschaft, in der individuelle Arbeit ohne Warenwert, Marktprüfung und Geldvermittlung unmittelbar gesellschaftlich wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SNX2","text":"Die Zirkulation ist um die Abwesenheit einer Garantie organisiert, dass gesellschaftliches Bedürfnis, Privatarbeit, Preis und Zahlungsfähigkeit zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0176","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SNX3","text":"Keine Geldgestalt versöhnt dauerhaft ideellen Wertanspruch, symbolische Geltung und materielle Einlösbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SNX4","text":"Die qualitative Schrankenlosigkeit allgemeinen Reichtums ist in keiner endlichen Geldsumme erreichbar; jede Akkumulation reproduziert ihre quantitative Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0162","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS1","text":"Abstrakte menschliche Arbeit → Arbeitszeit als immanentes Maß → Kommensurabilität der Warenwerte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS2","text":"Private Produktion → nur mittelbare Vergesellschaftung → allgemeine relative Wertform → allgemeines Äquivalent → Geldware.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS3","text":"Warenwert → ideeller Ausdruck in der Geldware → Preis → Veräußerlichkeitsanspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS4","text":"Geldware als Wertmaß → Fixierung eines Metallquantums → Teilung und gesetzliche Benennung → Maßstab der Preise → Rechengeld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS5","text":"Preis → notwendige Realisierung → Verkauf W–G → nachträgliche Validierung privater Arbeit → Kauf G–W → gesellschaftlicher Stoffwechsel W–G–W.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS6","text":"Trennung von Verkauf und Kauf → Verschlingung selbständiger Metamorphosen → sachliche Gesamtbewegung → Krisenmöglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0081","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS7","text":"Warenmetamorphose → Geldumlauf als Erscheinungsform → Preissumme geteilt durch Umlaufshäufigkeit → erforderliche Zirkulationsmasse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0105","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS8","text":"Umlauf → Münzverschleiß → Trennung von Nominal- und Realgehalt → Metallzeichen → staatlich geltendes Papierzeichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0132","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS9","text":"Unterbrechung nach dem Verkauf → Schatz; zeitliche Trennung von Ware und Preisrealisierung → Schuldverhältnis → Zahlungsmittel → Verrechnung oder Geldkrise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0170","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0180","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS10","text":"Austritt aus der nationalen Zirkulation → Abstreifung lokaler Formen → Barrenform → Weltgeld → internationale Zahlung, Kauf und Reichtumsübertragung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0204","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AF1","text":"Wertsubstanz → allgemeines Äquivalent → Wertmaß → Preis → Preismaßstab → Warenmetamorphose → Zirkulationsmittel → Münze und Zeichen → Schatz → Zahlungsmittel → Weltgeld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_pr