ctural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME1","text":"Geld wird von einem äußeren Tauschinstrument zur notwendigen Erscheinungsform gesellschaftlicher Arbeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME2","text":"Preis und Wert werden als notwendig verbundene, aber nicht deckungsgleiche Kategorien sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME3","text":"Der Markt erscheint als nachträglicher Validierungsmechanismus privater Arbeit statt als bloßer Ort des Produktentauschs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME4","text":"Warenzirkulation wird vom direkten Tausch durch die Verselbständigung und Verschlingung ihrer Metamorphosen unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME5","text":"Die Identität von Verkauf und Kauf wird in eine polare Identität desselben Akts und eine reale Trennung aufeinanderfolgender Akte zerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME6","text":"Die Kausalität zwischen Preisen und Geldmenge wird umgekehrt: Preise, Warenmasse und Geschwindigkeit regulieren die Zirkulationsmasse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0112","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0120","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME7","text":"Geldzeichen werden weder als bloße Täuschung noch als autonomes Staatsprodukt, sondern als lokal begrenzte Funktionsformen der Geldware klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0137","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME8","text":"Schatz, Zahlungsmittel und Weltgeld werden als gesteigerte Verselbständigungen derselben Wertform statt als äußerlich verschiedene Geldarten geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0176","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME9","text":"Krise wird als endogene Möglichkeit der auseinandergetretenen Zirkulationsmomente sichtbar, ohne bereits aus der einfachen Zirkulation vollständig erklärt zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0081","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0083","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text differenziert Geld als Wertmaß, Preismaßstab, Rechengeld, Zirkulationsmittel, Münze, Wertzeichen, Schatz, Zahlungsmittel und Weltgeld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0128","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0136","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Geldfunktionen organisieren die nachträgliche Vergesellschaftung privater Arbeit innerhalb einer naturwüchsigen Arbeitsteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse ersetzt Erklärungen aus Geldmenge, Staatsbenennung oder unmittelbarem Tausch durch eine Ableitung der Erscheinungen aus Wertform und Warenmetamorphose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0120","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Gesellschaftliche Beziehungen nehmen sachliche Gestalt an; zeitliche Trennungen verwandeln komplementäre Akte in selbständige Prozesse und erzeugen Schuld, Schatzbildung und Krisenmöglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Funktionsfolge vom Wertmaß bis zum Weltgeld und ihre Krisenimplikationen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0081","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt innerhalb des Kapitels die vorgängige Ableitung der allgemeinen Äquivalentform und die historische Fixierung gerade des Goldes als Geldware.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist auf der Ebene der funktionalen Ableitung und bei der Umkehrung des scheinbaren Kausalverhältnisses von Geldbewegung und Warenbewegung am stärksten geschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0088","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0092","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT4","text":"Die Annahmen eines gegebenen Geldwerts, eines normalen Warenpreises und eines gesellschaftlich notwendigen Arbeitsquantums komprimieren Bedingungen, deren Bestimmung außerhalb der jeweiligen Ableitung liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0100","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT5","text":"Die Begrenzung des Papiergelds durch eine hypothetisch zirkulierende Goldmenge bleibt bei schwankender Warenzirkulation nur über ein vorausgesetztes Erfahrungsminimum bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0141","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT6","text":"Die Einheit eines nationalen Wertmaßes und das doppelte Wertmaß von Gold und Silber auf dem Weltmarkt werden funktional nebeneinandergestellt, aber nicht vollständig vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0203","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT7","text":"Die einfache Zirkulation erzeugt nur die Krisenmöglichkeit; die Bedingungen ihres notwendigen Umschlags in wirkliche Krise bleiben ausdrücklich ausgespart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT8","text":"Die Behauptung, imaginäre Preise wesentlicher Produktionsverhältnisse verbärgen wirkliche Wertbeziehungen, verweist auf eine spätere Analyse, ohne sie hier auszuführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT9","text":"Die rhetorische Darstellung des Geldes als nivellierende gesellschaftliche Macht verdichtet einen ableitbaren Formeffekt, ersetzt aber teilweise die genaue Vermittlung zwischen allgemeiner Verkäuflichkeit und sozialer Herrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0156","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0159","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT10","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes: Wertform → Zirkulationsform → funktionelle Symbolisierung → Verselbständigung → Krise und Weltmarkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0136","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T210820451390Z_8e9ef51e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3) Money or the Circulation of Commodities.","source_sha256":"1b4d7575edf7d5830a4f9795679d3209c407f5f4f358d1bbdaf88c86335598a4","sha256":"8221abd14d414a6ecbef542356d410160a5a66c5afccbe4239f9af3277fe4348","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:08:20.452285+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AS1","text":"What is to be explained is how the different functions of money necessarily arise from the value-form, commodity exchange, and commodity metamorphosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AS2","text":"Money is the autonomized form of appearance of commodity value and not an instrument externally added to exchange.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AS3","text":"The argument is reconstructive-dialectical, diagnostic with respect to inversions of appearance, and polemical against nominalist as well as quantity-theoretical explanations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0120","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0125","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AS4","text":"The movement proceeds from the measure of value through price and the medium of circulation to the independent money-form in hoard, means of payment, and world money.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AS5","text":"The external opposition of commodity and money does not abolish the inner contradiction of the commodity, but produces its forms of motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AS6","text":"The analysis reverses the appearance: commodity movement generates money movement, although the former appears as the effect of the latter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0091","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AS7","text":"With the growing autonomization of money, social dependence, the possibility of crisis, and the material validity of money are simultaneously intensified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A1","text":"As values, commodities are objectifications of abstract human labour; labour-time is their immanent measure of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A2","text":"The merely indirect socialization of private labour compels the duplication of the product of labour into commodity and money commodity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A3","text":"A commodity becomes the universal equivalent by all other commodities expressing their values in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A4","text":"Price is the ideal money-form of commodity value and relates the commodity to a definite quantum of real money material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A5","text":"Money as measure of values is to be distinguished from the standard of prices as a fixed, divided, and legally named quantity of metal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A6","text":"The price-form permits quantitative deviations from value and qualitative prices of valueless things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A7","text":"The price-form presupposes the alienability of the commodity and the transformation of its ideal money-shape into actual money.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A8","text":"The contradiction of use-value and value is unfolded, not abolished, in the polarity of commodity and money as the movement W–G–W.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A9","text":"In sale, private labour must subsequently prove itself socially useful, socially necessary, and proportionally distributed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A10","text":"Sale and purchase are identical as a polar act of exchange, but remain separable in time, space, and persons as successive acts of the same person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11","text":"The interweaving of independent commodity metamorphoses constitutes the circulation of commodities as an uncontrolled social nexus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A12","text":"The circulation of money is the phenomenal form of commodity circulation and its changes of form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0091","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A13","text":"The required mass of means of circulation is determined by the sum of prices to be realized and the average velocity of circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0105","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14","text":"The separation of coin function from metal content makes possible money tokens whose validity is locally enforced and limited by the representable quantity of money.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0132","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15","text":"The interruption of metamorphosis after sale immobilizes money as hoard and as an independent form of wealth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0152","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","text":"The temporal separation of the delivery of the commodity and the realization of the price transforms money into means of payment and buyer and seller into debtor and creditor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0170","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17","text":"Chains of payment can be ideally balanced; unbalanced obligations require real money and, in the event of disturbance, can turn into a money crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0180","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18","text":"On the world market, money strips off its local forms and functions as corporeal universal means of payment, means of purchase, and social materiality of wealth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0204","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX1","text":"Money does not make commodities commensurable; their commensurability arises from their common substance of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX2","text":"Labour-money is not money on the basis of commodity production, because it would have to presuppose directly social labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX3","text":"Money possesses no price of its own, since this would presuppose a relation of money to itself as its own equivalent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX4","text":"Measure of values and standard of prices are not one identical function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX5","text":"Price is neither necessarily an adequate expression of the magnitude of value nor necessarily an expression of an existing value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX6","text":"Commodity circulation is not a direct exchange of products between the same participants.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0075","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX7","text":"The identity of every sale with a purchase does not establish a necessary equilibrium between the sale and the later purchase of the same person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0079","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX8","text":"Simple commodity circulation does not explain the actuality of crisis, but only its formal possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX9","text":"The mass of means of circulation does not antecedently determine commodity prices.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0120","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX10","text":"State naming, coinage, or paper issue produces neither value nor arbitrarily augmentable social wealth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0141","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX11","text":"Stagnating sales do not necessarily prove a shortage of means of circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0109","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0110","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:NX12","text":"The opposition of creditor and debtor is not always explicable from simple commodity circulation; it may merely reflect deeper production relations in money-form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0173","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0174","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D1","text":"The price-form transforms materially different commodity values into comparable, like-named money magnitudes.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A1","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A3","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D2","text":"A change in value of the money material changes the general expressions of price without changing the standard of prices or necessarily the relative values of commodities.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A1","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A4","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D3","text":"Legal money names enable socially valid value calculation and simultaneously conceal the underlying relation between commodity value and metal weight.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A4","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D4","text":"The market does not merely realize value, but subsequently decides whether and to what extent the private labour expended counts socially.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A2","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A7","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D5","text":"The personal independence of commodity producers produces a system of universal material dependence.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A2","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A9","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D6","text":"Circulation surpasses the local and individual barriers of direct exchange because sale and purchase connect different chains of commodities.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A10","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D7","text":"The autonomization of sale and purchase produces the possibility that their inner unity forcibly asserts itself as crisis.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A8","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A10","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0081","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D8","text":"Because the continuity of metamorphoses appears externally on the side of money, money seems to move commodities, although its movement is generated by them.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A8","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D9","text":"Increasing velocity of circulation diminishes, given a fixed sum of prices, the required mass of money; decreasing velocity of circulation increases it.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0107","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D10","text":"If the paper issue exceeds the representable quantity of metal, each token represents a smaller share of metal and prices rise nominally.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0141","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D11","text":"Hoard reservoirs make possible the contraction and expansion of the circulating mass of metallic money in accordance with fluctuations of circulation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A13","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0165","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0166","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D12","text":"The required mass of money is increased by payments due, diminished by mutual settlement, and modified by the velocity of circulation of means of payment.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A13","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0178","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0180","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0187","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D13","text":"Credit money arises from transferable promises of payment and thereby from the function of means of payment, not from the mere function of coin.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0137","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0191","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:D14","text":"International movements of metal follow the production of precious metals, fluctuations in exchange rates, balances of payments, and the reserve requirements of national spheres of circulation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0204","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0208","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0209","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0210","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD1","text":"The autonomization of money is not a counter-principle to the world of commodities, but a result generated by its own value-form.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A2","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A3","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A8","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A12","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD2","text":"Price deviation, subsequent market validation, and the possibility of crisis are adequate forms of a mode of production whose social regulation asserts itself as a blind law of averages.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A6","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A9","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A10","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD3","text":"The extension of social metabolism beyond immediate exchange relations simultaneously heightens the uncontrollability of the mediating total movement.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A10","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A11","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0076","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD4","text":"The money-form passes through a systematic sequence of idealization, symbolization, and rematerialization: ideal measure of value, functional token, hard means of payment, and corporeal world money.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A4","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0136","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0176","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD5","text":"State monetary power extends to the standardization of weight, name, coin, and local token validity, not to the free determination of value relations or the need for world money.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A1","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A5","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD6","text":"Credit and settlement reduce the need for real money in the normal course, but, when the chain of payments is disrupted, heighten dependence on an immediately available universal value-form.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0180","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0191","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD7","text":"The social power of universal exchangeability appears as the private power of the person who possesses the autonomized value-form.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A3","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A15","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0159","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SD8","text":"The unity of the concept of money generates function-specific opposing modes of existence; the reduction of all functions to a single form of appearance generates systematic errors of causality.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DGO:A5","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A12","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A14","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A16","CH_V4GB_3DGO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0137","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0120","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that private labour does not count immediately as social labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX2","text":"The system excludes a conscious prior coordination of the social division of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX3","text":"Value, magnitude of value, price, and realized money must not be treated as immediately identical magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0059","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX4","text":"The transformation of every commodity into money and of every money claim into payment is not guaranteed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0176","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX5","text":"Within commodity production, personal independence does not mean independence from the social totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX6","text":"Legal denomination and legal tender cannot suspend the limits imposed by value, the mass of commodities, and circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0141","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX7","text":"National money-forms do not constitute a closed or universally self-sufficient system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0128","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:DNX8","text":"The abstract categories of commodity circulation do not suffice to explain a determinate mode of production or the actualized crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0083","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SNX1","text":"The barred possibility is a society in which individual labour would be immediately social without commodity value, market testing, and monetary mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SNX2","text":"Circulation is organized around the absence of a guarantee that social need, private labour, price, and capacity to pay coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0176","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SNX3","text":"No money-form durably reconciles ideal claim to value, symbolic validity, and material redeemability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:SNX4","text":"The qualitative boundlessness of universal wealth is unattainable in any finite sum of money; every accumulation reproduces its quantitative limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0162","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS1","text":"Abstract human labour → labour-time as immanent measure → commensurability of commodity values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS2","text":"Private production → merely indirect socialization → universal relative value-form → universal equivalent → money commodity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS3","text":"Commodity value → ideal expression in the money commodity → price → claim to alienability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS4","text":"Money commodity as measure of value → fixing of a quantity of metal → division and legal naming → standard of prices → money of account.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS5","text":"Price → necessary realization → sale W–G → subsequent validation of private labour → purchase G–W → social metabolism W–G–W.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS6","text":"Separation of sale and purchase → interweaving of independent metamorphoses → material total movement → possibility of crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0081","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS7","text":"Commodity metamorphosis → circulation of money as phenomenal form → sum of prices divided by frequency of circulation → required mass of circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0105","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS8","text":"Circulation → wear of coins → separation of nominal and real content → metal tokens → state-valid paper tokens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0132","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS9","text":"Interruption after sale → hoard; temporal separation of commodity and realization of price → debt relation → means of payment → settlement or money crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0170","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0180","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:FGS10","text":"Exit from national circulation → stripping off of local forms → bullion form → world money → international payment, purchase, and transfer of wealth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0204","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AF1","text":"Substance of value → universal equivalent → measure of value → price → standard of prices → commodity metamorphosis → means of circulation → coin and token → hoard → means of payment → world money.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0128","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0136","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:AF2","text":"Commodity contradiction → external polarity of commodity and money → separation of complementary acts → autonomization of the value-form → material dependence → possibility of crisis → material return of money.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0081","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME1","text":"Money is reclassified from an external instrument of exchange into the necessary form of appearance of social labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME2","text":"Price and value become visible as necessarily connected but non-coincident categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME3","text":"The market appears as a subsequent validation mechanism of private labour rather than as a mere site of product exchange.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME4","text":"Commodity circulation is distinguished from direct exchange by the autonomization and interweaving of its metamorphoses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME5","text":"The identity of sale and purchase is decomposed into a polar identity of the same act and a real separation of successive acts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME6","text":"The causality between prices and the quantity of money is reversed: prices, the mass of commodities, and velocity regulate the mass of circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0112","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0120","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME7","text":"Money tokens are classified neither as mere deception nor as an autonomous state product, but as locally limited functional forms of the money commodity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0137","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME8","text":"Hoard, means of payment, and world money are ordered as intensified autonomizations of the same value-form rather than as externally different kinds of money.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0176","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ME9","text":"Crisis becomes visible as an endogenous possibility of the diverging moments of circulation, without yet being fully explained from simple circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0081","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0083","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text differentiates money as measure of value, standard of prices, money of account, means of circulation, coin, token of value, hoard, means of payment, and world money.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0128","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0136","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ALT2","text":"Structural — The functions of money organize the subsequent socialization of private labour within a spontaneously developed division of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis replaces explanations based on the quantity of money, state naming, or direct exchange with a derivation of phenomena from the value-form and commodity metamorphosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0120","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Social relations assume material form; temporal separations transform complementary acts into independent processes and produce debt, hoard formation, and the possibility of crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0080","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the sequence of functions from measure of value to world money and their crisis implications.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0081","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined within the chapter is the prior derivation of the universal equivalent form and the historical fixation precisely of gold as money commodity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT3","text":"The structure is most fully closed at the level of functional derivation and in the reversal of the apparent causal relation between money movement and commodity movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0088","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0092","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT4","text":"The assumptions of a given money value, a normal commodity price, and a socially necessary quantity of labour condense conditions whose determination lies outside the respective derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0100","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT5","text":"The limitation of paper money by a hypothetically circulating quantity of gold remains determinate, under fluctuating commodity circulation, only through a presupposed experiential minimum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0140","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0141","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT6","text":"The unity of a national measure of value and the double measure of value of gold and silver on the world market are functionally juxtaposed, but not fully mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0203","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT7","text":"Simple circulation produces only the possibility of crisis; the conditions of its necessary transformation into actual crisis remain expressly omitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0082","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT8","text":"The claim that imaginary prices of essential production relations conceal real value relations refers to a later analysis without carrying it out here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT9","text":"The rhetorical presentation of money as a levelling social power condenses a derivable form-effect, but partly replaces the precise mediation between universal salability and social domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0156","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0159","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DGO:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text: value-form → circulation-form → functional symbolization → autonomization → crisis and world market.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0136","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0151","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DGO:P0201","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_3DGO@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_3DGO:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 03","title":"3) Das Geld oder die Waarencirculation.","context":"Chapter 03"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV","layer":"CH","title":"Zweites Kapitel. Die Verwandlung von Geld in Kapital.","order":4,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_ZKDV"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV@R001","sha256":"09cd267be232482df9698ce745309ef61914bed633ba5c8e41eea749652ed7f2","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS1","text":"Zu erklären ist, wie Geld unter Geltung der Gesetze des Warenaustauschs zu Kapital wird und Mehrwert hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS2","text":"Kapital erscheint als Wertbewegung G–W–G′, in der vorgeschossener Wert vergrößert zurückkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS3","text":"Das Argument verfährt formanalytisch, immanent-kritisch, historisierend und rekonstruktiv.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS4","text":"Der Vergleich von W–G–W und G–W–G′ überführt den Gegensatz von Gebrauchszweck und Verwertung in einen Gegensatz endlicher und rekursiver Zirkulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS5","text":"Äquivalententausch erzeugt keinen Mehrwert, Nichtäquivalententausch verteilt vorhandenen Wert nur um, und isolierte Produktion verwertet keinen bestehenden Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS6","text":"Der Widerspruch wird durch eine Ware gelöst, deren Gebrauch selbst Wertschöpfung ist: die Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der rechtlich gleichen Markttransaktion über die historisch erzeugte Warenform der Arbeitskraft in die verborgene Produktionssphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A1","text":"Warenzirkulation ist die historische Voraussetzung des Kapitals, und Geld ist dessen erste Erscheinungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A2","text":"Geld als Geld und Geld als Kapital unterscheiden sich durch ihre Zirkulationsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A3","text":"W–G–W vermittelt den Austausch verschiedener Gebrauchswerte und endet in Konsumtion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","text":"G–W–G′ beginnt und endet mit Geld, wobei G′ = G + ΔG gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5","text":"ΔG ist Mehrwert, und die Bewegung seiner Hervorbringung macht vorgeschossenen Wert zu Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A6","text":"Die Verwertung besitzt kein immanentes Endmaß und erneuert sich aus ihrem jeweiligen Resultat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A7","text":"Der Kapitalist fungiert als bewusster Träger der objektiven Selbstverwertung des Werts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","text":"Der reine Austausch von Äquivalenten verändert Wertformen, aber keine Wertgrößen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A9","text":"Der Austausch von Nichtäquivalenten verändert die Wertverteilung, aber nicht die gesellschaftliche Gesamtwertsumme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A10","text":"Arbeit außerhalb der Zirkulation kann neuen Wert zusetzen, aber vorhandenen Wert nicht aus sich selbst verwerten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A11","text":"Kapital muss zugleich in der Zirkulation und außerhalb der Zirkulation entstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","text":"Die Arbeitskraft besitzt den besonderen Gebrauchswert, in ihrer Betätigung Wert zu schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","text":"Arbeitskraft kann nur als Ware erscheinen, wenn ihr Besitzer rechtlich frei ist und sie zeitlich begrenzt veräußert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A14","text":"Der Besitzer der Arbeitskraft muss von den Produktions- und Lebensmitteln getrennt sein, die eine selbständige Produktion ermöglichen würden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A15","text":"Die Begegnung von Geldbesitzer und doppelt freiem Arbeiter ist das Resultat einer spezifischen historischen Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft wird durch die gesellschaftlich notwendige Arbeitszeit ihrer normalen individuellen, generationellen und qualifikatorischen Reproduktion bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17","text":"Der Konsumtionsprozess der Arbeitskraft außerhalb der Zirkulation ist zugleich Produktionsprozess von Ware und Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A18","text":"Freiheit, Gleichheit, Eigentum und Eigennutz bilden die Rechtsform des Arbeitskraftkaufs innerhalb der Zirkulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX1","text":"Kapital wird nicht durch den stofflichen Inhalt der zirkulierenden Waren bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX2","text":"Geld ist nicht schon aufgrund seiner Geldform Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX3","text":"Schatzbildung ist keine Verwertung, weil der Zirkulation entzogener Wert nicht wächst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX4","text":"G–W–G ist als Austausch derselben Geldsumme gegen sich selbst keine hinreichende Kapitalbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX5","text":"Der gegenseitige Gewinn an Gebrauchswert ist keine Vermehrung des Tauschwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX6","text":"Äquivalententausch ist keine Quelle von Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX7","text":"Nichtäquivalententausch ist keine Quelle gesellschaftlichen Mehrwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX8","text":"Preisaufschläge, Unterpreise, effektive Nachfrage und Übervorteilung erklären die Kapitalbildung nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX9","text":"Die bloße Umkehrung von Kauf und Verkauf verändert die Natur der einzelnen Zirkulationsakte nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX10","text":"Reines Handels- und Wucherkapital kann die ursprüngliche Mehrwertbildung nicht erklären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX11","text":"Weder Geld in seiner ruhenden Form noch der bloße Wiederverkauf einer Ware erzeugt die erforderliche Wertänderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX12","text":"Arbeitskraft ist nicht identisch mit bereits verrichteter Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX13","text":"Die zeitlich begrenzte Veräußerung der Arbeitskraft ist nicht die vollständige Veräußerung der Person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX14","text":"Der freie Arbeiter ist weder Naturgegebenheit noch transhistorische Sozialform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX15","text":"Waren- und Geldzirkulation allein sind keine hinreichenden Existenzbedingungen des Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX16","text":"Die Rechtskategorien der Zirkulation erschöpfen das Verhältnis von Kapital und Lohnarbeit nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D1","text":"In W–G–W vermittelt Geld den Stoffwechsel verschiedener Waren; in G–W–G′ vermittelt die Ware die Rückkehr und Vergrößerung des Geldwerts.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A2","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A3","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D2","text":"Der Rückfluss des Geldes folgt aus der Vollendung des Kreislaufs, während seine vergrößerte Rückkehr über die erfolgreiche Verwertung entscheidet.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D3","text":"Da die Extreme der Kapitalbewegung qualitativ dieselbe Geldform besitzen, kann ihr Inhalt nur in einer quantitativen Wertdifferenz liegen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D4","text":"G′ bleibt eine begrenzte Geldsumme und wird deshalb zum erneuten Ausgangspunkt derselben Verwertungsbewegung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D5","text":"Kaufmannskapital, industrielles Kapital und zinstragendes Kapital unterscheiden sich durch ihre Vermittlungen, nicht durch den Rückkehrmodus G–G′.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D6","text":"Allgemeine Preismanipulation hebt sich zwischen den Rollen desselben Warenbesitzers als Verkäufer und Käufer auf.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D7","text":"Handels- und Wucherkapital sind innerhalb der reinen Zirkulationsanalyse nur abgeleitete Erscheinungsformen, deren Vermittlungen noch fehlen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A9","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D8","text":"Die gesuchte Quelle des Mehrwerts muss als Ware zu ihrem Wert gekauft werden und durch ihren Gebrauch zusätzlichen Wert hervorbringen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A11","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D9","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft ist vor ihrer Betätigung bestimmt, während ihr Gebrauchswert erst in der nachfolgenden Arbeit realisiert wird.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D10","text":"Die doppelte Freiheit verbindet rechtliche Verfügungsfähigkeit mit materieller Trennung von den Bedingungen selbständiger Produktion.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D11","text":"Der Reproduktionswert der Arbeitskraft umfasst Lebensunterhalt, Generationenersatz, Ausbildung sowie ein historisch und moralisch bestimmtes Normalniveau.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D12","text":"Sinkt der Preis der Arbeitskraft auf das bloß physische Minimum, kann er unter ihrem Wert liegen, weil normale Reproduktion mehr als nackte Erhaltung voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D13","text":"Die nachträgliche Lohnzahlung macht den Arbeiter zum Kreditgeber des Kapitalisten, ohne die Warenform des Vertrags aufzuheben.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD1","text":"Kapital ist kein ruhendes Ding, sondern die rekursive Identität eines Werts, der Geld- und Warenform durchläuft und seine Größe verändert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A2","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD2","text":"Äquivalententausch und Mehrwertbildung sind vereinbar, weil der gezahlte Wert der Arbeitskraft und die Wertschöpfung ihres Gebrauchs verschiedenen Bestimmungen unterliegen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD3","text":"Die Marktform des Kapitals setzt eine reproduzierte Klassenkonstellation aus Besitzern der Produktionsbedingungen und Besitzern bloßer Arbeitskraft voraus.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A14","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A15","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD4","text":"Die Zirkulation ist notwendiger Vermittlungsort der Kapitalbildung, aber nicht der Ort ihrer wertschöpferischen Ursache.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A11","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD5","text":"Der subjektive Bereicherungstrieb des Kapitalisten ist die bewusste Ausführung einer objektiv endlosen Verwertungslogik.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A6","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD6","text":"Die moderne Kapitalepoche beginnt nicht mit Waren oder Geld als solchen, sondern mit der historischen Verfügbarkeit der Arbeitskraft als Ware.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A1","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A14","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX1","text":"Eine Veränderung der Eigentumsverteilung kann nicht als Vermehrung der gesellschaftlichen Gesamtwertsumme gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX2","text":"Gebrauchswert kann nicht durchgehend als werttheoretisch irrelevant behandelt werden, weil der besondere Gebrauchswert der Arbeitskraft die Lösung trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX3","text":"Individueller Handelsgewinn kann nicht ohne Weiteres zum Erklärungsmodell des gesamtgesellschaftlichen Mehrwerts verallgemeinert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX4","text":"Die sichtbare Marktbeziehung kann nicht als vollständige Gestalt des Kapitalverhältnisses behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX5","text":"Rechtliche Selbstverfügung darf nicht mit materieller Verfügung über Produktionsbedingungen gleichgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX6","text":"Selbstverwertung kann keine unvermittelte magische Eigenschaft des Werts sein; sie setzt die produktive Konsumtion lebendiger Arbeitskraft voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX7","text":"Die Existenz von Waren und Geld darf nicht stillschweigend die Existenz des historisch spezifischen Kapitalverhältnisses implizieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SNX1","text":"Der Kapitalbewegung fehlt ein erreichbarer Endzustand, weil jedes Resultat nur als neuer Vorschuss fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SNX2","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit selbständiger Produktion strukturiert den Arbeitsmarkt; verfügte der Arbeiter über Produktions- und Lebensmittel, müsste seine Arbeitskraft nicht als Ware erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SNX3","text":"Die Quelle des Mehrwerts bleibt aus der sichtbaren Zirkulationsform ausgeschlossen und kann erst nach dem Übergang in die Produktion erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SNX4","text":"Die vollständige Veräußerung der Person bleibt unzulässig, weil sie den freien Warenbesitzer beseitigen würde, dessen wiederholte Selbstveräußerung das Kapitalverhältnis benötigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS1","text":"Warenproduktion und Warenzirkulation erzeugen Geld; Geld bildet die erste sichtbare Form möglichen Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS2","text":"W–G–W erzeugt die Sequenz Verkauf → Kauf → Gebrauchswert → Konsumtion → Abschluss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS3","text":"G–W–G′ erzeugt die Sequenz Vorschuss → Warenform → Rückfluss → Mehrwert → erneuter Vorschuss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS4","text":"Äquivalententausch → Formwechsel ohne Wertzuwachs; Nichtäquivalententausch → Umverteilung ohne Gesamtzuwachs; isolierte Produktion → Wertzusatz ohne Selbstverwertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS5","text":"Die dreifache Ausschließung erzeugt die Suchbedingung: Eine zu ihrem Wert gekaufte Ware muss durch ihren Gebrauch Wert hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS6","text":"Rechtliche Freiheit + zeitlich begrenzte Veräußerung + Trennung von Produktionsmitteln → Arbeitskraft als Ware.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS7","text":"Wertbestimmung der Arbeitskraft vor dem Austausch → Verkauf in der Zirkulation → wirklicher Gebrauch in der Produktion → Ware und Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS8","text":"Rechtliche Gleichheit des Vertrags → Verlassen der Marktsphäre → funktionale Trennung von Kapitalist und Arbeiter → erneuerte Kapitalbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AF1","text":"Warenzirkulation → Geld → Vergleich der Kreislaufformen → G–W–G′ → Mehrwert → Selbstverwertung → endlose Wiederholung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AF2","text":"Unmöglichkeit des Mehrwerts in reiner Zirkulation → Unmöglichkeit isolierter Selbstverwertung außerhalb der Zirkulation → Doppelwiderspruch → Arbeitskraft → doppelte Freiheit → Reproduktionswert → produktive Konsumtion → Kapitalbildung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME1","text":"Geld und Kapital werden nicht mehr als verschiedene Stoffe, sondern als verschiedene Bewegungsformen desselben Werts klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME2","text":"Individueller Gewinn, Umverteilung und gesamtgesellschaftliche Wertvermehrung werden voneinander getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME3","text":"Zirkulation und Produktion werden als notwendige, aber nicht symmetrische Orte der Kapitalbildung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME4","text":"Freie Arbeit wird als Einheit rechtlicher Selbstverfügung und materieller Produktionsmittellosigkeit neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME5","text":"Freiheit, Gleichheit und Eigentum werden als gültige Kategorien der Zirkulationsoberfläche lokalisiert, nicht als Gesamtbeschreibung des Kapitalverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME6","text":"Der Kapitalist wird vom autonomen Ursprung des Prozesses zum personifizierten Funktionsträger der Wertverwertung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME7","text":"Handels- und Wucherkapital werden von ursprünglichen Erklärungsformen zu abgeleiteten Erscheinungsformen des Kapitals verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ALT1","text":"Surface — Sichtbar sind die Kreislaufformen W–G–W und G–W–G′, der Arbeitsvertrag und die Rückkehr einer vergrößerten Geldsumme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Wertverwertung beruht auf der Verbindung von Äquivalententausch, Trennung der Arbeiter von Produktionsmitteln und produktiver Konsumtion der Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Erklärung eliminiert Zirkulationsillusionen, formuliert einen immanenten Widerspruch und verlagert die Untersuchung von der Marktoberfläche in die Produktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Kapital existiert als prozessierende Wertidentität; Arbeitskraft existiert als gegenwärtig verkaufte Fähigkeit, deren Gebrauch und Wertwirkung erst später eintreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um Formvergleich, Mehrwertproblem, Zirkulationswiderspruch, Arbeitskraftlösung und Sphärenwechsel zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die quantitative Bedingung, unter der der Gebrauch der Arbeitskraft tatsächlich mehr Wert erzeugt als ihre Reproduktion kostet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT3","text":"Die spezifischen Vermittlungen von Handelskapital und zinstragendem Kapital bleiben ausdrücklich auf spätere Ableitung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Gebrauchswert und Wert, individueller Gewinn und Gesamtwertzuwachs sowie Verkauf und Gebrauch der Arbeitskraft getrennt bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die doppelte Ausschließung von Äquivalententausch und Nichtäquivalententausch als Quellen gesellschaftlichen Mehrwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT6","text":"Die historische Erzeugung des doppelt freien Arbeiters wird als notwendige Voraussetzung gesetzt, aber genealogisch noch nicht entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT7","text":"Rechtliche Freiheit und materielle Verkaufsnotwendigkeit bleiben als konstitutive Spannung nebeneinander bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT8","text":"Die Darstellung des Werts als automatisches Subjekt bleibt spannungsvoll, weil seine Bewegung zugleich von der produktiven Konsumtion lebendiger Arbeitskraft abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT9","text":"Der Übergang von der Zirkulationsgleichheit zur Produktionsasymmetrie wird rhetorisch verdichtet, bevor die innere Organisation des Produktionsprozesses bewiesen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT10","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt nur erhalten, wenn die Arbeitskraft erst aus dem Scheitern aller Zirkulationserklärungen hervorgeht und nicht als unmittelbare Anfangsvoraussetzung eingesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T211546659596Z_337ce0af","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Second Chapter. The Transformation of Money into Capital.","source_sha256":"09cd267be232482df9698ce745309ef61914bed633ba5c8e41eea749652ed7f2","sha256":"cad717091dd2474f68268aa86eeddd01e20f54658ff4a1a6870cf31ebce26aa2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:15:46.662019+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS1","text":"What must be explained is how money, under the validity of the laws of commodity exchange, becomes capital and produces surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS2","text":"Capital appears as the movement of value G–W–G′, in which advanced value returns enlarged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS3","text":"The argument proceeds through formal analysis, immanent critique, historicization, and reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS4","text":"The comparison of W–G–W and G–W–G′ transforms the opposition between use-purpose and valorization into an opposition between finite and recursive circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS5","text":"Exchange of equivalents produces no surplus-value, exchange of non-equivalents merely redistributes existing value, and isolated production does not valorize existing value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS6","text":"The contradiction is resolved by a commodity whose use itself is value creation: labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AS7","text":"The movement leads from the legally equal market transaction, through the historically produced commodity-form of labour-power, into the hidden sphere of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A1","text":"Commodity circulation is the historical precondition of capital, and money is its first form of appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A2","text":"Money as money and money as capital differ through their form of circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A3","text":"W–G–W mediates the exchange of different use-values and ends in consumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","text":"G–W–G′ begins and ends with money, where G′ = G + ΔG.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5","text":"ΔG is surplus-value, and the movement of its production turns advanced value into capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A6","text":"Valorization possesses no immanent final measure and renews itself from its respective result.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A7","text":"The capitalist functions as the conscious bearer of the objective self-valorization of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","text":"The pure exchange of equivalents changes forms of value, but not magnitudes of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A9","text":"The exchange of non-equivalents changes the distribution of value, but not the total social sum of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A10","text":"Labour outside circulation can add new value, but cannot valorize existing value from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A11","text":"Capital must arise both in circulation and outside circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","text":"Labour-power possesses the particular use-value of creating value in its activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","text":"Labour-power can appear as a commodity only if its owner is legally free and alienates it for a limited time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A14","text":"The owner of labour-power must be separated from the means of production and subsistence that would enable independent production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A15","text":"The encounter between the money-owner and the doubly free worker is the result of a specific historical development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16","text":"The value of labour-power is determined by the socially necessary labour-time for its normal individual, generational, and qualificatory reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17","text":"The process of consumption of labour-power outside circulation is at the same time the process of production of commodity and surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A18","text":"Freedom, equality, property, and self-interest constitute the legal form of the purchase of labour-power within circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX1","text":"Capital is not determined by the material content of the commodities in circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX2","text":"Money is not capital merely by virtue of its money-form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX3","text":"Hoard formation is not valorization, because value withdrawn from circulation does not grow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX4","text":"G–W–G, as the exchange of the same sum of money for itself, is not a sufficient movement of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX5","text":"Mutual gain in use-value is not an increase in exchange-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX6","text":"Exchange of equivalents is not a source of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX7","text":"Exchange of non-equivalents is not a source of social surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX8","text":"Price mark-ups, underpricing, effective demand, and overreaching do not explain the formation of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX9","text":"The mere reversal of purchase and sale does not change the nature of the individual acts of circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX10","text":"Pure commercial and usury capital cannot explain the original formation of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX11","text":"Neither money in its resting form nor the mere resale of a commodity produces the required change in value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX12","text":"Labour-power is not identical with labour already performed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX13","text":"The temporally limited alienation of labour-power is not the complete alienation of the person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX14","text":"The free worker is neither a natural given nor a transhistorical social form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX15","text":"Commodity and money circulation alone are not sufficient conditions of existence for capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:NX16","text":"The legal categories of circulation do not exhaust the relation between capital and wage-labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D1","text":"In W–G–W, money mediates the metabolism of different commodities; in G–W–G′, the commodity mediates the return and enlargement of money-value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A2","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A3","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D2","text":"The reflux of money follows from the completion of the circuit, whereas its enlarged return decides successful valorization.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D3","text":"Since the extremes of the movement of capital possess qualitatively the same money-form, their content can lie only in a quantitative difference in value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D4","text":"G′ remains a limited sum of money and therefore becomes the renewed starting point of the same movement of valorization.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D5","text":"Merchant's capital, industrial capital, and interest-bearing capital differ through their mediations, not through the mode of return G–G′.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D6","text":"General price manipulation cancels itself out between the roles of the same commodity-owner as seller and buyer.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D7","text":"Within the analysis of pure circulation, commercial and usury capital are only derivative forms of appearance whose mediations are still absent.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A9","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D8","text":"The sought source of surplus-value must be purchased as a commodity at its value and produce additional value through its use.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A11","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D9","text":"The value of labour-power is determined before its activation, whereas its use-value is realized only in the subsequent labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D10","text":"The double freedom combines legal capacity of disposal with material separation from the conditions of independent production.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D11","text":"The reproductive value of labour-power includes subsistence, generational replacement, training, and a historically and morally determined normal level.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D12","text":"If the price of labour-power falls to the merely physical minimum, it can lie below its value, because normal reproduction presupposes more than bare maintenance.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:D13","text":"Subsequent wage payment makes the worker the capitalist's creditor, without abolishing the commodity-form of the contract.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD1","text":"Capital is not a resting thing, but the recursive identity of a value that passes through money- and commodity-form and changes its magnitude.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A2","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A4","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A5","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD2","text":"Exchange of equivalents and the formation of surplus-value are compatible because the paid value of labour-power and the value-creation of its use are subject to different determinations.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A8","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD3","text":"The market-form of capital presupposes a reproduced class constellation of owners of the conditions of production and owners of mere labour-power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A14","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A15","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD4","text":"Circulation is a necessary site of mediation for the formation of capital, but not the site of its value-creating cause.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A11","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A12","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD5","text":"The capitalist's subjective drive for enrichment is the conscious execution of an objectively endless logic of valorization.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A6","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SD6","text":"The modern epoch of capital begins not with commodities or money as such, but with the historical availability of labour-power as a commodity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A1","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A13","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A14","CH_V4GB_ZKDV:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX1","text":"A change in the distribution of property cannot count as an increase in the total social sum of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX2","text":"Use-value cannot consistently be treated as theoretically irrelevant to value, because the particular use-value of labour-power bears the solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX3","text":"Individual commercial profit cannot straightforwardly be generalized into the explanatory model of surplus-value for society as a whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX4","text":"The visible market relation cannot be treated as the complete form of the capital relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX5","text":"Legal self-disposal must not be equated with material disposal over the conditions of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX6","text":"Self-valorization cannot be an unmediated magical property of value; it presupposes the productive consumption of living labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:DNX7","text":"The existence of commodities and money must not tacitly imply the existence of the historically specific capital relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SNX1","text":"The movement of capital lacks an attainable final state, because every result functions only as a new advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SNX2","text":"The blocked possibility of independent production structures the labour market; if the worker possessed means of production and subsistence, his labour-power would not have to appear as a commodity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SNX3","text":"The source of surplus-value remains excluded from the visible form of circulation and can appear only after the transition into production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:SNX4","text":"The complete alienation of the person remains impermissible, because it would abolish the free commodity-owner whose repeated self-alienation the capital relation requires.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS1","text":"Commodity production and commodity circulation generate money; money constitutes the first visible form of possible capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS2","text":"W–G–W generates the sequence sale → purchase → use-value → consumption → conclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS3","text":"G–W–G′ generates the sequence advance → commodity-form → reflux → surplus-value → renewed advance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS4","text":"Exchange of equivalents → change of form without increase in value; exchange of non-equivalents → redistribution without total increase; isolated production → addition of value without self-valorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS5","text":"The threefold exclusion generates the condition of search: A commodity purchased at its value must produce value through its use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS6","text":"Legal freedom + temporally limited alienation + separation from means of production → labour-power as commodity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS7","text":"Determination of the value of labour-power before exchange → sale in circulation → actual use in production → commodity and surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:FGS8","text":"Legal equality of the contract → departure from the market sphere → functional separation of capitalist and worker → renewed movement of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AF1","text":"Commodity circulation → money → comparison of circuit-forms → G–W–G′ → surplus-value → self-valorization → endless repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:AF2","text":"Impossibility of surplus-value in pure circulation → impossibility of isolated self-valorization outside circulation → double contradiction → labour-power → double freedom → reproductive value → productive consumption → formation of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME1","text":"Money and capital are no longer classified as different materials, but as different forms of movement of the same value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME2","text":"Individual profit, redistribution, and the increase of value for society as a whole are separated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME3","text":"Circulation and production are mapped as necessary, but not symmetrical, sites of the formation of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME4","text":"Free labour is newly determined as the unity of legal self-disposal and material lack of means of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME5","text":"Freedom, equality, and property are located as valid categories of the surface of circulation, not as a total description of the capital relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME6","text":"The capitalist is reclassified from the autonomous origin of the process to the personified functionary of the valorization of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ME7","text":"Commercial and usury capital are shifted from original explanatory forms to derivative forms of appearance of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ALT1","text":"Surface — Visible are the circuit-forms W–G–W and G–W–G′, the labour contract, and the return of an enlarged sum of money.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ALT2","text":"Structural — The valorization of value rests on the connection between exchange of equivalents, separation of workers from means of production, and productive consumption of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The explanation eliminates illusions of circulation, formulates an immanent contradiction, and shifts the investigation from the market surface into production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Capital exists as a processual identity of value; labour-power exists as a presently sold capacity whose use and effect on value occur only later.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the comparison of forms, the problem of surplus-value, the contradiction of circulation, the labour-power solution, and the change of spheres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the quantitative condition under which the use of labour-power actually produces more value than its reproduction costs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT3","text":"The specific mediations of commercial capital and interest-bearing capital remain expressly deferred to later derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as use-value and value, individual profit and total increase in value, as well as sale and use of labour-power, remain distinct.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT5","text":"The strongest operation is the double exclusion of exchange of equivalents and exchange of non-equivalents as sources of social surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT6","text":"The historical production of the doubly free worker is posited as a necessary precondition, but has not yet been genealogically developed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT7","text":"Legal freedom and material necessity of sale continue to exist alongside one another as a constitutive tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT8","text":"The presentation of value as an automatic subject remains tension-filled, because its movement depends at the same time on the productive consumption of living labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT9","text":"The transition from equality in circulation to asymmetry in production is rhetorically condensed before the inner organization of the production process has been demonstrated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV:MRT10","text":"The actual movement of the argument is preserved only if labour-power emerges first from the failure of all explanations of circulation and is not introduced as an immediate initial presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_ZKDV@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_ZKDV:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 04","title":"Zweites Kapitel. Die Verwandlung von Geld in Kapital.","context":"Chapter 04"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV","layer":"CH","title":"1) Arbeitsprozess und Verwerthungsprozess.","order":5,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_1AUV"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_1AUV@R001","sha256":"1910810cdb40d34365b8953ff784ee05d35cde3b1415d7ea38e216a90a3f71be","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS1","text":"Zu erklären ist, wie aus dem Austausch von Äquivalenten ein Wertüberschuss hervorgehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS2","text":"Die Argumentation verfährt rekonstruktiv, indem sie den kapitalistischen Produktionsprozess zunächst in Arbeitsprozess und Wertbildungsprozess zerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS3","text":"Der Arbeitsprozess wird zuerst als gesellschaftsformübergreifende Produktion von Gebrauchswerten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS4","text":"Die kapitalistische Form fügt dem materiell zunächst unveränderten Arbeitsprozess Kontrolle, Produkteigentum und Verwertungszweck hinzu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS5","text":"Die Wertanalyse übersetzt konkrete Produktionsfaktoren in Quanta gesellschaftlich notwendiger Arbeitszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS6","text":"Die bloße Addition vorgeschossener Werte reproduziert den Vorschuss, erzeugt aber keinen Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS7","text":"Die Differenz zwischen dem Wert der Arbeitskraft und dem durch ihren Gebrauch erzeugbaren Wert liefert die gesuchte Quelle des Mehrwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS8","text":"Die Bewegung führt vom allgemeinen Stoffwechselprozess über seine kapitalistische Einfassung zur zeitlichen Überschreitung des bloßen Wertersatzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A1","text":"Der Gebrauch der Ware Arbeitskraft ist lebendige Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A2","text":"Spezifisch menschliche Arbeit verwirklicht einen vor Beginn des Prozesses ideell gesetzten Zweck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A3","text":"Arbeit vermittelt den Stoffwechsel zwischen Mensch und Natur durch zweckmäßige Veränderung des Naturstoffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A4","text":"Arbeitskraft, Arbeitsgegenstand und Arbeitsmittel bilden die einfachen Momente des im Gebrauchswertprodukt erlöschenden Arbeitsprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A5","text":"Arbeitsgegenstand, Rohmaterial, Arbeitsmittel und Produkt sind funktionelle Stellungen innerhalb eines bestimmten Arbeitsprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A6","text":"Produkte früherer Arbeitsprozesse können als Produktionsmittel in spätere Arbeitsprozesse eingehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A7","text":"Vergangene Arbeit wird als Gebrauchswert nur durch ihren Kontakt mit lebendiger Arbeit erhalten und verwirklicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8","text":"Der einfache Arbeitsprozess ist die gesellschaftsformübergreifende Form produktiver Konsumtion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A9","text":"Der Kapitalist kauft die Produktionsmittel und den zeitlich begrenzten Gebrauch der Arbeitskraft, ohne dadurch die technische Natur des Arbeitsprozesses zunächst zu verändern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A10","text":"Im kapitalistischen Arbeitsprozess untersteht die Arbeit der Kontrolle des Kapitalisten, und das Produkt fällt ihm als Eigentum zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A11","text":"Kapitalistische Produktion bezweckt eine verkäufliche Ware, deren Wert den Wert der vorgeschossenen Waren übersteigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","text":"Der Warenwert wird durch die zu ihrer Produktion gesellschaftlich notwendige Arbeitszeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A13","text":"Die Werte verbrauchter Produktionsmittel gehen nur bei wirklicher, zweckmäßiger und gesellschaftlich normaler Verwendung als Wertbestandteile in das Produkt ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","text":"Dieselbe Arbeit produziert in konkreter Form Gebrauchswert und setzt in abstrakt-quantitativer Form neuen Wert zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A15","text":"Ein Wertbildungsprozess, der nur die vorgeschossenen Werte ersetzt, erzeugt keinen Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A16","text":"Der Tageswert der Arbeitskraft wird durch ihre Reproduktionskosten bestimmt, während ihr täglicher Gebrauch ein größeres Arbeitsquantum vergegenständlichen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A17","text":"Im äquivalenten Warentausch realisiert der Verkäufer den Tauschwert der Arbeitskraft und veräußert ihren Gebrauchswert für die gekaufte Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18","text":"Wird die Arbeitskraft über die zum Ersatz ihres eigenen Werts notwendige Zeit hinaus gebraucht, erzeugt die zusätzliche Arbeitsdauer Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX1","text":"Menschliche Arbeit ist nicht auf instinktmäßige Naturtätigkeit reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX2","text":"Nicht jeder Arbeitsgegenstand ist Rohmaterial; Rohmaterial setzt bereits vergangene Arbeit voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX3","text":"Rohmaterial, Arbeitsmittel und Produkt sind keine unveränderlichen Eigenschaften von Dingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX4","text":"Arbeitsmittel sind nicht auf unmittelbar einwirkende Werkzeuge beschränkt, sondern umfassen auch gegenständliche Prozessbedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX5","text":"Die materielle Gestalt eines Arbeitsprozesses bestimmt nicht von sich aus seine gesellschaftliche Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX6","text":"Die Bestimmung produktiver Arbeit aus dem einfachen Arbeitsprozess genügt nicht zur Bestimmung kapitalistisch produktiver Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX7","text":"Der Gebrauchswert wird in der Warenproduktion nicht um seiner selbst willen produziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0044","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX8","text":"Wert entsteht nicht aus der besonderen Qualität oder Nützlichkeit einer konkreten Arbeitsart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX9","text":"Technisch überflüssige Arbeitszeit, Materialverschwendung und zweckwidriger Verschleiß bilden keinen Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0096","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX10","text":"Mehrwert kann nicht aus der bloßen Addition bereits vorhandener Warenwerte hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX11","text":"Absicht, Abstinenz, Dienstleistung oder bloße Oberaufsicht des Kapitalisten erklären keinen Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0075","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0076","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0080","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0081","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX12","text":"Mehrwert setzt weder Unterbezahlung der gekauften Waren noch Verkauf des Produkts über seinem Wert voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX13","text":"Die Zirkulation allein erzeugt keinen Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX14","text":"Komplizierte Arbeit bildet keine von der Arbeitsdauer unabhängige Quelle des Mehrwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D1","text":"Die vorgängige Zwecksetzung und die dauernde Unterordnung des Willens unter diesen Zweck unterscheiden menschliche Arbeit strukturell von instinktmäßiger Tätigkeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A2","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D2","text":"Derselbe Gebrauchswert kann mit dem Wechsel seiner Prozessstelle nacheinander als Produkt, Rohmaterial oder Arbeitsmittel fungieren.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A4","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A5","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D3","text":"Produktion bildet eine rekursive Ordnung, in der die Resultate vergangener Arbeit zu Bedingungen neuer Arbeit werden.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A6","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D4","text":"Produktive Konsumtion unterscheidet sich von individueller Konsumtion dadurch, dass sie Produktionsmittel verzehrt und ein vom Konsumenten verschiedenes Produkt erzeugt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A4","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A6","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D5","text":"Die anfängliche Unterordnung der Arbeit unter das Kapital verändert ihre Eigentums- und Kontrollform, nicht notwendig bereits ihre technische Ausführung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A9","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D6","text":"Warenproduktion ist die Einheit von Arbeitsprozess und Wertbildungsprozess; kapitalistische Produktion ist die Einheit von Arbeitsprozess und Verwertungsprozess.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A11","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0100","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D7","text":"Die Werte der Produktionsmittel können im Produkt konzentriert und erhalten werden, ohne dadurch einen Wertüberschuss zu erzeugen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A13","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D8","text":"Wertbildung setzt normale Produktionsmittel, durchschnittliche Arbeitskraft, gesellschaftlich übliche Intensität und Ausschluss vermeidbarer Verschwendung voraus.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A13","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0096","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D9","text":"Der Punkt, an dem der neu geschaffene Wert den Wert der Arbeitskraft ersetzt, trennt einfache Wertbildung von Verwertung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A15","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A16","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D10","text":"Die Zirkulation vermittelt den Verwertungsprozess durch den Kauf der Arbeitskraft, während der Wertüberschuss erst im produktiven Gebrauch dieser Arbeitskraft entsteht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A9","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A17","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D11","text":"Komplizierte Arbeit kann als ein Mehrfaches gesellschaftlicher Durchschnittsarbeit behandelt werden, ohne das zeitliche Prinzip der Mehrwertbildung zu verändern.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A16","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0105","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD1","text":"Formale Äquivalenz im Austausch ist mit der Aneignung eines nicht zusätzlich vergüteten Teils der Arbeitsdauer vereinbar.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A16","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A17","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD2","text":"Kapital erscheint als sich selbst verwertender Wert, bleibt aber auf die Einverleibung lebendiger Arbeit in gegenständliche vergangene Arbeit angewiesen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A7","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A11","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0090","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD3","text":"Gesellschaftlich notwendige Arbeitszeit fungiert zugleich als Wertmaß und als Normierungsprinzip kapitalistischer Kontrolle über Technik, Intensität und Materialverbrauch.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A10","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A13","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0096","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD4","text":"Der kapitalistische Charakter der Produktion liegt nicht im Gebrauchswertprodukt oder in der technischen Operation, sondern in der Verbindung von Eigentum, Kontrolle und zeitlich verlängerter Wertbildung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A9","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A10","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD5","text":"Die entscheidende Grenze kapitalistischer Verwertung ist zeitlich: Der qualitative Arbeitsprozess bleibt derselbe, während seine Verlängerung über den Wertersatzpunkt hinaus seine gesellschaftliche Funktion verändert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A15","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX1","text":"Die kapitalistische Produktionsbeziehung darf nicht aus der stofflichen Beschaffenheit des Arbeitsprozesses abgeleitet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX2","text":"Vergangene Arbeit besitzt ohne lebendige Arbeit keine autonome Fähigkeit zur Erhaltung, Produktbildung oder Verwertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX3","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft darf nicht mit dem Wert gleichgesetzt werden, den ihr Gebrauch hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX4","text":"Formale Marktgleichheit schließt ein asymmetrisches Kommando über den Gebrauch der gekauften Arbeitskraft nicht aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX5","text":"Tatsächlich verausgabte Arbeitszeit gilt nicht unabhängig von gesellschaftlicher Notwendigkeit als wertbildende Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0067","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX6","text":"Das Produkteigentum wird nicht aus der Vergegenständlichung der Arbeit durch den unmittelbaren Produzenten hergeleitet, sondern aus der vorgängigen Eigentumsordnung der gekauften Produktionsfaktoren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX7","text":"Qualitative Arbeitsverschiedenheit darf die quantitative Vergleichbarkeit der Arbeiten im Wert nicht aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0065","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX8","text":"Ein rein zirkulatorisches Modell des Kapitals ist ausgeschlossen, weil Äquivalententausch keinen Wertüberschuss aus sich selbst erzeugen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Selbstverwertung des Werts ohne die Verfügbarkeit einer Ware, deren Gebrauch selbst wertbildende Tätigkeit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine kapitalistische Verwertung ohne einen Teil des Arbeitstags, für den kein zusätzlicher Gegenwert der Arbeitskraft gezahlt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX3","text":"Die unmittelbare Verfügung des Produzenten über sein Produkt ist innerhalb der rekonstruierten Lohnarbeitsbeziehung strukturell nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX4","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Herrschaftsform bleibt an der stofflichen Gestalt des gelungenen Produkts abwesend und wird erst durch die Rekonstruktion von Eigentum, Zeit und Prozessstellung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX5","text":"Die historische Erzeugung des Arbeitskraftverkäufers und der kapitalistischen Eigentumsordnung bleibt ausgeblendet, obwohl der Beweis ihre Existenz voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS1","text":"Abstraktion von gesellschaftlicher Form → Isolation des allgemeinen Arbeitsprozesses → Bestimmung seiner invarianten Momente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS2","text":"Ideeller Zweck → zweckmäßige Arbeit → Vermittlung durch Arbeitsmittel → Veränderung des Arbeitsgegenstands → Gebrauchswertprodukt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS3","text":"Produkt vergangener Arbeit → Eintritt als Produktionsmittel → Kontakt mit lebendiger Arbeit → Erhaltung oder Veränderung → neues Produkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS4","text":"Kauf von Produktionsmitteln und Arbeitskraft → kapitalistische Kontrolle → produktive Konsumtion der Arbeitskraft → Eigentum am Produkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS5","text":"Konkrete Prozessmomente → Reduktion auf gesellschaftlich notwendige Arbeitszeiten → übertragene Werte plus neu zugesetzter Wert → Gesamtwert des Produkts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS6","text":"Neu zugesetzter Wert = Wert der Arbeitskraft → bloße Wertbildung → kein Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS7","text":"Fortsetzung derselben Arbeit über den Wertersatzpunkt hinaus → zusätzlicher Wert ohne zusätzlichen Kauf der Arbeitskraft → Mehrwert → Verwertungsprozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS8","text":"Kauf in der Zirkulation → Mehrwertproduktion außerhalb der Zirkulation → Verkauf zum Warenwert → Rückkehr eines vergrößerten Geldwerts → Geld als Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AF1","text":"Gebrauch der Arbeitskraft → allgemeiner Arbeitsprozess → elementare Prozessmomente → Gebrauchswertprodukt → rekursive Verwendung vergangener Produkte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AF2","text":"Rückkehr zum Kapitalisten → Kauf der Prozessfaktoren → Kontrolle und Produkteigentum → Ware als Produktionsziel → Verdopplung in Arbeits- und Wertbildungsprozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AF3","text":"Berechnung der übertragenen und neu zugesetzten Werte → Scheitern bloßer Wertaddition → Differenz von Wert und Gebrauchswert der Arbeitskraft → Verlängerung des Arbeitstags → Mehrwert → Verwandlung von Geld in Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0086","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME1","text":"Ein identischer Arbeitsakt wird als konkrete Gebrauchswertproduktion und als abstrakte Wertbildung doppelt lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME2","text":"Rohmaterial, Arbeitsmittel und Produkt werden von stofflichen Klassen in relationale Prozessfunktionen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME3","text":"Produkte erscheinen zugleich als Endpunkte vergangener und als Voraussetzungen künftiger Arbeitsprozesse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME4","text":"Arbeitsmittel werden als Gradmesser produktiver Kräfte und als Indizes gesellschaftlicher Produktionsverhältnisse lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME5","text":"Kapitalistische Produktion wird nicht als besondere Technik, sondern als bestimmte Einheit von Arbeitsprozess, Eigentum und Verwertung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0100","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME6","text":"Die Quelle des Mehrwerts wird von Preisabweichung und Zirkulation in den zeitlich verlängerten Gebrauch der Arbeitskraft verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME7","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Äquivalententausch und Mehrwertaneignung wird durch die Unterscheidung von Tauschwert und Gebrauchswert der Arbeitskraft aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME8","text":"Kapitalistische Kontrolle wird als Durchsetzung gesellschaftlich normaler Wertbildungsbedingungen neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0096","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text zerlegt die Herstellung eines Gebrauchswerts in Arbeit, Arbeitsgegenstand, Arbeitsmittel und Produkt und berechnet anschließend den Wert des Produkts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eigentum an Produktionsmitteln, Kauf der Arbeitskraft, Kontrolle des Arbeitsvollzugs und Aneignung des Produkts bilden die institutionelle Form des Prozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Erklärung des Mehrwerts wird von moralischen Ansprüchen, Preisbetrug und Zirkulation auf die innere Zeitstruktur der Produktion verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0081","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Lebendige zwecksetzende Tätigkeit aktiviert vergangene vergegenständlichte Arbeit; der Übergang von Reproduktion zu Verwertung erfolgt durch Überschreitung eines zeitlichen Schwellenpunkts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Trennung und anschließende Einheit von Arbeitsprozess, Wertbildungsprozess und Verwertungsprozess zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0100","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die historische Entstehung des freien Arbeitskraftverkäufers und der kapitalistischen Eigentumsordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die rechtlichen, physischen und sozialen Grenzen der Zeitspanne, für die der Gebrauch der Arbeitskraft verfügbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern konkrete und abstrakte Arbeit sowie Tauschwert und Gebrauchswert strikt auseinandergehalten werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Ableitung liegt in der Bestimmung des Mehrwerts als zeitlicher Überschreitung des bloßen Ersatzes des Arbeitskraftwerts bei fortbestehendem Äquivalententausch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT6","text":"Die Reduktion komplizierter Arbeit auf Durchschnittsarbeit und die Bestimmung gesellschaftlicher Normalität werden vorausgesetzt, nicht innerhalb des Kapitels vollständig erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0067","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT7","text":"Zwischen der gesellschaftsformübergreifenden Abstraktion des Arbeitsprozesses und der Lesbarkeit gesellschaftlicher Epochen aus ihren Arbeitsmitteln bleibt eine kontrollierte, aber nicht vollständig formalisierte Spannung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT8","text":"Die Ableitung des Produkteigentums aus dem Kauf der Prozessfaktoren komprimiert den Übergang vom zeitlich begrenzten Gebrauch der Arbeitskraft zur vollständigen Aneignung ihres Produkts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT9","text":"Die Darstellung des Kapitals als sich selbst verwertender Wert verdeckt rhetorisch, was die Analyse zugleich freilegt: seine vollständige Abhängigkeit von lebendiger Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0090","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT10","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von der materiellen Allgemeinform über die kapitalistische Einfassung zur zeitlichen Erzeugung des Mehrwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T210453925051Z_2ed23ff8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1) Labour Process and Valorisation Process.","source_sha256":"1910810cdb40d34365b8953ff784ee05d35cde3b1415d7ea38e216a90a3f71be","sha256":"9ae88335f776ec491b8c9409fcc26438b2db7209cd54bbac1c78595743696ee6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:04:53.927290+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS1","text":"What must be explained is how a surplus of value can arise from the exchange of equivalents.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS2","text":"The argument proceeds reconstructively by initially separating the capitalist production process into the labour process and the value-formation process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS3","text":"The labour process is first determined as the production of use-values across social forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS4","text":"The capitalist form adds control, ownership of the product, and the purpose of valorisation to the labour process, which is initially materially unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS5","text":"Value analysis translates concrete factors of production into quantities of socially necessary labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS6","text":"The mere addition of advanced values reproduces the advance, but generates no surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS7","text":"The difference between the value of labour-power and the value producible through its use provides the sought source of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AS8","text":"The movement proceeds from the general metabolic process through its capitalist enclosure to the temporal exceeding of mere value replacement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A1","text":"The use of the commodity labour-power is living labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A2","text":"Specifically human labour realizes a purpose ideally posited before the beginning of the process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A3","text":"Labour mediates the metabolism between human being and nature through the purposive alteration of natural material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A4","text":"Labour-power, object of labour, and means of labour form the simple moments of the labour process extinguished in the use-value product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A5","text":"Object of labour, raw material, means of labour, and product are functional positions within a determinate labour process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A6","text":"Products of earlier labour processes can enter later labour processes as means of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A7","text":"Past labour is preserved and realized as use-value only through its contact with living labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8","text":"The simple labour process is the form of productive consumption across social forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A9","text":"The capitalist purchases the means of production and the temporally limited use of labour-power, without thereby initially altering the technical nature of the labour process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A10","text":"In the capitalist labour process, labour is subject to the capitalist's control, and the product accrues to him as property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A11","text":"Capitalist production aims at a saleable commodity whose value exceeds the value of the commodities advanced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","text":"The value of the commodity is determined by the labour-time socially necessary for its production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A13","text":"The values of consumed means of production enter the product as components of value only when they are actually, purposively, and socially normally employed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","text":"The same labour, in concrete form, produces use-value and, in abstract-quantitative form, adds new value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A15","text":"A value-formation process that merely replaces the advanced values generates no surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A16","text":"The daily value of labour-power is determined by its reproduction costs, whereas its daily use can objectify a greater quantity of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A17","text":"In the exchange of commodities at equivalents, the seller realizes the exchange-value of labour-power and alienates its use-value for the time purchased.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18","text":"If labour-power is used beyond the time necessary to replace its own value, the additional duration of labour generates surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX1","text":"Human labour cannot be reduced to instinctual natural activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX2","text":"Not every object of labour is raw material; raw material already presupposes past labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX3","text":"Raw material, means of labour, and product are not unchanging properties of things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX4","text":"Means of labour are not limited to tools acting directly, but also include objective conditions of the process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX5","text":"The material shape of a labour process does not by itself determine its social form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX6","text":"The determination of productive labour from the simple labour process does not suffice for determining capitalist productive labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX7","text":"In commodity production, use-value is not produced for its own sake.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0044","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX8","text":"Value does not arise from the particular quality or usefulness of a concrete kind of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX9","text":"Technically superfluous labour-time, waste of materials, and purposeless wear do not constitute value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0096","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX10","text":"Surplus-value cannot arise from the mere addition of already existing commodity values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX11","text":"The capitalist's intention, abstinence, service, or mere supervision do not explain surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0075","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0076","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0080","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0081","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX12","text":"Surplus-value presupposes neither underpayment for the commodities purchased nor sale of the product above its value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX13","text":"Circulation alone generates no surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:NX14","text":"Complex labour does not constitute a source of surplus-value independent of labour duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D1","text":"The prior positing of purpose and the enduring subordination of the will to this purpose structurally distinguish human labour from instinctual activity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A2","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D2","text":"With the change of its process-position, the same use-value can function successively as product, raw material, or means of labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A4","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A5","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D3","text":"Production forms a recursive order in which the results of past labour become conditions of new labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A6","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D4","text":"Productive consumption differs from individual consumption in that it consumes means of production and produces a product distinct from the consumer.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A4","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A6","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D5","text":"The initial subordination of labour to capital changes its form of ownership and control, but not necessarily yet its technical execution.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A9","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D6","text":"Commodity production is the unity of the labour process and the value-formation process; capitalist production is the unity of the labour process and the valorisation process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A11","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0100","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D7","text":"The values of the means of production can be concentrated and preserved in the product without thereby generating a surplus of value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A13","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D8","text":"Value formation presupposes normal means of production, average labour-power, socially customary intensity, and the exclusion of avoidable waste.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A13","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0096","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D9","text":"The point at which the newly created value replaces the value of labour-power separates simple value formation from valorisation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A15","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A16","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D10","text":"Circulation mediates the valorisation process through the purchase of labour-power, whereas the surplus of value arises only in the productive use of this labour-power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A9","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A17","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:D11","text":"Complex labour can be treated as a multiple of average social labour without altering the temporal principle of surplus-value formation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A16","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0105","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD1","text":"Formal equivalence in exchange is compatible with the appropriation of a part of labour duration that is not additionally remunerated.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A16","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A17","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD2","text":"Capital appears as self-valorising value, but remains dependent upon the incorporation of living labour into objectified past labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A7","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A11","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0090","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD3","text":"Socially necessary labour-time functions simultaneously as a measure of value and as a principle of standardization for capitalist control over technology, intensity, and material consumption.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A10","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A12","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A13","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0096","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD4","text":"The capitalist character of production lies not in the use-value product or in the technical operation, but in the connection of ownership, control, and temporally extended value formation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A8","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A9","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A10","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SD5","text":"The decisive limit of capitalist valorisation is temporal: the qualitative labour process remains the same, while its extension beyond the point of value replacement changes its social function.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1AUV:A14","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A15","CH_V4GB_1AUV:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX1","text":"The capitalist relation of production must not be derived from the material constitution of the labour process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX2","text":"Without living labour, past labour possesses no autonomous capacity for preservation, product formation, or valorisation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX3","text":"The value of labour-power must not be equated with the value produced by its use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX4","text":"Formal equality on the market does not exclude an asymmetrical command over the use of purchased labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX5","text":"Labour-time actually expended does not count as value-forming time independently of social necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0067","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX6","text":"Ownership of the product is derived not from the objectification of labour by the immediate producer, but from the prior property order of the purchased factors of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX7","text":"Qualitative differences between kinds of labour must not abolish the quantitative comparability of labours in value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0065","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:DNX8","text":"A purely circulatory model of capital is excluded because the exchange of equivalents cannot generate a surplus of value from itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX1","text":"Excluded is self-valorisation of value without the availability of a commodity whose use is itself value-forming activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX2","text":"Excluded is capitalist valorisation without a part of the working day for which no additional equivalent of labour-power is paid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX3","text":"The producer's immediate disposal over his product is structurally unavailable within the reconstructed wage-labour relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX4","text":"The social form of domination remains absent from the material shape of the successful product and becomes visible only through the reconstruction of ownership, time, and process-position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:SNX5","text":"The historical production of the seller of labour-power and of the capitalist property order remains bracketed out, although the proof presupposes their existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS1","text":"Abstraction from social form → isolation of the general labour process → determination of its invariant moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS2","text":"Ideal purpose → purposive labour → mediation through means of labour → alteration of the object of labour → use-value product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS3","text":"Product of past labour → entry as means of production → contact with living labour → preservation or alteration → new product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS4","text":"Purchase of means of production and labour-power → capitalist control → productive consumption of labour-power → ownership of the product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS5","text":"Concrete process moments → reduction to socially necessary labour-times → transferred values plus newly added value → total value of the product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS6","text":"Newly added value = value of labour-power → mere value formation → no surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS7","text":"Continuation of the same labour beyond the point of value replacement → additional value without additional purchase of labour-power → surplus-value → valorisation process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:FGS8","text":"Purchase in circulation → production of surplus-value outside circulation → sale at commodity value → return of an enlarged money-value → money as capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AF1","text":"Use of labour-power → general labour process → elementary process moments → use-value product → recursive use of past products.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AF2","text":"Return to the capitalist → purchase of the process factors → control and ownership of the product → commodity as the aim of production → duplication into labour process and value-formation process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:AF3","text":"Calculation of transferred and newly added values → failure of mere value addition → difference between the value and use-value of labour-power → extension of the working day → surplus-value → transformation of money into capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0086","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME1","text":"An identical act of labour becomes legible twice: as concrete production of use-value and as abstract value formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME2","text":"Raw material, means of labour, and product are transformed from material classes into relational process-functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME3","text":"Products appear simultaneously as endpoints of past and as preconditions of future labour processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME4","text":"Means of labour become legible as measures of productive forces and as indices of social relations of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME5","text":"Capitalist production is classified not as a particular technique, but as a determinate unity of labour process, ownership, and valorisation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0100","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME6","text":"The source of surplus-value is shifted from price deviation and circulation to the temporally extended use of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME7","text":"The contradiction between the exchange of equivalents and the appropriation of surplus-value is resolved through the distinction between the exchange-value and use-value of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0084","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ME8","text":"Capitalist control is newly determined as the enforcement of socially normal conditions of value formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0096","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text breaks down the production of a use-value into labour, object of labour, means of labour, and product, and subsequently calculates the value of the product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ownership of means of production, purchase of labour-power, control of the execution of labour, and appropriation of the product form the institutional form of the process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The explanation of surplus-value is shifted from moral claims, price fraud, and circulation to the inner temporal structure of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0081","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0089","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Living purpose-positing activity activates past objectified labour; the transition from reproduction to valorisation occurs by exceeding a temporal threshold point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the separation and subsequent unity of the labour process, the value-formation process, and the valorisation process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0100","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT2","text":"The historical emergence of the free seller of labour-power and of the capitalist property order remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT3","text":"The legal, physical, and social limits of the span of time for which the use of labour-power is available remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as concrete and abstract labour, as well as exchange-value and use-value, are kept strictly distinct.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0092","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT5","text":"The strongest derivation lies in the determination of surplus-value as the temporal exceeding of the mere replacement of the value of labour-power while the exchange of equivalents persists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0085","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0088","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT6","text":"The reduction of complex labour to average labour and the determination of social normality are presupposed, not fully generated within the chapter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0067","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0094","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT7","text":"A controlled but not fully formalized tension remains between the abstraction of the labour process across social forms and the legibility of social epochs from their means of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT8","text":"The derivation of ownership of the product from the purchase of the process factors compresses the transition from the temporally limited use of labour-power to the complete appropriation of its product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT9","text":"The representation of capital as self-valorising value rhetorically conceals what the analysis simultaneously reveals: its complete dependence on living labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0083","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0090","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1AUV:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from the material general form through capitalist enclosure to the temporal production of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1AUV:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_1AUV@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_1AUV:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 05","title":"1) Arbeitsprozess und Verwerthungsprozess.","context":"Chapter 05"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU","layer":"CH","title":"2) Constantes Kapital und variables Kapital.","order":6,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_2CKU"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_2CKU@R001","sha256":"3ad189aa21ed44f9725f32f46b56b209c8b41438f024b702ff3821eeaf4d2d07","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt die verschiedenen Beiträge von Produktionsmitteln und Arbeitskraft zur Bildung des Produktenwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS2","text":"Produktionsmittel übertragen vorhandenen Wert, während lebendige Arbeit neuen Wert erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS3","text":"Das rekonstruktive Argument isoliert durch kontrollierte Variation von Produktivität, Arbeitsdauer und Produktionsmittelwert voneinander unabhängige Wertwirkungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS4","text":"Die Gleichzeitigkeit von Wertschöpfung und Werterhaltung führt vom doppelten Resultat zur Doppelseitigkeit derselben Arbeit als abstrakter und konkreter Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS5","text":"Die Analyse begrenzt die Wertübertragung durch den Wertverlust der Produktionsmittel und lokalisiert die originäre Wertschöpfung ausschließlich in der betätigten Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS6","text":"Die unterschiedlichen Wertfunktionen werden auf Kapitalformen abgebildet und gegen externe Wertrevolutionen sowie Änderungen der Kapitalzusammensetzung stabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A1","text":"Arbeit ist zugleich konkrete nützliche Tätigkeit und abstrakte gesellschaftliche Verausgabung menschlicher Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","text":"Abstrakte gesellschaftliche Arbeit ist innerhalb des Produktionsprozesses die Quelle des Neuwwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","text":"Die Größe des zugesetzten Neuwwerts wird durch die Dauer der Arbeitsverausgabung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","text":"Konkrete nützliche Arbeit verwandelt Produktionsmittel in Elemente eines neuen Gebrauchswerts und vermittelt dadurch die Übertragung ihres vorhandenen Werts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5","text":"Wertschöpfung und Wertübertragung sind Wirkungen desselben unteilbaren Arbeitsakts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","text":"Wert bedarf eines Gebrauchswertträgers, ohne an dessen besondere Form gebunden zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","text":"Im Arbeitsprozess wird der Gebrauchswert der Produktionsmittel produktiv konsumiert, während ihr vorhandener Tauschwert nicht neu produziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","text":"Ein Produktionsmittel überträgt nur den Wert, den es durch seine normale produktive Vernutzung verliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","text":"Der maximal übertragbare Wert eines Produktionsmittels ist durch dessen jeweils vorhandene Wertgröße begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","text":"Die Wertgröße einer Ware wird durch die unter gegenwärtigen gesellschaftlichen Bedingungen notwendige Arbeitszeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","text":"Die Betätigung der Arbeitskraft erzeugt bis zum Äquivalent ihres eigenen Werts einen tatsächlich neu geschaffenen Ersatzwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12","text":"Die Fortsetzung der Arbeit über die zur Reproduktion des Arbeitskraftwerts erforderliche Zeit hinaus erzeugt Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","text":"Der vorgeschossene Kapitalwert nimmt im Produktionsprozess die Formen Produktionsmittel und Arbeitskraft an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0048","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","text":"Der in Produktionsmittel umgesetzte Kapitalteil verändert seine Wertgröße durch den Verwertungsprozess selbst nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15","text":"Der in Arbeitskraft umgesetzte Kapitalteil reproduziert sein Äquivalent und erzeugt einen veränderlichen Überschuss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16","text":"Externe Wertänderungen der Produktionsmittel heben deren Funktion als konstantes Kapital nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17","text":"Änderungen des Größenverhältnisses zwischen Produktionsmitteln und Arbeitskraft heben deren funktionalen Unterschied nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX1","text":"Der Arbeiter verrichtet nicht eine Arbeit zur Wertschöpfung und eine zweite Arbeit zur Werterhaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX2","text":"Neuwwert entsteht nicht aus der besonderen Nützlichkeit der Arbeit, und alter Wert wird nicht durch die bloße Quantität abstrakter Arbeit erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX3","text":"Produktionsmittel erzeugen weder ihren übertragenen Wert neu noch einen darüber hinausgehenden Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX4","text":"Die nützlichen Dienste eines Produktionsmittels sind keine selbständige Quelle von Tauschwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX5","text":"Die physische Aufnahme eines Produktionsmittels in den Produktkörper ist kein notwendiges Maß seiner Wertübertragung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX6","text":"Der wiedererscheinende Wert verbrauchter Produktionsmittel ist nicht reproduzierter Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX7","text":"Konstantes Kapital bezeichnet keine historisch oder marktlich unveränderliche Wertgröße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX8","text":"Variables Kapital wird nicht durch seine quantitative Proportion zum Gesamtkapital definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0056","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX9","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft entsteht nicht durch Übertragung des Werts konsumierter Lebensmittel auf den Arbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX10","text":"Mehrwert kann nicht aus dem bloßen Wiedererscheinen vorgeschossener Werte hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D1","text":"Das doppelte Wertresultat erfordert keine Verdopplung der Arbeit, sondern folgt aus deren gleichzeitig abstrakter und konkreter Bestimmung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A1","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D2","text":"Bei gleichbleibender Arbeitsdauer kann höhere Produktivität mehr Produktionsmittelwert übertragen, ohne mehr Neuwwert hervorzubringen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D3","text":"Eine Änderung des Produktionsmittelwerts verändert bei unverändertem Arbeitsprozess den übertragenen Wert, nicht aber den durch dieselbe Arbeitsdauer erzeugten Neuwwert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D4","text":"Unter konstanten technischen Bedingungen und konstanten Produktionsmittelwerten wachsen übertragener Wert und Neuwwert proportional zur Arbeitsdauer, ohne kausal identisch zu sein.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D5","text":"Ein langlebiges Arbeitsmittel geht als ganzer Gebrauchswert in den Arbeitsprozess, aber nur gemäß seinem durchschnittlichen irreversiblen Verschleiß in den gleichzeitigen Verwertungsprozess ein.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D6","text":"Der Wert normal und unvermeidbar vernichteter Produktionsmittel kann vollständig in den Produktwert eingehen, obwohl ihr Stoff nicht in den Produktkörper eingeht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D7","text":"Naturgegebene Produktionsmittel können Gebrauchswerte bilden, ohne Tauschwert auf das Produkt zu übertragen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D8","text":"Der Wert der Produktionsmittel erscheint in einem neuen Gebrauchswert wieder, während das Äquivalent des Arbeitskraftwerts durch neue Wertschöpfung tatsächlich reproduziert wird.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D9","text":"Die Erhaltung vorhandenen Kapitalwerts beansprucht keinen zusätzlichen Arbeitsakt und fällt dem Kapital daher als unentgoltene Begleitwirkung lebendiger Arbeit zu.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D10","text":"Der Produktenwert besteht aus dem übertragenen aktuellen Wert der Produktionsmittel und dem von lebendiger Arbeit neu erzeugten Wert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D11","text":"Der Neuwwert zerfällt in das Äquivalent des Arbeitskraftwerts und den durch Mehrarbeit erzeugten Mehrwert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D12","text":"Dieselben Produktionsfaktoren erscheinen im Arbeitsprozess als objektiver und subjektiver Faktor, im Verwertungsprozess dagegen als konstantes und variables Kapital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D13","text":"Wertrevolutionen und technische Umwälzungen verändern die Größen des konstanten und variablen Kapitals, nicht den Grund ihrer begrifflichen Unterscheidung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD1","text":"Arbeitsprozess und Verwertungsprozess sind nicht deckungsgleich, weil stoffliche Teilnahme, Gebrauchswertvernutzung und Wertübertragung unterschiedlichen Proportionen folgen können.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD2","text":"Der Produktenwert ist zeitlich geschichtet aus übertragenem, gegenwärtig bewertetem vergangenem Arbeitswert und neu vergegenständlichter lebendiger Arbeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD3","text":"Gegenwärtige gesellschaftliche Produktionsbedingungen können den Wert bereits vorhandener Waren rückwirkend verändern, ohne deren frühere Produktionsgeschichte zu verändern.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD4","text":"Die Konstanz oder Variabilität eines Kapitalteils ist eine relationale Funktion innerhalb der Verwertung und keine natürliche Eigenschaft seines Stoffs oder seiner absoluten Größe.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD5","text":"Technische Produktivitätssteigerung kann den Stoffdurchsatz und die Masse übertragenen Werts erhöhen, ohne die Wertschöpfungskraft einer gegebenen Arbeitsdauer zu erhöhen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD6","text":"Kapitalverwertung hängt doppelt von lebendiger Arbeit ab, weil diese vorhandenen Kapitalwert erhält und zugleich den reproduzierten Arbeitskraftwert überschreitenden Neuwwert erzeugt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Produktionsmittel sich nicht kraft ihrer gegenständlichen Existenz selbst verwerten können.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX2","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Nützlichkeit und technische Wirksamkeit keine eigenständige Quelle von Tauschwert sind.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX3","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Wert keine physische Substanz ist, die sich unabhängig von gesellschaftlicher Arbeit materiell konserviert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX4","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass historische Anschaffungskosten keine unveränderliche Wertidentität garantieren.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX5","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass physische Beteiligung am Produkt und wertmäßige Beteiligung am Produktenwert nicht eins zu eins abbildbar sind.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX6","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass erhöhte Produktivität die Gebrauchswertproduktion, nicht aber den Neuwwert derselben Arbeitsdauer vervielfacht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX1","text":"Eine Selbstverwertung aufgehäufter vergangener Arbeit ohne lebendige Arbeit ist im System ausgeschlossen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX2","text":"Eine Quelle des Mehrwerts außerhalb der über die Reproduktion der Arbeitskraft hinaus fortgesetzten lebendigen Arbeit ist nicht verfügbar.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX3","text":"Zwischen symbolischem Wertzeichen und Gebrauchswertträger wird kein dritter selbständiger Existenzort des Werts zugelassen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX4","text":"Eine über historische Zeit unverändert fortbestehende Wertidentität ist ausgeschlossen, weil gegenwärtige gesellschaftliche Arbeitsbedingungen vorhandene Werte neu bestimmen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX5","text":"Eine von der wertschöpfenden Arbeit getrennte und eigens vergütete Werterhaltungsleistung wird nicht anerkannt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS1","text":"Differenz im Produktenwert → Isolierung von wiedererscheinendem altem Wert und im Prozess entstehendem Neuwwert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS2","text":"Einheit des Arbeitsakts + Verschiedenheit seiner Wertwirkungen → Doppelcharakter der Arbeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A1","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS3","text":"Konkrete Arbeitsform → produktive Vernutzung des alten Gebrauchswerts → neuer Gebrauchswertträger → Wertübertragung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS4","text":"Abstrakte Arbeitsverausgabung → zeitliche Quantifizierung → Neuwwert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS5","text":"Tatsächlicher Wertverlust + aktueller Eigenwert des Produktionsmittels → obere Grenze der Wertübertragung; Verschleiß und normaler Abfall bestimmen deren Zurechnung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS6","text":"Neuwwert bis zum Arbeitskraftäquivalent → Reproduktion des variablen Vorschusses; darüber hinausgehender Neuwwert → Mehrwert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS7","text":"Vorgeschossener Geldwert → Produktionsmittel und Arbeitskraft → unvermehrt übertragender Kapitalteil und sich verwertender Kapitalteil → konstantes und variables Kapital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS8","text":"Externe Revaluation oder technische Kompositionsänderung → Größenänderung der Kapitalteile ohne Mutation ihrer Wertfunktion.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AF1","text":"Verschiedene Beiträge zum Produktenwert → doppeltes Resultat eines Arbeitsakts → abstrakt-konkreter Doppelcharakter der Arbeit → Trennung von Neuwwert und Wertübertragung → Begrenzung der Übertragung durch Wertverlust und aktuellen Eigenwert → tatsächliche Reproduktion des Arbeitskraftäquivalents → Mehrwert durch Mehrarbeit → konstantes und variables Kapital → Stabilisierung der Unterscheidung gegen Revaluation und technische Kompositionsänderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME1","text":"Arbeit wird von einer einheitlichen Tätigkeit in zwei gleichzeitig wirksame Bestimmungen mit verschiedenen Wertfunktionen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME2","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen objektivem und subjektivem Arbeitsfaktor wird in die wertfunktionale Unterscheidung zwischen konstantem und variablem Kapital überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME3","text":"Stoffliche Teilnahme, produktive Konsumtion und wertmäßige Zurechnung werden als voneinander unterscheidbare Ordnungen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME4","text":"Produktionsmittel werden von vermeintlichen Mitproduzenten des Neuwwerts zu Trägern und Übermittlern bereits vorhandenen Werts umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME5","text":"Technischer Fortschritt wird als Veränderung von Gebrauchswertmasse, Stoffdurchsatz und Kapitalzusammensetzung sichtbar, nicht als autonome neue Wertquelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME6","text":"Vorhandene Warenbestände werden aus der Fixierung auf historische Produktionskosten gelöst und unter gegenwärtige gesellschaftliche Wertbedingungen gestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ALT1","text":"**Altitude 1 — Surface:** Der Text definiert konstantes und variables Kapital anhand ihrer verschiedenen Wirkungen auf den Produktenwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ALT2","text":"**Altitude 2 — Structural:** Arbeitsprozess und Verwertungsprozess bilden überlagerte Strukturen, deren Faktoren stofflich identisch, funktional aber verschieden klassifiziert sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ALT3","text":"**Altitude 3 — Metastrategic:** Die Analyse ersetzt Erklärungen aus technischer Nützlichkeit, Stofflichkeit oder Größenverhältnis durch die Frage nach der spezifischen Wertfunktion jedes Kapitalteils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ALT4","text":"**Altitude 4 — Ontological/Temporal:** Wert ist trägerabhängig, formindifferent und gegenwartsbezogen; der Produktenwert vereinigt übertragenen vergangenen Wert mit gegenwärtig erzeugtem Neuwwert und gliedert die Arbeitszeit in notwendige Arbeit und Mehrarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT1","text":"Das extrahierte Axiomensystem reicht zur Rekonstruktion der vollständigen Kapitelbewegung von der Doppelseitigkeit der Arbeit bis zur Kapitaldifferenz aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die vorausgesetzten Theorien des Werts, der abstrakten Arbeit, der gesellschaftlich notwendigen Arbeitszeit und des Werts der Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern konkrete und abstrakte Arbeit als Bestimmungen desselben Akts und Arbeitsprozess und Verwertungsprozess als verschiedene Analyseebenen festgehalten werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Beweisoperation liegt in der unabhängigen Variation von Produktivität, Arbeitsdauer und Produktionsmittelwert, durch die Neuwwert und Wertübertragung entkoppelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT5","text":"Die These, Wertübertragung folge dem Verlust des Gebrauchswerts, steht unter Spannung zur externen Entwertung noch brauchbarer Produktionsmittel; die Trennung von Produktionsprozess und äußerer Wertrevolution begrenzt, beseitigt aber nicht die temporale Anschlussfrage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0054","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT6","text":"Die notwendige Bindung des Werts an ein Ding steht unter Spannung zu seiner Gleichgültigkeit gegen jeden bestimmten Träger und zu seiner Darstellung als übergehende Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT7","text":"Durchschnittliche Lebensdauer, normaler Abfall und gesellschaftliche Notwendigkeit fungieren als Zurechnungsnormen, deren konkrete gesellschaftliche Feststellung nicht innerhalb des Kapitels abgeleitet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT8","text":"Die Bezeichnung der Werterhaltung als Naturgabe komprimiert einen gesellschaftlich bestimmten Wertzusammenhang in eine naturalisierende Formel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT9","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur dann, wenn Verschleiß, normaler Abfall und Revaluation als strukturelle Grenzfälle und nicht als entbehrliche Beispiele erhalten bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T210621030038Z_17254a5e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2) Constant Capital and Variable Capital.","source_sha256":"3ad189aa21ed44f9725f32f46b56b209c8b41438f024b702ff3821eeaf4d2d07","sha256":"9648d93691356fffb542bd15ffc41d137923e48cc40ea79d1df470b223d5b17d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:06:21.031303+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS1","text":"The text determines the different contributions of means of production and labour-power to the formation of the product's value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS2","text":"Means of production transfer existing value, whereas living labour creates new value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS3","text":"The reconstructive argument isolates value effects independent of one another through controlled variation of productivity, duration of labour, and value of the means of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS4","text":"The simultaneity of value creation and value preservation leads from the double result to the dual character of the same labour as abstract and concrete labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS5","text":"The analysis limits value transfer by the loss of value of the means of production and locates original value creation exclusively in labour-power set in motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AS6","text":"The different value functions are mapped onto forms of capital and stabilized against external value revolutions as well as changes in the composition of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A1","text":"Labour is at once concrete useful activity and abstract social expenditure of human labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","text":"Within the production process, abstract social labour is the source of new value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","text":"The magnitude of the added new value is determined by the duration of the expenditure of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","text":"Concrete useful labour transforms means of production into elements of a new use-value and thereby mediates the transfer of their existing value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5","text":"Value creation and value transfer are effects of the same indivisible act of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","text":"Value requires a use-value bearer without being bound to its particular form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","text":"In the labour process, the use-value of the means of production is consumed productively, whereas their existing exchange-value is not produced anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","text":"A means of production transfers only the value that it loses through its normal productive wear and tear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","text":"The maximum transferable value of a means of production is limited by its respectively existing magnitude of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","text":"The magnitude of value of a commodity is determined by the labour-time necessary under present social conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","text":"The employment of labour-power creates, up to the equivalent of its own value, an actually newly created replacement value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12","text":"The continuation of labour beyond the time required for the reproduction of the value of labour-power creates surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","text":"The advanced capital-value assumes, in the production process, the forms of means of production and labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0048","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","text":"The portion of capital converted into means of production does not alter its magnitude of value through the valorization process itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15","text":"The portion of capital converted into labour-power reproduces its equivalent and creates a variable surplus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16","text":"External changes in the value of the means of production do not abolish their function as constant capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17","text":"Changes in the ratio of magnitudes between means of production and labour-power do not abolish their functional difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX1","text":"The worker does not perform one labour for value creation and a second labour for value preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX2","text":"New value does not arise from the particular usefulness of labour, and old value is not preserved by the mere quantity of abstract labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX3","text":"Means of production create neither their transferred value anew nor value exceeding it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX4","text":"The useful services of a means of production are not an independent source of exchange-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX5","text":"The physical incorporation of a means of production into the product body is not a necessary measure of its value transfer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX6","text":"The reappearing value of consumed means of production is not reproduced value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX7","text":"Constant capital does not designate a historically or market-wise unchanging magnitude of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX8","text":"Variable capital is not defined by its quantitative proportion to total capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0056","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX9","text":"The value of labour-power does not arise through the transfer of the value of consumed means of subsistence to the worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:NX10","text":"Surplus-value cannot arise from the mere reappearance of advanced values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D1","text":"The double value result requires no doubling of labour, but follows from its simultaneously abstract and concrete determination.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A1","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D2","text":"With an unchanged duration of labour, higher productivity can transfer more value of means of production without producing more new value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D3","text":"A change in the value of the means of production changes, given an unchanged labour process, the transferred value, but not the new value produced by the same duration of labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D4","text":"Under constant technical conditions and constant values of means of production, transferred value and new value grow in proportion to the duration of labour without being causally identical.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D5","text":"A durable instrument of labour enters the labour process as a whole use-value, but enters the simultaneous valorization process only in accordance with its average irreversible wear and tear.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D6","text":"The value of means of production normally and unavoidably destroyed can enter the product's value in full, although their material does not enter the product body.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D7","text":"Naturally given means of production can form use-values without transferring exchange-value to the product.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D8","text":"The value of the means of production reappears in a new use-value, whereas the equivalent of the value of labour-power is actually reproduced through new value creation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D9","text":"The preservation of existing capital-value requires no additional act of labour and therefore accrues to capital as an unpaid concomitant effect of living labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D10","text":"The product's value consists of the transferred current value of the means of production and the value newly produced by living labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D11","text":"New value divides into the equivalent of the value of labour-power and the surplus-value produced by surplus labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D12","text":"The same factors of production appear in the labour process as objective and subjective factors, but in the valorization process as constant and variable capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:D13","text":"Value revolutions and technical upheavals change the magnitudes of constant and variable capital, not the basis of their conceptual distinction.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD1","text":"The labour process and the valorization process are not congruent, because material participation, use-value consumption, and value transfer may follow different proportions.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD2","text":"The product's value is temporally layered from transferred, presently valued past labour-value and newly objectified living labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD3","text":"Present social conditions of production can retroactively alter the value of already existing commodities without altering their earlier history of production.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD4","text":"The constancy or variability of a portion of capital is a relational function within valorization and not a natural property of its material or its absolute magnitude.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD5","text":"Technical increases in productivity can increase material throughput and the mass of transferred value without increasing the value-creating power of a given duration of labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SD6","text":"Capital valorization depends doubly on living labour, because it preserves existing capital-value and at the same time creates new value exceeding the reproduced value of labour-power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that means of production cannot valorize themselves by virtue of their objective existence.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX2","text":"The system presupposes that usefulness and technical efficacy are not an independent source of exchange-value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX3","text":"The system presupposes that value is not a physical substance that is materially conserved independently of social labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX4","text":"The system presupposes that historical acquisition costs do not guarantee an unchanging value identity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX5","text":"The system presupposes that physical participation in the product and value participation in the product's value cannot be mapped one-to-one.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:DNX6","text":"The system presupposes that increased productivity multiplies use-value production, but not the new value of the same duration of labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX1","text":"The self-valorization of accumulated past labour without living labour is excluded in the system.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX2","text":"A source of surplus-value outside living labour continued beyond the reproduction of labour-power is unavailable.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX3","text":"No third independent locus of value's existence is admitted between symbolic sign of value and use-value bearer.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX4","text":"A value identity persisting unchanged across historical time is excluded, because present social conditions of labour determine existing values anew.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:SNX5","text":"A value-preserving performance separated from value-creating labour and separately remunerated is not recognized.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS1","text":"Difference in the product's value → isolation of reappearing old value and new value arising in the process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS2","text":"Unity of the act of labour + difference of its value effects → dual character of labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A1","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS3","text":"Concrete form of labour → productive consumption of the old use-value → new use-value bearer → value transfer.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A4","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A6","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A7","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS4","text":"Abstract expenditure of labour → temporal quantification → new value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A2","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS5","text":"Actual loss of value + current intrinsic value of the means of production → upper limit of value transfer; wear and tear and normal waste determine its attribution.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A8","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A9","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS6","text":"New value up to the labour-power equivalent → reproduction of the variable advance; new value exceeding it → surplus-value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A11","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS7","text":"Advanced money-value → means of production and labour-power → capital portion transferring without increase and capital portion valorizing itself → constant and variable capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A13","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A14","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:FGS8","text":"External revaluation or technical change in composition → change in magnitude of the portions of capital without mutation of their value function.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2CKU:A16","CH_V4GB_2CKU:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:AF1","text":"Different contributions to the product's value → double result of an act of labour → abstract-concrete dual character of labour → separation of new value and value transfer → limitation of transfer by loss of value and current intrinsic value → actual reproduction of the labour-power equivalent → surplus-value through surplus labour → constant and variable capital → stabilization of the distinction against revaluation and technical change in composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME1","text":"Labour is remapped from a unified activity into two simultaneously effective determinations with different value functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME2","text":"The distinction between the objective and subjective factor of labour is transferred into the value-functional distinction between constant and variable capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME3","text":"Material participation, productive consumption, and value attribution become visible as orders distinguishable from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME4","text":"Means of production are reclassified from supposed co-producers of new value into bearers and transmitters of already existing value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME5","text":"Technical progress becomes visible as a change in the mass of use-values, material throughput, and composition of capital, not as an autonomous new source of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ME6","text":"Existing stocks of commodities are released from fixation on historical production costs and placed under present social conditions of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ALT1","text":"**Altitude 1 — Surface:** The text defines constant and variable capital by their different effects on the product's value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ALT2","text":"**Altitude 2 — Structural:** The labour process and the valorization process form superimposed structures, whose factors are materially identical but functionally classified differently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ALT3","text":"**Altitude 3 — Metastrategic:** The analysis replaces explanations based on technical usefulness, materiality, or ratio of magnitudes with the question of the specific value function of each portion of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:ALT4","text":"**Altitude 4 — Ontological/Temporal:** Value depends on a bearer, is indifferent to form, and is present-oriented; the product's value unites transferred past value with presently created new value and divides labour-time into necessary labour and surplus labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT1","text":"The extracted system of axioms suffices to reconstruct the complete movement of the chapter from the dual character of labour to the capital distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT2","text":"The presupposed theories of value, abstract labour, socially necessary labour-time, and the value of labour-power remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that concrete and abstract labour are maintained as determinations of the same act, and the labour process and valorization process as different levels of analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation of proof lies in the independent variation of productivity, duration of labour, and value of means of production, through which new value and value transfer are decoupled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT5","text":"The thesis that value transfer follows the loss of use-value is in tension with the external devaluation of means of production that remain usable; the separation of the production process and external value revolution limits, but does not eliminate, the temporal question of connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0054","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT6","text":"The necessary attachment of value to a thing is in tension with its indifference to every determinate bearer and with its representation as a passing identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT7","text":"Average lifespan, normal waste, and social necessity function as norms of attribution, whose concrete social determination is not derived within the chapter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT8","text":"The designation of value preservation as a gift of nature compresses a socially determined value relation into a naturalizing formula.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0053","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2CKU:MRT9","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if wear and tear, normal waste, and revaluation remain preserved as structural limiting cases rather than as dispensable examples.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2CKU:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_2CKU@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_2CKU:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 06","title":"2) Constantes Kapital und variables Kapital.","context":"Chapter 06"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD","layer":"CH","title":"3) Die Rate des Mehrwerths.","order":7,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_3DRD"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_3DRD@R001","sha256":"dcaa8c83232b966f255f4bd77c2e2391ecb639fd936d88037a97f69d08a7f434","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS1","text":"Der bloße Wertüberschuss C′−C=m bestimmt das Resultat der Verwertung, aber weder dessen Quelle noch dessen proportionale Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS2","text":"Die Zerlegung des Vorschusses in konstantes und variables Kapital trennt bloße Wertübertragung von wirklicher Wertneubildung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS3","text":"Mehrwert entspringt ausschließlich der Betätigung der durch variables Kapital gekauften Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS4","text":"Die analytische Ausschaltung des konstanten Kapitals isoliert das Wertprodukt v+m, ohne die technische Notwendigkeit der Produktionsmittel zu leugnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS5","text":"Die Rate m/v übersetzt die Verwertung des variablen Kapitals in das Verhältnis von Mehrarbeit zu notwendiger Arbeit und bestimmt dadurch den Exploitationsgrad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS6","text":"Die funktionelle Zerlegung von Produktenwert, Gesamtprodukt und Arbeitstag widerlegt die Vorstellung, Mehrwert entstehe erst in einem chronologisch letzten Arbeitsabschnitt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS7","text":"Das rekonstruktiv-analytische und polemische Argument bewegt sich vom sichtbaren Wertüberschuss über seine kausale Isolierung zur zeitlichen Bestimmung der Ausbeutung und zur Widerlegung ihrer buchhalterischen Verschleierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A1","text":"Das vorgeschossene Kapital zerfällt wertmäßig in konstantes und variables Kapital: C=c+v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A2","text":"Für die Wertproduktionsrechnung zählt von c nur der im Produktionsprozess verzehrte und an das Produkt abgegebene Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","text":"Konstantes Kapital überträgt vorhandenen Wert auf das Produkt, erzeugt aber keinen neuen Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A4","text":"Variables Kapital ist der in Arbeitskraft umgesetzte Teil des vorgeschossenen Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5","text":"Die Betätigung der Arbeitskraft erzeugt als lebendige Arbeit neuen Wert proportional zu ihrer Dauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A6","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft wird durch die zu ihrer Reproduktion notwendige Arbeitszeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","text":"Notwendige Arbeit reproduziert im Produktionsprozess den Wert des variablen Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","text":"Arbeit jenseits der notwendigen Arbeitszeit erzeugt Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A9","text":"Der Produktenwert hat die Form c+v+m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A10","text":"Das im Produktionsprozess neu erzeugte Wertprodukt hat die Form v+m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A11","text":"Konstantes Kapital ist technische Funktionsbedingung des variablen Kapitals, aber kein Bestimmungsgrund der Größe des neu erzeugten Werts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12","text":"Die Rate des Mehrwerts ist das Verhältnis m/v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","text":"Das Wertverhältnis m/v ist identisch mit dem Zeitverhältnis Mehrarbeit/notwendige Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A14","text":"Die Rate des Mehrwerts ist der exakte Ausdruck des Exploitationsgrades der Arbeitskraft durch das Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15","text":"Der Arbeitstag ist die Summe aus notwendiger Arbeitszeit und Mehrarbeitszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0087","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A16","text":"Ökonomische Gesellschaftsformationen unterscheiden sich durch die Form, in der Mehrarbeit dem unmittelbaren Produzenten abgepresst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A17","text":"Die Produktion von Mehrwert ist der bestimmende Zweck kapitalistischer Produktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX1","text":"Der fortbestehende, nicht verzehrte Teil des fixen Kapitals gehört nicht einseitig in den Wertvorschuss; seine Aufnahme auf beiden Rechnungsseiten verändert den Mehrwert nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX2","text":"Mehrwert entspringt nicht dem konstanten Kapital und nicht der Gesamtheit der Produktionsmittel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX3","text":"Produktenwert und neu erzeugtes Wertprodukt sind nicht identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX4","text":"Die analytische Setzung c=0 behauptet nicht die stoffliche Entbehrlichkeit der Produktionsmittel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX5","text":"Variables Kapital heißt nicht deshalb variabel, weil seine ursprünglich vorgeschossene Geldgröße unbestimmt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX6","text":"Die Rate des Mehrwerts ist nicht m/C und nicht m/(c+v); dieses Verhältnis betrifft die spätere Bestimmung der Profitrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX7","text":"Profit, Zins, Rente, Zehnten und ähnliche Verteilungsrubriken sind keine selbständigen Entstehungsgründe des Mehrwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX8","text":"Die funktionelle Zerlegung des Gesamtprodukts bedeutet weder, dass einzelne Produktteile physisch ohne Produktionsmittel oder Arbeit entstanden, noch dass die Wertbestandteile nacheinander produziert wurden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX9","text":"Der Reingewinn entsteht nicht ausschließlich in einer chronologisch letzten Arbeitsstunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX10","text":"Die illustrativen Berechnungen setzen Preise gleich Werten, begründen diese Gleichsetzung aber nicht als allgemeines Gesetz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D1","text":"Ein nicht verzehrter Fixkapitalrest kann durch symmetrische Hinzurechnung zu Vorschuss und Produktenwert weder die Differenz m noch deren Quelle verändern.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A2","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D2","text":"Nach Abzug des nur wiedererscheinenden konstanten Werts bleibt v+m als einziger im Prozess neu erzeugter Wert zurück.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A9","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D3","text":"Bei hinreichender stofflicher Masse der Produktionsmittel verändern deren Wert, Natur oder Wertschwankung die Größe des Wertprodukts nicht unmittelbar.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D4","text":"Die Variabilität von v liegt nicht im vorgeschossenen Geldquantum, sondern in dessen prozessualem Resultat v+m.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A4","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D5","text":"Die absolute Größe m misst die Masse des Mehrwerts, während m/v dessen proportionale Größe misst.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D6","text":"Die Mehrwertrate bestimmt das relative Verhältnis der beiden Teile des Arbeitstags, ohne dessen absolute Dauer, die Arbeiterzahl oder die Prozessperiode zu bestimmen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D7","text":"Eine Mehrwertrate von 100 Prozent impliziert Gleichheit von notwendiger Arbeitszeit und Mehrarbeitszeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D8","text":"Das Verhältnis m/(c+v) unterschätzt den Exploitationsgrad umso stärker, je größer c gegenüber v ist.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A1","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D9","text":"Ein teilbares Gesamtprodukt kann funktionell in Produktquanta zerlegt werden, die c, v und m vertreten, obwohl jedes einzelne Produktstück stofflich aus demselben Arbeitsprozess hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D10","text":"Der m vertretende Produktteil ist das Mehrprodukt; sein Verhältnis zum v vertretenden Produktteil entspricht bei aliquoter Zerlegung der Mehrwertrate.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D11","text":"Jede Produktionsstunde kann zugleich vorhandenen Produktionsmittelwert übertragen und neuen Wert zusetzen; die zeitliche Lage einer Stunde bestimmt daher nicht ihre wertbildende Funktion.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D12","text":"Bei sonst gleichen Bedingungen vermindert eine Verkürzung des Arbeitstags die Mehrarbeit, beseitigt den Mehrwert aber erst, wenn der Arbeitstag auf die notwendige Arbeitszeit fällt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D13","text":"Mehrarbeit bildet einen formationsübergreifenden ökonomischen Gehalt, während ihre Aneignungsweise historisch variiert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD1","text":"Die kapitalistische Erscheinung einer Selbstbewegung des Werts entsteht dadurch, dass die Leistung lebendiger Arbeit dem in Arbeitskraft umgesetzten Wert zugerechnet wird.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A4","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD2","text":"Die Architektur trennt technische Abhängigkeit von wertkausaler Abhängigkeit: Produktionsmittel sind notwendige Träger der Produktion, aber keine Quelle des Wertzuwachses.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD3","text":"Die monetäre Relation m/v kodiert eine gesellschaftliche Zeitrelation und macht die Kapitalverwertung als Verhältnis angeeigneter zu reproduktiver Arbeitszeit lesbar.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A6","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD4","text":"Die gewöhnliche Gesamtkapitalrechnung verschleiert systematisch den Exploitationsgrad, weil sie einen nicht mehrwertbildenden Wertteil in den Nenner einführt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A1","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD5","text":"Der Konflikt um die Länge des Arbeitstags ist strukturell ein Konflikt um die quantitative Grenze der Mehrarbeit, nicht um den Fortbestand einer isolierten letzten Profitstunde.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD6","text":"Die kapitalistische Reichtumsmetrik privilegiert die Masse des Mehrprodukts gegenüber der Masse des Gesamtprodukts, weil nur das Mehrprodukt den bestimmenden Produktionszweck verkörpert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD7","text":"Die historische Variabilität der Ausbeutungsformen setzt einen logisch invarianten Kern aus notwendiger Arbeit, Mehrarbeit und Aneignung voraus.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt die Unwahrheit einer homogenen Wertproduktivität des Gesamtkapitals voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0069","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0072","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX2","text":"Technische Unentbehrlichkeit kann nicht als Beweis wertbildender Kausalität gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX3","text":"Der äquivalente Kauf der Arbeitskraft schließt weder unbezahlte Arbeit noch Exploitation aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX4","text":"Der Arbeitslohn vergütet nicht den gesamten von der Arbeitskraft während des Arbeitstags erzeugten Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX5","text":"Sichtbare Einkommens- und Verteilungsformen können die Genese des verteilten Mehrwerts nicht erklären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX6","text":"Die chronologische Position eines Arbeitsabschnitts besitzt keine selbständige werttheoretische Kausalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX7","text":"Physische Produktmasse, Beschäftigtenzahl und Bevölkerungsgröße bilden innerhalb des kapitalistischen Zwecks keinen vom Mehrprodukt unabhängigen Reichtumsmaßstab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0085","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX1","text":"Die Lohnform enthält keinen Anspruch des Arbeiters auf den Wert, den seine Arbeitskraft über ihren eigenen Reproduktionswert hinaus erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX2","text":"Eine autonome Selbstverwertung des Kapitals ist ausgeschlossen; dennoch muss die Tätigkeit lebendiger Arbeit in der Erscheinungsform des Systems als Bewegung des Werts verschwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX3","text":"Ein zeitlich isolierbarer Augenblick, in dem ausschließlich Mehrwert entsteht, ist innerhalb der Wertbildungsstruktur nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX4","text":"Die Reproduktion des Arbeiters und die Vermehrung menschlicher Gebrauchswerte besitzen im kapitalistischen Reichtumsmaß keinen selbständigen Endzweck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0086","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX5","text":"Eine empirisch exakte Mehrwertrate ist aus Marktpreisen allein nicht verfügbar, solange die Vermittlung zwischen Preisen und Werten ungeklärt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS1","text":"Kapitalvorschuss: C=c+v → Produktionsresultat: C′=c+v+m → Verwertung: C′−C=m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS2","text":"Angewandtes c=c₍verzehrt₎+c₍fortbestehend₎ → Wertrechnung berücksichtigt c₍verzehrt₎ → symmetrische Aufnahme von c₍fortbestehend₎ hebt sich in der Differenz auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS3","text":"Produktenwert c+v+m → Subtraktion des übertragenen c → Wertprodukt v+m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS4","text":"Analytische Kausalisolierung: c→0 → Wertprodukt bleibt v+m → Wertzuwachs wird als Änderung des durch v vermittelten Prozesses bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS5","text":"Reproduktionsbedingung der Arbeitskraft → notwendige Arbeitszeit N → Reproduktion von v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS6","text":"Überschreitung von N → Mehrarbeitszeit S → Erzeugung von m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS7","text":"m/v=S/N → proportionale Verwertung des variablen Kapitals → Exploitationsgrad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS8","text":"Berechnungsoperation: Produktenwert−c=v+m → bei gegebenem m: v=(v+m)−m → bei gegebenem v: m=(v+m)−v → Rate=m/v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS9","text":"Produktzerlegung: Q=Qᶜ+Qᵛ+Qᵐ mit W(Qᶜ)=c, W(Qᵛ)=v und W(Qᵐ)=m → Qᵐ=Mehrprodukt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS10","text":"Räumliche Produktzerlegung und zeitliche Produktionsfolge sind Darstellungsübersetzungen; sie erzeugen keine chronologisch getrennten Wertursachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS11","text":"Arbeitstag T=N+S → bei konstantem N und T↓ folgt S↓ → m↓; m verschwindet erst bei T=N.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AF1","text":"**Wertüberschuss** → **Kapitalzerlegung in c und v** → **Begrenzung von c auf verbrauchten Wert** → **Trennung von Produktenwert und Wertprodukt** → **Isolierung der Wertänderung in v** → **Definition m/v** → **Übersetzung in Mehrarbeit/notwendige Arbeit** → **Bestimmung des Exploitationsgrades** → **funktionelle Produktzerlegung** → **Widerlegung der letzten Stunde** → **Mehrprodukt und Arbeitstag als Abschlussformen**","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME1","text":"Das Kapital wird von einer homogenen Wertsumme in einen wertübertragenden und einen wertverändernden Funktionsbereich umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME2","text":"Der sichtbare Produktenwert wird in übertragenen Altwert und tatsächlich neu erzeugten Wert getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME3","text":"Variabilität wird von einer Eigenschaft des vorgeschossenen Geldquantums zu einer Eigenschaft des Produktionsprozesses umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME4","text":"Eine monetäre Verwertungsrate wird als Verhältnis gesellschaftlich geteilter Arbeitszeit lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME5","text":"Der scheinbar einheitliche Arbeitstag wird in reproduktive notwendige Arbeit und angeeignete Mehrarbeit gegliedert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME6","text":"Das Gesamtprodukt wird als funktionelle Repräsentation von konstantem Kapital, notwendiger Arbeit und Mehrarbeit rekonfiguriert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME7","text":"Profit, Zins, Rente und verwandte Rubriken werden von Ursprungsformen zu nachgeordneten Verteilungsformen des Mehrwerts herabgestuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME8","text":"Gesellschaftsformationen werden nicht nach dem Vorhandensein von Mehrarbeit, sondern nach deren spezifischer Aneignungsform unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME9","text":"Kapitalistischer Reichtum wird von Gesamtprodukt und Bevölkerung auf Mehrprodukt und Mehrwertproduktion umzentriert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ALT1","text":"**Altitude 1 — Surface** — Die unmittelbare Ebene bestimmt die Berechnung der Mehrwertrate aus Produktenwert, konstantem Kapital, variablem Kapital und Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ALT2","text":"**Altitude 2 — Structural** — Die strukturelle Ebene trennt Wertübertragung, Reproduktion der Arbeitskraft, Mehrwertbildung und nachträgliche Verteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ALT3","text":"**Altitude 3 — Metastrategic** — Die metastrategische Ebene rahmt Arbeitszeitkonflikte als Kämpfe um Mehrarbeit und entzieht apologetischen Gesamtkapitalrechnungen ihre Beweiskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0069","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ALT4","text":"**Altitude 4 — Ontological/Temporal** — Die ontologisch-zeitliche Ebene setzt vergegenständlichte gegen lebendige Arbeit, ruhende gegen fließende Größe und überführten Altwert gegen zeitlich erzeugten Neuwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen zur Rekonstruktion der Kapitalzerlegung, der Wertproduktisolierung, der Mehrwertrate, ihrer Zeitübersetzung und der Produktzerlegung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die vorausgesetzte Arbeitswerttheorie und die vorgängige Herleitung des Werts der Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT3","text":"Die Mehrwertrate bestimmt ohne Zusatzdaten nur die relative Teilung des Arbeitstags, nicht dessen absolute Länge, die Arbeiterzahl oder die Mehrwertmasse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Kohärenz liegt in der durchgängigen Trennung von übertragenem konstantem Wert und durch lebendige Arbeit erzeugtem Neuwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT5","text":"Die Setzung c=0 ist als kausale Abstraktion konsistent, bleibt aber gegen die gleichzeitig behauptete technische Unentbehrlichkeit von c spannungsvoll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT6","text":"Die Bezeichnung des zunächst festen Vorschusses v als variable Größe verschiebt den Widerspruch auf den Prozess und benennt ihn als systemimmanent, ohne ihn ontologisch vollständig aufzulösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT7","text":"Die empirischen Beispiele bleiben wegen der unterstellten Gleichheit von Preisen und Werten bedingt; die erforderliche Vermittlung wird auf eine spätere Analyse verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT8","text":"Die Übersetzung funktioneller Produktteile in zeitlich aufeinanderfolgende Teilprodukte ist rechnerisch tragfähig, erzeugt aber genau die chronologische Fehllektüre, die anschließend zurückgewiesen werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0060","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT9","text":"Die Bestimmung des Mehrprodukts als kapitalistischen Reichtumsmaßstab hängt stärker an der komprimierten Zweckprämisse als an der vorangehenden formalen Ableitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT10","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung vom Wertüberschuss über seine kausale und zeitliche Bestimmung bis zur Polemik gegen seine buchhalterische Verschleierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T210914640727Z_a2724ae4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3) The Rate of Surplus-Value.","source_sha256":"dcaa8c83232b966f255f4bd77c2e2391ecb639fd936d88037a97f69d08a7f434","sha256":"8d7690d5a987583fd5b6c4c0607c07c4dbde08b7b7b46d62cac865c23c36dce5","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:09:14.642152+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS1","text":"The mere excess of value C′−C=m determines the result of valorization, but neither its source nor its proportional magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS2","text":"The decomposition of the advance into constant and variable capital separates mere value transfer from actual new value formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS3","text":"Surplus-value arises exclusively from the activity of the labour-power purchased by variable capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS4","text":"The analytical elimination of constant capital isolates the value product v+m, without denying the technical necessity of the means of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS5","text":"The rate m/v translates the valorization of variable capital into the ratio of surplus labour to necessary labour and thereby determines the degree of exploitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS6","text":"The functional decomposition of product value, total product, and working day refutes the notion that surplus-value arises only in a chronologically final segment of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AS7","text":"The reconstructive-analytical and polemical argument proceeds from the visible excess of value through its causal isolation to the temporal determination of exploitation and to the refutation of its bookkeeping concealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A1","text":"The capital advanced divides in value terms into constant and variable capital: C=c+v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A2","text":"For the calculation of value production, only the value of c consumed in the production process and transferred to the product counts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","text":"Constant capital transfers existing value to the product but creates no new value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A4","text":"Variable capital is the portion of the capital advanced that is converted into labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5","text":"The activity of labour-power, as living labour, creates new value proportional to its duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A6","text":"The value of labour-power is determined by the labour-time necessary for its reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","text":"Necessary labour reproduces, in the production process, the value of variable capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","text":"Labour beyond necessary labour-time creates surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A9","text":"The product value has the form c+v+m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A10","text":"The value product newly created in the production process has the form v+m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A11","text":"Constant capital is a technical condition of functioning for variable capital, but not a determining ground of the magnitude of newly created value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12","text":"The rate of surplus-value is the ratio m/v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","text":"The value ratio m/v is identical with the time ratio surplus labour/necessary labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A14","text":"The rate of surplus-value is the exact expression of the degree of exploitation of labour-power by capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15","text":"The working day is the sum of necessary labour-time and surplus labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0087","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A16","text":"Economic social formations differ by the form in which surplus labour is squeezed out of the immediate producer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:A17","text":"The production of surplus-value is the determining purpose of capitalist production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX1","text":"The persisting, unconsumed portion of fixed capital does not belong one-sidedly in the value advance; its inclusion on both sides of the calculation does not alter surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX2","text":"Surplus-value arises neither from constant capital nor from the totality of the means of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX3","text":"Product value and newly created value product are not identical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX4","text":"The analytical positing c=0 does not assert the material dispensability of the means of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX5","text":"Variable capital is not called variable because its originally advanced monetary magnitude would be indeterminate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX6","text":"The rate of surplus-value is not m/C and not m/(c+v); this ratio concerns the later determination of the rate of profit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX7","text":"Profit, interest, rent, tithes, and similar categories of distribution are not independent sources of the origin of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX8","text":"The functional decomposition of the total product means neither that individual portions of the product arose physically without means of production or labour, nor that the value components were produced successively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX9","text":"Net profit does not arise exclusively in a chronologically final hour of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:NX10","text":"The illustrative calculations equate prices with values, but do not establish this equation as a general law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D1","text":"An unconsumed remainder of fixed capital can, through symmetrical addition to advance and product value, alter neither the difference m nor its source.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A2","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D2","text":"After deduction of the merely reappearing constant value, v+m remains as the only value newly created in the process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A9","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D3","text":"Given a sufficient material mass of the means of production, their value, nature, or fluctuations in value do not directly alter the magnitude of the value product.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D4","text":"The variability of v lies not in the advanced sum of money, but in its processual result v+m.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A4","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D5","text":"The absolute magnitude m measures the mass of surplus-value, whereas m/v measures its proportional magnitude.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D6","text":"The rate of surplus-value determines the relative ratio of the two parts of the working day, without determining its absolute duration, the number of workers, or the period of the process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D7","text":"A rate of surplus-value of 100 percent implies equality of necessary labour-time and surplus labour-time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D8","text":"The ratio m/(c+v) understates the degree of exploitation all the more strongly the greater c is relative to v.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A1","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D9","text":"A divisible total product can be functionally decomposed into quantities of product representing c, v, and m, although every individual piece of product materially emerges from the same labour process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D10","text":"The portion of the product representing m is the surplus product; its ratio to the portion of the product representing v corresponds, in an aliquot decomposition, to the rate of surplus-value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D11","text":"Every hour of production can simultaneously transfer existing means-of-production value and add new value; the temporal position of an hour therefore does not determine its value-forming function.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D12","text":"Other conditions remaining the same, a shortening of the working day reduces surplus labour, but eliminates surplus-value only when the working day falls to necessary labour-time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:D13","text":"Surplus labour constitutes an economic content across formations, while its mode of appropriation varies historically.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD1","text":"The capitalist appearance of a self-motion of value arises because the performance of living labour is attributed to the value converted into labour-power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A4","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A5","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD2","text":"The architecture separates technical dependence from value-causal dependence: means of production are necessary bearers of production, but not a source of the increment of value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD3","text":"The monetary relation m/v encodes a social time relation and renders capital valorization legible as a relation of appropriated to reproductive labour-time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A6","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD4","text":"The customary calculation of total capital systematically conceals the degree of exploitation because it introduces a value component that does not form surplus-value into the denominator.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A1","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A3","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A12","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD5","text":"The conflict over the length of the working day is structurally a conflict over the quantitative limit of surplus labour, not over the persistence of an isolated final hour of profit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A13","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD6","text":"The capitalist metric of wealth privileges the mass of the surplus product over the mass of the total product, because only the surplus product embodies the determining purpose of production.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SD7","text":"The historical variability of forms of exploitation presupposes a logically invariant core of necessary labour, surplus labour, and appropriation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3DRD:A7","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A8","CH_V4GB_3DRD:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes the falsity of a homogeneous value-productivity of total capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0069","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0072","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX2","text":"Technical indispensability cannot count as proof of value-forming causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX3","text":"The equivalent purchase of labour-power excludes neither unpaid labour nor exploitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX4","text":"Wages do not remunerate the total value created by labour-power during the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX5","text":"Visible forms of income and distribution cannot explain the genesis of the distributed surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX6","text":"The chronological position of a segment of labour possesses no independent value-theoretical causality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:DNX7","text":"Within the capitalist purpose, physical mass of products, number of employed persons, and population size do not constitute a measure of wealth independent of the surplus product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0085","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX1","text":"The wage form contains no claim of the worker to the value that his labour-power creates beyond its own reproductive value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX2","text":"An autonomous self-valorization of capital is excluded; nevertheless, in the form of appearance of the system, the activity of living labour must disappear as a movement of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX3","text":"A temporally isolable moment in which surplus-value alone arises is unavailable within the structure of value formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX4","text":"The reproduction of the worker and the multiplication of human use-values possess no independent final purpose in the capitalist measure of wealth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0086","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:SNX5","text":"An empirically exact rate of surplus-value is not available from market prices alone so long as the mediation between prices and values remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS1","text":"Capital advance: C=c+v → result of production: C′=c+v+m → valorization: C′−C=m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS2","text":"Applied c=c₍verzehrt₎+c₍fortbestehend₎ → value calculation takes account of c₍verzehrt₎ → symmetrical inclusion of c₍fortbestehend₎ cancels out in the difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS3","text":"Product value c+v+m → subtraction of transferred c → value product v+m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS4","text":"Analytical causal isolation: c→0 → value product remains v+m → increment of value is determined as a change in the process mediated by v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS5","text":"Condition of reproduction of labour-power → necessary labour-time N → reproduction of v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS6","text":"Exceeding N → surplus labour-time S → creation of m.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS7","text":"m/v=S/N → proportional valorization of variable capital → degree of exploitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS8","text":"Calculation operation: product value−c=v+m → with given m: v=(v+m)−m → with given v: m=(v+m)−v → rate=m/v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS9","text":"Product decomposition: Q=Qᶜ+Qᵛ+Qᵐ with W(Qᶜ)=c, W(Qᵛ)=v and W(Qᵐ)=m → Qᵐ=surplus product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS10","text":"Spatial product decomposition and temporal sequence of production are translations of representation; they do not generate chronologically separate causes of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:FGS11","text":"Working day T=N+S → with constant N and T↓ follows S↓ → m↓; m disappears only when T=N.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:AF1","text":"**Excess of value** → **decomposition of capital into c and v** → **limitation of c to consumed value** → **separation of product value and value product** → **isolation of the change in value in v** → **definition of m/v** → **translation into surplus labour/necessary labour** → **determination of the degree of exploitation** → **functional product decomposition** → **refutation of the final hour** → **surplus product and working day as concluding forms**","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME1","text":"Capital is remapped from a homogeneous sum of value into a value-transferring and a value-altering functional domain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME2","text":"The visible product value is separated into transferred old value and actually newly created value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME3","text":"Variability is reclassified from a property of the advanced sum of money into a property of the production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME4","text":"A monetary rate of valorization becomes legible as a ratio of socially divided labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME5","text":"The seemingly unitary working day is articulated into reproductive necessary labour and appropriated surplus labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME6","text":"The total product is reconfigured as a functional representation of constant capital, necessary labour, and surplus labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME7","text":"Profit, interest, rent, and related categories are downgraded from forms of origin to subordinate forms of distribution of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME8","text":"Social formations are distinguished not by the existence of surplus labour, but by its specific form of appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ME9","text":"Capitalist wealth is recentered from total product and population onto surplus product and surplus-value production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ALT1","text":"**Altitude 1 — Surface** — The immediate level determines the calculation of the rate of surplus-value from product value, constant capital, variable capital, and surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ALT2","text":"**Altitude 2 — Structural** — The structural level separates value transfer, reproduction of labour-power, surplus-value formation, and subsequent distribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ALT3","text":"**Altitude 3 — Metastrategic** — The metastrategic level frames conflicts over labour-time as struggles over surplus labour and deprives apologetic calculations of total capital of their probative force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0064","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0069","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:ALT4","text":"**Altitude 4 — Ontological/Temporal** — The ontological-temporal level sets objectified against living labour, dormant against fluid magnitude, and transferred old value against temporally created new value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice for the reconstruction of the decomposition of capital, the isolation of the value product, the rate of surplus-value, its translation into time, and the product decomposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT2","text":"The presupposed labour theory of value and the prior derivation of the value of labour-power remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT3","text":"Without additional data, the rate of surplus-value determines only the relative division of the working day, not its absolute length, the number of workers, or the mass of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT4","text":"The strongest coherence lies in the consistent separation of transferred constant value and new value created by living labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT5","text":"The positing c=0 is consistent as a causal abstraction, but remains tension-filled in relation to the simultaneously asserted technical indispensability of c.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT6","text":"The designation of the initially fixed advance v as a variable magnitude shifts the contradiction onto the process and names it as system-immanent, without fully resolving it ontologically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT7","text":"The empirical examples remain conditional because of the assumed equality of prices and values; the necessary mediation is deferred to a later analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT8","text":"The translation of functional portions of the product into temporally successive partial products is computationally viable, but generates precisely the chronological misreading that must subsequently be rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0060","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0062","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0073","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT9","text":"The determination of the surplus product as the capitalist measure of wealth depends more strongly on the compressed premise of purpose than on the preceding formal derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0084","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3DRD:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from the excess of value through its causal and temporal determination to the polemic against its bookkeeping concealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3DRD:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_3DRD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_3DRD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 07","title":"3) Die Rate des Mehrwerths.","context":"Chapter 07"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR","layer":"CH","title":"4) Der Arbeitstag. · reading part 1/2","order":8,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_4DAR"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_4DAR@R001","sha256":"93ceb28fdce93ef936564b90a5666a819b34e9eead0ac78553accaf585d281eb","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS1","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft bestimmt die notwendige Arbeitszeit, nicht aber die Gesamtlänge des Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS2","text":"Der Arbeitstag wird als Summe eines reproduktiven Fixums und einer variablen Mehrarbeitszeit bestimmt und bleibt deshalb quantitativ offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS3","text":"Das Argument verbindet formale Wertanalyse, Diagnose des Verwertungstriebs und Genealogie der gesetzlichen Zeitbegrenzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS4","text":"Die Unbestimmtheit des Warentauschs erzeugt zwei gleichberechtigte, entgegengesetzte Ansprüche auf die Konsumtionsdauer der Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS5","text":"Die rechtlich unentscheidbare Antinomie wird durch gesellschaftliche Gewalt in einen Klassenkampf um die zeitlichen Grenzen der Verwertung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung verläuft von der formalen Unbestimmtheit über schrankenlose Aneignung, Zerstörung und Widerstand zur erzwungenen Regulierung und Verallgemeinerung gesellschaftlicher Kontrolle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0189","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A1","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft wird durch die gesellschaftlich notwendige Arbeitszeit ihrer täglichen Reproduktion bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","text":"Der Arbeitstag besteht aus notwendiger Arbeitszeit und Mehrarbeitszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A3","text":"Die Rate des Mehrwerts wird durch das Verhältnis der Mehrarbeitszeit zur notwendigen Arbeitszeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4","text":"Bei gegebener notwendiger Arbeitszeit variiert die Gesamtlänge des Arbeitstags mit der Dauer der Mehrarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5","text":"Die Variation des Arbeitstags wird durch absolute physische und historisch relative soziale Schranken begrenzt, deren Elastizität keine bestimmte Normaldauer liefert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","text":"Das Kapital verlangt als sich verwertendes Verhältnis die größtmögliche Masse an Mehrarbeit aus der gekauften Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft setzt ihre tägliche Reproduktion in normaler Kraft, Gesundheit und Lebensdauer voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","text":"Das Gesetz des Warentauschs legitimiert sowohl die maximale Nutzung durch den Käufer als auch die Begrenzung auf normale Reproduktion durch den Verkäufer, ohne zwischen beiden Ansprüchen zu entscheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","text":"Der Konflikt gleichberechtigter Ansprüche wird durch das Kräfteverhältnis zwischen Kapitalistenklasse und Arbeiterklasse entschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A10","text":"Mehrarbeit entsteht überall dort, wo eine Klasse die Produktionsmittel monopolisiert und andere zur Produktion ihres Unterhalts zwingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A11","text":"Die Vorherrschaft des Tauschwerts und die Produktion des Mehrwerts lösen die Aneignung von Mehrarbeit von einem begrenzten Kreis unmittelbarer Bedürfnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A12","text":"Die Lohnform verschmilzt notwendige Arbeit und Mehrarbeit in derselben Arbeitszeit und verbirgt damit ihre Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","text":"Die Verwertung vorgeschossener Produktionsmittel erzeugt den Druck, den Produktionsprozess durch Schichtwechsel auf alle Stunden des Tages auszudehnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","text":"Das Kapital maximiert die gegenwärtige Verausgabung der Arbeitskraft auch durch Verkürzung ihrer Lebensdauer, sofern Ersatz verfügbar bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0169","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","text":"Die Konkurrenz setzt dem einzelnen Kapitalisten die immanenten Verwertungsgesetze als äußeren Zwang entgegen und destabilisiert freiwillige Selbstbegrenzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","text":"Wirksame Arbeitszeitbegrenzung erfordert einheitliche Zeiträume, verbindliche Pausen, Kontrolle, Sanktionen und ausführende Organe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0247","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","text":"Der Normalarbeitstag ist das historische Resultat eines langwierigen Klassenkampfs und keine aus dem Austauschvertrag ableitbare Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18","text":"Da kapitalistische Exploitation nicht auf mechanisierte Fabriken beschränkt ist, tendiert ihre gesetzliche Kontrolle zur Ausdehnung auf alle kapitalistisch unterworfenen Arbeitsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0316","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX1","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft bestimmt nicht die Länge des gesamten Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX2","text":"Der Arbeitstag ist weder eine konstante Größe noch mit dem natürlichen Tag identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX3","text":"Die Mehrwertrate bestimmt nicht die absolute Dauer ihrer beiden zeitlichen Bestandteile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX4","text":"Die Reduktion des Arbeitstags auf die notwendige Arbeitszeit ist innerhalb kapitalistischer Produktion keine realisierbare Minimalschranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX5","text":"Weder der Warentausch noch die elastischen physischen und sozialen Schranken liefern ein bestimmtes Maß des Normalarbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX6","text":"Die kapitalistische Besonderheit besteht nicht in der Erfindung der Mehrarbeit, sondern in ihrer Verwandlung in einen immanenten, maßlosen Verwertungsdrang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX7","text":"Moralische Eigenschaften einzelner Kapitalisten und ihr langfristiges Interesse an der Erhaltung der Arbeitskraft begrenzen den Arbeitstag nicht zuverlässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0189","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX8","text":"Formelle Gesetzgebung ohne materielle Durchsetzung bildet keine wirksame gesellschaftliche Kontrolle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D1","text":"Dieselbe Mehrwertrate ist mit verschiedenen absoluten Längen des Arbeitstags vereinbar.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A3","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D2","text":"Der Normalarbeitstag muss politisch und institutionell festgesetzt werden, weil weder Wertrelation noch Naturgrenze seine konkrete Dauer erzeugen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0291","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D3","text":"Übermäßige Konsumtion der Arbeitskraft verwandelt den nominell äquivalenten Tageskauf in eine Unterzahlung ihres beschleunigt verbrauchten Gesamtwerts.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A1","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D4","text":"Unter dem Verwertungsgesetz werden selbst kleinste Zeitfragmente zu umkämpften Profitquellen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0065","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D5","text":"Frohnarbeit und Lohnarbeit besitzen dieselbe quantitative Mehrarbeitsstruktur, unterscheiden sich aber in deren Sichtbarkeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A10","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D6","text":"Der kapitalistisch beherrschte Weltmarkt kann vorkapitalistischen Herrschaftsformen einen zusätzlichen, auf Tauschwertproduktion gerichteten Zwang zur Überarbeit aufpfropfen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A10","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D7","text":"Ein ersetzbares Arbeitskräfteangebot entkoppelt das individuelle Erhaltungsinteresse des Kapitals von der Reproduktion der Arbeiterklasse.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0173","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0181","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D8","text":"Die Arbeitsgesetzgebung entwickelt sich rekursiv durch Beschränkung, kapitalistische Umgehung, Kontrollversagen und erneute Präzisierung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0240","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D9","text":"Die erfolgreiche Regulierung des industriellen Kernbereichs erzeugt die Grundlage für die Verallgemeinerung des Schutzprinzips auf andere Produktionszweige.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0304","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0305","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0306","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD1","text":"Formale Austauschgleichheit erzeugt keinen harmonischen Vertrag, sondern einen strukturell unentscheidbaren Konflikt um die Konsumtionsdauer einer lebendigen Ware.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD2","text":"Die Freiheit des Arbeitskraftverkäufers schlägt innerhalb des Produktionsprozesses in den Anspruch des Kapitals auf seine gesamte verfügbare Lebenszeit um.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0163","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD3","text":"Die kapitalistische Zeitökonomie steigert die kurzfristige Produktionszeit des Arbeiters durch Verkürzung seiner biologischen Reproduktions- und Lebenszeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD4","text":"Die gesetzliche Begrenzung des Arbeitstags fungiert als gesellschaftlich erzwungene Selbstbegrenzung eines Systems, dessen Einzelakteure diese Grenze konkurrenzbedingt nicht freiwillig herstellen können.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0189","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0191","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD5","text":"Die moderne Industrie produziert zugleich die maßlose Ausdehnung der Arbeitszeit, ihre konzentrierten sozialen Schäden, die kollektive Widerstandsfähigkeit der Arbeiter und die Bedingungen gesetzlicher Vereinheitlichung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0315","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX1","text":"Äquivalenter Warentausch garantiert keine nichtdestruktive Konsumtion der Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX2","text":"Die Arbeitskraft kann nicht widerspruchsfrei wie eine gewöhnliche Ware behandelt werden, weil ihre Nutzung ihre künftige Reproduzierbarkeit und ihren Gesamtwert verändert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX3","text":"Der Marktpreis der Arbeitskraft internalisiert ihre beschleunigte Abnutzung nicht notwendig, solange verschlissene Träger ersetzt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0173","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0185","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX4","text":"Technische Produktivitätssteigerung enthält keine immanente Tendenz zur Verkürzung der Arbeitszeit; sie kann den Zugriff auf Arbeitszeit intensivieren und verstetigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0315","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX5","text":"Der Staat fungiert weder als neutraler Ableiter einer natürlichen Zeitnorm noch als widerspruchslos einheitliches Organ des Einzelkapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX6","text":"Formale Rechtsgleichheit impliziert keine Gleichheit der Verfügungsmacht über Zeit, Existenzmittel und Vertragsverweigerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0257","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SNX1","text":"Dem kapitalistischen Austausch fehlt ein immanentes quantitatives Maß, das einen bestimmten Arbeitstag als normal ausweisen könnte.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SNX2","text":"Eine dem Arbeiter unverfügbar eigene Zeit erscheint innerhalb der Kapitallogik nicht als legitime positive Größe, sondern als entzogene Verwertungszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SNX3","text":"Eine endgültige Versöhnung zwischen maximaler Verwertung und normaler Reproduktion der Arbeitskraft ist innerhalb des Systems nicht verfügbar; ihre Grenze bleibt institutionalisierter und erneuerbarer Kampf.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0291","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SNX4","text":"Der moralisch ansprechbare Träger, dessen Mitgefühl den Verwertungszwang zuverlässig suspendieren könnte, bleibt strukturell abwesend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS1","text":"Reproduktionskosten der Arbeitskraft → notwendige Arbeitszeit → Zerlegung des Arbeitstags in notwendige Arbeit und Mehrarbeit → messbare Mehrwertrate bei unbestimmter Gesamtdauer.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A1","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A3","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS2","text":"Elastische Natur- und Sozialgrenzen + fehlende Austauschgrenze → Käuferrecht auf maximale Nutzung versus Verkäuferrecht auf normale Reproduktion → Rechtsantinomie → Entscheidung durch Klassenmacht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS3","text":"Mehrwertzweck + vorgeschossenes konstantes Kapital + Konkurrenz → Verlängerung, Nachtarbeit, Schichtwechsel, Zeitdiebstahl und Umgehung formeller Grenzen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS4","text":"Maximale gegenwärtige Verausgabung → verkürzte Regeneration und Lebensdauer → rascher Verschleiß → Ersatz aus dem Arbeitsmarkt → Externalisierung der Reproduktionskosten.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0173","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0185","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS5","text":"Überarbeit → körperliche und soziale Zerstörung → Arbeiterwiderstand → gesetzliche Begrenzung → kapitalistische Umgehung → präzisierte Kontrolle → erneute Umgehung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0240","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0267","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS6","text":"Regulierung des industriellen Kernbereichs → nachweisbare Reproduktionsverbesserung → Abschwächung kapitalistischen Widerstands und Erweiterung gesellschaftlicher Bündnisse → Ausdehnung der Kontrolle auf weitere Arbeitsformen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0304","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0305","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0306","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AF1","text":"Wert der Arbeitskraft → notwendige Arbeitszeit → variable Mehrarbeit → quantitativ unbestimmter Arbeitstag → elastische äußere Schranken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AF2","text":"Käuferrecht → Verkäuferrecht → Antinomie des Warentauschs → Gewaltentscheidung → Klassenkampf um den Normalarbeitstag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AF3","text":"Verwertungstrieb → maßlose Zeitaneignung → Verschleiß der Arbeitskraft → Widerstand → Fabrikgesetzgebung → Umgehung und Nachregulierung → allgemeine gesellschaftliche Arbeitszeitkontrolle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0169","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0240","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME1","text":"Der Arbeitstag wird von einer natürlichen oder vertraglich selbstverständlichen Einheit in eine zusammengesetzte, variable und umkämpfte Relation überführt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME2","text":"Der Warentausch wird von einem Modell harmonischer Äquivalenz in eine Quelle gleichberechtigter, aber unvereinbarer Zeitansprüche umkartiert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME3","text":"Frohnarbeit, Sklavenarbeit und Lohnarbeit werden als verschiedene Erscheinungsformen derselben Aneignungsrelation klassifiziert; ihre Differenz liegt wesentlich in Sichtbarkeit und gesellschaftlicher Vermittlung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A10","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME4","text":"Arbeiter werden innerhalb der Verwertungsrechnung von Trägern eigener Lebenszeit zu personifizierten Quanten verwertbarer Arbeitszeit umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0163","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME5","text":"Überarbeit wird von einer moralischen Abweichung einzelner Unternehmer zu einem reproduzierten Effekt von Mehrwertzweck, Konkurrenz, Fixkapital und Arbeitskräfteersatz verschoben.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0185","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME6","text":"Arbeitszeitgesetzgebung wird von äußerer Marktintervention zu einer erzwungenen gesellschaftlichen Bedingung der Reproduktion der Arbeitskraft und schließlich zu einem verallgemeinerbaren Organisationsprinzip umkartiert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0189","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0304","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der unmittelbare Gegenstand ist die Bestimmung, Verlängerung und gesetzliche Begrenzung des Arbeitstags.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Arbeitszeit wird durch Mehrwertproduktion, Fixkapitalnutzung, Konkurrenz, Arbeitskräfteangebot, Klassenmacht und staatliche Durchsetzung organisiert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0181","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der individuelle Vertragskonflikt wird als kollektiver Kampf um verbindliche, kontrollierbare und sektorübergreifende Zeitnormen neu gerahmt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0246","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0247","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Lebendige Arbeitskraft ist eine endliche, reproduktionsbedürftige Fähigkeit, während das Kapital Zeit als abstrakten Verwertungsstoff behandelt und gegen Regeneration, Entwicklung und Lebensdauer verrechnet.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0163","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0168","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0169","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die formale Unbestimmtheit des Arbeitstags, den Verwertungstrieb, die Rechtsantinomie und die historische Notwendigkeit erzwungener Begrenzung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0191","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt jede konkrete Zahl des Normalarbeitstags, weil sie weder aus dem Wert der Arbeitskraft noch aus den physischen und sozialen Schranken deduziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Wertanalyse, Konkurrenzmechanismus und Klassenkampf als verschiedene Vermittlungsebenen derselben Zeitrelation behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt im Übergang von der fehlenden Austauschgrenze zur Antinomie gleicher Rechte und von dort zur historischen Gewaltentscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT5","text":"Die Personifikation des Kapitals komprimiert unterschiedliche Kapitalfraktionen und Handlungsmotive; die später dargestellten Kompromisse, Ausnahmen und Fabrikantenkoalitionen bleiben darin nur begrenzt differenziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0242","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0291","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0293","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT6","text":"Die Voraussetzung des Kaufs der Arbeitskraft zu ihrem Wert gerät unter Spannung, sobald die Konsumtionsdauer selbst den reproduzierbaren Umfang der verkauften Ware verändert; der Begriff normaler Reproduktion bearbeitet, quantifiziert aber diese Spannung nicht abschließend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT7","text":"Der vom Kapital beherrschte Staat erscheint zugleich als Organ wirksamer Kapitalbegrenzung; Arbeiterdruck und gesellschaftliche Reproduktionsgefahr erklären den Umschlag, ohne seine institutionelle Vermittlung vollständig zu formalisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0277","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT8","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen langfristigem Erhaltungsinteresse des Gesamtkapitals und kurzfristiger Zerstörung der Arbeitskraft wird durch Konkurrenz, Ersatzangebot und zeitliche Externalisierung plausibilisiert, aber nicht als bestimmtes Schwellenmodell gelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0173","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0185","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT9","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von der Wertform über die Zeitantinomie und destruktive Verwertung zur kämpferisch erzwungenen, rekursiv verfeinerten und verallgemeinerten Regulierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T211013796361Z_da0e6df9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"4) The Working Day. · reading part 1/2","source_sha256":"93ceb28fdce93ef936564b90a5666a819b34e9eead0ac78553accaf585d281eb","sha256":"0b56c113b43bda8f4eae94fd2a482893fd00ba79f41355e8e02c0b1164764a9a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:10:13.797869+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS1","text":"The value of labour-power determines the necessary labour-time, but not the total length of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS2","text":"The working day is determined as the sum of a reproductive fixed component and a variable surplus-labour time, and therefore remains quantitatively open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS3","text":"The argument connects formal value analysis, the diagnosis of the drive toward valorization, and the genealogy of legal time limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS4","text":"The indeterminacy of commodity exchange generates two equally justified, opposed claims to the duration of consumption of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS5","text":"The legally undecidable antinomy is transformed by social violence into a class struggle over the temporal limits of valorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AS6","text":"The movement proceeds from formal indeterminacy through boundless appropriation, destruction, and resistance to enforced regulation and the generalization of social control.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0189","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A1","text":"The value of labour-power is determined by the socially necessary labour-time for its daily reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","text":"The working day consists of necessary labour-time and surplus-labour time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A3","text":"The rate of surplus-value is determined by the ratio of surplus-labour time to necessary labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4","text":"Given necessary labour-time, the total length of the working day varies with the duration of surplus labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5","text":"The variation of the working day is limited by absolute physical and historically relative social barriers, whose elasticity supplies no determinate normal duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","text":"As a self-valorizing relation, capital demands the greatest possible mass of surplus labour from the purchased labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","text":"The value of labour-power presupposes its daily reproduction in normal strength, health, and lifespan.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","text":"The law of commodity exchange legitimates both maximum utilization by the buyer and limitation to normal reproduction by the seller, without deciding between the two claims.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","text":"The conflict of equally justified claims is decided by the relation of forces between the capitalist class and the working class.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A10","text":"Surplus labour arises wherever a class monopolizes the means of production and compels others to produce its subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A11","text":"The predominance of exchange-value and the production of surplus-value detach the appropriation of surplus labour from a limited circle of immediate needs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A12","text":"The wage form fuses necessary labour and surplus labour into the same labour-time and thereby conceals their separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","text":"The valorization of advanced means of production generates the pressure to extend the production process through shift changes to all hours of the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","text":"Capital maximizes the present expenditure of labour-power also by shortening its lifespan, insofar as replacement remains available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0169","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","text":"Competition confronts the individual capitalist with the immanent laws of valorization as an external coercion and destabilizes voluntary self-limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","text":"Effective limitation of working time requires uniform time periods, binding breaks, inspection, sanctions, and enforcing organs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0247","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","text":"The normal working day is the historical result of a protracted class struggle and not a magnitude derivable from the exchange contract.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18","text":"Since capitalist exploitation is not limited to mechanized factories, its legal control tends toward extension to all forms of labour subordinated to capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0316","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX1","text":"The value of labour-power does not determine the length of the entire working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX2","text":"The working day is neither a constant magnitude nor identical with the natural day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX3","text":"The rate of surplus-value does not determine the absolute duration of its two temporal components.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX4","text":"The reduction of the working day to necessary labour-time is not a realizable minimum limit within capitalist production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX5","text":"Neither commodity exchange nor the elastic physical and social barriers supplies a determinate measure of the normal working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX6","text":"The capitalist peculiarity does not consist in the invention of surplus labour, but in its transformation into an immanent, boundless drive toward valorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX7","text":"The moral qualities of individual capitalists and their long-term interest in preserving labour-power do not reliably limit the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0189","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:NX8","text":"Formal legislation without material enforcement does not constitute effective social control.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D1","text":"The same rate of surplus-value is compatible with different absolute lengths of the working day.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A3","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D2","text":"The normal working day must be established politically and institutionally, because neither the value relation nor the natural limit produces its concrete duration.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0291","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D3","text":"Excessive consumption of labour-power transforms the nominally equivalent daily purchase into an underpayment of its total value consumed at an accelerated rate.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A1","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D4","text":"Under the law of valorization, even the smallest fragments of time become contested sources of profit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0065","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D5","text":"Corvée labour and wage labour possess the same quantitative structure of surplus labour, but differ in its visibility.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A10","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D6","text":"The capitalist-dominated world market can graft onto pre-capitalist forms of domination an additional compulsion to overwork directed toward exchange-value production.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A10","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D7","text":"A replaceable supply of labour-power decouples capital's individual interest in preservation from the reproduction of the working class.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0173","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0181","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D8","text":"Labour legislation develops recursively through limitation, capitalist evasion, failure of control, and renewed specification.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0240","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:D9","text":"The successful regulation of the industrial core generates the basis for generalizing the principle of protection to other branches of production.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0304","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0305","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0306","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD1","text":"Formal equality in exchange produces not a harmonious contract, but a structurally undecidable conflict over the duration of consumption of a living commodity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD2","text":"The freedom of the seller of labour-power is transformed within the production process into capital's claim upon his entire available lifetime.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0163","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD3","text":"The capitalist economy of time increases the worker's short-term production time by shortening his biological reproduction time and lifespan.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD4","text":"The legal limitation of the working day functions as the socially enforced self-limitation of a system whose individual actors cannot voluntarily produce this limit because of competition.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0189","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0191","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SD5","text":"Modern industry simultaneously produces the boundless extension of working time, its concentrated social harms, the collective capacity for resistance of workers, and the conditions of legal unification.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0315","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX1","text":"Equivalent commodity exchange guarantees no non-destructive consumption of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX2","text":"Labour-power cannot be treated without contradiction like an ordinary commodity, because its use alters its future reproducibility and its total value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX3","text":"The market price of labour-power does not necessarily internalize its accelerated wear, so long as worn-out bearers can be replaced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0173","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0185","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX4","text":"Technical increases in productivity contain no immanent tendency toward the shortening of working time; they can intensify and perpetuate access to labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0315","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX5","text":"The state functions neither as a neutral derivation of a natural norm of time nor as an organ of individual capital that is uniformly free of contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:DNX6","text":"Formal legal equality implies no equality of power of disposal over time, means of subsistence, and refusal of contract.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0257","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SNX1","text":"Capitalist exchange lacks an immanent quantitative measure that could designate a determinate working day as normal.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SNX2","text":"Time that belongs inalienably to the worker himself appears within the logic of capital not as a legitimate positive magnitude, but as time withdrawn from valorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SNX3","text":"A final reconciliation between maximum valorization and normal reproduction of labour-power is not available within the system; its limit remains institutionalized and renewable struggle.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0291","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:SNX4","text":"The morally responsive bearer whose compassion could reliably suspend the compulsion to valorize remains structurally absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS1","text":"Reproduction costs of labour-power → necessary labour-time → division of the working day into necessary labour and surplus labour → measurable rate of surplus-value with indeterminate total duration.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A1","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A3","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS2","text":"Elastic natural and social limits + absent exchange limit → buyer's right to maximum utilization versus seller's right to normal reproduction → legal antinomy → decision by class power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS3","text":"Purpose of surplus-value + advanced constant capital + competition → prolongation, night work, shift changes, time theft, and evasion of formal limits.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS4","text":"Maximum present expenditure → shortened regeneration and lifespan → rapid wear → replacement from the labour market → externalization of reproduction costs.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0173","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0185","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS5","text":"Overwork → physical and social destruction → workers' resistance → legal limitation → capitalist evasion → specified control → renewed evasion.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0240","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0267","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:FGS6","text":"Regulation of the industrial core → demonstrable improvement of reproduction → weakening of capitalist resistance and expansion of social alliances → extension of control to further forms of labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0304","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0305","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0306","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AF1","text":"Value of labour-power → necessary labour-time → variable surplus labour → quantitatively indeterminate working day → elastic external limits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AF2","text":"Buyer's right → seller's right → antinomy of commodity exchange → decision by violence → class struggle over the normal working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:AF3","text":"Drive toward valorization → boundless appropriation of time → wear of labour-power → resistance → factory legislation → evasion and re-regulation → general social control of working time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0169","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0240","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME1","text":"The working day is shifted from a natural or contractually self-evident unit into a composite, variable, and contested relation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME2","text":"Commodity exchange is remapped from a model of harmonious equivalence into a source of equally justified but incompatible claims to time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME3","text":"Corvée labour, slave labour, and wage labour are classified as different forms of appearance of the same relation of appropriation; their difference lies essentially in visibility and social mediation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A10","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME4","text":"Within the calculation of valorization, workers are reclassified from bearers of their own lifetime into personified quanta of valorisable labour-time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0163","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME5","text":"Overwork is displaced from a moral deviation of individual entrepreneurs to a reproduced effect of the purpose of surplus-value, competition, fixed capital, and replacement of labour-power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0185","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ME6","text":"Working-time legislation is remapped from external market intervention into an enforced social condition for the reproduction of labour-power and finally into a generalizable principle of organization.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0189","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0304","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate object is the determination, extension, and legal limitation of the working day.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A2","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A4","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ALT2","text":"Structural — Working time is organized through the production of surplus-value, use of fixed capital, competition, supply of labour-power, class power, and state enforcement.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A6","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A15","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0129","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0181","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The individual contractual conflict is reframed as a collective struggle over binding, controllable, and cross-sectoral norms of time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A8","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A9","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A17","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0246","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0247","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Living labour-power is a finite capacity requiring reproduction, whereas capital treats time as an abstract material of valorization and offsets it against regeneration, development, and lifespan.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4DAR:A7","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A13","CH_V4GB_4DAR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0163","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0168","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0169","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the formal indeterminacy of the working day, the drive toward valorization, the legal antinomy, and the historical necessity of enforced limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0191","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT2","text":"Every concrete number for the normal working day remains underdetermined, because it is deduced neither from the value of labour-power nor from the physical and social barriers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as value analysis, the mechanism of competition, and class struggle are treated as different levels of mediation of the same temporal relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies in the transition from the absent exchange limit to the antinomy of equal rights, and from there to the historical decision by violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT5","text":"The personification of capital compresses different factions of capital and motives for action; the compromises, exceptions, and coalitions of factory owners presented later remain only limitedly differentiated therein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0242","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0291","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0293","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT6","text":"The presupposition of the purchase of labour-power at its value comes under tension once the duration of consumption itself alters the reproducible extent of the commodity sold; the concept of normal reproduction addresses, but does not conclusively quantify, this tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT7","text":"The state dominated by capital appears simultaneously as an organ of effective limitation of capital; workers' pressure and the danger to social reproduction explain the reversal, without fully formalizing its institutional mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0277","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT8","text":"The contradiction between the long-term interest of total capital in preservation and the short-term destruction of labour-power is rendered plausible by competition, the supply of replacements, and temporal externalization, but is not resolved as a determinate threshold model.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0171","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0173","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0185","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4DAR:MRT9","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from the value form through the temporal antinomy and destructive valorization to combatively enforced, recursively refined, and generalized regulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0170","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0192","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0228","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0248","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4DAR:P0317","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_4DAR@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_4DAR:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 08","title":"4) Der Arbeitstag. · reading part 1/2","context":"Chapter 08"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2","layer":"CH","title":"4) Der Arbeitstag. · reading part 2/2","order":9,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_4D_2"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_4D_2@R001","sha256":"c680c57e67427d69fb0ec589039100402dd4370ea121b4c5f1c489c9d58c3c95","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS1","text":"Der vereinzelte Verkäufer von Arbeitskraft unterliegt bei entwickelter kapitalistischer Produktion der kapitalistischen Klasse widerstandslos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS2","text":"Der Normalarbeitstag entsteht nicht aus Vertrag oder Marktgleichheit, sondern aus einem langwierigen Klassenkampf um eine gesetzliche Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS3","text":"Die national unterschiedlichen Formen der Arbeitszeitgesetzgebung demonstrieren zugleich die allgemeine Notwendigkeit gesetzlicher Begrenzung und die kontingente Form ihrer Durchsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS4","text":"Die Abschaffung der Sklaverei bildet in den Vereinigten Staaten die Bedingung dafür, dass eine eigenständige Arbeiterbewegung den Achtstundentag fordern kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS5","text":"Die Erfahrung des Produktionsprozesses entlarvt den freien Arbeitsvertrag als Form, in der die Verkaufszeit der Arbeitskraft zugleich zur erzwungenen Verkaufszeit wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS6","text":"Die Arbeiterklasse muss durch Staatsgesetz eine Schranke erzwingen, welche den Verkauf der Arbeitskraft begrenzt und eine von kapitalistischer Aneignung unterschiedene Eigenzeit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A1","text":"Der Austausch von Arbeitskraft erscheint auf dem Markt als freiwilliger Vertrag zwischen rechtlich gleichen Warenbesitzern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A2","text":"Der Besitz von Arbeitskraft sichert dem Arbeiter nicht die Freiheit, ihre Verkaufsdauer tatsächlich zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A3","text":"Die Reproduktion des Arbeiters zwingt ihn, seine Arbeitskraft wiederholt an das Kapital zu verkaufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","text":"Kapital verlängert und intensiviert die Aneignung fremder Arbeitskraft bis an die Grenze ihrer physischen und moralischen Zerstörung, sofern keine äußere Schranke besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A5","text":"Der vereinzelte Arbeiter kann dem kapitalistischen Zugriff auf seine Arbeitszeit nicht wirksam widerstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","text":"Der Normalarbeitstag ist kein spontanes Resultat des Warentauschs, sondern ein Ergebnis organisierter Klassengewalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7","text":"Eine wirksame Begrenzung des Arbeitstags verlangt ein zwingendes und vollstreckbares Staatsgesetz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","text":"Die gesetzliche Arbeitszeitbegrenzung ist eine Vorbedingung weiterer sozialer und politischer Emanzipation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A9","text":"Sklaverei verhindert die volle Emanzipation freier Lohnarbeit, weil sie die Arbeit selbst nach rassifizierter Unfreiheit spaltet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A10","text":"Die gesetzliche Begrenzung trennt die dem Kapital verkaufte Zeit von der dem Arbeiter zugehörigen Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX1","text":"Freie Lohnarbeit ist nicht freie Verfügung des Arbeiters über die Dauer des Verkaufs seiner Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX2","text":"Der Arbeitsvertrag ist kein hinreichender Schutz gegen Selbstverausgabung, Degeneration und generationsübergreifende Reproduktion der Abhängigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX3","text":"Der Normalarbeitstag ist keine natürliche, ökonomisch selbstregulierende oder moralisch freiwillig gesetzte Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX4","text":"Die formale Begrenzung individueller Schichten begrenzt nicht notwendig die ununterbrochene Betriebsdauer des Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX5","text":"Gesetzliche Regelung ist nicht mit Humanität identisch, wenn ihre Form kapitalistische Umgehung ermöglicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX6","text":"Arbeiteremanzipation ist nicht von der Begrenzung des Arbeitstags abtrennbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX7","text":"Die rechtliche Freiheit weißer Arbeit ist nicht vollständig real, solange schwarze Arbeit als Sklavenarbeit gebrandmarkt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D1","text":"Die Vertragsfreiheit fungiert als Erscheinungsform eines Zwangsverhältnisses, weil der Arbeiter seine Arbeitskraft verkaufen muss, um sich zu reproduzieren.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D2","text":"Der Kampf um Arbeitszeit ist ein Kampf um die Verfügung über das Leben des Arbeiters und nicht bloß um die technische Dauer einer Arbeitsschicht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D3","text":"Die Arbeiterklasse wird erst durch kollektive Organisation und Gesetzgebung zu einem dem Kapital entgegengesetzten handlungsfähigen Subjekt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A5","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D4","text":"Die rechtliche Schranke des Arbeitstags verwandelt formale Gleichheit im Austausch in eine materielle Begrenzung kapitalistischer Verfügungsgewalt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D5","text":"Die verschiedenen nationalen Arbeitszeitgesetze sind Varianten desselben Konflikts zwischen kapitalistischer Aneignung und kollektiver Begrenzung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D6","text":"Die Beseitigung der Sklaverei eröffnet die Möglichkeit einer allgemeinen Arbeitszeitforderung, weil sie eine zentrale Spaltung der Arbeitermacht aufhebt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SD1","text":"Das Recht erscheint als Klasseninstrument in doppelter Form: Es schützt zunächst die Vertragsform kapitalistischer Aneignung und muss dann gegen deren Resultate als Schranke erzwungen werden.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SD2","text":"Die Zeit wird zum zentralen Gegenstand der Emanzipation, weil die Verfügung über Arbeitszeit die Verfügung über körperliche Reproduktion, Bildung, Erholung und politische Handlungsfähigkeit vermittelt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SD3","text":"Die universelle Arbeiterforderung nach einem Normalarbeitstag setzt keine bereits vorhandene Arbeitergemeinschaft voraus, sondern produziert diese als internationale politische Form.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SD4","text":"Die Begrenzung des Arbeitstags ist keine partielle Sozialreform, sondern die minimale institutionelle Bedingung, unter der weitere Emanzipationsforderungen überhaupt wirksam werden können.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX1","text":"Marktgleichheit darf nicht als reale Gleichheit der Verfügungsmacht gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX2","text":"Individuelle Unveräußerlichkeitsrechte dürfen nicht als Schutz gegen den faktischen Verkauf von Lebenszeit gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX3","text":"Kapitalistische Selbstbegrenzung darf nicht als Quelle einer menschlichen Arbeitszeitgrenze gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX4","text":"Gesetzgebung darf nicht als äußerlicher Zusatz zur Produktionsweise gelten; sie wird durch deren Konflikte erzeugt und bleibt von deren Umgehungsformen bedroht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX5","text":"Arbeiterfreiheit darf nicht als national isolierbare Kategorie gelten, solange die Arbeitsordnung durch Sklaverei und rassifizierte Unfreiheit strukturiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass der Arbeiter innerhalb eines unbeschränkten freien Vertrags seine eigene Nichtverwertung sichern kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Emanzipation, die weder kollektive Klassenbildung noch staatlich erzwingbare Begrenzung der kapitalistischen Zeitaneignung voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Freiheit der Arbeit, die mit der Koexistenz versklavter Arbeit vereinbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine endgültige Trennung von ökonomischer und politischer Sphäre, weil die ökonomische Aneignung von Arbeitszeit erst durch politische Gegenmacht begrenzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS1","text":"Juristische Marktgleichheit plus Eigentum an Arbeitskraft erzeugt die Form des freien Arbeitsvertrags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS2","text":"Reproduktionszwang plus kapitalistische Aneignungslogik verwandeln die Vertragsform in fortgesetzte erzwungene Veräußerung von Lebenszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS3","text":"Vereinzelung des Arbeiters plus fehlende äußere Schranke erzeugen die Unterwerfung unter die Verlängerung des Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS4","text":"Kollektive Klassenorganisation plus Klassenkampf erzeugen die Forderung nach einem gesetzlich bestimmten Normalarbeitstag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS5","text":"Gesetzliche Schranke plus strikte Vollstreckung begrenzen die kapitalistische Zeitaneignung und trennen Verkaufszeit von Eigenzeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS6","text":"Verfügbare Eigenzeit erzeugt die materielle Voraussetzung weiterer sozialer, moralischer und politischer Emanzipation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF1","text":"Die Niederlage des vereinzelten Arbeiters **→** die Bestimmung des Normalarbeitstags als Resultat von Klassenkampf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF2","text":"Die historische Vielfalt nationaler Regelungen **→** die Unterscheidung zwischen allgemeiner Schranke und kontingenten Rechtsformen ihrer Durchsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF3","text":"Die Bindung freier Arbeit an Sklavenarbeit **→** die Bestimmung der Abschaffung der Sklaverei als Bedingung eigenständiger Arbeiterbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF4","text":"Die Achtstundenforderung als internationale Forderung **→** die Arbeitszeitbegrenzung als Vorbedingung aller weiteren Emanzipation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF5","text":"Die Entdeckung des Zwangs hinter dem freien Vertrag **→** die Ersetzung individueller Vertragsfreiheit durch kollektive gesetzliche Schranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF6","text":"Die gesetzliche Begrenzung der Verkaufszeit **→** die Herausbildung einer dem Arbeiter zugehörigen Zeit und potenzieller politischer Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME1","text":"Der Arbeitsvertrag wird von einem Modell wechselseitiger Freiheit zu einer Form verschoben, in der Gleichheit im Austausch mit materieller Abhängigkeit zusammenfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME2","text":"Der Arbeitstag wird von einer betrieblichen Organisationsfrage zu einem gesellschaftlichen Grenzobjekt zwischen Kapitalzeit und Eigenzeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME3","text":"Gesetzgebung wird von äußerer Regulierung zu einem Resultat und zugleich zu einem Einsatzpunkt des Klassenkampfs umdefiniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME4","text":"Nationale Unterschiede erscheinen nicht als Gegenbeweis gegen die allgemeine Arbeitszeitfrage, sondern als unterschiedliche institutionelle Gestalten desselben Antagonismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME5","text":"Sklaverei wird nicht als getrennte Ausnahmeordnung, sondern als Bedingung begriffen, welche die Emanzipation freier Lohnarbeit strukturell begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt die gesetzliche Begrenzung des Arbeitstags als Gegenstand organisierter Arbeiterforderungen und staatlicher Regelung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Verlängerung des Arbeitstags folgt aus der asymmetrischen Verfügungsmacht zwischen Kapital und reproduktionsabhängigem Verkäufer von Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Emanzipation wird als Übergang von individueller Vertragsbehauptung zu kollektiver Erzwingung einer gesetzlichen Schranke gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Arbeiter erscheint als Subjekt, dessen Leben zeitlich zwischen kapitalistisch angeeigneter Verkaufszeit und erst gesetzlich gesicherter Eigenzeit geteilt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT5","text":"Historical-Global — Die Arbeiterfrage wird als internationaler Prozess gefasst, dessen nationale Formen durch Rechtsentwicklung, Klassenkampf und die Aufhebung der Sklaverei vermittelt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von formaler Vertragsfreiheit zur Forderung nach gesetzlicher Arbeitszeitbegrenzung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die konkrete institutionelle Mechanik, durch welche Klassenorganisation in dauerhaft vollstreckbares Staatsrecht übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Marktform, Produktionszwang, Klassenkampf und Gesetz als aufeinander bezogene Ebenen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation besteht in der Umkehrung des freien Vertrags in den Nachweis erzwungener Verfügbarkeit über Lebenszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Notwendigkeit staatlicher Zwangsgewalt gegen den freien Vertrag und der Darstellung des Staates als durch Klassenkampf erzwingbares Mittel der Arbeiterklasse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt zwischen der universellen Norm des Normalarbeitstags und den national unterschiedlichen Gesetzen, Durchsetzungsweisen und Umgehungsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT7","text":"Die behauptete Fortsetzung von Eigenzeit in politischer Macht bleibt als Tendenz angelegt und wird nicht als notwendig gesicherte Folge bewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes, wenn sie von der Vertragsillusion über Klassenkampf und Gesetz zur zeitlichen Selbstverfügung fortschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T211038271090Z_4a9566cc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"4) The Working Day. · reading part 2/2","source_sha256":"c680c57e67427d69fb0ec589039100402dd4370ea121b4c5f1c489c9d58c3c95","sha256":"4076d0ba29e102800ddab2b9ab344589d0d620e84710236a5bb1813c3cda603a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:10:38.272578+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS1","text":"Under developed capitalist production, the isolated seller of labour-power is helplessly subject to the capitalist class.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS2","text":"The normal working day arises not from contract or market equality, but from a protracted class struggle over a legal barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS3","text":"The nationally differing forms of working-time legislation demonstrate both the general necessity of legal limitation and the contingent form of its enforcement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS4","text":"In the United States, the abolition of slavery constitutes the condition under which an independent workers' movement can demand the eight-hour day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS5","text":"The experience of the production process exposes the free labour contract as a form in which the sale-time of labour-power simultaneously becomes enforced sale-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AS6","text":"The working class must enforce, through state law, a barrier that limits the sale of labour-power and produces a time of its own distinct from capitalist appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A1","text":"The exchange of labour-power appears on the market as a voluntary contract between legally equal owners of commodities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A2","text":"Possession of labour-power does not secure for the worker the freedom actually to determine the duration of its sale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A3","text":"The reproduction of the worker compels him repeatedly to sell his labour-power to capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","text":"Capital prolongs and intensifies the appropriation of others' labour-power to the limit of its physical and moral destruction, insofar as no external barrier exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A5","text":"The isolated worker cannot effectively resist capitalist access to his working time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","text":"The normal working day is not a spontaneous result of commodity exchange, but an outcome of organized class violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7","text":"An effective limitation of the working day requires a compulsory and enforceable state law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","text":"The legal limitation of working time is a precondition of further social and political emancipation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A9","text":"Slavery prevents the full emancipation of free wage-labour because it divides labour itself along lines of racialized unfreedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:A10","text":"Legal limitation separates the time sold to capital from the time belonging to the worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX1","text":"Free wage-labour is not the worker's free disposal over the duration of the sale of his labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX2","text":"The labour contract is not sufficient protection against self-expenditure, degeneration, and the transgenerational reproduction of dependency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX3","text":"The normal working day is not a natural, economically self-regulating, or morally voluntarily established limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX4","text":"The formal limitation of individual shifts does not necessarily limit capital's uninterrupted operating time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX5","text":"Legal regulation is not identical with humanity when its form enables capitalist evasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX6","text":"Workers' emancipation is not separable from the limitation of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:NX7","text":"The legal freedom of white labour is not fully real so long as Black labour remains branded as slave labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D1","text":"Freedom of contract functions as the form of appearance of a relation of compulsion because the worker must sell his labour-power in order to reproduce himself.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D2","text":"The struggle over working time is a struggle over disposal of the worker's life, and not merely over the technical duration of a work shift.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D3","text":"Only through collective organization and legislation does the working class become an agent capable of action opposed to capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A5","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D4","text":"The legal barrier of the working day transforms formal equality in exchange into a material limitation of capitalist power of disposal.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D5","text":"The different national working-time laws are variants of the same conflict between capitalist appropriation and collective limitation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:D6","text":"The elimination of slavery opens the possibility of a general demand for working-time limitation because it abolishes a central division of workers' power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SD1","text":"Law appears as a class instrument in a double form: it initially protects the contractual form of capitalist appropriation and must then be enforced as a barrier against its results.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SD2","text":"Time becomes the central object of emancipation because disposal over working time mediates disposal over bodily reproduction, education, rest, and political capacity for action.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SD3","text":"The universal workers' demand for a normal working day presupposes no already existing workers' community, but produces it as an international political form.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A6","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SD4","text":"The limitation of the working day is not a partial social reform, but the minimal institutional condition under which further demands for emancipation can become effective at all.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4D_2:A7","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A8","CH_V4GB_4D_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX1","text":"Market equality must not count as real equality of power of disposal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX2","text":"Individual rights of inalienability must not count as protection against the factual sale of lifetime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX3","text":"Capitalist self-limitation must not count as the source of a human limit on working time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX4","text":"Legislation must not count as an external addition to the mode of production; it is produced by its conflicts and remains threatened by its forms of evasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:DNX5","text":"Workers' freedom must not count as a nationally isolable category so long as the labour order is structured by slavery and racialized unfreedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that, within an unrestricted free contract, the worker can secure his own non-valorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an emancipation that presupposes neither collective class formation nor a state-enforceable limitation of capitalist appropriation of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a freedom of labour that would be compatible with the coexistence of enslaved labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a definitive separation of the economic and political spheres, because the economic appropriation of working time is limited only through political counter-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS1","text":"Juridical market equality plus ownership of labour-power produce the form of the free labour contract.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS2","text":"The compulsion of reproduction plus the capitalist logic of appropriation transform the contractual form into the continued enforced alienation of lifetime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS3","text":"The isolation of the worker plus the absence of an external barrier produce subjection to the prolongation of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS4","text":"Collective class organization plus class struggle produce the demand for a legally determined normal working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS5","text":"Legal barrier plus strict enforcement limit the capitalist appropriation of time and separate sale-time from time of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:FGS6","text":"Available time of one's own produces the material precondition of further social, moral, and political emancipation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF1","text":"The defeat of the isolated worker **→** the determination of the normal working day as a result of class struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF2","text":"The historical diversity of national regulations **→** the distinction between a general barrier and the contingent legal forms of its enforcement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF3","text":"The binding of free labour to slave labour **→** the determination of the abolition of slavery as the condition of an independent workers' movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF4","text":"The eight-hour demand as an international demand **→** the limitation of working time as the precondition of all further emancipation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF5","text":"The discovery of compulsion behind the free contract **→** the replacement of individual contractual freedom by a collective legal barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:AF6","text":"The legal limitation of sale-time **→** the formation of a time belonging to the worker and of potential political power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME1","text":"The labour contract is shifted from a model of reciprocal freedom to a form in which equality in exchange coincides with material dependency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME2","text":"The working day is reclassified from a question of workplace organization into a social boundary object between capital-time and time of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME3","text":"Legislation is redefined from external regulation into a result and at the same time a point of intervention of class struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME4","text":"National differences appear not as a counterproof against the general question of working time, but as different institutional configurations of the same antagonism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ME5","text":"Slavery is understood not as a separate exceptional order, but as a condition that structurally limits the emancipation of free wage-labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text determines the legal limitation of the working day as the object of organized workers' demands and state regulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — The prolongation of the working day follows from the asymmetrical power of disposal between capital and the seller of labour-power dependent on reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Emancipation is conceived as the transition from individual contractual assertion to collective enforcement of a legal barrier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The worker appears as a subject whose life is temporally divided between sale-time appropriated by capital and time of one's own secured only by law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:ALT5","text":"Historical-Global — The workers' question is conceived as an international process whose national forms are mediated by legal development, class struggle, and the abolition of slavery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from formal contractual freedom to the demand for legal limitation of working time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the concrete institutional mechanism through which class organization passes into permanently enforceable state law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as market form, compulsion of production, class struggle, and law are treated as mutually related levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation consists in reversing the free contract into the demonstration of enforced availability over lifetime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the necessity of state coercive power against the free contract and the presentation of the state as a means enforceable by the working class through class struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies between the universal norm of the normal working day and nationally differing laws, modes of enforcement, and forms of evasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT7","text":"The asserted continuation of time of one's own into political power remains posited as a tendency and is not proved as a necessarily secured consequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4D_2:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text if it proceeds from the contractual illusion through class struggle and law to temporal self-disposal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4D_2:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_4D_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_4D_2:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 09","title":"4) Der Arbeitstag. · reading part 2/2","context":"Chapter 09"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM","layer":"CH","title":"5) Rate und Masse des Mehrwerths.","order":10,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_5RUM"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_5RUM@R001","sha256":"b0bbeed4db4fbae94f66c8281c7e90aa78c4a2573cc368f5e0fd881ca9d21f20","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS1","text":"Der Text rekonstruiert quantitativ, wie die Masse des Mehrwerths aus dem Wert der Arbeitskraft, der Mehrwerthsrate und der Zahl gleichzeitig exploitirter Arbeitskräfte hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS2","text":"Die Mehrwerthsmasse wird als Produkt aus vorgeschossenem variablem Kapital und Mehrwerthsrate bestimmt, nicht als Funktion des Gesammtkapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS3","text":"Die Austauschbarkeit von Arbeiterzahl und Exploitationsgrad erklärt, wie dieselbe Mehrwerthsmasse durch verschiedene Kombinationen von variablem Kapital und Arbeitstagsverlängerung erzeugt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS4","text":"Die Möglichkeit dieses Ersatzes wird durch die natürliche Schranke des Arbeitstags und auf gesellschaftlicher Ebene durch die Arbeiterbevölkerung begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS5","text":"Die quantitative Bestimmung führt zur Unterscheidung von constantem und variablem Kapital sowie zu einem Kapitalminimum, ohne das die kapitalistische Funktion nicht stabil ausgeübt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS6","text":"Die Analyse endet in der Neurahmung des Produktionsprozesses als Verwerthungsprozess, in dem Produktionsmittel zu Mitteln der Aneignung fremder Arbeit und Mehrarbeit werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A1","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft und die zu ihrer Reproduktion nothwendige Arbeitszeit werden als gegebne constante Größe vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A2","text":"Bei gegebenem Wert der Arbeitskraft bestimmt die Rate des Mehrwerths die vom einzelnen Arbeiter erzeugte Mehrwerthsmasse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A3","text":"Das variable Kapital ist der Gesammtwerth der gleichzeitig angewandten Arbeitskräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","text":"Die Mehrwerthsmasse ist das Produkt aus dem Mehrwerth je Arbeiter und der Zahl der gleichzeitig beschäftigten Arbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5","text":"Proportionale Verminderung des variablen Kapitals kann durch proportionale Steigerung der Mehrwerthsrate ersetzt werden, ohne die Mehrwerthsmasse zu verändern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","text":"Der durchschnittliche Arbeitstag bleibt naturgemäß unter 24 Stunden und begrenzt daher absolut die Steigerung des Exploitationsgrads.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","text":"Constantes Kapital erscheint im Produktenwerth wieder, geht aber nicht in das neugebildete Werthprodukt ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A8","text":"Unterschiede in der technischen und organischen Zusammensetzung des Kapitals verändern nicht das Gesetz, dass neugebildeter Werth und Mehrwerth von lebendiger Arbeit abhängen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A9","text":"Die täglich gesellschaftlich bewegte Arbeit kann als ein einziger gesellschaftlicher Arbeitstag behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A10","text":"Bei gegebner Länge des gesellschaftlichen Arbeitstags begrenzt die Arbeiterbevölkerung die Mehrwerthsmasse; bei gegebner Bevölkerung begrenzt die mögliche Verlängerung des Arbeitstags sie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","text":"Die Verwandlung von Geld oder Waare in Kapital setzt ein Minimum vorgeschossenen Werths voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12","text":"Kapital entwickelt sich im Produktionsprozess zum Kommando über Arbeit und zu einem Zwangsverhältniß zur Erpressung von Mehrarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A13","text":"Die Produktion absoluten Mehrwerths unterwirft zunächst vorhandne Arbeitsbedingungen, ohne die Produktionsweise unmittelbar verändern zu müssen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14","text":"Unter dem Gesichtspunkt der Verwerthung wenden nicht Arbeiter die Produktionsmittel an, sondern Produktionsmittel wenden Arbeiter an und werden zu Anspruchs- und Zwangstiteln auf fremde Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX1","text":"Constantes Kapital ist nicht Quelle des neugebildeten Werths oder Mehrwerths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX2","text":"Die Mehrwerthsmasse ist nicht direkt aus der Größe des Gesammtkapitals oder seiner sichtbaren technischen Ausstattung abzulesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX3","text":"Die Ersetzung von Arbeiterzahl durch gesteigerten Exploitationsgrad ist nicht unbegrenzt möglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX4","text":"Die Zufuhr exploitable Arbeit ist nicht ausschließlich durch Arbeitsangebot und Arbeitsnachfrage bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX5","text":"Der selbst mitarbeitende kleine Meister ist nicht schon in voller Bedeutung Kapitalist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX6","text":"Produktion absoluten Mehrwerths ist nicht notwendig an technische Umwälzung der Produktionsweise gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX7","text":"Der Schein unterschiedlicher Profitmassen widerlegt das Werthgesetz nicht unmittelbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D1","text":"Die Mehrwerthsmasse lässt sich als Produkt aus variablem Kapital und Mehrwerthsrate bestimmen: M = V · m′.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A1","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A2","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A3","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D2","text":"Bei unveränderter Mehrwerthsmasse bilden Umfang des variablen Kapitals und Exploitationsgrad eine proportionale Ersatzrelation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D3","text":"Die Ersatzrelation zwischen Arbeiterzahl und Mehrwerthsrate gilt nur innerhalb der durch die Tageslänge gesetzten absoluten Grenze.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D4","text":"Bei gleichem Wert der Arbeitskraft und gleichem Exploitationsgrad verhalten sich die Massen von Werth und Mehrwerth direkt wie die variablen Bestandtheile der Kapitale.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A3","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D5","text":"Auf gesellschaftlicher Ebene wird die Mehrwerthsproduktion durch die Verbindung von Bevölkerungsgröße, Arbeitstagslänge und Exploitationsgrad begrenzt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A9","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D6","text":"Das Kapitalminimum trennt die kapitalistische Funktion der dauernden Aneignung, Kontrolle und Verwerthung fremder Arbeit von der bloßen Subsistenz des selbstarbeitenden Produzenten.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D7","text":"Derselbe technische Arbeitsprozess erscheint aus der Perspektive des Arbeiters als Stoffwechsel mit Produktionsmitteln, aus der Perspektive der Verwerthung aber als Einsaugung lebendiger Arbeit durch Kapital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A13","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SD1","text":"Die Mehrwerthsproduktion besitzt zwei substituierbare Skalierungsachsen: die extensive Masse angewandter Arbeitskräfte und den intensiven beziehungsweise zeitlichen Exploitationsgrad dieser Arbeitskräfte.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A3","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SD2","text":"Das Kapital ist strukturell widersprüchlich organisiert, weil es den variablen Kapitalbestand und die Arbeiterzahl zu vermindern sucht, seine Mehrwerthsmasse aber allein aus der Exploitation lebendiger Arbeitskraft gewinnt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SD3","text":"Auf gesellschaftlicher Ebene ist die Erweiterung des Mehrwerths nicht nur kapital-, sondern auch zeit- und bevölkerungsbegrenzt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A9","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SD4","text":"Die Verwandlung von Geld in Produktionsmittel erzeugt nicht nur einen Produktionsfonds, sondern ein soziales Machtverhältnis, in dem gegenständlicher Werth als Anspruch auf fremde lebendige Arbeit fungiert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX1","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Mehrwerth durch unbegrenzte Verlängerung des Arbeitstags unabhängig von der Zahl der Arbeiter gesteigert werden könne.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX2","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass todte Arbeit oder Produktionsmittel aus sich selbst neuen Werth erzeugen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX3","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass der Kauf der Arbeitskraft den Produktionsprozess als bloßen Austausch unter Gleichen erschöpft.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX4","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass jeder beliebige Geldbesitzer bereits über die Bedingungen verfügt, Kapitalist zu sein.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX5","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass der Verkaufswerth einer Maschine ihre künftig aus Arbeiterinnen und Arbeitern zu ziehende Mehrarbeit bereits enthält.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein sich selbst verwerthender Werth, der von lebendiger Arbeit tatsächlich unabhängig wäre.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Verfügung des Arbeiters über seine eigenen Produktionsmittel und über eine auf seine Reproduktion begrenzte Arbeitszeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich ist eine unbegrenzte kapitalistische Mehrwerthsausdehnung, die zugleich Arbeitstagsgrenzen, Bevölkerungsgrenzen und die Abhängigkeit von lebendiger Arbeit aufhebt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A9","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS1","text":"Gegebener Wert der Arbeitskraft v → gegebne nothwendige Arbeitszeit → bestimmbarer individueller Mehrwerth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS2","text":"Zahl der Arbeitskräfte N × Wert je Arbeitskraft v → variables Kapital V = N · v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS3","text":"Individueller Mehrwerth × N → Mehrwerthsmasse M = V · m′.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS4","text":"V↓ bei proportionalem m′↑ → M konstant; V↑ bei proportionalem m′↓ → M konstant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS5","text":"Arbeitstag < 24 Stunden → Begrenzung von m′; gesellschaftlicher Arbeitstag + Arbeiterbevölkerung → Begrenzung von M.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS6","text":"Constantes Kapital überträgt Werth, erzeugt aber keinen neuen Werth → Verschiebung des Maßstabs vom Gesammtkapital auf seinen variablen Bestandtheil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS7","text":"Überschreiten des Kapitalminimums → dauernde Aneignung und Kontrolle fremder Arbeit → Kapital als Kommando- und Zwangsverhältniß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS8","text":"Betrachtung des Produktionsprozesses als Verwerthung → Umkehrung von Arbeiter und Produktionsmitteln → gegenständlicher Werth erscheint als Subjekt der Arbeitsaneignung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF1","text":"Gegebner Werth der Arbeitskraft → Bestimmung der nothwendigen Arbeit → Bestimmung der individuellen Mehrarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF2","text":"Individuelle Mehrarbeit → Aggregation gleichzeitig beschäftigter Arbeiter → variable Kapitalgröße → Mehrwerthsmasse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF3","text":"Verhältnis von variablem Kapital und Mehrwerthsrate → proportionale Ersetzbarkeit → Schranke des Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF4","text":"Trennung von constantem und variablem Kapital → Ausschluß des constanten Kapitals aus der Werthneubildung → Vorrang lebendiger Arbeit als Mehrwerthquelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF5","text":"Aggregation zum gesellschaftlichen Arbeitstag → Bevölkerungsgrenze und Zeitgrenze → Begrenzung der gesellschaftlichen Mehrwerthsproduktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF6","text":"Kapitalminimum → Kapitalist als personificirtes Kapital → Kommando über Arbeit → Verkehrung von Arbeitsmitteln in Mittel der Arbeitsaneignung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME1","text":"Das begriffliche Maß der Mehrwerthsproduktion wird vom Gesammtkapital auf den in Arbeitskraft umgesetzten variablen Kapitalbestandtheil verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME2","text":"Arbeiterzahl und Mehrwerthsrate erscheinen nicht als getrennte Ursachen, sondern als begrenzt substituierbare Faktoren derselben Mehrwerthsmasse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME3","text":"Die individuelle Arbeitszeit wird als gesellschaftlicher Gesammtarbeitstag kartiert, dessen Grenzen demographisch und zeitlich bestimmt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME4","text":"Das Kapitalminimum zeichnet eine Grenze zwischen bloßem Geldbesitz, handwerklicher Selbstarbeit und kapitalistischer Herrschaftsfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME5","text":"Der Produktionsprozess zerfällt in Arbeitsprozess und Verwerthungsprozess, deren Perspektiven dieselben Produktionsmittel gegensätzlich klassifizieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME6","text":"Sichtbare Unterschiede von Profit und Kapitalzusammensetzung werden als Erscheinungsproblem neu klassifiziert, das die elementare Mehrwerthsbestimmung nicht unmittelbar aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text bestimmt rechnerisch die Relation zwischen Mehrwerthsrate, variablem Kapital, Arbeiterzahl und Mehrwerthsmasse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text trennt die Werthübertragung des constanten Kapitals von der Werthschöpfung lebendiger Arbeit und bestimmt Kapital als Zwangsverhältniß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text zeigt die kapitalistische Steuerungslogik, Arbeiterzahl, Arbeitstagslänge und Exploitationsgrad gegeneinander zu verschieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Text ordnet todte und lebendige Arbeit in ein asymmetrisches Verhältnis ein, dessen Bewegungsform die Selbstverwerthung des Werths und dessen Grenze die endliche Arbeitszeit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Grundformel M = V · m′, ihre Ersetzungsrelation und ihre absolute zeitliche Begrenzung zu rekonstruiren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die historische Bestimmung des Werths der Arbeitskraft und der Mehrwerthsrate, weil beide als gegebne Größen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT3","text":"Der Widerspruch zwischen dem Gesetz der variablen Kapitalbestandtheile und den sichtbaren Profitdifferenzen bleibt innerhalb dieser Einheit absichtlich ungelöst und auf spätere Mittelglieder verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern proportionale Ersetzung nur als konditionale Beziehung innerhalb der Schranke des Arbeitstags verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der Verbindung von quantitativer Formel, absoluter Zeitgrenze und Unterscheidung von constantem und variablem Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT6","text":"Die Bestimmung des Kapitalminimums hängt von historisch variablen Bedingungen und von einer nicht vollständig formalisierten Schwelle zwischen Subsistenzproduktion und kapitalistischer Funktion ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT7","text":"Die abschließende Verkehrung von Produktionsmitteln und Arbeit folgt aus der Verwerthungsperspektive, doch ihre ideologische Verallgemeinerung wird eher diagnostisch behauptet als innerhalb der Formel selbst abgeleitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T211208264786Z_470bfec8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"5) Rate and Mass of Surplus-Value.","source_sha256":"b0bbeed4db4fbae94f66c8281c7e90aa78c4a2573cc368f5e0fd881ca9d21f20","sha256":"c05b86ea24940964e1a86444253a491b41f296883f2674448404a428710e98f9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:12:08.266627+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS1","text":"The text quantitatively reconstructs how the mass of surplus-value arises from the value of labour-power, the rate of surplus-value, and the number of simultaneously exploited labour-powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS2","text":"The mass of surplus-value is determined as the product of advanced variable capital and the rate of surplus-value, not as a function of total capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS3","text":"The interchangeability of the number of workers and the degree of exploitation explains how the same mass of surplus-value can be produced through different combinations of variable capital and extension of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS4","text":"The possibility of this substitution is limited by the natural barrier of the working day and, at the social level, by the working population.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS5","text":"The quantitative determination leads to the distinction between constant and variable capital as well as to a minimum of capital, without which the capitalist function cannot be exercised stably.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AS6","text":"The analysis ends in the reframing of the process of production as a valorisation process, in which means of production become means of appropriating the labour and surplus-labour of others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A1","text":"The value of labour-power and the labour-time necessary for its reproduction are assumed as given constant magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A2","text":"Given the value of labour-power, the rate of surplus-value determines the mass of surplus-value produced by the individual worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A3","text":"Variable capital is the total value of the simultaneously employed labour-powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","text":"The mass of surplus-value is the product of the surplus-value per worker and the number of simultaneously employed workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5","text":"A proportional diminution of variable capital can be replaced by a proportional increase in the rate of surplus-value without altering the mass of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","text":"The average working day remains naturally below 24 hours and therefore absolutely limits the increase of the degree of exploitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","text":"Constant capital reappears in the value of the product, but does not enter into the newly formed value-product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A8","text":"Differences in the technical and organic composition of capital do not alter the law that newly formed value and surplus-value depend on living labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A9","text":"The labour socially set in motion daily can be treated as a single social working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A10","text":"Given the length of the social working day, the working population limits the mass of surplus-value; given the population, the possible extension of the working day limits it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","text":"The transformation of money or commodity into capital presupposes a minimum of advanced value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12","text":"In the process of production, capital develops into command over labour and into a coercive relation for the extraction of surplus-labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A13","text":"The production of absolute surplus-value initially subordinates existing conditions of labour without having to alter the mode of production directly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14","text":"From the standpoint of valorisation, it is not workers who apply the means of production, but means of production that apply workers and become titles of claim and coercion upon the labour of others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX1","text":"Constant capital is not a source of newly formed value or surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX2","text":"The mass of surplus-value cannot be read directly from the magnitude of total capital or from its visible technical equipment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX3","text":"The replacement of the number of workers by an increased degree of exploitation is not possible without limit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX4","text":"The supply of exploitable labour is not determined exclusively by the supply and demand for labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX5","text":"The small master who works alongside others is not thereby already a capitalist in the full sense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX6","text":"The production of absolute surplus-value is not necessarily bound to a technical revolution in the mode of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:NX7","text":"The appearance of differing masses of profit does not directly refute the law of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D1","text":"The mass of surplus-value can be determined as the product of variable capital and the rate of surplus-value: M = V · m′.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A1","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A2","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A3","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D2","text":"With the mass of surplus-value unchanged, the magnitude of variable capital and the degree of exploitation form a proportional relation of substitution.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D3","text":"The relation of substitution between the number of workers and the rate of surplus-value holds only within the absolute limit set by the length of the day.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D4","text":"With the same value of labour-power and the same degree of exploitation, the masses of value and surplus-value are directly proportional to the variable components of the capitals.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A3","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D5","text":"At the social level, the production of surplus-value is limited by the combination of population size, length of the working day, and degree of exploitation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A9","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D6","text":"The minimum of capital separates the capitalist function of the permanent appropriation, control, and valorisation of the labour of others from the mere subsistence of the self-working producer.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:D7","text":"The same technical labour-process appears, from the perspective of the worker, as metabolism with means of production, but from the perspective of valorisation as the absorption of living labour by capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A13","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SD1","text":"The production of surplus-value possesses two substitutable axes of scaling: the extensive mass of employed labour-powers and the intensive or temporal degree of exploitation of those labour-powers.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A3","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SD2","text":"Capital is structurally organized contradictorily because it seeks to diminish the stock of variable capital and the number of workers, yet derives its mass of surplus-value solely from the exploitation of living labour-power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SD3","text":"At the social level, the expansion of surplus-value is limited not only by capital, but also by time and population.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A9","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SD4","text":"The transformation of money into means of production produces not only a fund of production, but a social relation of power in which objectified value functions as a claim upon the living labour of others.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX1","text":"It must be false that surplus-value could be increased through unlimited extension of the working day independently of the number of workers.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A5","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX2","text":"It must be false that dead labour or means of production generate new value from themselves.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX3","text":"It must be false that the purchase of labour-power exhausts the process of production as a mere exchange among equals.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX4","text":"It must be false that every arbitrary possessor of money already possesses the conditions for being a capitalist.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:DNX5","text":"It must be false that the sale-value of a machine already contains the surplus-labour to be drawn from female and male workers in the future.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is self-valorising value that would in fact be independent of living labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A4","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A7","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the worker's disposal over his own means of production and over labour-time limited to his reproduction.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A11","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A12","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:SNX3","text":"Impossible is an unlimited capitalist expansion of surplus-value that simultaneously abolishes the limits of the working day, population limits, and dependence on living labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_5RUM:A6","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A9","CH_V4GB_5RUM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS1","text":"Given value of labour-power v → given necessary labour-time → determinable individual surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS2","text":"Number of labour-powers N × value per labour-power v → variable capital V = N · v.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS3","text":"Individual surplus-value × N → mass of surplus-value M = V · m′.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS4","text":"V↓ with proportional m′↑ → M constant; V↑ with proportional m′↓ → M constant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS5","text":"Working day < 24 hours → limitation of m′; social working day + working population → limitation of M.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS6","text":"Constant capital transfers value but produces no new value → displacement of the measure from total capital to its variable component.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS7","text":"Exceeding the minimum of capital → permanent appropriation and control of the labour of others → capital as a relation of command and coercion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:FGS8","text":"Consideration of the process of production as valorisation → reversal of worker and means of production → objectified value appears as subject of the appropriation of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF1","text":"Given value of labour-power → determination of necessary labour → determination of individual surplus-labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF2","text":"Individual surplus-labour → aggregation of simultaneously employed workers → magnitude of variable capital → mass of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF3","text":"Relation of variable capital and rate of surplus-value → proportional substitutability → barrier of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF4","text":"Separation of constant and variable capital → exclusion of constant capital from the formation of new value → primacy of living labour as source of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF5","text":"Aggregation into the social working day → population limit and time limit → limitation of the social production of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:AF6","text":"Minimum of capital → capitalist as personified capital → command over labour → inversion of means of labour into means of appropriating labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME1","text":"The conceptual measure of the production of surplus-value is shifted from total capital to the variable component of capital converted into labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME2","text":"The number of workers and the rate of surplus-value appear not as separate causes, but as limitedly substitutable factors of the same mass of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME3","text":"Individual labour-time is mapped as a social aggregate working day, whose limits are determined demographically and temporally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME4","text":"The minimum of capital draws a boundary between mere possession of money, artisanal self-labour, and the capitalist function of domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME5","text":"The process of production divides into labour-process and valorisation process, whose perspectives classify the same means of production oppositely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ME6","text":"Visible differences of profit and capital composition are reclassified as a problem of appearance that does not directly abolish the elementary determination of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text arithmetically determines the relation among the rate of surplus-value, variable capital, the number of workers, and the mass of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text separates the transfer of value by constant capital from the creation of value by living labour and determines capital as a coercive relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shows the capitalist logic of control that shifts the number of workers, the length of the working day, and the degree of exploitation against one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The text places dead and living labour in an asymmetrical relation, whose form of movement is the self-valorisation of value and whose limit is finite labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the basic formula M = V · m′, its relation of substitution, and its absolute temporal limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT2","text":"The historical determination of the value of labour-power and of the rate of surplus-value remains underdetermined because both are treated as given magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT3","text":"The contradiction between the law of the variable components of capital and the visible differences in profit remains deliberately unresolved within this unit and is deferred to later mediating links.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as proportional substitution is understood only as a conditional relation within the barrier of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT5","text":"The strongest point of the system lies in the connection of quantitative formula, absolute time limit, and distinction between constant and variable capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT6","text":"The determination of the minimum of capital depends on historically variable conditions and on a threshold between subsistence production and capitalist function that is not fully formalised.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_5RUM:MRT7","text":"The concluding inversion of means of production and labour follows from the perspective of valorisation, yet its ideological generalisation is asserted diagnostically rather than derived within the formula itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_5RUM:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_5RUM@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_5RUM:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 10","title":"5) Rate und Masse des Mehrwerths.","context":"Chapter 10"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR","layer":"CH","title":"1) Begriff des relativen Mehrwerths.","order":11,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_1BDR"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_1BDR@R001","sha256":"0382a3b718334a04070da48d3a68fa268fa86b2dc93931851dfb036a527693df","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS1","text":"Der Text rekonstruiert, wie Mehrarbeit bei gegebener Länge des Arbeitstags vergrößert werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS2","text":"Die Vergrößerung wird als Verschiebung der Grenze zwischen notwendiger Arbeit und Mehrarbeit bestimmt, nicht als Verlängerung des gesamten Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS3","text":"Unter der Voraussetzung des Kaufs der Arbeitskraft zu ihrem vollen Wert kann notwendige Arbeitszeit nur sinken, wenn der Wert der Arbeitskraft selbst sinkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS4","text":"Die Senkung des Werts der Arbeitskraft wird auf eine Steigerung der Produktivkraft in den Produktionsbedingungen der notwendigen Lebensmittel zurückgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS5","text":"Der Text unterscheidet den vorübergehenden Extra-Mehrwert des innovierenden Einzelkapitals von der allgemeinen Produktion relativen Mehrwerts durch gesellschaftlich verallgemeinerte Produktivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Bestimmung der Produktivkraftsteigerung als kapitalistische Technik zur Aneignung eines größeren Teils des Arbeitstags, nicht als Technik zur Verkürzung des Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A1","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft bestimmt die zu ihrer Reproduktion notwendige Arbeitszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A2","text":"Bei gegebener Länge des Arbeitstags ist die Mehrarbeit die Differenz zwischen Gesamtarbeitstag und notwendiger Arbeitszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A3","text":"Unter der Voraussetzung des Äquivalententauschs kann notwendige Arbeitszeit nur durch Senkung des Werts der Arbeitskraft verkürzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft wird durch den Wert der für ihre Reproduktion notwendigen Lebensmittel bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","text":"Steigende Produktivkraft verkürzt die gesellschaftlich notwendige Arbeitszeit zur Produktion einer Ware und senkt dadurch ihren Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A6","text":"Eine nachhaltige Steigerung der Produktivkraft setzt Veränderungen der Arbeitsmittel, Arbeitsmethoden oder beider voraus und revolutioniert damit die Produktionsweise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","text":"Produktivitätssteigerungen senken den Wert der Arbeitskraft nur, soweit sie notwendige Lebensmittel oder deren Produktionsmittel verwohlfeilern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A8","text":"Der maßgebliche Wert einer Ware wird durch die gesellschaftlich notwendige, nicht durch die individuell verausgabte Arbeitszeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","text":"Solange eine verbesserte Produktionsweise vereinzelt bleibt, kann ihr Anwender die Differenz zwischen individuellem und gesellschaftlichem Warenwert als Extra-Mehrwert realisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A10","text":"Die Konkurrenz verallgemeinert erfolgreiche Produktionsweisen und beseitigt damit die Differenz, aus der der Extra-Mehrwert entspringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11","text":"Relativer Mehrwert entsteht durch Verkürzung der notwendigen Arbeitszeit und die entsprechende Verlängerung der Mehrarbeit innerhalb eines gegebenen Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12","text":"Das Kapital ist auf realisierbaren Mehrwert gerichtet und behandelt den absoluten Wert der von ihm produzierten Ware nur als Mittel dieser Realisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A13","text":"Die Verkürzung der zur Produktion eines Warenquantums nötigen Arbeitszeit erzwingt keine Verkürzung des Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX1","text":"Relativer Mehrwert ist nicht Mehrwert aus Verlängerung des Arbeitstags; diese Form ist absoluter Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX2","text":"Die Senkung des Lohns unter den Wert der Arbeitskraft ist nicht die hier analysierte Quelle des Mehrwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX3","text":"Jede beliebige Produktivitätssteigerung senkt nicht notwendig den Wert der Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX4","text":"Der Extra-Mehrwert eines innovierenden Einzelkapitals ist nicht identisch mit dem allgemeinen relativen Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX5","text":"Der Warenwert ist nicht durch die zufällige individuelle Arbeitszeit des einzelnen Produzenten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX6","text":"Verwohlfeilerung einer Ware ist nicht unmittelbar gleichbedeutend mit einer Verminderung der notwendigen Arbeitszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX7","text":"Ökonomie an Arbeit in der Warenproduktion ist nicht notwendig Freisetzung von Zeit für den Arbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D1","text":"Bei festem Arbeitstag vergrößert sich die Mehrarbeit genau in dem Maß, in dem die notwendige Arbeitszeit sinkt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A1","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A2","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A3","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D2","text":"Eine Produktivitätssteigerung in der Produktion notwendiger Lebensmittel senkt den Wert der Arbeitskraft nur entsprechend ihrem Anteil an deren Reproduktion.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D3","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Verkürzung notwendiger Arbeitszeit ist die Summe der Verkürzungen in den Produktionszweigen, die direkt oder vermittelt die notwendigen Lebensmittel herstellen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D4","text":"Das innovierende Einzelkapital kann seine Ware unter ihrem gesellschaftlichen und über ihrem individuellen Wert verkaufen und dadurch Extra-Mehrwert erzielen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A8","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D5","text":"Die Verallgemeinerung der Produktionsmethode beseitigt den Extra-Mehrwert, erhöht aber die allgemeine Mehrwertrate nur dann, wenn sie den Wert der Arbeitskraft senkt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A10","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D6","text":"Derselbe Produktivitätsprozess kann Warenwerte senken und den Mehrwert steigern, weil die Verbilligung der notwendigen Lebensmittel die notwendige Arbeitszeit reduziert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D7","text":"Die kapitalistische Steigerung der Produktivkraft kann mit einem gleichbleibenden oder verlängerten Arbeitstag vereinbar sein.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SD1","text":"Technische Veränderung wird im kapitalistischen Produktionsverhältnis zu einer vermittelten Umverteilung der Zeit innerhalb des Arbeitstags: Weniger Zeit reproduziert die Arbeitskraft, mehr Zeit erscheint als Mehrarbeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A1","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A2","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SD2","text":"Die Konkurrenz bildet einen rekursiven Mechanismus, in dem individuelle Produktivitätsvorsprünge Extra-Mehrwert erzeugen, ihre eigene Verallgemeinerung erzwingen und damit ihre besondere Quelle wieder aufheben.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A8","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A10","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SD3","text":"Produktivitätsfortschritt erscheint für das Kapital nicht primär als Verringerung gesellschaftlicher Arbeitslast, sondern als Ausdehnung des unentgeltlich angeeigneten Zeitanteils.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A2","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SD4","text":"Die Produktivkraft besitzt zwei systemisch verschiedene Wirkungen: Sie kann jedem Einzelkapital unabhängig vom Warenzweig vorübergehend Extra-Mehrwert verschaffen, aber nur über notwendige Lebensmittel allgemeinen relativen Mehrwert erzeugen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A10","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine wertneutrale Produktivitätssteigerung, deren technische Wirkung von der Reproduktion der Arbeitskraft und der Teilung des Arbeitstags getrennt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass die Verbilligung notwendiger Lebensmittel dauerhaft nur den Konsum des Arbeiters erweitert, ohne den Wert seiner Arbeitskraft zu senken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Wertmaß, das sich unmittelbar aus der individuellen Verausgabung einzelner Produzenten ableiten ließe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein dauerhaft konkurrenzfreier Besitz einer produktiveren Produktionsweise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine kapitalistische Aneignung von Produktivitätsgewinnen, die notwendig in freie Zeit statt in Mehrarbeit überginge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Ordnung, in der die durch Produktivitätssteigerung frei werdende Zeit dem Arbeiter als Verkürzung des Arbeitstags zufällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine stabile individuelle Innovationsrente, weil ihre Konkurrenzverallgemeinerung die Differenz zwischen individuellem und gesellschaftlichem Wert aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SNX3","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist die Annahme, dass Äquivalententausch die Aneignung unbezahlter Arbeit ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS1","text":"Gegebener Arbeitstag T + Wert der Arbeitskraft V_A → notwendige Arbeitszeit N; Mehrarbeit M = T − N.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS2","text":"Voller Wertkauf der Arbeitskraft + Ausschluss der Lohnsenkung unter V_A → M kann nur durch Senkung von V_A wachsen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS3","text":"Steigerung der Produktivkraft → Verringerung gesellschaftlich notwendiger Arbeitszeit je Ware → Senkung des Warenwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS4","text":"Produktivitätssteigerung in notwendigen Lebensmitteln oder ihren Produktionsmitteln → V_A↓ → N↓ → M↑ → relativer Mehrwert↑.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS5","text":"Vereinzelte neue Produktionsweise → individueller Warenwert unter gesellschaftlichem Wert → Extra-Mehrwert bei erfolgreicher Realisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS6","text":"Konkurrenzzwang → Verallgemeinerung der neuen Produktionsweise → gesellschaftlicher Warenwert↓ → Extra-Mehrwert des Innovators↓ oder 0.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS7","text":"Produktivitätssteigerung + kapitalistische Mehrwertorientierung → keine notwendige Verkürzung von T; T kann gleich bleiben oder wachsen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF1","text":"Gegebener Arbeitstag → Grenze der Verlängerung von Mehrarbeit → Verschiebung der Teilung zwischen notwendiger Arbeit und Mehrarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF2","text":"Äquivalententausch → Ausschluss der Lohnsenkung unter den Wert der Arbeitskraft → Erfordernis einer Senkung des Arbeitskraftwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF3","text":"Senkung des Arbeitskraftwerts → Verbilligung notwendiger Lebensmittel → Produktivitätssteigerung → Umwälzung der Produktionsweise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF4","text":"Vereinzelte Produktivitätssteigerung → individueller Wert unter gesellschaftlichem Wert → temporärer Extra-Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF5","text":"Konkurrenzverallgemeinerung → Verschwinden des Extra-Mehrwerts → allgemeiner relativer Mehrwert nur bei Senkung des Arbeitskraftwerts → permanenter Produktivitätszwang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME1","text":"Die Teilung des Arbeitstags wird als veränderliche Verteilungsform derselben Gesamtzeit sichtbar, nicht als bloße Folge seiner äußeren Länge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME2","text":"Die Produktionsweise erscheint nicht als technischer Hintergrund, sondern als unmittelbarer Bestimmungsgrund des Verhältnisses von notwendiger Arbeit und Mehrarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME3","text":"Die Produktionszweige der notwendigen Lebensmittel und ihrer Produktionsmittel werden als kausale Infrastruktur der allgemeinen Mehrwertrate kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME4","text":"Die Opposition zwischen fallendem Warenwert und steigendem Mehrwert zerfällt, weil beide Wirkungen aus derselben Produktivkraftsteigerung hervorgehen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME5","text":"Das Einzelkapital und das Kapital im Allgemeinen werden als verschiedene Wirkungsebenen unterschieden: individuelle Innovation erzeugt Extra-Mehrwert, gesellschaftliche Verallgemeinerung relativen Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME6","text":"Konkurrenz wird als Erscheinungs- und Zwangsform immanenter Wertgesetze sichtbar, nicht als deren selbständige Grundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ALT1","text":"Auf der Oberflächenebene wird relativer Mehrwert als Mehrwert aus der Verkürzung notwendiger Arbeitszeit bei gegebener Länge des Arbeitstags bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ALT2","text":"Auf der strukturellen Ebene vermittelt die Reproduktion der Arbeitskraft zwischen Produktivität, Warenwert, Lohnwert und Teilung des Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ALT3","text":"Auf der metastrategischen Ebene wird individuelle technische Innovation als durch Konkurrenz erzwungene und selbstaufhebende Strategie der Mehrwertsteigerung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ALT4","text":"Auf der ontologisch-zeitlichen Ebene wird Produktivität als Macht über die gesellschaftlich notwendige Zeit und damit über die Verteilung der Zeit innerhalb des Arbeitstags gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Hauptkette von Arbeitskraftwert über notwendige Arbeitszeit, Produktivität und Warenverbilligung bis zum relativen Mehrwert zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt unterbestimmt hinsichtlich des sozialen Mechanismus, durch den verbilligte notwendige Lebensmittel tatsächlich in eine Senkung des Werts der Arbeitskraft übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern voller Wertkauf der Arbeitskraft, gegebene Länge des Arbeitstags und gesellschaftliche Wertbestimmung zugleich festgehalten werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems ist die Vermittlung von Produktivkraft, Warenverbilligung, Arbeitskraftwert und zeitlicher Aneignung innerhalb desselben Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur hängt von der komprimierten Annahme ab, dass sinkende Reproduktionskosten der Arbeitskraft nicht dauerhaft als steigender Realkonsum der Arbeiter bestehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der gesellschaftlichen Bestimmung des Warenwerts und der Darstellung außergewöhnlich produktiver Arbeit als potenzierter, im gleichen Zeitraum höheren Wert schaffender Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass die Verkürzung notwendiger Arbeitszeit keinen Schutz gegen die Verlängerung des gesamten Arbeitstags bietet und daher die zeitliche Entlastung des Arbeiters nicht impliziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur, wenn die Differenz zwischen individuellem Extra-Mehrwert und allgemeinem relativem Mehrwert sowie die sektorale Begrenzung auf notwendige Lebensmittel erhalten bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T210519170342Z_360d05d5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1) Concept of Relative Surplus-Value.","source_sha256":"0382a3b718334a04070da48d3a68fa268fa86b2dc93931851dfb036a527693df","sha256":"2f25b144d9f6b8290df02872e54d378b60b9bd6d19050794cea5a548d7ea334e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:05:19.172692+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS1","text":"The text reconstructs how surplus labour can be increased given the length of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS2","text":"The increase is determined as a displacement of the boundary between necessary labour and surplus labour, not as an extension of the entire working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS3","text":"Under the presupposition of the purchase of labour-power at its full value, necessary labour-time can decline only if the value of labour-power itself declines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS4","text":"The reduction of the value of labour-power is traced back to an increase in productive power in the conditions of production of the necessary means of subsistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS5","text":"The text distinguishes the temporary extra surplus-value of the innovating individual capital from the general production of relative surplus-value through socially generalized productivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AS6","text":"The movement concludes in the determination of the increase in productive power as a capitalist technique for appropriating a larger part of the working day, not as a technique for shortening the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A1","text":"The value of labour-power determines the labour-time necessary for its reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A2","text":"Given the length of the working day, surplus labour is the difference between the total working day and necessary labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A3","text":"Under the presupposition of exchange of equivalents, necessary labour-time can be shortened only by reducing the value of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","text":"The value of labour-power is determined by the value of the means of subsistence necessary for its reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","text":"Rising productive power shortens the socially necessary labour-time for the production of a commodity and thereby lowers its value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A6","text":"A sustained increase in productive power presupposes changes in the instruments of labour, the methods of labour, or both, and thereby revolutionizes the mode of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","text":"Increases in productivity lower the value of labour-power only insofar as they cheapen necessary means of subsistence or their means of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A8","text":"The determining value of a commodity is determined by socially necessary, not by individually expended, labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","text":"So long as an improved mode of production remains isolated, its user can realize the difference between individual and social commodity value as extra surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A10","text":"Competition generalizes successful modes of production and thereby eliminates the difference from which extra surplus-value arises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11","text":"Relative surplus-value arises through the shortening of necessary labour-time and the corresponding extension of surplus labour within a given working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12","text":"Capital is directed toward realizable surplus-value and treats the absolute value of the commodity it produces only as a means of this realization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:A13","text":"The shortening of the labour-time required for the production of a quantity of commodities does not compel a shortening of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX1","text":"Relative surplus-value is not surplus-value from the extension of the working day; this form is absolute surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX2","text":"The reduction of wages below the value of labour-power is not the source of surplus-value analysed here.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX3","text":"Any arbitrary increase in productivity does not necessarily lower the value of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX4","text":"The extra surplus-value of an innovating individual capital is not identical with general relative surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX5","text":"Commodity value is not determined by the accidental individual labour-time of the individual producer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX6","text":"The cheapening of a commodity is not immediately equivalent to a reduction of necessary labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:NX7","text":"Economy of labour in commodity production is not necessarily the release of time for the worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D1","text":"With a fixed working day, surplus labour increases exactly to the extent that necessary labour-time declines.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A1","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A2","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A3","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D2","text":"An increase in productivity in the production of necessary means of subsistence lowers the value of labour-power only in accordance with their share in its reproduction.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D3","text":"The social shortening of necessary labour-time is the sum of the shortenings in the branches of production that directly or indirectly produce the necessary means of subsistence.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D4","text":"The innovating individual capital can sell its commodity below its social value and above its individual value and thereby obtain extra surplus-value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A8","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D5","text":"The generalization of the method of production eliminates extra surplus-value, but raises the general rate of surplus-value only if it lowers the value of labour-power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A10","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D6","text":"The same process of productivity can lower commodity values and increase surplus-value, because the cheapening of necessary means of subsistence reduces necessary labour-time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:D7","text":"The capitalist increase in productive power can be compatible with an unchanged or extended working day.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SD1","text":"Technical change becomes, in the capitalist relation of production, a mediated redistribution of time within the working day: less time reproduces labour-power, more time appears as surplus labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A1","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A2","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A4","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A5","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SD2","text":"Competition forms a recursive mechanism in which individual productivity advantages generate extra surplus-value, compel their own generalization, and thereby again abolish their particular source.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A8","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A10","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SD3","text":"For capital, progress in productivity appears not primarily as a reduction of the social burden of labour, but as an expansion of the share of time appropriated without payment.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A2","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A12","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SD4","text":"Productive power has two systemically different effects: it can temporarily procure extra surplus-value for every individual capital independently of the branch of commodities, but can generate general relative surplus-value only through necessary means of subsistence.","refs":["CH_V4GB_1BDR:A7","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A9","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A10","CH_V4GB_1BDR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a value-neutral increase in productivity whose technical effect would be separate from the reproduction of labour-power and the division of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the cheapening of necessary means of subsistence permanently only expands the worker's consumption without lowering the value of his labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a measure of value that could be derived directly from the individual expenditure of individual producers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a permanently competition-free possession of a more productive mode of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a capitalist appropriation of productivity gains that would necessarily pass into free time rather than surplus labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is an order in which the time released through increased productivity accrues to the worker as a shortening of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a stable individual innovation rent, because its competitive generalization abolishes the difference between individual and social value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is the assumption that exchange of equivalents excludes the appropriation of unpaid labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS1","text":"Given working day T + value of labour-power V_A → necessary labour-time N; surplus labour M = T − N.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS2","text":"Purchase of labour-power at full value + exclusion of wage reduction below V_A → M can grow only through reduction of V_A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS3","text":"Increase in productive power → reduction of socially necessary labour-time per commodity → reduction of commodity value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS4","text":"Increase in productivity in necessary means of subsistence or their means of production → V_A↓ → N↓ → M↑ → relative surplus-value↑.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS5","text":"Isolated new mode of production → individual commodity value below social value → extra surplus-value upon successful realization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS6","text":"Compulsion of competition → generalization of the new mode of production → social commodity value↓ → innovator's extra surplus-value↓ or 0.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:FGS7","text":"Increase in productivity + capitalist orientation toward surplus-value → no necessary shortening of T; T can remain unchanged or grow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF1","text":"Given working day → limit to the extension of surplus labour → displacement of the division between necessary labour and surplus labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF2","text":"Exchange of equivalents → exclusion of wage reduction below the value of labour-power → necessity of a reduction in the value of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF3","text":"Reduction of the value of labour-power → cheapening of necessary means of subsistence → increase in productivity → revolutionizing of the mode of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF4","text":"Isolated increase in productivity → individual value below social value → temporary extra surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:AF5","text":"Competitive generalization → disappearance of extra surplus-value → general relative surplus-value only upon reduction of the value of labour-power → permanent compulsion to increase productivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME1","text":"The division of the working day becomes visible as a variable form of distribution of the same total time, not as the mere consequence of its external length.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME2","text":"The mode of production appears not as a technical background, but as the immediate determining ground of the relation between necessary labour and surplus labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME3","text":"The branches of production of necessary means of subsistence and of their means of production are mapped as the causal infrastructure of the general rate of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME4","text":"The opposition between falling commodity value and rising surplus-value disintegrates, because both effects can arise from the same increase in productive power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME5","text":"Individual capital and capital in general are distinguished as different levels of effect: individual innovation generates extra surplus-value, social generalization relative surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ME6","text":"Competition becomes visible as the form of appearance and compulsion of immanent laws of value, not as their independent foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, relative surplus-value is determined as surplus-value from the shortening of necessary labour-time given the length of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, the reproduction of labour-power mediates between productivity, commodity value, wage value, and the division of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, individual technical innovation is determined as a strategy of increasing surplus-value that is compelled by competition and self-abolishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:ALT4","text":"At the ontological-temporal level, productivity is grasped as power over socially necessary time and thereby over the distribution of time within the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the principal chain from the value of labour-power through necessary labour-time, productivity, and the cheapening of commodities to relative surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with regard to the social mechanism through which cheapened necessary means of subsistence actually pass into a reduction of the value of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as purchase of labour-power at full value, a given length of the working day, and social determination of value are maintained together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system is the mediation of productive power, the cheapening of commodities, the value of labour-power, and temporal appropriation within the same working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT5","text":"The structure depends on the compressed assumption that declining reproduction costs of labour-power do not permanently remain as increasing real consumption by the workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT6","text":"A tension remains between the social determination of commodity value and the presentation of exceptionally productive labour as intensified labour creating greater value in the same period of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT7","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the shortening of necessary labour-time offers no protection against the extension of the entire working day and therefore does not imply the worker's temporal relief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0042","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_1BDR:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if the difference between individual extra surplus-value and general relative surplus-value, as well as the sectoral limitation to necessary means of subsistence, are retained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_1BDR:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_1BDR@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_1BDR:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 11","title":"1) Begriff des relativen Mehrwerths.","context":"Chapter 11"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO","layer":"CH","title":"2) Cooperation.","order":12,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_2COO"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_2COO@R001","sha256":"8f5e62c35b801b4e4d66a66b8a0ab6084673542c6e1c29308cb4dbbbbb5a894e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem besteht darin, wie die quantitative Zusammenfassung vieler Lohnarbeiter unter einem Kapital eine qualitative Veränderung des realen Arbeitsprozesses erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS2","text":"Kooperation wird als planmäßige Verbindung vieler Arbeiten innerhalb desselben oder zusammenhängender Produktionsprozesse bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS3","text":"Der Beweisgang verbindet logisch-genetische Rekonstruktion, produktionsökonomische Analyse und Kritik der naturalisierten Kapitalherrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung führt von additiver Wertbildung über Durchschnittsbildung und gemeinsamen Produktionsmittelkonsum zur emergenten Produktivkraft des Gesamtarbeiters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS5","text":"Die produktive Vergesellschaftung setzt unter Lohnarbeitsbedingungen die Konzentration von Arbeitskräften und Produktionsmitteln in einem Kapital voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS6","text":"Die technisch erforderliche Koordination wird innerhalb des Verwertungsprozesses zur antagonistischen und despotischen Kommandofunktion des Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS7","text":"Die unbezahlte gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft erscheint dadurch als Eigenkraft des Kapitals; Kooperation wird zur ersten und fortbestehenden Grundform der realen Subsumtion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A1","text":"Die eigentlich kapitalistische Produktion beginnt erst mit der gleichzeitigen Beschäftigung einer hinreichend großen Arbeiterzahl durch dasselbe individuelle Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A2","text":"Kooperation ist das planmäßige Zusammenwirken vieler Arbeiter in demselben oder in zusammenhängenden Produktionsprozessen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A3","text":"Bei unveränderter Mehrwertrate wächst die Mehrwertmasse proportional zur Zahl der gleichzeitig beschäftigten Arbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A4","text":"In der Wertbildung bleibt die Arbeit vereinigter Arbeiter zunächst die additive Summe individueller Arbeitszeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A5","text":"In einer hinreichend großen Arbeitermasse kompensieren sich individuelle Leistungsabweichungen zur gesellschaftlichen Durchschnittsarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A6","text":"Der gemeinsame Konsum von Produktionsmitteln vermindert den auf das einzelne Produkt übertragenen Wertanteil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","text":"Kooperation erzeugt eine gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft, die nicht auf die Summe isolierter individueller Kräfte reduzierbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A8","text":"Kooperation ordnet Einzelarbeiten als gleichzeitige, kontinuierliche, räumlich koordinierte oder funktional ergänzende Momente eines Gesamtarbeiters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A9","text":"Kapitalistische Kooperation setzt die gleichzeitige Verfügung desselben Kapitals über viele Arbeitskräfte und konzentrierte Produktionsmittel voraus; ihre Stufenleiter hängt vom Umfang dieser Verfügung ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","text":"Gesellschaftliche Arbeit auf größerer Stufenleiter erfordert eine koordinierende Leitungsfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","text":"Unter kapitalistischen Bedingungen liegt die Einheit der kooperierenden Arbeiten außerhalb der Arbeiter im sie zusammenführenden Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A12","text":"Der kapitalistische Produktionsprozess ist zugleich gesellschaftlicher Arbeitsprozess und Verwertungsprozess des Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A13","text":"Der bestimmende Zweck kapitalistischer Produktion ist die größtmögliche Selbstverwertung des Kapitals durch Mehrwertproduktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A14","text":"Der kapitalistische Arbeitsprozess ist durch den Antagonismus zwischen Verwerter und ausgebeuteter Arbeitskraft sowie durch fremdes Eigentum an den Produktionsmitteln strukturiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A15","text":"Der Kapitalist kauft individuelle Arbeitskräfte, nicht die erst im Produktionsprozess entstehende kombinierte Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A16","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft der Kooperation entsteht ohne gesonderten Preis innerhalb des bereits vom Kapital angeeigneten Arbeitsprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A17","text":"Kapitalistische Kooperation ist eine historisch spezifische, auf freier Lohnarbeit beruhende Form der Kooperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A18","text":"Kooperation ist die erste und fortbestehende Grundform der wirklichen Veränderung des Arbeitsprozesses durch seine Subsumtion unter das Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX1","text":"Vereinzelte Lohnarbeit oder bloße Warenproduktion bildet noch keine eigentlich kapitalistische Produktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX2","text":"Der gleichzeitige Kauf vieler Arbeitskräfte ist nicht bereits deren Kooperation; diese beginnt erst im Produktionsprozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX3","text":"Einfache Kooperation setzt weder entwickelte Arbeitsteilung noch Maschinerie voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0071","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX4","text":"Die Vereinigung vieler Arbeiter erhöht für sich weder die Mehrwertrate noch den pro Arbeitsstunde geschaffenen Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX5","text":"Die Produktivkraft kombinierter Arbeit ist keine bloße Addition individueller Produktivkräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX6","text":"Der gesellschaftliche Charakter gemeinsam benutzter Arbeitsmittel setzt noch keinen unmittelbar gemeinsamen Arbeitsvollzug voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX7","text":"Der Kapitalist ist nicht Kapitalist, weil er industrieller Leiter ist; er übernimmt die Leitung, weil er Kapitalist ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0058","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX8","text":"Technische Koordination und antagonistische Kontrolle sind keine identischen Leitungsfunktionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX9","text":"Kooperation als solche ist keine ausschließlich kapitalistische Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX10","text":"Kapitalistische Kooperation beruht weder auf Gemeineigentum noch auf unmittelbarer persönlicher Knechtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX11","text":"Einfache Kooperation bildet keine abgeschlossene Entwicklungsepoche der kapitalistischen Produktionsweise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D1","text":"Die Zusammenfassung vieler Arbeiter erlaubt dem einzelnen Kapital, gesellschaftliche Durchschnittsarbeit und damit das Gesetz der Verwertung regelmäßiger zu realisieren als der Kleinproduzent.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A3","CH_V4GB_2COO:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D2","text":"Gemeinsamer Produktionsmittelkonsum senkt den konstanten Wertanteil des Produkts und, soweit Arbeiterkonsumgüter verbilligt werden, den Wert der Arbeitskraft.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D3","text":"Der kombinierte Arbeitstag erzeugt in gleicher Zeit mehr Gebrauchswert oder benötigt für denselben Nutzeffekt weniger Arbeitszeit als die entsprechende Summe vereinzelter Arbeitstage.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","CH_V4GB_2COO:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D4","text":"Quantitative Vergrößerung schlägt auf der Gebrauchswertseite in qualitative Produktivitätssteigerung um, ohne die additive Logik der Wertbildung aufzuheben.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A1","CH_V4GB_2COO:A4","CH_V4GB_2COO:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D5","text":"Die Konzentration von variablem und konstantem Kapital wird zur materiellen Bedingung der Verwandlung zersplitterter Arbeitsprozesse in einen gesellschaftlichen Gesamtprozess.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A1","CH_V4GB_2COO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D6","text":"Die allgemeine Koordinationsfunktion gesellschaftlicher Arbeit erscheint als Funktion des Kapitals, weil die produktive Einheit der Arbeiter durch das Kapital hergestellt wird.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D7","text":"Kapitalistische Leitung verbindet sachliche Koordination mit Ausbeutungs-, Widerstands- und Eigentumskontrolle und nimmt deshalb eine despotische Form an.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","CH_V4GB_2COO:A12","CH_V4GB_2COO:A13","CH_V4GB_2COO:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D8","text":"Mit wachsender Kooperationsstufe verselbständigt sich das Kapitalkommando in einer bezahlten Hierarchie von Leitern und Aufsehern.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A9","CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D9","text":"Weil nur die individuellen Arbeitskräfte bezahlt werden, kann das Kapital die Produktivität ihrer Kombination ohne besonderes Äquivalent aneignen und als eigene Produktivität darstellen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A15","CH_V4GB_2COO:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D10","text":"Das Kapital fungiert zugleich als historisches Mittel der Vergesellschaftung des Arbeitsprozesses und als Form seiner profitgerichteten Ausbeutung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A13","CH_V4GB_2COO:A17","CH_V4GB_2COO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0069","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD1","text":"Vergesellschaftung und Entfremdung sind im kapitalistischen Kooperationsprozess nicht getrennte Vorgänge: Dieselbe Verbindung, die den Gesamtarbeiter erzeugt, stellt ihm seine Einheit als fremde Macht gegenüber.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A15","CH_V4GB_2COO:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD2","text":"Die scheinbar immanente Produktivkraft des Kapitals ist die verdinglichte Erscheinungsform einer zwischen Arbeitern erzeugten gesellschaftlichen Relation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD3","text":"Die sachliche Notwendigkeit von Koordination begründet weder die Notwendigkeit kapitalistischen Eigentums noch die despotische Form des Kommandos.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A14","CH_V4GB_2COO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD4","text":"Die Arbeiter treten auf dem Markt als selbständige Eigentümer individueller Arbeitskräfte auf und werden im Produktionsprozess zu unselbständigen Organen eines fremd beherrschten Gesamtkörpers.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A14","CH_V4GB_2COO:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD5","text":"Die reale Subsumtion beginnt als organisatorische Transformation des Arbeitsprozesses, bevor Arbeitsteilung oder Maschinerie seine technische Grundlage umwälzen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A1","CH_V4GB_2COO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0071","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD6","text":"Kapitalistische Konzentration verlagert die gesellschaftliche Durchschnittsnorm aus einem nachträglichen Gesamtausgleich in den inneren Betrieb des einzelnen Kapitals.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A5","CH_V4GB_2COO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD7","text":"Der Gesamtarbeiter überwindet individuelle Zeit- und Raumgrenzen, indem er Arbeitsmasse verdichtet, Operationen synchronisiert und räumliche Angriffspunkte vervielfacht oder konzentriert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","CH_V4GB_2COO:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX1","text":"Ein atomistisches Modell, das gesellschaftliche Produktivität vollständig aus persönlichen Fähigkeiten einzelner Arbeiter erklärt, muss falsch sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX2","text":"Der freie Arbeitsvertrag kann die im Produktionsprozess entstehende kollektive Abhängigkeit nicht vollständig erklären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX3","text":"Eigentum an Produktionsbedingungen kann nicht als kausaler Ursprung der gesellschaftlichen Kombinationskraft gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX4","text":"Industrielle Leitung und Eigentümerherrschaft dürfen nicht als transhistorisch notwendige Einheit behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0058","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX5","text":"Koordination kann innerhalb eines auf Selbstverwertung gerichteten Prozesses keine neutrale, vom Klassenverhältnis unberührte Funktion bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX6","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Organisation von Arbeit darf weder auf kapitalistische Produktion noch auf entwickelte Arbeitsteilung und Maschinerie zurückgeführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0071","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SNX1","text":"Strukturell abwesend ist der Gesamtarbeiter als Eigentümer und selbstbestimmter Leiter seiner eigenen gesellschaftlichen Produktivkraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SNX2","text":"Für die kombinierte Arbeitskraft existiert weder ein eigener Kaufakt noch ein besonderes Äquivalent; ihre Aneignung bleibt außerhalb der Vertragsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SNX3","text":"Die kapitalistische Kooperation sperrt die Möglichkeit, gesellschaftliche Einheit unmittelbar aus den Beziehungen der Arbeiter untereinander statt aus der Einheit des Kapitals hervorgehen zu lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SNX4","text":"Die autonome Arbeiterassoziation erscheint als mögliche Gegenform, wird jedoch nicht in die positive Architektur der Kooperation integriert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS1","text":"Kapitalminimum → hinreichende Arbeiterzahl → proportionale Mehrwertmasse → Entbindung des Arbeitsanwenders von unmittelbarer Arbeit → vollgültige Kapitalistenfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS2","text":"Gleichzeitiger Kauf vieler Einzelarbeitskräfte + Konzentration von Produktionsmitteln → gemeinsamer Produktionsraum → Möglichkeit planmäßiger Kooperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS3","text":"Wertpfad: additive Einzelarbeiten → statistischer Ausgleich individueller Abweichungen → gesellschaftliche Durchschnittsarbeit → regelmäßigere Verwertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS4","text":"Gebrauchswertpfad: gemeinsamer Produktionsmittelkonsum + Synchronisation + funktionale Ergänzung + räumliche Koordination → spezifische gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS5","text":"Individuelle Verkäufe von Arbeitskraft → Eintritt in den kapitalistischen Arbeitsprozess → Entstehung unbezahlter Kombinationskraft → Aneignung durch das Kapital → Erscheinung als Kapitalproduktivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS6","text":"Vergrößerter Gesamtarbeiter → Koordinationsbedarf + Arbeiterwiderstand + fremdes Eigentum → doppelte Leitungsfunktion → despotisches Kommando → delegierte Aufsichtshierarchie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS7","text":"Gemeineigentum / unmittelbare Knechtschaft / freie Lohnarbeit → unterschiedliche historische Träger derselben allgemeinen Möglichkeit kooperativer Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS8","text":"Quantitative Konzentration → qualitative Veränderung des Arbeitsprozesses → reale Subsumtion → einfache Kooperation als persistierende Basisschicht entwickelter kapitalistischer Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AF1","text":"Quantitative Konzentration vieler Arbeiter unter einem Kapital → wertseitige Durchschnittsbildung und gemeinsamer Produktionsmittelkonsum → Entstehung des Gesamtarbeiters → spezifische gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft → materielle Abhängigkeit von Kapitalkonzentration → externalisierte Leitung → antagonistisch-despotisches Kommando → unbezahlte Aneignung und Verdinglichung der Kombinationskraft → historische Spezifikation kapitalistischer Kooperation → Grundform der realen Subsumtion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME1","text":"Eine Mehrzahl von Arbeitern wird von einer numerischen Summe in einen funktional gegliederten Gesamtarbeiter umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME2","text":"Produktivität wird von einer Eigenschaft isolierter Individuen zu einer emergenten Relation zwischen koordinierten Arbeiten verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME3","text":"Gleichartigkeit der Einzelarbeiten schließt funktionale Differenzierung nicht mehr aus; gleiche Verrichtungen können Phasen einer Gesamtoperation bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME4","text":"Wertbildung und Gebrauchswertproduktion werden als getrennte Wirkungsfelder derselben Arbeiterkonzentration sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME5","text":"Kapital wird von einer bloßen Wertsumme zum Organisations- und Kommandozentrum gesellschaftlicher Arbeit neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME6","text":"Industrielle Leitung zerfällt in eine allgemeine Koordinationsfunktion und eine historisch spezifische Ausbeutungs- und Kontrollfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME7","text":"Die scheinbare Trennung der Produktionsmittelökonomie von der Arbeitsproduktivität wird als Effekt der Verselbständigung der Arbeitsbedingungen gegenüber den Arbeitern lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME8","text":"Kooperation wird nach Eigentums-, Abhängigkeits- und Vertragsformen historisiert, statt mit ihrer kapitalistischen Gestalt gleichgesetzt zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME9","text":"Einfache Kooperation wird nicht als vergangene Stufe, sondern als fortwirkende Basisschicht von Arbeitsteilung und Maschinerie kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0071","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die gleichzeitige planmäßige Beschäftigung vieler Arbeiter steigert den Nutzeffekt eines gegebenen Gesamtarbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ALT2","text":"Structural — Kapitalkonzentration, gemeinsamer Produktionsmittelkonsum, Durchschnittsbildung, Leitung und Kontrolle erzeugen den kapitalistisch organisierten Gesamtarbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse trennt technische Koordination von Kapitalherrschaft und rekodiert vermeintliche Kapitalproduktivität als angeeignete gesellschaftliche Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft existiert als emergente Kraft eines relationalen Gesamtkörpers, dessen Gleichzeitigkeit individuelle Zeit verdichtet und dessen räumliche Organisation Wirkungssphären erweitert oder konzentriert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von quantitativer Arbeiterkonzentration zu Produktivkraft, Kommando und kapitalistischer Aneignung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die genaue Mindestgröße des Kapitals, die Messung durchschnittlicher Arbeitsfähigkeit und die quantitative Größe einzelner Kooperationseffekte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern additive Wertbildung und qualitative Gebrauchswertsteigerung strikt unterschieden bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist die Scharnierstruktur zwischen allgemeinem Koordinationsbedarf, kapitalistischer Funktionsaneignung und antagonistisch-despotischer Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT5","text":"Die behauptete historische Notwendigkeit des Kapitals für die Vergesellschaftung bleibt in ihrer Reichweite unbestimmt, da nichtkapitalistische Großkooperation zugleich vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0069","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT6","text":"Die Möglichkeit erfolgreicher Arbeiterassoziation destabilisiert die Behauptung, dass Lohnarbeiter nur durch dasselbe Kapital kooperieren können; die Einschränkung auf kapitalistische Kooperation löst diese Spannung nur teilweise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT7","text":"Die Bezeichnung der gesellschaftlichen Produktivkraft als für das Kapital kostenlos komprimiert den Unterschied zwischen fehlendem Sonderäquivalent und den realen Auslagen für ihre materiellen Bedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von Konzentration über Emergenz und Leitung zur Verdinglichung und historischen Bestimmung der Kooperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T210650214613Z_000689a1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2) Cooperation.","source_sha256":"8f5e62c35b801b4e4d66a66b8a0ab6084673542c6e1c29308cb4dbbbbb5a894e","sha256":"84a0d90136cba2ec9a5222098c0fbf2a99364b7b8f5ae44161a10c3c78dfe11c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:06:50.215563+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS1","text":"The central problem consists in how the quantitative aggregation of many wage labourers under one capital produces a qualitative change in the real labour process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS2","text":"Cooperation is defined as the planned combination of many labours within the same or interconnected production processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS3","text":"The course of proof combines logical-genetic reconstruction, production-economic analysis, and critique of naturalized capitalist domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS4","text":"The movement proceeds from additive value formation through averaging and the common consumption of means of production to the emergent productive power of the collective worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS5","text":"Under conditions of wage labour, productive socialization presupposes the concentration of labour powers and means of production in one capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS6","text":"Within the valorization process, technically necessary coordination becomes capital's antagonistic and despotic command function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AS7","text":"The unpaid social productive power thereby appears as capital's own power; cooperation becomes the first and enduring basic form of real subsumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A1","text":"Properly capitalist production begins only with the simultaneous employment of a sufficiently large number of workers by the same individual capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A2","text":"Cooperation is the planned working together of many workers in the same or interconnected production processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A3","text":"Given an unchanged rate of surplus value, the mass of surplus value grows in proportion to the number of workers simultaneously employed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A4","text":"In value formation, the labour of united workers initially remains the additive sum of individual labour-times.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A5","text":"In a sufficiently large mass of workers, individual deviations in performance compensate one another into socially average labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A6","text":"The common consumption of means of production diminishes the share of value transferred to the individual product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","text":"Cooperation produces a social productive power that cannot be reduced to the sum of isolated individual powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A8","text":"Cooperation orders individual labours as simultaneous, continuous, spatially coordinated, or functionally complementary moments of a collective worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A9","text":"Capitalist cooperation presupposes the simultaneous disposal by the same capital over many labour powers and concentrated means of production; its scale depends on the extent of this disposal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","text":"Social labour on a larger scale requires a coordinating function of direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","text":"Under capitalist conditions, the unity of cooperating labours lies outside the workers, in the capital that brings them together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A12","text":"The capitalist production process is at once a social labour process and capital's valorization process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A13","text":"The determining purpose of capitalist production is the greatest possible self-valorization of capital through the production of surplus value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A14","text":"The capitalist labour process is structured by the antagonism between the valorizer and exploited labour power, as well as by alien ownership of the means of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A15","text":"The capitalist purchases individual labour powers, not the combined labour power that arises only in the production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A16","text":"The social productive power of cooperation arises without a separate price within the labour process already appropriated by capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A17","text":"Capitalist cooperation is a historically specific form of cooperation based on free wage labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:A18","text":"Cooperation is the first and enduring basic form of the real transformation of the labour process through its subsumption under capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX1","text":"Isolated wage labour or mere commodity production does not yet constitute properly capitalist production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX2","text":"The simultaneous purchase of many labour powers is not already their cooperation; this begins only in the production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX3","text":"Simple cooperation presupposes neither a developed division of labour nor machinery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0071","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX4","text":"The union of many workers does not by itself increase either the rate of surplus value or the value created per hour of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX5","text":"The productive power of combined labour is not a mere addition of individual productive powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX6","text":"The social character of jointly used instruments of labour does not yet presuppose an immediately common execution of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX7","text":"The capitalist is not a capitalist because he is an industrial manager; he assumes management because he is a capitalist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0058","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX8","text":"Technical coordination and antagonistic control are not identical functions of direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX9","text":"Cooperation as such is not an exclusively capitalist form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX10","text":"Capitalist cooperation rests neither on common property nor on immediate personal servitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:NX11","text":"Simple cooperation does not constitute a self-contained epoch of development of the capitalist mode of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0070","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D1","text":"The aggregation of many workers enables the individual capital to realize socially average labour, and thus the law of valorization, more regularly than the small producer.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A3","CH_V4GB_2COO:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D2","text":"The common consumption of means of production lowers the constant share of value in the product and, insofar as workers' means of consumption are cheapened, the value of labour power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D3","text":"In the same time, the combined working day produces more use-value, or requires less labour-time for the same useful effect, than the corresponding sum of isolated working days.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","CH_V4GB_2COO:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D4","text":"Quantitative enlargement turns, on the use-value side, into a qualitative increase in productivity, without abolishing the additive logic of value formation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A1","CH_V4GB_2COO:A4","CH_V4GB_2COO:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D5","text":"The concentration of variable and constant capital becomes the material condition for transforming fragmented labour processes into a social total process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A1","CH_V4GB_2COO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D6","text":"The general coordinating function of social labour appears as a function of capital because the productive unity of the workers is brought about by capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D7","text":"Capitalist management combines objective coordination with control over exploitation, resistance, and property, and therefore assumes a despotic form.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","CH_V4GB_2COO:A12","CH_V4GB_2COO:A13","CH_V4GB_2COO:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D8","text":"With a growing scale of cooperation, capital's command becomes autonomous in a paid hierarchy of managers and overseers.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A9","CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D9","text":"Because only the individual labour powers are paid, capital can appropriate the productivity of their combination without a special equivalent and represent it as its own productivity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A15","CH_V4GB_2COO:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:D10","text":"Capital functions at once as a historical means of socializing the labour process and as the form of its profit-directed exploitation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A13","CH_V4GB_2COO:A17","CH_V4GB_2COO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0069","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD1","text":"Socialization and alienation are not separate processes in the capitalist process of cooperation: the same connection that produces the collective worker confronts it with its unity as an alien power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A15","CH_V4GB_2COO:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD2","text":"The seemingly immanent productive power of capital is the reified form of appearance of a social relation produced among workers.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD3","text":"The objective necessity of coordination establishes neither the necessity of capitalist property nor the despotic form of command.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A10","CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A14","CH_V4GB_2COO:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD4","text":"On the market, workers appear as independent owners of individual labour powers and become, in the production process, dependent organs of a collectively constituted body ruled by another.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A11","CH_V4GB_2COO:A14","CH_V4GB_2COO:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD5","text":"Real subsumption begins as an organizational transformation of the labour process before division of labour or machinery revolutionizes its technical basis.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A1","CH_V4GB_2COO:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0071","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD6","text":"Capitalist concentration shifts the social average norm from a subsequent overall equalization into the internal operation of the individual capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A5","CH_V4GB_2COO:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SD7","text":"The collective worker overcomes individual limits of time and space by condensing labour mass, synchronizing operations, and multiplying or concentrating spatial points of application.","refs":["CH_V4GB_2COO:A7","CH_V4GB_2COO:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX1","text":"An atomistic model that explains social productivity entirely from the personal capacities of individual workers must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX2","text":"The free labour contract cannot fully explain the collective dependency arising in the production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX3","text":"Ownership of the conditions of production cannot count as the causal origin of social combinatory power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX4","text":"Industrial management and the rule of owners must not be treated as a transhistorically necessary unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0058","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX5","text":"Within a process directed toward self-valorization, coordination cannot remain a neutral function untouched by the class relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:DNX6","text":"The social organization of labour must be traced back neither to capitalist production nor to a developed division of labour and machinery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0071","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SNX1","text":"Structurally absent is the collective worker as owner and self-determining director of its own social productive power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SNX2","text":"For combined labour power, neither an act of purchase of its own nor a special equivalent exists; its appropriation remains outside the contractual form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SNX3","text":"Capitalist cooperation blocks the possibility of allowing social unity to arise directly from the relations of workers among themselves rather than from the unity of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:SNX4","text":"The autonomous association of workers appears as a possible counter-form, but is not integrated into the positive architecture of cooperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS1","text":"Capital minimum → sufficient number of workers → proportional mass of surplus value → release of the user of labour from immediate labour → fully valid capitalist function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS2","text":"Simultaneous purchase of many individual labour powers + concentration of means of production → common production space → possibility of planned cooperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS3","text":"Value path: additive individual labours → statistical equalization of individual deviations → socially average labour → more regular valorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS4","text":"Use-value path: common consumption of means of production + synchronization + functional complementarity + spatial coordination → specific social productive power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS5","text":"Individual sales of labour power → entry into the capitalist labour process → emergence of unpaid combinatory power → appropriation by capital → appearance as capital productivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS6","text":"Enlarged collective worker → need for coordination + worker resistance + alien property → dual function of direction → despotic command → delegated supervisory hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0055","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS7","text":"Common property / immediate servitude / free wage labour → different historical bearers of the same general possibility of cooperative labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:FGS8","text":"Quantitative concentration → qualitative transformation of the labour process → real subsumption → simple cooperation as the persistent basal layer of developed capitalist forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:AF1","text":"Quantitative concentration of many workers under one capital → averaging on the value side and common consumption of means of production → emergence of the collective worker → specific social productive power → material dependence on capital concentration → externalized direction → antagonistic-despotic command → unpaid appropriation and reification of combinatory power → historical specification of capitalist cooperation → basic form of real subsumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME1","text":"A plurality of workers is reclassified from a numerical sum into a functionally articulated collective worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME2","text":"Productivity is shifted from a property of isolated individuals to an emergent relation among coordinated labours.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME3","text":"Uniformity of individual labours no longer excludes functional differentiation; identical operations can form phases of a total operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME4","text":"Value formation and use-value production become visible as distinct fields of effect of the same concentration of workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME5","text":"Capital is redefined from a mere sum of value into the organizational and command centre of social labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME6","text":"Industrial management divides into a general function of coordination and a historically specific function of exploitation and control.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME7","text":"The apparent separation of the economy of means of production from labour productivity becomes legible as an effect of the autonomization of the conditions of labour vis-à-vis the workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME8","text":"Cooperation is historicized according to forms of property, dependency, and contract, instead of being equated with its capitalist shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ME9","text":"Simple cooperation is mapped not as a past stage but as an enduring basal layer of division of labour and machinery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0070","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0071","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ALT1","text":"Surface — The simultaneous planned employment of many workers increases the useful effect of a given aggregate working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ALT2","text":"Structural — Capital concentration, common consumption of means of production, averaging, management, and control produce the capitalistically organized collective worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis separates technical coordination from capitalist domination and recodes purported capital productivity as appropriated social labour power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Social productive power exists as the emergent power of a relational collective body, whose simultaneity condenses individual time and whose spatial organization expands or concentrates spheres of effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from quantitative concentration of workers to productive power, command, and capitalist appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT2","text":"The exact minimum size of capital, the measurement of average capacity for labour, and the quantitative magnitude of individual cooperation effects remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that additive value formation and qualitative increase in use-value remain strictly distinct.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT4","text":"The hinge structure between the general need for coordination, capitalist appropriation of function, and antagonistic-despotic form is strongest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT5","text":"The claimed historical necessity of capital for socialization remains indeterminate in its scope, since non-capitalist large-scale cooperation is simultaneously presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0065","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0069","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT6","text":"The possibility of successful workers' association destabilizes the claim that wage labourers can cooperate only through the same capital; the restriction to capitalist cooperation resolves this tension only partially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT7","text":"The designation of social productive power as free of charge for capital compresses the distinction between the absence of a special equivalent and the actual expenditures for its material conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_2COO:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from concentration through emergence and management to reification and the historical determination of cooperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_2COO:P0068","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_2COO@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_2COO:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 12","title":"2) Cooperation.","context":"Chapter 12"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA","layer":"CH","title":"3) Theilung der Arbeit und Manufaktur.","order":13,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_3TDA"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_3TDA@R001","sha256":"962a95d1638914338edfee215db02e7f6cdfc51ad0220d7a04621e6f03e3a36c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS1","text":"Erklärungsbedürftig ist, wie handwerkliche Tätigkeit in einen kapitalistisch beherrschten gesellschaftlichen Produktionsmechanismus überführt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS2","text":"Die Kombination verschiedenartiger Handwerke und die Zerlegung gleichartiger Handwerke konvergieren in derselben Gestalt des spezialisierten Teilarbeiters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS3","text":"Die Manufaktur steigert Produktivität durch Spezialisierung, Kontinuität, Gleichzeitigkeit, Werkzeugdifferenzierung und proportionierte Abhängigkeit der Teilfunktionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS4","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft des Gesamtarbeiters erscheint aufgrund der kapitalistischen Verfügung über den Produktionsmechanismus als Produktivkraft des Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS5","text":"Die planmäßige Despotie innerhalb der Werkstatt und die anarchische Vermittlung der gesellschaftlichen Arbeit durch den Markt bilden verschiedene, einander bedingende Organisationsweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS6","text":"Die Steigerung der gesellschaftlichen Produktivkraft wird durch Entselbständigung, Entwertung und Verkrüppelung des individuellen Arbeiters erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS7","text":"Das genealogisch-diagnostische Argument bewegt sich von der doppelten Entstehung über den inneren Mechanismus und seine Herrschaftseffekte zu dem Widerspruch, der die Ablösung der handwerklichen Grundlage durch Maschinerie vorbereitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A1","text":"Die Manufaktur ist die spezifisch kapitalistische Form einer auf Teilung der Arbeit beruhenden Kooperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A2","text":"Ihre materielle Ausgangsbedingung ist die gleichzeitige Beschäftigung vieler Arbeiter unter dem Kommando desselben Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A3","text":"Die Manufaktur entsteht entweder durch Kombination verschiedenartiger Handwerke oder durch Zerlegung eines gleichartigen Handwerks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4","text":"Beide Entstehungswege enden in einem Produktionsmechanismus, dessen spezialisierte Organe Menschen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A5","text":"Das handwerkliche Geschick des einzelnen Arbeiters bleibt die technologische Grundlage der Manufaktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","text":"Die ausschließliche Teilfunktion eignet sich den Arbeiter lebenslang als ihr einseitiges Organ an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","text":"Die dauernde Wiederholung einer begrenzten Operation steigert deren Produktivität und vermindert Wechsel- und Übergangsverluste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8","text":"Die Zerlegung des Arbeitsprozesses differenziert und spezialisiert die Werkzeuge und schafft damit eine materielle Bedingung der Maschinerie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A9","text":"Die Beschaffenheit des Produkts erzeugt entweder eine heterogene Montage selbständiger Teilprodukte oder eine organische Folge zusammenhängender Stufenprozesse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10","text":"Die organische Manufaktur verwandelt zeitlich aufeinanderfolgende Operationen in gleichzeitige und quantitativ proportionierte Teilfunktionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","text":"Die manufakturmäßige Arbeitsteilung wird durch den Verkauf verschiedener Arbeitskräfte an denselben Kapitalisten und durch dessen konzentriertes Eigentum an den Produktionsmitteln vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Arbeitsteilung wird durch den Warenaustausch unabhängiger Produzenten mit zersplitterten Produktionsmitteln vermittelt und erst nachträglich durch Marktzwänge proportioniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A13","text":"Die Manufaktur setzt eine gereifte, durch Warenzirkulation vermittelte gesellschaftliche Arbeitsteilung voraus und erweitert diese rückwirkend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0078","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A14","text":"Die proportionierte Gliederung der Teilfunktionen schreibt ein wachsendes Minimum an gleichzeitig beschäftigten Arbeitern und vorgeschossenem Kapital vor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0107","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A15","text":"Die Gliederung der Teilfunktionen erzeugt eine Hierarchie qualifizierter und unqualifizierter Arbeitskräfte mit abgestuften Ausbildungskosten und Löhnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A16","text":"Die Verminderung der Ausbildungskosten senkt den Wert der Arbeitskraft und erweitert die für das Kapital verfügbare Mehrarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17","text":"Die gesellschaftlichen und geistigen Produktivkräfte des Gesamtarbeiters treten den Teilarbeitern als Eigentum und Macht des Kapitals gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0114","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A18","text":"Die fortbestehende handwerkliche Grundlage begrenzt technische Einheit, Skalierung und Unterordnung der Arbeit und gerät mit den von der Manufaktur erzeugten Produktionsbedürfnissen in Widerspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX1","text":"Die Manufaktur ist keine bloße räumliche Zusammenstellung unverändert fortarbeitender Handwerker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX2","text":"Die Maschine ist nicht das herrschende Produktionsorgan der Manufaktur; deren spezifische Maschinerie ist der kombinierte Gesamtarbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0059","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX3","text":"Die Zerlegung des Produktionsprozesses ist noch keine wissenschaftliche Analyse, sondern bleibt an handwerksmäßig ausführbare Teiloperationen gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX4","text":"Der einzelne Teilarbeiter produziert keine selbständige Ware.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0086","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX5","text":"Die Arbeitsteilung innerhalb der Werkstatt ist nicht nur eine räumlich sichtbarere Form der gesellschaftlichen Arbeitsteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0083","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX6","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Verteilung der Arbeit folgt keinem bewusst vorausgesetzten Proportionalitätsplan.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX7","text":"Die manufakturmäßige Arbeitsteilung ist keine allen Gesellschaftsformationen gemeinsame Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX8","text":"Die konkrete Arbeitsteilung entspringt nicht fertig aus dem Erfindungsgenie des Kapitalisten, sondern wird empirisch gefunden, stabilisiert und tradiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0127","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0129","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX9","text":"Die Kombination mehrerer Manufakturen erzeugt auf handwerklicher Grundlage keine wirkliche technologische Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0054","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX10","text":"Die gesteigerte gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft erscheint nicht als selbständige Macht der Arbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX11","text":"Zünftige Gewerbesonderung führt nicht von selbst zur Manufaktur, solange Arbeiter und Produktionsmittel verbunden bleiben und Kapital Arbeitskraft nicht unmittelbar kommandiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0102","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0104","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D1","text":"Die Verbindung zuvor selbständiger Handwerke und die Verselbständigung zuvor verbundener Operationen erzeugen dieselbe Struktur komplementärer Teilfunktionen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A3","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D2","text":"Die Ware wird zum gesellschaftlichen Produkt des Gesamtarbeiters, weil keine einzelne Teilfunktion ein selbständiges Endprodukt hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0086","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D3","text":"Repetition, Beseitigung von Tätigkeitswechseln und gleichzeitige Ausführung der Produktionsphasen erhöhen Ausstoß und Arbeitsintensität.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D4","text":"Das spezialisierte Werkzeug wird zur materiellen Verlängerung des spezialisierten Teilarbeiters und zugleich zum Ausgangselement späterer Maschinenkombinationen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D5","text":"Die gesellschaftlich notwendige Arbeitszeit tritt innerhalb der Manufaktur nicht nur als äußerer Konkurrenzzwang, sondern als technisches Gesetz des gekoppelten Produktionsprozesses auf.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D6","text":"Festgelegte Verhältnisse zwischen den Teilfunktionen erlauben Produktionserweiterung nur durch proportionale Vervielfältigung der Arbeitergruppen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0047","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D7","text":"Die Ausbildung einseitiger Virtuosität erzeugt zugleich unqualifizierte Arbeit als besondere, von komplexeren Tätigkeiten abgetrennte Funktion.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D8","text":"Produktivitätssteigerung und Verbilligung der Arbeitskraft machen die Manufaktur zu einer Methode der Erzeugung relativen Mehrwerts.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A16","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D9","text":"Marktliche Unabhängigkeit zwischen Warenproduzenten und unbedingte Autorität innerhalb der Werkstatt bilden keine Alternativen, sondern korrespondierende Seiten derselben Produktionsweise.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D10","text":"Die manufakturmäßige Spezialisierung erzeugt neue Werkzeuggewerbe, verselbständigt Produktionsstufen und verstärkt berufliche sowie territoriale Arbeitsteilung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0081","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D11","text":"Die Arbeitskraft des Teilarbeiters kann produktiv nur noch innerhalb des nach ihrem Verkauf hergestellten kapitalistischen Gesamtzusammenhangs funktionieren.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0112","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D12","text":"Die Manufaktur erzeugt sowohl die spezialisierten Instrumente als auch den Skalierungsdruck, aus denen die Ablösung ihrer handwerklichen Grundlage durch Maschinerie hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D13","text":"Ein Teil der Produktivitätsgewinne stammt aus allgemeiner Kooperation und darf nicht ausschließlich der spezifischen manufakturmäßigen Arbeitsteilung zugerechnet werden.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A2","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D14","text":"Die heterogene Manufaktur erlaubt wegen der Selbständigkeit ihrer Teilprodukte eher zerstreute Produktion, während die organische Manufaktur unmittelbare zeitliche und räumliche Kopplung erzwingt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A9","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD1","text":"Die Manufaktur erzeugt einen Akkumulationskreislauf, in dem gesteigerte Produktivität den Materialdurchsatz und Kapitalbedarf erhöht, während größeres Kapital weitere Arbeitsteilung ermöglicht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A14","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0107","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD2","text":"Die Bereicherung des gesellschaftlichen Gesamtarbeiters an Produktivkraft setzt innerhalb der kapitalistischen Form die Verarmung des individuellen Arbeiters an vielseitigem Produktionsvermögen voraus.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0117","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD3","text":"Die kapitalistische Produktionsordnung totalisiert sich als Verbindung mikroökonomischer Planung und makroökonomischer Anarchie.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD4","text":"Die Manufaktur verwandelt die zeitliche Konkurrenznorm des Marktes in eine innere Disziplin, die jeden Arbeiter durch die unmittelbare Abhängigkeit der Teilprozesse kontrolliert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD5","text":"Die Manufaktur selektiert nicht nur vorhandene individuelle Fähigkeiten, sondern produziert rekursiv die einseitigen Arbeitskräfte, die ihr gegliederter Mechanismus benötigt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD6","text":"Der Gesamtarbeiter ist das produktive Subjekt des Prozesses, kann jedoch nicht als autonomes gesellschaftliches Subjekt auftreten, weil seine Einheit erst durch das Kapital hergestellt und beherrscht wird.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0112","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD7","text":"Die Manufaktur erzeugt die Bedingungen ihrer eigenen Überschreitung, indem ihre Werkzeugproduktion und ihre Skalierungsbedürfnisse eine objektive Maschinerie verlangen, die das Handwerksgeschick als regulierendes Prinzip aufhebt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A14","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD8","text":"Historischer Fortschritt und kapitalistische Exploitation sind innerhalb der Manufaktur keine getrennten Wirkungen, sondern zwei Resultate derselben Organisation gesellschaftlicher Produktivkraft.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A16","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein neutraler, von Eigentum und Kommando unabhängiger Begriff der Arbeitsteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0091","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist der selbständige Einzelproduzent als elementares Subjekt der manufakturmäßigen Produktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0113","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, Produktivitätssteigerung und Entwicklung individueller Fähigkeiten müssten gleichgerichtet verlaufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, marktliche Freiheit unabhängiger Produzenten verhindere innerbetriebliche Despotie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0091","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein spontanes gesellschaftliches Gleichgewicht; Marktproportionalität erscheint nur als Reaktion auf fortwährende Disproportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0089","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein bloß äußerliches Eigentumsverhältnis des Kapitals zur Produktion; das Kapital organisiert und verkörpert den gesellschaftlichen Arbeitskörper selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX7","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die unbegrenzte Skalierbarkeit einer Produktionsweise, deren Zusammenhang weiterhin vom subjektiven Handwerksgeschick abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX8","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Erklärung der Arbeitshierarchie allein aus vorgefundenen natürlichen Fähigkeiten, weil die Manufaktur die benötigten Einseitigkeiten selbst erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0059","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0060","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX1","text":"Abwesend ist ein kollektiver Arbeiter, der die von ihm erzeugte gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft selbst besitzt und bewusst disponiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0114","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX2","text":"Versperrt ist die Fortexistenz des ganzen, vielseitig produktionsfähigen Arbeiters innerhalb eines Mechanismus, der seine Organe als getrennte Personen organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0113","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX3","text":"Als unstatthaft behandelt die bürgerliche Ordnung die bewusste gesellschaftliche Planung, obwohl sie innerhalb der kapitalistischen Werkstatt planmäßige Unterordnung voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0092","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist innerhalb der Manufaktur eine vom subjektiven Handwerksgeschick unabhängige technologische Einheit des Produktionsprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0054","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX5","text":"Abwesend ist eine Versöhnung von gesellschaftlichem Fortschritt, individueller Selbständigkeit und vielseitiger menschlicher Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0113","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS1","text":"Warenproduktion + gereifte gesellschaftliche Arbeitsteilung + Kapitalaggregation → konzentrierte Kooperation vieler Arbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0107","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS2","text":"Kombination heterogener Handwerke ∨ Zerlegung eines homogenen Handwerks → isolierte und komplementäre Teilfunktionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS3","text":"Teilfunktion + lebenslange Arbeiterbindung + spezialisiertes Werkzeug → Detailarbeiter als Elementarorgan.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS4","text":"Produktstruktur → heterogene Montage selbständiger Teilprodukte ∨ organische Folge abhängiger Stufenprozesse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS5","text":"Zeitliches Nacheinander → räumliches Nebeneinander → synchrone Abhängigkeit → feste quantitative Proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS6","text":"Repetition + Kontinuität + Gleichzeitigkeit + Proportionalität → Zeitökonomie + Intensivierung + höhere Produktivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS7","text":"Verkauf der Arbeitskräfte an ein Kapital + konzentriertes Eigentum an Produktionsmitteln → Gesamtarbeiter als Funktionsform des Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS8","text":"Funktionsvereinfachung + Qualifikationshierarchie + Trennung geistiger Potenzen → Entwertung und Abhängigkeit der Arbeitskraft → Erweiterung der Mehrarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0114","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS9","text":"Planmäßige Proportion innerhalb der Werkstatt ↔ nachträgliche Marktregulation außerhalb der Werkstatt → kapitalistische Einheit von Despotie und Anarchie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS10","text":"Handwerkliche Basis → Grenzen von Kontrolle und Skalierung → Widerspruch zu erzeugten Produktionsbedürfnissen → Maschinerie → Aufhebung des Handwerks als regulierendes Prinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AF1","text":"Doppelte handwerkliche Genese → Teilarbeiter und spezialisiertes Werkzeug → gegliederter Gesamtmechanismus → Produktivität und proportionierte Abhängigkeit → Unterscheidung von Werkstatt- und Gesellschaftsteilung → kapitalistische Aneignung der gesellschaftlichen Produktivkraft → Entwertung und Verkrüppelung des Arbeiters → technologische Grenze → Übergang zur Maschinerie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME1","text":"Der selbständige Handwerker wird vom Produzenten einer Ware zum unselbständigen Organ eines kapitalistisch besessenen Gesamtmechanismus umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0112","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0113","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME2","text":"Arbeitsteilung zerfällt in zwei strukturell verschiedene Vermittlungsregime: Warenaustausch zwischen Produzenten und Arbeitskraftverkauf an ein gemeinsames Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME3","text":"Zeitliche Produktionsfolge wird als räumliche Gleichzeitigkeit und quantitativ geregelte Kopplung neu sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME4","text":"Individuelle Unvollkommenheit wird als funktionale Vollkommenheit des Gesamtarbeiters lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0061","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME5","text":"Produktivitätssteigerung wird von einer neutralen Effizienzkategorie in eine Form kapitalistischer Aneignung und Herrschaft überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME6","text":"Werkstattordnung und gesellschaftliche Anarchie verlieren den Status von Gegensätzen und erscheinen als komplementäre Ebenen derselben Produktionsweise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME7","text":"Werkzeugdifferenzierung wird nicht nur als Anpassung an Teilarbeit, sondern als materielle Vorstufe der Maschinerie kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME8","text":"Historischer Fortschritt wird zugleich als Entwicklung gesellschaftlicher Produktivkraft und als Zerstörung individueller Produktionsfähigkeit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ALT1","text":"Auf der Oberflächenebene untersucht der Text Entstehungswege, Grundformen, Produktivitätswirkungen und Grenzen der manufakturmäßigen Arbeitsteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ALT2","text":"Auf der strukturellen Ebene operiert die Manufaktur als proportionierter Arbeitskörper, dessen Einheit durch Kapitalbesitz, Kommando und wechselseitige Abhängigkeit der Teilfunktionen hergestellt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ALT3","text":"Auf der metastrategischen Ebene wird die Effizienzlehre der politischen Ökonomie in eine Analyse von Aneignung, Disziplinierung, Arbeitskraftentwertung und Herrschaft umgerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0133","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ALT4","text":"Auf der ontologischen und zeitlichen Ebene ersetzt der gesellschaftliche Gesamtarbeiter den Einzelproduzenten, während zeitliche Folge in räumliche Gleichzeitigkeit und historische Entwicklung in einen Prozess der Selbstüberschreitung der Produktionsform übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT1","text":"Die achtzehn Axiome reichen zur Rekonstruktion der argumentativen Bewegung von der handwerklichen Genese bis zur maschinellen Überschreitung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die relative historische Reichweite der verschiedenen Manufakturformen und das Gewicht der zahlreichen empirischen Sonderfälle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Eigentum, Kommando und technische Gliederung als untrennbare Momente derselben Produktionsform behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist die Unterscheidung zwischen planmäßiger Arbeitsteilung innerhalb der Werkstatt und nachträglicher Marktproportionierung innerhalb der Gesellschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT5","text":"Ebenfalls tragfähig ist die Kette von Funktionszerlegung über Arbeitskraftentwertung und kapitalistische Aneignung bis zur Erzeugung relativen Mehrwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0130","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT6","text":"Eine Bruchlinie liegt zwischen Produktivitätswirkungen allgemeiner Kooperation und solchen der spezifischen manufakturmäßigen Arbeitsteilung; ihre jeweilige Kausalquote bleibt nicht vollständig getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen der Anpassung der Funktionen an vorgefundene Fähigkeiten und der Behauptung, die Manufaktur produziere die benötigten einseitigen Fähigkeiten selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0059","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0060","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT8","text":"Das Handwerksgeschick fungiert zugleich als Produktivitätsquelle, Disziplinierungshindernis und technologische Schranke, ohne dass diese drei Funktionen vollständig vermittelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT9","text":"Die innere Planung der Werkstatt bleibt von einer äußeren, anarchisch bestimmten Nachfrage abhängig; die Kopplung beider Proportionalitätsregime wird nur teilweise formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0089","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT10","text":"Der Übergang zur Maschinerie ist als endogene Richtung bestimmt, aber noch nicht vollständig erklärt; die breiten sozialen und pathologischen Folgerungen hängen stärker von historischen Beispielen und Zeugnissen ab als der rekonstruierte Kernmechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T210945108397Z_1b01762a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3) Division of Labour and Manufacture.","source_sha256":"962a95d1638914338edfee215db02e7f6cdfc51ad0220d7a04621e6f03e3a36c","sha256":"2c9b9f1189121a6a236c8a42d7bee6afee1c698adc2b50ff096f82f964415068","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:09:45.109439+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS1","text":"What requires explanation is how artisanal activity is transformed into a social mechanism of production dominated by capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS2","text":"The combination of heterogeneous crafts and the division of homogeneous crafts converge in the same form of the specialized detail worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS3","text":"Manufacture increases productivity through specialization, continuity, simultaneity, differentiation of tools, and the proportioned dependence of partial functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS4","text":"By virtue of capitalist control over the mechanism of production, the social productive power of the collective worker appears as the productive power of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS5","text":"Planned despotism within the workshop and the anarchic mediation of social labour through the market constitute distinct, mutually conditioning modes of organization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS6","text":"The increase in social productive power is produced through the loss of independence, devaluation, and mutilation of the individual worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AS7","text":"The genealogical-diagnostic argument moves from the dual emergence, through the inner mechanism and its effects of domination, to the contradiction that prepares the replacement of the artisanal basis by machinery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A1","text":"Manufacture is the specifically capitalist form of cooperation based on the division of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A2","text":"Its material initial condition is the simultaneous employment of many workers under the command of the same capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A3","text":"Manufacture arises either through the combination of heterogeneous crafts or through the division of a homogeneous craft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4","text":"Both paths of emergence end in a mechanism of production whose specialized organs are human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A5","text":"The artisanal skill of the individual worker remains the technological basis of manufacture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","text":"The exclusive partial function appropriates the worker for life as its one-sided organ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","text":"The continual repetition of a limited operation increases its productivity and reduces losses from changes and transitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8","text":"The division of the labour process differentiates and specializes the tools and thereby creates a material condition of machinery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A9","text":"The nature of the product generates either a heterogeneous assembly of independent partial products or an organic sequence of connected stage-processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10","text":"Organic manufacture transforms temporally successive operations into simultaneous and quantitatively proportioned partial functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","text":"The manufacturing division of labour is mediated by the sale of different labour-powers to the same capitalist and by the latter's concentrated ownership of the means of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12","text":"The social division of labour is mediated by the exchange of commodities among independent producers with fragmented means of production and is only subsequently proportioned by market compulsions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A13","text":"Manufacture presupposes a mature social division of labour mediated by commodity circulation and retrospectively expands it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0078","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A14","text":"The proportioned articulation of partial functions prescribes a growing minimum of simultaneously employed workers and advanced capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0107","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A15","text":"The articulation of partial functions generates a hierarchy of skilled and unskilled labour-powers with graduated training costs and wages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A16","text":"The reduction of training costs lowers the value of labour-power and expands the surplus labour available to capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17","text":"The social and intellectual productive powers of the collective worker confront the detail workers as the property and power of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0114","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:A18","text":"The persisting artisanal basis limits technical unity, scaling, and the subordination of labour, and comes into contradiction with the needs of production generated by manufacture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX1","text":"Manufacture is not a mere spatial assemblage of craftsmen continuing to work unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX2","text":"The machine is not the dominant organ of production in manufacture; its specific machinery is the combined collective worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0059","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX3","text":"The division of the production process is not yet scientific analysis, but remains bound to partial operations executable in artisanal fashion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX4","text":"The individual detail worker produces no independent commodity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0086","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX5","text":"The division of labour within the workshop is not merely a spatially more visible form of the social division of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0083","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX6","text":"The social distribution of labour follows no consciously presupposed plan of proportionality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX7","text":"The manufacturing division of labour is not a form common to all social formations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX8","text":"The concrete division of labour does not spring fully formed from the inventive genius of the capitalist, but is empirically discovered, stabilized, and transmitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0127","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0129","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX9","text":"The combination of several manufactures produces no real technological unity on an artisanal basis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0054","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX10","text":"The increased social productive power does not appear as an independent power of the workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:NX11","text":"Guild-like occupational separation does not of itself lead to manufacture so long as workers and means of production remain united and capital does not directly command labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0102","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0104","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D1","text":"The union of previously independent crafts and the autonomization of previously connected operations generate the same structure of complementary partial functions.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A3","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D2","text":"The commodity becomes the social product of the collective worker because no individual partial function produces an independent final product.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0086","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D3","text":"Repetition, the elimination of changes of activity, and the simultaneous execution of the phases of production increase output and labour intensity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D4","text":"The specialized tool becomes the material extension of the specialized detail worker and at the same time the initial element of later combinations of machines.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D5","text":"Within manufacture, socially necessary labour time appears not only as an external compulsion of competition, but as the technical law of the coupled production process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D6","text":"Fixed relations among partial functions permit an expansion of production only through the proportional multiplication of worker groups.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0047","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D7","text":"The training of one-sided virtuosity simultaneously generates unskilled labour as a particular function separated from more complex activities.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D8","text":"Increased productivity and the cheapening of labour-power make manufacture a method for producing relative surplus-value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A16","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D9","text":"Market independence among commodity producers and unconditional authority within the workshop constitute not alternatives, but corresponding aspects of the same mode of production.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D10","text":"Manufacturing specialization generates new tool trades, renders stages of production autonomous, and intensifies occupational as well as territorial divisions of labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0081","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D11","text":"The labour-power of the detail worker can function productively only within the capitalist total context established after its sale.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0112","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D12","text":"Manufacture generates both the specialized instruments and the pressure to scale from which the replacement of its artisanal basis by machinery proceeds.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D13","text":"Part of the productivity gains derives from general cooperation and must not be attributed exclusively to the specific manufacturing division of labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A2","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:D14","text":"Because of the independence of its partial products, heterogeneous manufacture permits more dispersed production, whereas organic manufacture compels immediate temporal and spatial coupling.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A9","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD1","text":"Manufacture generates a circuit of accumulation in which increased productivity raises material throughput and capital requirements, while greater capital enables further division of labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A14","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0107","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD2","text":"The enrichment of the social collective worker in productive power presupposes, within the capitalist form, the impoverishment of the individual worker in versatile productive capacity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0117","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD3","text":"The capitalist order of production totalizes itself as the connection of microeconomic planning and macroeconomic anarchy.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD4","text":"Manufacture transforms the market's temporal norm of competition into an internal discipline that controls every worker through the immediate dependence of the partial processes.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A10","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD5","text":"Manufacture not only selects pre-existing individual abilities, but recursively produces the one-sided labour-powers required by its articulated mechanism.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A6","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD6","text":"The collective worker is the productive subject of the process, yet cannot appear as an autonomous social subject because its unity is first produced and dominated by capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A4","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A11","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0112","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD7","text":"Manufacture generates the conditions of its own transcendence insofar as its tool production and its requirements of scale demand an objective machinery that supersedes artisanal skill as the regulating principle.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A8","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A14","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SD8","text":"Historical progress and capitalist exploitation are within manufacture not separate effects, but two results of the same organization of social productive power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_3TDA:A7","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A16","CH_V4GB_3TDA:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a neutral concept of the division of labour independent of property and command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0091","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the independent individual producer as the elementary subject of manufacturing production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0113","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption that increased productivity and the development of individual abilities must proceed in the same direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the market freedom of independent producers prevents despotism within the enterprise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0091","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a spontaneous social equilibrium; market proportionality appears only as a reaction to continual disproportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0089","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a merely external relation of capital's ownership to production; capital organizes and embodies the social body of labour itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX7","text":"Excluded is the unlimited scalability of a mode of production whose coherence continues to depend on subjective artisanal skill.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:DNX8","text":"Excluded is the explanation of the labour hierarchy solely from given natural abilities, because manufacture itself produces the required one-sidedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0059","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0060","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX1","text":"Absent is a collective worker who himself possesses and consciously disposes of the social productive power generated by him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0114","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX2","text":"Barred is the continued existence of the whole worker, capable of versatile production, within a mechanism that organizes his organs as separate persons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0113","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX3","text":"The bourgeois order treats conscious social planning as inadmissible, although within the capitalist workshop it presupposes planned subordination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0092","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX4","text":"Unavailable within manufacture is a technological unity of the production process independent of subjective artisanal skill.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0054","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:SNX5","text":"Absent is a reconciliation of social progress, individual independence, and versatile human development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0113","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS1","text":"Commodity production + mature social division of labour + capital aggregation → concentrated cooperation of many workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0078","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0107","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS2","text":"Combination of heterogeneous crafts ∨ division of a homogeneous craft → isolated and complementary partial functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS3","text":"Partial function + lifelong binding of the worker + specialized tool → detail worker as elementary organ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS4","text":"Product structure → heterogeneous assembly of independent partial products ∨ organic sequence of dependent stage-processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS5","text":"Temporal succession → spatial coexistence → synchronous dependence → fixed quantitative proportion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS6","text":"Repetition + continuity + simultaneity + proportionality → economy of time + intensification + higher productivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS7","text":"Sale of labour-powers to one capital + concentrated ownership of means of production → collective worker as functional form of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS8","text":"Simplification of functions + qualification hierarchy + separation of intellectual powers → devaluation and dependence of labour-power → expansion of surplus labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0114","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS9","text":"Planned proportion within the workshop ↔ subsequent market regulation outside the workshop → capitalist unity of despotism and anarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:FGS10","text":"Artisanal basis → limits of control and scaling → contradiction with generated needs of production → machinery → supersession of craft as the regulating principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:AF1","text":"Dual artisanal genesis → detail worker and specialized tool → articulated overall mechanism → productivity and proportioned dependence → distinction between workshop and social division of labour → capitalist appropriation of social productive power → devaluation and mutilation of the worker → technological limit → transition to machinery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME1","text":"The independent craftsman is reclassified from the producer of a commodity into the dependent organ of a collectively functioning mechanism possessed by capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0112","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0113","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME2","text":"The division of labour splits into two structurally distinct regimes of mediation: commodity exchange among producers and the sale of labour-power to a common capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME3","text":"The temporal sequence of production becomes newly visible as spatial simultaneity and quantitatively regulated coupling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME4","text":"Individual imperfection becomes legible as the functional perfection of the collective worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0061","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME5","text":"Increased productivity is transferred from a neutral category of efficiency into a form of capitalist appropriation and domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0130","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME6","text":"Workshop order and social anarchy lose the status of opposites and appear as complementary levels of the same mode of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME7","text":"The differentiation of tools is mapped not only as adaptation to partial labour, but as a material preliminary stage of machinery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ME8","text":"Historical progress is classified simultaneously as the development of social productive power and as the destruction of individual productive capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ALT1","text":"At the surface level, the text investigates paths of emergence, basic forms, effects on productivity, and limits of the manufacturing division of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ALT2","text":"At the structural level, manufacture operates as a proportioned body of labour whose unity is produced by capital ownership, command, and the reciprocal dependence of partial functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ALT3","text":"At the metastrategic level, the political economy doctrine of efficiency is reframed into an analysis of appropriation, disciplining, the devaluation of labour-power, and domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0131","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0133","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:ALT4","text":"At the ontological and temporal level, the social collective worker replaces the individual producer, while temporal succession passes into spatial simultaneity and historical development into a process of the production form's self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT1","text":"The eighteen axioms suffice to reconstruct the argumentative movement from artisanal genesis to mechanical transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT2","text":"The relative historical scope of the various forms of manufacture and the weight of the numerous empirical special cases remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent provided that property, command, and technical articulation are treated as inseparable moments of the same mode of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT4","text":"Strongest is the distinction between planned division of labour within the workshop and subsequent market proportionalization within society.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0087","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT5","text":"Also sustainable is the chain from functional division through the devaluation of labour-power and capitalist appropriation to the production of relative surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0066","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0130","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT6","text":"A line of fracture lies between the productivity effects of general cooperation and those of the specific manufacturing division of labour; their respective causal shares do not remain fully separated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT7","text":"A further tension exists between the adaptation of functions to given abilities and the assertion that manufacture itself produces the needed one-sided abilities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0059","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0060","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT8","text":"Artisanal skill functions simultaneously as a source of productivity, an obstacle to disciplining, and a technological barrier, without these three functions being fully mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0146","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0148","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT9","text":"The workshop's internal planning remains dependent on an external demand determined anarchically; the coupling of the two regimes of proportionality is only partially formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0089","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0090","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_3TDA:P0093","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_3TDA:MRT10","text":"The transition to machinery is determined as an endogenous direction, but not yet fully explained; the broad social and pathological consequences depend more strongly on historical examples and testimonies than does the reconstructed core mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_3TDA@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_3TDA:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 13","title":"3) Theilung der Arbeit und Manufaktur.","context":"Chapter 13"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG","layer":"CH","title":"4) Maschinerie und grosse Industrie. · reading part 1/2","order":14,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_4MUG"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_4MUG@R001","sha256":"18291c19e9fdc18212b462486b8ac3dc71a1f5e29b197bca3661c4be690a482f","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS1","text":"Das zu lösende Problem ist, warum arbeitssparende Maschinerie unter kapitalistischen Bedingungen nicht Arbeitsentlastung, sondern gesteigerte Verwertung und Beherrschung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS2","text":"Kapitalistisch angewandte Maschinerie dient der Verkürzung notwendiger Arbeit zugunsten der Mehrarbeit und ist daher Mittel der Mehrwertproduktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS3","text":"Die Maschine wird ökonomisch durch die Übertragung des operierenden Werkzeugs vom Arbeiter auf einen Mechanismus bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS4","text":"Die technische Bewegung führt von der Werkzeugmaschine über zentralen Antrieb und kombinierte Maschinensysteme zum Automaten und zur maschinellen Produktion der Maschinerie selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS5","text":"Die Wertanalyse trennt die produktive Leistung der Maschine von ihrer bloßen Übertragung bereits vergegenständlichten Werts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS6","text":"Die kapitalistische Anwendung erweitert das Exploitationsmaterial, verlängert oder verdichtet die Arbeitszeit, unterwirft den Arbeiter dem Automaten und erzeugt Verdrängung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS7","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich rekonstruktiv-diagnostisch von der technischen Genesis über Wertform und Fabrikorganisation zu Klassenwirkung, Regulierung und erneuter Intensivierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","text":"Der kapitalistische Zweck der Maschinerie ist die Produktion von Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A2","text":"Die große Industrie revolutioniert den Produktionsprozess vom Arbeitsmittel her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A3","text":"Eine Maschine entsteht, sobald das operierende Werkzeug vom menschlichen Organismus auf einen Mechanismus übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A4","text":"Entwickelte Maschinerie besteht aus Bewegungsmaschine, Transmissionsmechanismus und Werkzeugmaschine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A5","text":"Die Werkzeugmaschine eröffnet die industrielle Revolution, weil sie die Zahl gleichzeitig operierender Werkzeuge von den organischen Grenzen des Arbeiters emanzipiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A6","text":"Die Ausdehnung der Werkzeugmaschinerie erzwingt mächtigere, kontrollierbare Triebkräfte und die Zusammenfassung vieler Arbeitsmaschinen unter einen gemeinsamen Antrieb.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","text":"Das Maschinensystem zerlegt den Gesamtprozess objektiv in technische Phasen und verbindet diese nach dem Prinzip kontinuierlicher Produktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8","text":"Die große Industrie besitzt erst dann eine adäquate technologische Basis, wenn Maschinen durch Maschinen produziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","text":"Das Maschinensystem verkörpert Naturkräfte, Wissenschaft und unmittelbar vergesellschaftete Arbeit als objektiven Produktionsorganismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","text":"Maschinerie schafft keinen Neuwert, sondern überträgt ihren eigenen Wert entsprechend ihrem Verschleiß auf das Produkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","text":"Eine Maschine steigert die gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft nur, wenn die in ihr vergegenständlichte Arbeit geringer ist als die von ihr ersetzte lebendige Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12","text":"Kapital verwendet eine Maschine nach der Differenz zwischen ihrem Wert und dem Wert der ersetzten Arbeitskraft, nicht nach der Differenz zur gesamten ersetzten Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13","text":"Die Einbeziehung von Frauen und Kindern erweitert das Exploitationsmaterial und verteilt den Wert der familiären Arbeitskraft auf mehr Arbeitskräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14","text":"Die Bindung von Kapital in teurer, zeitlich und moralisch verschleißender Maschinerie erzeugt einen Verwertungsdruck zur Verlängerung des Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A15","text":"Maschinerie erhöht die Mehrwertrate, indem sie zugleich die Zahl der beschäftigten, allein Mehrwert erzeugenden Arbeitskräfte vermindert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A16","text":"Die gesetzliche Verkürzung des Arbeitstags verlagert den Verwertungsdruck auf Geschwindigkeit, Arbeitsdichte und Erweiterung des maschinellen Arbeitsfeldes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17","text":"Unter kapitalistischer Anwendung tritt der objektive Maschinenorganismus dem Arbeiter als autonomes Subjekt und als Macht des Kapitals gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18","text":"Die Einführung von Maschinerie verwandelt variables in konstantes Kapital und setzt daher keinen gleich großen Fonds zur Wiederbeschäftigung der verdrängten Arbeiter frei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX1","text":"Die Erleichterung der menschlichen Tagesarbeit ist nicht der Zweck kapitalistisch angewandter Maschinerie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX2","text":"Der ökonomische Unterschied zwischen Werkzeug und Maschine besteht nicht in mathematischer Einfachheit oder Zusammengesetztheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX3","text":"Der Unterschied zwischen Werkzeug und Maschine besteht nicht in der menschlichen oder nichtmenschlichen Herkunft der Triebkraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX4","text":"Gesellschaftliche und technologische Epochen werden nicht durch abstrakt scharfe Grenzlinien getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX5","text":"Die Dampfmaschine ist nicht der ursprüngliche Auslöser der industriellen Revolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX6","text":"Die Maschine verdrängt das Werkzeug nicht, sondern löst es vom menschlichen Organismus und integriert es in einen Mechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX7","text":"Die Gliederung des maschinellen Produktionsprozesses beruht nicht auf der subjektiven Anpassung der Arbeit an spezialisierte Arbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX8","text":"Naturkräfte und Wissenschaft erzeugen durch ihre produktive Anwendung keinen Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX9","text":"Maschinerie kann dem Produkt keinen eigenständigen Zins- oder Profitbestandteil als Neuwert zusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX10","text":"Gesellschaftliche Arbeitsersparnis und kapitalistische Rentabilität sind keine identischen Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX11","text":"Die Einbeziehung unmündiger Familienmitglieder bewahrt nicht den Charakter eines Vertrags zwischen freien, unabhängigen Warenbesitzern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX12","text":"Die Verkürzung des Arbeitstags impliziert weder notwendig geringere Produktion noch geringere Ausbeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX13","text":"Technisch erzwungene Kooperation begründet weder Gleichheit noch Selbstleitung der Produzenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX14","text":"Der strukturelle Gegner des Arbeiters ist nicht die Maschine als solche, sondern ihre kapitalistische Anwendungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX15","text":"Die durch Maschinerie verdrängten Arbeiter werden nicht notwendig und nicht gleichzeitig durch freigesetztes Kapital wieder beschäftigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D1","text":"Nach der Übertragung des operierenden Werkzeugs auf den Mechanismus wird die menschliche Triebkraft technisch zufällig und ersetzbar.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A3","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D2","text":"Die entwickelte Werkzeugmaschine erzeugt den Bedarf nach einem universellen und kontrollierbaren Motor; die revolutionierte Dampfmaschine folgt daher der Werkzeugrevolution.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A5","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D3","text":"Gleichartige Maschinen bilden unter gemeinsamem Antrieb eine technologische Kooperation, während verschiedenartige, sequenziell gekoppelte Maschinen ein gegliedertes Produktionssystem bilden.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A4","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A6","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D4","text":"Die Manufaktur liefert der großen Industrie ihre erste technische Grundlage, wird aber zur Schranke, sobald der Maschinenbau weiterhin von persönlichem Geschick abhängt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A2","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D5","text":"Die Maschine geht vollständig in den Arbeitsprozess, aber nur stückweise in den Verwertungsprozess ein; ihr produktiver Dienst übersteigt ihre tägliche Wertübertragung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D6","text":"Längere Lebensdauer, größere Produktenmasse und maschinelle Maschinenproduktion vermindern den von der Maschinerie auf die einzelne Ware übertragenen Wertteil.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D7","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Produktivitätsgrenze der Maschine ist weiter als ihre kapitalistische Anwendungsgrenze.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D8","text":"Niedrige Löhne können den Einsatz einer gesellschaftlich arbeitssparenden Maschine für das Kapital unrentabel machen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D9","text":"Die Einbeziehung der ganzen Arbeiterfamilie vermehrt die Zahl der Lohnarbeiter, senkt den Preis der einzelnen Arbeitskraft und steigert den familiär gelieferten Mehrarbeitsumfang.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D10","text":"Verlängerung des Arbeitstags beschleunigt die Reproduktion des Maschinenwerts, vermindert das Risiko moralischer Entwertung und steigert die Nutzung des fixierten Kapitals.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D11","text":"Die Verminderung der beschäftigten Arbeiterzahl treibt das Kapital zur Vermehrung relativer und absoluter Mehrarbeit sowie zur Erzeugung einer disponiblen Arbeiterpopulation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A15","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D12","text":"Eine gesetzliche Schranke der extensiven Ausbeutung erzeugt den Übergang zur intensiven Ausbeutung derselben oder einer kürzeren Arbeitszeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D13","text":"Wissenschaft, Naturkraft und gesellschaftliche Kooperation erscheinen im Fabriksystem als Eigenschaften der Maschinerie und damit als Mächte des Kapitals über die Arbeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D14","text":"Die technische Unterordnung unter den kontinuierlichen Automaten erzeugt Fabrikdisziplin, Aufsichtshierarchie und privatgesetzliche Sanktionierung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D15","text":"Der Verlust des freien Vertragsscheins durch Kinder- und Familienarbeit liefert die systeminterne Begründung staatlicher Fabrikgesetzgebung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D16","text":"Mechanische Innovation wird zum Mittel des Klassenkampfs, sobald sie Widerstand, Streikfähigkeit und Abhängigkeit von qualifizierten Arbeitern vermindert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D17","text":"Bei gleichbleibender Ausbringungsmenge vermindert Maschinerie die gesellschaftliche Gesamtarbeit; eine expandierende Ausbringung kann zusätzliche Arbeit in vorgelagerten Sektoren erzeugen, ohne die verdrängten Arbeiter notwendig zu kompensieren.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD1","text":"Die technische Verkürzung notwendiger Arbeitszeit wird unter dem Mehrwertimperativ in eine Ausdehnung der dem Kapital verfügbaren Lebenszeit verwandelt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD2","text":"Dieselbe Maschinerie, die gesellschaftliche Arbeit objektiv vereinigt, enteignet die Produzenten subjektiv von der Leitung ihres eigenen Produktionsprozesses.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD3","text":"Die maschinelle Revolution eines Produktionszweigs überträgt ihren Zwang auf technisch verbundene Industrien, Rohstoffproduktion, Transport, Kommunikation und Maschinenbau.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A6","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD4","text":"Die maschinelle Produktion von Maschinerie erzeugt eine selbstbeschleunigende technologische Basis, auf der Verbesserungen vorhandene Maschinen fortlaufend entwerten.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD5","text":"Die Wertlogik setzt der Produktivkraft eine innere Schranke, weil steigende technische Leistungsfähigkeit den mehrwertproduzierenden variablen Kapitalanteil vermindert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A15","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD6","text":"Staatliche Begrenzung beseitigt den Verwertungszwang nicht, sondern zwingt ihn zur technischen Rekonfiguration der Ausbeutung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD7","text":"Unterschiede in Lohnhöhe und Exploitationsgrad erzeugen eine räumlich und sektoral ungleiche Einführung derselben verfügbaren Technologie.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD8","text":"Die individuelle Rationalität des Kapitals kann gesellschaftliche Arbeitsverschwendung erhalten, sofern billige Arbeitskraft kostengünstiger als Maschinerie bleibt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD9","text":"Familie, Wissenschaft, Naturkraft, Arbeitszeit und Kooperation werden in eine einheitliche Verwertungsarchitektur eingezogen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX1","text":"Technischer Fortschritt besitzt keine immanente Tendenz zur Verbesserung der Lage der unmittelbaren Produzenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX2","text":"Die Kostenrationalität des Einzelkapitals fällt nicht mit der Ökonomie gesellschaftlicher Gesamtarbeit zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX3","text":"Vergegenständlichte Produktivkraft ist keine selbständige Quelle von Wert oder Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX4","text":"Der Arbeitsmarkt verteilt verdrängte Arbeitskräfte nicht reibungslos, weil ihre Arbeitskraft spezialisiert, entwertet und sektoral beschränkt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX5","text":"Formale Vertragsgleichheit garantiert keine tatsächliche Verfügung des Arbeiters über sich und seine Familie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX6","text":"Das individuelle Erfindersubjekt ist keine zureichende Kausaleinheit technologischer Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX7","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Wirkung der Maschinerie lässt sich nicht aus ihrer technischen Gestalt allein ableiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX8","text":"Der Verwertungsprozess enthält keine selbsttätige humane Grenze für Dauer, Intensität oder Bedingungen der Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SNX1","text":"Die durch Maschinerie mögliche freie Zeit bleibt den Produzenten als gesellschaftlich verfügbare Möglichkeit versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SNX2","text":"Die kollektive Verfügung der Produzenten über den objektiv vergesellschafteten Produktionsorganismus fehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SNX3","text":"Eine nichtkapitalistische Organisationsform der Maschinerie bleibt positiv unbestimmt und fungiert nur als ausgeschlossene Gegenmöglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SNX4","text":"Eine endgültige regulatorische Schließung ist nicht verfügbar, weil jede extensive Begrenzung in intensive Ausbeutung und erneute Regulierung umschlagen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS1","text":"Mehrwertimperativ → Verkürzung notwendiger Arbeit → Ausdehnung der Mehrarbeit → kapitalistischer Maschinenzweck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS2","text":"Werkzeugübertragung auf Mechanismus → Aufhebung organischer Werkzeuggrenzen → Austauschbarkeit der Triebkraft → zentraler Motor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS3","text":"Einzelmaschine → Kooperation gleichartiger Maschinen → Kette verschiedenartiger Teilmaschinen → kontinuierliches Maschinensystem → Automat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS4","text":"Manufaktureller Maschinenbau → technologische Schranke → Maschinenproduktion durch Maschinen → adäquate Grundlage der großen Industrie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS5","text":"Naturkraft und Wissenschaft → Verkörperung im kostspieligen Apparat → produktiver Gratisdienst → partielle Wertübertragung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS6","text":"Gesellschaftliche Arbeitsersparnis / kapitalistische Lohnersparnis → divergierende Einsatzgrenzen → ungleiche Technisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS7","text":"Fixiertes Maschinenkapital → beschleunigte Nutzung und Wertreproduktion → Verlängerung des Arbeitstags → gesetzliche Grenze → Intensivierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS8","text":"Objektiver Produktionsorganismus → Entzug von Geschick und Prozesswissen → Arbeiter als Anhängsel → Fabrikdisziplin → Autokratie des Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS9","text":"Ersatz lebendiger Arbeit → variables Kapital wird konstant → Verdrängung und Überpopulation → Lohndruck → verstärkte Herrschaft über verbleibende Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS10","text":"Behauptete Kapitalfreisetzung → Prüfung der Kapitalzusammensetzung → Nachweis der Kapitalbindung → Widerlegung notwendiger Wiederbeschäftigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AF1","text":"Kapitalistischer Maschinenzweck → ökonomische Neubestimmung der Maschine → technologische Entwicklung zum Automaten → Selbstproduktion der Maschinerie → Trennung von Produktivität und Wertschöpfung → kapitalistisches Einsatzkalkül → Ausdehnung und Verdichtung der Exploitation → Fabrikdespotie und Verdrängung → Widerstand und Gesetzgebung → Kritik der Kompensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AF2","text":"Arbeitsersparnis → Verringerung variablen Kapitals → innerer Mehrwertwiderspruch → Verlängerung des Arbeitstags → gesetzliche Beschränkung → Intensivierung und technische Verbesserung → erneute Belastungsgrenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME1","text":"Werkzeug und Maschine werden nach dem Träger der operierenden Funktion statt nach Komplexität oder Triebkraft unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME2","text":"Die Dampfmaschine wird vom Ursprung der industriellen Revolution zu einer durch die Werkzeugmaschine erzeugten Entwicklungsbedingung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME3","text":"Arbeitsteilung wird von der Zerlegung der Arbeiterfunktionen auf die objektive Analyse des Produktionsprozesses verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME4","text":"Die Fabrik erscheint nicht als bloßes Aggregat von Maschinen und Arbeitern, sondern als zentral angetriebener Produktionsautomat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME5","text":"Naturkraft, Wissenschaft und Kooperation werden als gesellschaftliche Produktivkräfte sichtbar, die durch Eigentum und Apparatform als Kapitalmacht erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME6","text":"Maschinenproduktivität und kapitalistische Maschinenrentabilität werden als zwei verschiedene Messsysteme kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME7","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Arbeitsersparnis und Ausbeutung bricht zusammen; dieselbe Technik kann notwendige Arbeit verkürzen und verfügbare Arbeitszeit des Kapitals vergrößern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME8","text":"Arbeitszeitregulierung wird als Auslöser technischer Intensivierung statt als bloße äußere Begrenzung neu eingeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME9","text":"Maschinenwiderstand wird vom Angriff auf das Produktionsmittel zur Kritik seiner gesellschaftlichen Anwendungsform verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME10","text":"Maschinenbedingte Verdrängung wird über den unmittelbar mechanisierten Betrieb hinaus auf Nachfrage-, Zuliefer- und Arbeitsmarkteffekte ausgedehnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die technische Anatomie der Maschine und ihre unmittelbaren Wirkungen auf Arbeitszeit, Arbeitskräfte und Produktion bilden die Oberfläche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT2","text":"Structural — Wertübertragung, Kapitalzusammensetzung, Fabrikorganisation, Familienarbeit und Arbeitsmarkt bilden den strukturellen Mechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verlagert den Konflikt von der Maschine auf ihre kapitalistische Anwendung und rekonstruiert Gesetzgebung als Moment einer fortgesetzten Verwertungskonkurrenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Vergangene, vergegenständlichte Arbeit tritt als scheinbar selbsttätiges Subjekt der lebendigen Arbeit gegenüber; Arbeitszeit wird extensiv und intensiv formbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — Die ökonomisch-historische Bestimmung der Technologie ersetzt mathematische Klassifikation, individualistische Erfindungsgeschichte und abstrakt naturwissenschaftlichen Materialismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um technische Genesis, Wertmechanismus, Fabrikform und zentrale Arbeiterwirkungen des Arguments zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben das quantitative Nettoverhältnis von Verdrängung und zusätzlicher Beschäftigung sowie dessen sektorale und zeitliche Grenzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern die vorausgesetzte Theorie von Arbeitskraft, notwendiger Arbeit, Mehrarbeit und konstantem beziehungsweise variablem Kapital übernommen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verknüpfung liegt in der Unterscheidung zwischen gesellschaftlicher Arbeitsersparnis und kapitalistischer Ersparnis bezahlter Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT5","text":"Die Trennung zwischen Maschinerie an sich und kapitalistischer Anwendung bleibt gespannt, weil die konkrete Maschinenform zugleich unter dem Verwertungszwang entwickelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT6","text":"Die behauptete Nivellierung der Maschinenarbeit bleibt durch fortbestehende Spezialisierung, frühe Einübung und eine abgetrennte technische Fachschicht begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT7","text":"Die positive Alternative einer kollektiv beherrschten Maschinerie wird nicht institutionell bestimmt; sie bleibt negative Kontrastbedingung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung von technischer Neubestimmung über Wertanalyse und Ausbeutungsmechanismus zur regulatorischen und konfliktförmigen Rückkopplung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T211114082948Z_7db2b2e8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"4) Machinery and Large-Scale Industry. · reading part 1/2","source_sha256":"18291c19e9fdc18212b462486b8ac3dc71a1f5e29b197bca3661c4be690a482f","sha256":"c73c0b9b48b14a9a3583e6fdba1777a6362d3d753a27834369adeb9c89026138","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:11:14.084328+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS1","text":"The problem to be solved is why labour-saving machinery, under capitalist conditions, produces not relief from labour but intensified valorization and domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS2","text":"Machinery applied capitalistically serves to shorten necessary labour in favour of surplus labour and is therefore a means of surplus-value production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS3","text":"The machine is determined economically by the transfer of the operating tool from the worker to a mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS4","text":"The technical movement proceeds from the machine tool via central drive and combined machine systems to the automaton and to the machine production of machinery itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS5","text":"The value analysis separates the productive performance of the machine from its mere transfer of already objectified value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS6","text":"Capitalist application expands the material of exploitation, lengthens or intensifies working time, subordinates the worker to the automaton, and produces displacement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AS7","text":"The argument moves reconstructively-diagnostically from technical genesis through value form and factory organization to class effect, regulation, and renewed intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","text":"The capitalist purpose of machinery is the production of surplus value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A2","text":"Large-scale industry revolutionizes the production process from the side of the instrument of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A3","text":"A machine arises as soon as the operating tool passes from the human organism to a mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A4","text":"Developed machinery consists of a motor mechanism, a transmission mechanism, and a machine tool.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A5","text":"The machine tool inaugurates the industrial revolution because it emancipates the number of simultaneously operating tools from the organic limits of the worker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A6","text":"The expansion of machine tools compels more powerful, controllable motive forces and the combination of many working machines under a common drive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","text":"The machine system objectively divides the total process into technical phases and connects them according to the principle of continuous production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8","text":"Large-scale industry possesses an adequate technological basis only when machines are produced by machines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","text":"The machine system embodies natural forces, science, and directly socialized labour as an objective organism of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","text":"Machinery creates no new value, but transfers its own value to the product in accordance with its wear and tear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","text":"A machine increases social productive power only if the labour objectified in it is less than the living labour it replaces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12","text":"Capital employs a machine according to the difference between its value and the value of the labour-power replaced, not according to the difference from the total labour replaced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13","text":"The incorporation of women and children expands the material of exploitation and distributes the value of family labour-power across more labourers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14","text":"The tying-up of capital in expensive machinery subject to temporal and moral wear generates a valorization pressure to lengthen the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A15","text":"Machinery raises the rate of surplus value by simultaneously reducing the number of employed labourers who alone produce surplus value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A16","text":"The legal shortening of the working day shifts the pressure of valorization onto speed, labour density, and expansion of the machine's field of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17","text":"Under capitalist application, the objective machine organism confronts the worker as an autonomous subject and as the power of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18","text":"The introduction of machinery transforms variable into constant capital and therefore does not release an equally large fund for the re-employment of displaced workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX1","text":"The easing of human daily labour is not the purpose of machinery applied capitalistically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX2","text":"The economic difference between tool and machine does not consist in mathematical simplicity or complexity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX3","text":"The difference between tool and machine does not consist in the human or non-human origin of the motive force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX4","text":"Social and technological epochs are not separated by abstractly sharp boundary lines.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX5","text":"The steam engine is not the original trigger of the industrial revolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX6","text":"The machine does not displace the tool, but detaches it from the human organism and integrates it into a mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX7","text":"The articulation of the machine production process is not based on the subjective adaptation of labour to specialized workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX8","text":"Natural forces and science produce no value through their productive application.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX9","text":"Machinery cannot add to the product an independent component of interest or profit as new value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX10","text":"Social saving of labour and capitalist profitability are not identical magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX11","text":"The incorporation of underage family members does not preserve the character of a contract between free, independent commodity owners.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX12","text":"The shortening of the working day implies neither necessarily lower production nor lower exploitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX13","text":"Technically compelled cooperation establishes neither equality nor the self-direction of producers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX14","text":"The worker's structural adversary is not the machine as such, but its capitalist form of application.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:NX15","text":"Workers displaced by machinery are neither necessarily nor simultaneously re-employed by released capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D1","text":"After the transfer of the operating tool to the mechanism, human motive power becomes technically contingent and replaceable.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A3","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D2","text":"The developed machine tool generates the need for a universal and controllable motor; the revolutionized steam engine therefore follows the tool revolution.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A5","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D3","text":"Similar machines under a common drive form a technological cooperation, whereas dissimilar, sequentially coupled machines form an articulated system of production.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A4","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A6","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D4","text":"Manufacture provides large-scale industry with its first technical foundation, but becomes a barrier as soon as machine-building continues to depend on personal skill.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A2","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D5","text":"The machine enters wholly into the labour process, but only piecemeal into the valorization process; its productive service exceeds its daily transfer of value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D6","text":"Longer lifespan, a greater mass of products, and the machine production of machines diminish the portion of value transferred by machinery to the individual commodity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D7","text":"The social productivity limit of the machine is broader than its capitalist limit of application.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D8","text":"Low wages can make the use of a socially labour-saving machine unprofitable for capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D9","text":"The incorporation of the entire worker's family increases the number of wage labourers, lowers the price of individual labour-power, and increases the amount of surplus labour supplied by the family.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D10","text":"Lengthening the working day accelerates the reproduction of machine value, reduces the risk of moral depreciation, and increases the utilization of fixed capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D11","text":"The reduction in the number of employed workers drives capital toward an increase in relative and absolute surplus labour and toward the production of a disposable worker population.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A15","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D12","text":"A legal barrier to extensive exploitation produces the transition to intensive exploitation of the same or a shorter working time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D13","text":"In the factory system, science, natural force, and social cooperation appear as properties of machinery and thus as powers of capital over labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D14","text":"Technical subordination to the continuous automaton produces factory discipline, a hierarchy of supervision, and sanctioning by private law.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D15","text":"The loss of the appearance of free contract through child and family labour provides the system-internal justification for state factory legislation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D16","text":"Mechanical innovation becomes a means of class struggle as soon as it reduces resistance, capacity to strike, and dependence on skilled workers.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:D17","text":"With a constant volume of output, machinery reduces total social labour; an expanding output can generate additional labour in upstream sectors without necessarily compensating displaced workers.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD1","text":"The technical shortening of necessary labour-time is transformed, under the surplus-value imperative, into an expansion of the life-time available to capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD2","text":"The same machinery that objectively unites social labour subjectively expropriates producers from control over their own production process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD3","text":"The machine revolution in one branch of production transfers its compulsion to technically connected industries, raw-material production, transport, communication, and machine-building.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A6","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A7","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD4","text":"The machine production of machinery produces a self-accelerating technological basis on which improvements continually devalue existing machines.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A8","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD5","text":"Value logic imposes an inner barrier on productive power, because rising technical performance reduces the variable portion of capital that produces surplus value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A10","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A15","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD6","text":"State limitation does not abolish the compulsion to valorize, but compels it toward the technical reconfiguration of exploitation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A14","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD7","text":"Differences in wage levels and degrees of exploitation produce a spatially and sectorally unequal introduction of the same available technology.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD8","text":"The individual rationality of capital can preserve social waste of labour insofar as cheap labour-power remains less costly than machinery.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A11","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A12","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SD9","text":"Family, science, natural force, working time, and cooperation are drawn into a unified architecture of valorization.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4MUG:A1","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A9","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A13","CH_V4GB_4MUG:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX1","text":"Technical progress possesses no immanent tendency to improve the situation of the immediate producers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX2","text":"The cost rationality of individual capital does not coincide with the economy of total social labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX3","text":"Objectified productive power is not an independent source of value or surplus value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX4","text":"The labour market does not smoothly distribute displaced labourers because their labour-power is specialized, devalued, and sectorally restricted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX5","text":"Formal contractual equality guarantees no actual disposal by the worker over himself and his family.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX6","text":"The individual inventor-subject is not an adequate causal unit of technological development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX7","text":"The social effect of machinery cannot be derived from its technical form alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:DNX8","text":"The valorization process contains no self-acting humane limit for the duration, intensity, or conditions of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SNX1","text":"The free time made possible by machinery remains barred to producers as a socially available possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SNX2","text":"The collective control of producers over the objectively socialized organism of production is absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SNX3","text":"A non-capitalist organizational form of machinery remains positively indeterminate and functions only as an excluded counter-possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:SNX4","text":"A final regulatory closure is unavailable, because every extensive limitation can turn into intensive exploitation and renewed regulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS1","text":"Surplus-value imperative → shortening of necessary labour → expansion of surplus labour → capitalist purpose of machinery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS2","text":"Transfer of tool to mechanism → abolition of organic tool limits → interchangeability of motive force → central motor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS3","text":"Single machine → cooperation of similar machines → chain of dissimilar partial machines → continuous machine system → automaton.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS4","text":"Manufactural machine-building → technological barrier → machine production by machines → adequate foundation of large-scale industry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS5","text":"Natural force and science → embodiment in costly apparatus → productive gratuitous service → partial transfer of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS6","text":"Social saving of labour / capitalist saving of wages → divergent limits of application → unequal mechanization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS7","text":"Fixed machine capital → accelerated utilization and reproduction of value → lengthening of the working day → legal limit → intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS8","text":"Objective organism of production → withdrawal of skill and process knowledge → worker as appendage → factory discipline → autocracy of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS9","text":"Replacement of living labour → variable capital becomes constant → displacement and overpopulation → wage pressure → intensified domination over remaining labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:FGS10","text":"Asserted release of capital → examination of the composition of capital → demonstration of capital being tied up → refutation of necessary re-employment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AF1","text":"Capitalist purpose of machinery → economic redefinition of the machine → technological development toward the automaton → self-production of machinery → separation of productivity and value creation → capitalist calculation of application → expansion and intensification of exploitation → factory despotism and displacement → resistance and legislation → critique of compensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:AF2","text":"Saving of labour → reduction of variable capital → inner surplus-value contradiction → lengthening of the working day → legal restriction → intensification and technical improvement → renewed limit of burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME1","text":"Tool and machine are distinguished according to the bearer of the operating function rather than according to complexity or motive force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME2","text":"The steam engine is reclassified from the origin of the industrial revolution to a condition of development produced by the machine tool.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME3","text":"Division of labour is shifted from the division of worker functions to the objective analysis of the production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME4","text":"The factory appears not as a mere aggregate of machines and workers, but as a centrally driven production automaton.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME5","text":"Natural force, science, and cooperation become visible as social productive powers that appear as the power of capital through property and apparatus form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME6","text":"Machine productivity and capitalist machine profitability are mapped as two distinct systems of measurement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME7","text":"The opposition between saving of labour and exploitation collapses; the same technology can shorten necessary labour and enlarge the labour-time available to capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME8","text":"Working-time regulation is reclassified as a trigger of technical intensification rather than as a mere external limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME9","text":"Resistance to machinery is shifted from an attack on the means of production to a critique of its social form of application.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ME10","text":"Machine-induced displacement is extended beyond the directly mechanized enterprise to demand, supplier, and labour-market effects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT1","text":"Surface — The technical anatomy of the machine and its immediate effects on working time, labourers, and production constitute the surface.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT2","text":"Structural — Value transfer, composition of capital, factory organization, family labour, and the labour market constitute the structural mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the conflict from the machine to its capitalist application and reconstructs legislation as a moment of an ongoing competition of valorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Past, objectified labour confronts living labour as an apparently self-acting subject; working time is extensively and intensively malleable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:ALT5","text":"Epistemic — The economic-historical determination of technology replaces mathematical classification, individualistic history of invention, and abstract natural-scientific materialism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the technical genesis, value mechanism, factory form, and central worker effects of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the quantitative net relation between displacement and additional employment, as well as its sectoral and temporal limits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as the presupposed theory of labour-power, necessary labour, surplus labour, and constant versus variable capital is adopted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT4","text":"The strongest linkage lies in the distinction between social saving of labour and capitalist saving of paid labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT5","text":"The separation between machinery as such and capitalist application remains tense, because the concrete form of the machine is at the same time developed under the compulsion to valorize.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT6","text":"The asserted levelling of machine labour remains limited by persisting specialization, early training, and a separate technical professional stratum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT7","text":"The positive alternative of collectively controlled machinery is not institutionally determined; it remains a negative condition of contrast.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4MUG:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from technical redefinition through value analysis and the mechanism of exploitation to regulatory and conflictual feedback.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_4MUG@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_4MUG:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 14","title":"4) Maschinerie und grosse Industrie. · reading part 1/2","context":"Chapter 14"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2","layer":"CH","title":"4) Maschinerie und grosse Industrie. · reading part 2/2","order":15,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_4M_2"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_4M_2@R001","sha256":"d91cbb674e3924be640e54d0de38046da96a528372bc321305107f4d2dd8d221","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS1","text":"Der Text erklärt, weshalb Maschinerie zugleich Arbeit verdrängt, neue Arbeitsfelder erzeugt, Produktionsformen reorganisiert und die Voraussetzungen ihrer gesellschaftlichen Begrenzung hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS2","text":"Absolute Beschäftigungszunahme widerlegt die relative Verdrängung lebendiger Arbeit durch Maschinerie nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS3","text":"Das Argument verfährt diagnostisch, kausal, historisch und widerspruchslogisch, indem es sichtbare Beschäftigungseffekte auf Kapitalzusammensetzung, Weltmarkt, Konkurrenz und Produktionsform zurückführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0103","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS4","text":"Die Bewegung führt von sektoraler Produktionsausweitung über relative Arbeitsersetzung und industrielle Zyklen zur Unterwerfung von Handwerk, Manufaktur und Hausarbeit unter das Fabrikprinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0094","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS5","text":"Die Fabrikgesetzgebung erscheint zugleich als Schutzreaktion gegen kapitalistische Verwüstung und als Beschleuniger von Maschinerie, Konzentration und Fabrikregime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS6","text":"Die revolutionäre Beweglichkeit der technologischen Grundlage gerät in Widerspruch zur kapitalistischen Fixierung des Arbeiters auf eine partikulare Funktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung endet bei der allgemeinen Form kapitalistischen Fortschritts: gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft wird durch gleichzeitige Untergrabung von Arbeiter und Erde entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A1","text":"Maschinerie steigert die Produktivkraft, indem sie für eine gegebene Produktenmasse relativ weniger lebendige Arbeit benötigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","text":"Der kapitalistische Einsatz der Produktivkraft wird durch Mehrwertproduktion, Warenverwohlfeilerung und Konkurrenz bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","text":"Der technische Fortschritt erhöht tendenziell den konstanten Kapitalanteil gegenüber dem in Arbeitskraft ausgelegten variablen Kapitalanteil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4","text":"Quantitative Ausdehnung auf gegebener technischer Grundlage zieht Arbeiter an, während qualitative technische Veränderung Arbeiter ersetzt oder verdrängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A5","text":"Die wachsende Masse maschinell erzeugter Produkte und Produktionsmittel erzeugt zusätzliche Arbeitsfelder in vor-, nach- und nebengelagerten Produktionssphären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A6","text":"Der Umfang dieser zusätzlichen Beschäftigung hängt von der Kapitalzusammensetzung und dem technischen Entwicklungsstand der betreffenden Sphären ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7","text":"Die elastische Ausdehnung des reifen Fabriksystems unter Weltmarktabhängigkeit nimmt notwendig die Form industrieller Zyklen an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A8","text":"Warenverwohlfeilerung und revolutionierte Transportmittel erzeugen eine internationale Arbeitsteilung zwischen industriellen Zentren und überwiegend agrarischen Rohstoffgebieten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A9","text":"Das Maschinenprinzip zerlegt Produktionsprozesse wissenschaftlich in ihre Elemente und macht ihre technologische Gestalt permanent veränderlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0214","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0215","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0216","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","text":"Mechanische Triebkraft und Akkumulation treiben zur Konzentration von Produktionsmitteln und Arbeitern unter dem Kommando desselben Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0162","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0164","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11","text":"Moderne Manufaktur, Handwerk und Hausarbeit werden zu abhängigen Abteilungen kapitalistisch organisierter Produktion und beruhen konkurrenziell auf wohlfeiler, ungeschützter Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A12","text":"Die kapitalistische Form reproduziert trotz technologischer Beweglichkeit die Fixierung des Arbeiters auf eine beschränkte Teilfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A13","text":"Die grosse Industrie löst die ökonomische Grundlage der alten Familie auf und zieht Frauen, Jugendliche und Kinder in gesellschaftlich organisierte Produktion hinein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","text":"Die Fabrikgesetzgebung ist die erste bewusste und planmässige gesellschaftliche Rückwirkung auf die naturwüchsige Gestalt des kapitalistischen Produktionsprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15","text":"Die gesetzliche Begrenzung der Arbeitsausbeutung erzwingt technische Anpassung, Maschinisierung, Kapitalauslage und Konzentration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0168","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A16","text":"Die angemessene gesellschaftliche Form einer revolutionären technologischen Grundlage erfordert wechselnde Funktionen, polytechnische Bildung und vielseitig entwickelte Individuen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A17","text":"Kapitalistische Agrikultur steigert die Produktivität durch gleichzeitige Erschöpfung der Arbeitskraft, Beraubung des Bodens und Störung des Stoffwechsels zwischen Mensch und Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0277","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0278","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18","text":"Die Entwicklung der inneren Widersprüche einer historischen Produktionsform erzeugt die Bedingungen ihrer Auflösung und Neugestaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX1","text":"Die Zunahme der Fabrikarbeiter beweist nicht, dass Maschinerie keine Arbeit verdrängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX2","text":"Absolute Beschäftigungszunahme ist nicht mit relativer Beschäftigungszunahme identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX3","text":"Neue Produktionszweige, Transportarbeit, Luxusproduktion und Dienstbotenarbeit bilden keinen notwendigen quantitativen Ersatz für die verdrängte Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX4","text":"Moderne Hausarbeit ist keine Fortsetzung selbständiger häuslicher Produktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX5","text":"Kleinbetrieb und räumliche Zerstreuung schützen nicht vor kapitalistischer Unterwerfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0099","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX6","text":"Behauptete technische und geschäftliche Naturschranken gegen Arbeitszeitregulierung sind keine unveränderlichen Produktionsbedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0171","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0175","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0176","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX7","text":"Fabrikgesetzgebung ist nicht bloss eine äusserliche humanitäre Korrektur eines ansonsten unveränderten Produktionsprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX8","text":"Die technologische Aufhebung handwerklicher Spezialisierung hebt die kapitalistische Teilung der Arbeit nicht automatisch auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0205","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX9","text":"Der Missbrauch elterlicher Gewalt ist nicht die ursprüngliche Ursache kapitalistischer Kinderexploitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX10","text":"Wissenschaftlich betriebene Agrikultur ist unter kapitalistischen Bedingungen nicht mit dauerhafter stofflicher Rationalität identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0278","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D1","text":"Eine absolute Zunahme der Beschäftigten kann mit einer erheblichen relativen Abnahme der beschäftigten Arbeit vereinbar sein.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D2","text":"Die von Maschinerie erzeugte Beschäftigung in anderen Zweigen begründet kein allgemeines Kompensationsgesetz.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A5","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D3","text":"Eine wachsende Zahl von Fabrikarbeitern setzt ein gegenüber der Beschäftigung überproportionales Wachstum des Gesamtkapitals und zeitweilige Ruhepunkte der technischen Veränderung voraus.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D4","text":"Repulsion und Attraktion der Arbeiter bilden zusammen mit dem industriellen Zyklus die normale Form kapitalistischer Beschäftigungsunsicherheit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D5","text":"Die Eroberung fremder Märkte zerstört dortige Produktionsformen und verwandelt die betroffenen Gebiete in Lieferanten von Rohstoffen für industrielle Zentren.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D6","text":"Handwerk, Manufaktur und Hausarbeit bleiben unter der grossen Industrie nur als Übergangsformen oder ausgelagerte Abteilungen kapitalistischer Produktion bestehen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D7","text":"Sobald die Verwohlfeilerung durch schrankenlosen Verbrauch wohlfeiler Arbeitskraft ihre natürlichen Grenzen erreicht, wird Maschinerie zum nächsten Mittel der Kostensenkung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0149","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D8","text":"Gesetzliche Zeitbegrenzung verwandelt angeblich unvermeidliche Produktionshindernisse in technisch lösbare Organisationsprobleme.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A9","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0175","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0176","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D9","text":"Partielle Arbeitsregulierung verschiebt die Ausbeutung in unregulierte Bereiche und erzeugt dadurch den Druck zur Verallgemeinerung der Gesetzgebung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0232","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0233","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D10","text":"Die Regulation der Arbeit schützt Arbeiter unmittelbar, beschleunigt aber zugleich den Untergang kleiner Produzenten und die Konzentration des Kapitals.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0241","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D11","text":"Die technisch erzwungene Beweglichkeit der Funktionen macht die kapitalistische Fixierung auf Teilfunktionen zu einer Quelle permanenter Entwertung und Überzähligmachung der Arbeiter.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A9","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A12","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D12","text":"Die Auflösung der alten Familienform erzeugt unter kapitalistischen Bedingungen Verwüstung, enthält aber zugleich die materielle Voraussetzung einer anderen Familien- und Geschlechterordnung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A13","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D13","text":"Die Trennung von Industrie und Agrikultur erzeugt zugleich die Notwendigkeit und die materielle Möglichkeit ihrer höheren Verbindung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A17","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD1","text":"Die Beschäftigungswirkungen der Maschinerie bilden kein Gleichgewichtssystem, sondern eine durch Akkumulation vermittelte Kombination aus relativer Verdrängung, sekundärer Arbeitsnachfrage und periodischer Wiederanziehung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A5","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD2","text":"Eine disponible Arbeiterbevölkerung wird nicht nur durch technische Ersetzung, sondern durch das Zusammenwirken von Auslagerung, Saisonarbeit, Marktfluktuation und industriellem Zyklus reproduziert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD3","text":"Die räumliche Expansion der grossen Industrie totalisiert ihre innere Asymmetrie als internationale Teilung zwischen industrieller Akkumulation und agrarischer Rohstoffproduktion.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD4","text":"Gesetzliche Begrenzung wirkt dialektisch: Sie beschränkt einzelne Formen der Ausbeutung und verallgemeinert zugleich die technisch konzentrierte Herrschaft des Kapitals.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0241","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD5","text":"Die grosse Industrie produziert technisch die Möglichkeit vielseitiger Individualität, während ihre kapitalistische Form den Arbeiter als austauschbaren Träger wechselnder Teilfunktionen reproduziert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A9","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A12","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A16","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD6","text":"Die kapitalistische Produktionsweise entwickelt gesellschaftliche Produktivkraft nur durch systematische Externalisierung ihrer Kosten auf Arbeitskraft, Familie, Gemeinwesen und Naturstoffwechsel.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A13","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0108","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD7","text":"Der Fortschritt der kapitalistischen Produktion erzeugt seine Transformationsbedingungen nicht ausserhalb seiner Zerstörungen, sondern durch die Zuspitzung derselben Widersprüche.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A16","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A17","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0271","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX1","text":"Technischer Fortschritt ist nicht gesellschaftlich neutral, weil seine Wirkung durch die Form der Kapitalverwertung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX2","text":"Produktivitätssteigerung enthält keine automatische Tendenz zur Verbesserung der Lage der Produzenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0277","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX3","text":"Freier Vertrag, Konkurrenz und individuelles Eigeninteresse erzeugen keine hinreichenden Grenzen gegen die Zerstörung von Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0119","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0192","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0194","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX4","text":"Dauerhafte berufliche Spezialisierung ist keine naturgemässe Eigenschaft des Arbeiters, sondern eine historisch erzeugte Fixierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0211","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX5","text":"Familie und elterliche Gewalt bilden keine von den Produktionsverhältnissen autonome Privatsphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0227","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX6","text":"Dezentrale Produktion und Kleineigentum bilden keinen stabilen Gegenraum zur Herrschaft des Kapitals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX7","text":"Bodenfruchtbarkeit und menschliche Arbeitskraft sind keine folgenlos konsumierbaren Voraussetzungen kapitalistischer Akkumulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX1","text":"Eine automatische Versöhnung von kapitalistischer Verwertung, technologischer Revolution und voller menschlicher Entwicklung ist strukturell ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX2","text":"Eine dauerhaft gesicherte Arbeitsfunktion ist innerhalb permanenter technischer Umwälzung und zyklischer Akkumulation nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX3","text":"Eine bewusst vergesellschaftete Regulation von Produktion, Arbeitswechsel und Naturstoffwechsel bleibt die notwendige, aber institutionell nicht ausgearbeitete Gegenform des Systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX4","text":"Das vielseitig entwickelte Individuum bleibt unter kapitalistischen Bedingungen als erzeugte Möglichkeit vorhanden und als gesellschaftliche Wirklichkeit versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX5","text":"Die höhere Verbindung von Industrie und Agrikultur, Produktion und Bildung sowie gesellschaftlicher Arbeit und Familienform wird vorausgesetzt, aber nicht positiv formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0204","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS1","text":"Produktivkraftsteigerung → sinkender Bedarf an lebendiger Arbeit je Produkteinheit → steigender konstanter Kapitalanteil → relative Arbeitsverdrängung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS2","text":"Qualitative technische Veränderung → Repulsion von Arbeitern; quantitative Akkumulation auf gegebener Grundlage → Attraktion von Arbeitern; Wechsel beider Bewegungen → absolute Zunahme bei relativer Abnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS3","text":"Steigende Produkten- und Mehrwertmasse → Ausweitung vor- und nachgelagerter Zweige → Luxus-, Transport- und Dienstleistungswachstum → bedingte, nicht kompensatorische Beschäftigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS4","text":"Elastische Produktionskapazität → Weltmarktexpansion → Marktüberfüllung → Krise und Stagnation → Beschäftigungsunsicherheit → erneuter Kostensenkungsdruck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS5","text":"Wissenschaftliche Prozesszerlegung → partielle Maschinisierung → mechanische Triebkraft → Konzentration → Fabrikbetrieb → Expropriation selbständiger Produzenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0103","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0162","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0164","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS6","text":"Unbegrenzte Exploitation → soziale Verwüstung → gesetzliche Begrenzung → technische Anpassung → grössere Kapitalauslage → Konzentration und Verallgemeinerung des Fabrikregimes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0232","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS7","text":"Revolutionäre Technologie → wechselnde Arbeitsfunktionen → Konflikt mit fixierter Teilfunktion → Erfordernis polytechnischer Bildung und vielseitiger Individualität → Konflikt mit kapitalistischer Produktionsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS8","text":"Kapitalistische Agrarrevolution → Auflösung bäuerlicher Selbständigkeit → Trennung von Stadt und Land → gestörter Stoffwechsel und Bodenerschöpfung → Notwendigkeit einer bewusst geregelten Synthese.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0278","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AF1","text":"Ausweitung angrenzender Produktionszweige → Prüfung ihrer Beschäftigungseffekte → Unterscheidung absoluter und relativer Beschäftigung → Zurückweisung des Kompensationstheorems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AF2","text":"Reifung des Fabriksystems → elastische Expansion → Weltmarkteroberung → Überproduktion und Krise → zyklische Repulsion und Attraktion der Arbeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AF3","text":"Auflösung von Handwerk und Manufaktur → kapitalistische Umformung der Hausarbeit → maximale Ausbeutung wohlfeiler Arbeitskraft → Maschinisierung und Übergang zum Fabrikbetrieb.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0094","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0154","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0165","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AF4","text":"Fabrikgesetzgebung → technische und organisatorische Reaktion → Konzentration des Kapitals → Widerspruch zwischen technologischer Beweglichkeit und fixierter Teilfunktion → Bildung, Familie und Agrikultur als Transformationsfelder → Arbeiter und Erde als untergrabene Quellen des Reichtums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME1","text":"Die Beschäftigungsfrage wird von absoluten Arbeiterzahlen auf das Verhältnis von Beschäftigung, Gesamtkapital und technischer Zusammensetzung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME2","text":"Der Fabrikbegriff wird von der einzelnen Fabrik auf ein Netz abhängiger Manufakturen, Werkstätten, Hausarbeiter, Rohstoffgebiete und Absatzmärkte erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0105","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0152","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME3","text":"Angebliche Naturschranken der Produktion werden als technisch veränderbare Formen kapitalistischer Geschäftsorganisation reklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0171","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0175","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0176","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME4","text":"Arbeitsgesetzgebung wird zugleich als Schutzform, technischer Innovationszwang und Mechanismus der Kapitalkonzentration sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0241","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME5","text":"Arbeitsteilung wird nicht mehr als stabile Spezialisierung, sondern als Konflikt zwischen technologischer Funktionsbeweglichkeit und kapitalistischer Fixierung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME6","text":"Familie, Kindererziehung und Geschlechterverhältnis werden aus der Privatsphäre in die Struktur der Produktionsverhältnisse verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0227","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME7","text":"Bodenerschöpfung, Stadt-Land-Trennung und gestörter Stoffwechsel werden als innere Resultate kapitalistischer Produktivitätsentwicklung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0278","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Beschäftigungszahlen, Arbeitszeiten, Löhne, Fabrikformen, Hausarbeit, gesetzliche Regulation und agrarische Maschinisierung bilden die sichtbaren Gegenstände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0272","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Kapitalzusammensetzung, Konkurrenz, Akkumulation, Weltmarkt, industrielle Zyklen, Konzentration und Subsumtion erzeugen die beobachtbaren Wirkungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0164","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Kampf wird von isolierter Abwehr einzelner Missstände auf allgemeine Regulation, politische Macht, polytechnische Bildung und Aufhebung fixierter Arbeitsteilung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0189","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität erscheint als widersprüchlicher Prozess permanenter technologischer Umwälzung, zyklischer Zeit, historisch veränderlicher Sozialformen und materiellen Stoffwechsels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0216","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Beschäftigungsanalyse, die Transformation der Produktionsformen, die Funktion der Fabrikgesetzgebung und die agrarische Schlussfolgerung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0103","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0272","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die exakten quantitativen Grenzen, innerhalb deren sekundäre Beschäftigung die unmittelbare Verdrängung teilweise ausgleicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange Kapitalverwertung als gemeinsames Vermittlungsprinzip zwischen Technik, Beschäftigung, Gesetzgebung und Naturverhältnis festgehalten wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Ableitung liegt in der Verbindung von Kapitalzusammensetzung, relativer Arbeitsabnahme und möglicher absoluter Beschäftigungszunahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT5","text":"Die Fabrikgesetzgebung bleibt spannungsvoll bestimmt, weil sie Ausbeutung begrenzt und zugleich Konzentration, Intensivierung und Fabrikregime beschleunigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0241","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT6","text":"Der Übergang von technologisch erzeugter Vielseitigkeit zur politischen Notwendigkeit der Arbeitermacht wird behauptet, aber innerhalb dieses Textabschnitts nicht vollständig vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT7","text":"Die höheren Formen von Familie, Bildung, Arbeitswechsel und Stadt-Land-Verhältnis werden vorwiegend durch Negation der kapitalistischen Form bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0204","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT8","text":"Die Verallgemeinerung dokumentierter Branchenfälle zu einer Systemgesetzlichkeit hängt teilweise von exemplarischer Verdichtung und polemischer Totalisierung ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0271","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT9","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von scheinbarer Beschäftigungskompensation über Krisen- und Subsumtionsanalyse zur allgemeinen Widerspruchsform kapitalistischer Produktivkraftentwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T211143287140Z_06c06120","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"4) Machinery and Large-Scale Industry. · reading part 2/2","source_sha256":"d91cbb674e3924be640e54d0de38046da96a528372bc321305107f4d2dd8d221","sha256":"c943c1eb40f44dbbf2185df0d5275991d8b87e566330b0f318d78a4c57a279da","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:11:43.288606+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS1","text":"The text explains why machinery simultaneously displaces labour, creates new fields of labour, reorganizes forms of production, and brings forth the conditions for its social limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS2","text":"An absolute increase in employment does not refute the relative displacement of living labour by machinery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS3","text":"The argument proceeds diagnostically, causally, historically, and according to the logic of contradiction, by tracing visible employment effects back to the composition of capital, the world market, competition, and the form of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0103","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS4","text":"The movement proceeds from sectoral expansion of production through relative replacement of labour and industrial cycles to the subjection of handicraft, manufacture, and domestic labour to the factory principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0094","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS5","text":"Factory legislation appears both as a protective reaction against capitalist devastation and as an accelerator of machinery, concentration, and the factory regime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS6","text":"The revolutionary mobility of the technological foundation comes into contradiction with the capitalist fixation of the worker upon a particular function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AS7","text":"The movement ends with the general form of capitalist progress: social productive power is developed through the simultaneous undermining of worker and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A1","text":"Machinery increases productive power by requiring relatively less living labour for a given mass of products.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","text":"The capitalist application of productive power is determined by surplus-value production, the cheapening of commodities, and competition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","text":"Technical progress tends to increase the constant share of capital relative to the variable share of capital laid out in labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4","text":"Quantitative expansion on a given technical foundation attracts workers, whereas qualitative technical change replaces or displaces workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A5","text":"The growing mass of mechanically produced products and means of production creates additional fields of labour in antecedent, subsequent, and adjacent spheres of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A6","text":"The extent of this additional employment depends on the composition of capital and the level of technical development in the spheres concerned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7","text":"The elastic expansion of the mature factory system under dependence on the world market necessarily assumes the form of industrial cycles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A8","text":"The cheapening of commodities and revolutionized means of transport create an international division of labour between industrial centres and predominantly agricultural raw-material regions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A9","text":"The machine principle scientifically decomposes production processes into their elements and renders their technological form permanently variable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0214","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0215","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0216","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","text":"Mechanical motive power and accumulation drive toward the concentration of means of production and workers under the command of the same capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0162","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0164","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11","text":"Modern manufacture, handicraft, and domestic labour become dependent departments of capitalistically organized production and rest competitively upon cheap, unprotected labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A12","text":"Despite technological mobility, the capitalist form reproduces the fixation of the worker upon a limited partial function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A13","text":"Large-scale industry dissolves the economic foundation of the old family and draws women, young people, and children into socially organized production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","text":"Factory legislation is the first conscious and systematic social reaction upon the spontaneously evolved form of the capitalist production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15","text":"The legal limitation of labour exploitation compels technical adaptation, mechanization, capital outlay, and concentration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0168","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A16","text":"The adequate social form of a revolutionary technological foundation requires changing functions, polytechnic education, and versatilely developed individuals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A17","text":"Capitalist agriculture increases productivity through the simultaneous exhaustion of labour-power, robbery of the soil, and disturbance of the metabolism between human being and earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0277","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0278","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18","text":"The development of the internal contradictions of a historical form of production produces the conditions of its dissolution and reconfiguration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX1","text":"The increase in factory workers does not prove that machinery displaces no labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX2","text":"An absolute increase in employment is not identical with a relative increase in employment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX3","text":"New branches of production, transport labour, luxury production, and domestic service do not constitute a necessary quantitative replacement for displaced labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX4","text":"Modern domestic labour is not a continuation of independent domestic production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX5","text":"Small-scale enterprise and spatial dispersion do not protect against capitalist subjection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0099","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX6","text":"Alleged technical and business natural barriers to working-time regulation are not immutable conditions of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0171","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0175","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0176","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX7","text":"Factory legislation is not merely an external humanitarian correction of an otherwise unchanged production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX8","text":"The technological abolition of artisanal specialization does not automatically abolish the capitalist division of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0205","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX9","text":"The abuse of parental authority is not the original cause of capitalist child exploitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:NX10","text":"Scientifically conducted agriculture under capitalist conditions is not identical with enduring material rationality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0278","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D1","text":"An absolute increase in the employed may be compatible with a considerable relative decrease in employed labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D2","text":"Employment in other branches produced by machinery does not establish a general law of compensation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A5","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D3","text":"A growing number of factory workers presupposes a growth of total capital disproportionate to employment and temporary resting points in technical change.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D4","text":"The repulsion and attraction of workers, together with the industrial cycle, constitute the normal form of capitalist employment insecurity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D5","text":"The conquest of foreign markets destroys local forms of production and transforms the affected territories into suppliers of raw materials for industrial centres.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D6","text":"Under large-scale industry, handicraft, manufacture, and domestic labour persist only as transitional forms or outsourced departments of capitalist production.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D7","text":"As soon as cheapening through the unrestricted consumption of cheap labour-power reaches its natural limits, machinery becomes the next means of reducing costs.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0149","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D8","text":"Legal time limitation transforms allegedly unavoidable obstacles to production into organizational problems that can be technically solved.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A9","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0171","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0175","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0176","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D9","text":"Partial labour regulation shifts exploitation into unregulated areas and thereby produces pressure toward the generalization of legislation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0232","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0233","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D10","text":"The regulation of labour directly protects workers, but simultaneously accelerates the downfall of small producers and the concentration of capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0241","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D11","text":"The technically compelled mobility of functions makes capitalist fixation upon partial functions a source of the permanent devaluation and rendering-superfluous of workers.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A9","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A12","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D12","text":"The dissolution of the old family form produces devastation under capitalist conditions, but simultaneously contains the material precondition of another family and gender order.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A13","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:D13","text":"The separation of industry and agriculture simultaneously produces the necessity and the material possibility of their higher union.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A17","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD1","text":"The employment effects of machinery do not form an equilibrium system, but a combination mediated by accumulation of relative displacement, secondary labour demand, and periodic re-attraction.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A1","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A3","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A5","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD2","text":"A disposable worker population is reproduced not only through technical replacement, but through the interaction of outsourcing, seasonal labour, market fluctuation, and the industrial cycle.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A4","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD3","text":"The spatial expansion of large-scale industry totalizes its internal asymmetry as an international division between industrial accumulation and agricultural raw-material production.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A7","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0053","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD4","text":"Legal limitation operates dialectically: it restricts individual forms of exploitation while simultaneously generalizing the technically concentrated domination of capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A10","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A14","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0241","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD5","text":"Large-scale industry technically produces the possibility of versatile individuality, while its capitalist form reproduces the worker as an interchangeable bearer of changing partial functions.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A9","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A12","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A16","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD6","text":"The capitalist mode of production develops social productive power only through the systematic externalization of its costs onto labour-power, family, community, and natural metabolism.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A2","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A11","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A13","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0108","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SD7","text":"The progress of capitalist production produces the conditions of its transformation not outside its destructions, but through the intensification of those same contradictions.","refs":["CH_V4GB_4M_2:A15","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A16","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A17","CH_V4GB_4M_2:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0271","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX1","text":"Technical progress is not socially neutral, because its effect is determined by the form of capital valorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX2","text":"An increase in productivity contains no automatic tendency toward improving the condition of the producers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0277","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX3","text":"Free contract, competition, and individual self-interest produce no sufficient limits against the destruction of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0119","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0192","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0194","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX4","text":"Enduring occupational specialization is not a natural property of the worker, but a historically produced fixation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0211","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX5","text":"Family and parental authority do not constitute a private sphere autonomous from relations of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0227","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX6","text":"Decentralized production and small property do not constitute a stable counter-space to the domination of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:DNX7","text":"Soil fertility and human labour-power are not preconditions of capitalist accumulation that can be consumed without consequences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX1","text":"An automatic reconciliation of capitalist valorization, technological revolution, and full human development is structurally excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX2","text":"A permanently secured labour function is unavailable within permanent technical upheaval and cyclical accumulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX3","text":"A consciously socialized regulation of production, changes of labour, and natural metabolism remains the necessary, but institutionally unelaborated, counter-form of the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX4","text":"Under capitalist conditions, the versatilely developed individual remains present as a produced possibility and obstructed as a social reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:SNX5","text":"The higher union of industry and agriculture, production and education, as well as social labour and family form, is presupposed but not positively formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0204","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS1","text":"Increase in productive power → declining need for living labour per unit of product → increasing constant share of capital → relative displacement of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS2","text":"Qualitative technical change → repulsion of workers; quantitative accumulation on a given foundation → attraction of workers; alternation of both movements → absolute increase with relative decrease.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS3","text":"Increasing mass of products and surplus value → expansion of antecedent and subsequent branches → growth of luxury, transport, and services → conditional, non-compensatory employment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS4","text":"Elastic productive capacity → expansion of the world market → market glut → crisis and stagnation → employment insecurity → renewed pressure to reduce costs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS5","text":"Scientific decomposition of the process → partial mechanization → mechanical motive power → concentration → factory operation → expropriation of independent producers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0095","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0103","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0162","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0164","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS6","text":"Unlimited exploitation → social devastation → legal limitation → technical adaptation → greater capital outlay → concentration and generalization of the factory regime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0108","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0232","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS7","text":"Revolutionary technology → changing labour functions → conflict with fixed partial function → requirement of polytechnic education and versatile individuality → conflict with the capitalist form of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:FGS8","text":"Capitalist agricultural revolution → dissolution of peasant independence → separation of town and country → disturbed metabolism and soil exhaustion → necessity of a consciously regulated synthesis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0278","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AF1","text":"Expansion of adjacent branches of production → examination of their employment effects → distinction between absolute and relative employment → rejection of the compensation theorem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AF2","text":"Maturation of the factory system → elastic expansion → conquest of the world market → overproduction and crisis → cyclical repulsion and attraction of workers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AF3","text":"Dissolution of handicraft and manufacture → capitalist transformation of domestic labour → maximum exploitation of cheap labour-power → mechanization and transition to factory operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0094","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0154","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0165","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:AF4","text":"Factory legislation → technical and organizational reaction → concentration of capital → contradiction between technological mobility and fixed partial function → education, family, and agriculture as fields of transformation → worker and earth as undermined sources of wealth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME1","text":"The question of employment is shifted from absolute worker numbers to the relation between employment, total capital, and technical composition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME2","text":"The concept of the factory is expanded from the individual factory to a network of dependent manufactures, workshops, home workers, raw-material regions, and markets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0105","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0152","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME3","text":"Alleged natural barriers of production are reclassified as technically alterable forms of capitalist business organization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0171","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0175","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0176","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME4","text":"Labour legislation becomes visible simultaneously as a form of protection, a technological compulsion to innovate, and a mechanism of capital concentration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0241","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME5","text":"The division of labour is no longer mapped as stable specialization, but as a conflict between technological mobility of functions and capitalist fixation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0218","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME6","text":"Family, child-rearing, and gender relations are shifted from the private sphere into the structure of relations of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0227","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ME7","text":"Soil exhaustion, the town-country separation, and disturbed metabolism are classified as internal results of capitalist productivity development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0278","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Employment figures, working hours, wages, factory forms, domestic labour, legal regulation, and agricultural mechanization constitute the visible objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0074","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0272","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — The composition of capital, competition, accumulation, the world market, industrial cycles, concentration, and subsumption produce the observable effects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0164","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The struggle is shifted from isolated resistance to individual abuses toward general regulation, political power, polytechnic education, and the abolition of the fixed division of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0189","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0191","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality appears as a contradictory process of permanent technological upheaval, cyclical time, historically variable social forms, and material metabolism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0216","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0275","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the analysis of employment, the transformation of forms of production, the function of factory legislation, and the agricultural conclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0103","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0272","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT2","text":"The exact quantitative limits within which secondary employment partially offsets direct displacement remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT3","text":"The structure remains internally coherent so long as capital valorization is retained as the common mediating principle between technology, employment, legislation, and the relation to nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0281","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest derivation lies in the connection between the composition of capital, relative decrease in labour, and possible absolute increase in employment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT5","text":"Factory legislation remains determined by tension, because it limits exploitation while simultaneously accelerating concentration, intensification, and the factory regime.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0177","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0241","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT6","text":"The transition from technologically produced versatility to the political necessity of workers' power is asserted, but not fully mediated within this section of text.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0221","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0222","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT7","text":"The higher forms of family, education, changes of labour, and the town-country relation are determined predominantly through negation of the capitalist form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0204","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0230","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0274","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0276","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT8","text":"The generalization of documented cases from branches of industry into a systemic lawfulness depends in part on exemplary condensation and polemical totalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0149","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0167","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0271","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_4M_2:MRT9","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from apparent employment compensation through crisis and subsumption analysis to the general form of contradiction of capitalist productive-power development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0060","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0104","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0217","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_4M_2:P0223","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_4M_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_4M_2:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 15","title":"4) Maschinerie und grosse Industrie. · reading part 2/2","context":"Chapter 15"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW","layer":"CH","title":"Fünftes Kapitel. Weitere Untersuchungen über die Produktion des absoluten und relativen Mehrwerths.","order":16,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_FNKW"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_FNKW@R001","sha256":"1abd72b4dbf9ee97a5ba57e2bb39807963208fe0aa783f1ddd2a34e2abc145d1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS1","text":"Der Text bestimmt, wie produktive Arbeit, Mehrwert und Arbeitslohn innerhalb des kapitalistischen Produktionsverhältnisses begrifflich zusammenhängen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS2","text":"Produktive Arbeit wird vom stofflichen Arbeitsresultat auf ihre Funktion für die Selbstverwertung des Kapitals umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS3","text":"Die genetische Bewegung führt von formeller Subsumtion und absolutem Mehrwert über die Umgestaltung des Arbeitsprozesses zu reeller Subsumtion und relativem Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS4","text":"Natur und Produktivität werden als Bedingungen verfügbarer Arbeitszeit anerkannt, aber als Ursachen tatsächlicher Mehrarbeit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS5","text":"Länge, Intensität und Produktivität der Arbeit werden als unabhängige Variablen zerlegt, deren Kombinationen Wert der Arbeitskraft und Mehrwert bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS6","text":"Die korrekte Mehrwertrate legt unbezahlte Arbeit frei; die Lohnform verwandelt dagegen den Wert der Arbeitskraft in den scheinbaren Wert der Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS7","text":"Die Argumentation bewegt sich diagnostisch-rekonstruktiv von Produktionsstruktur über quantitative Gesetze und Erscheinungsinversion zu den Kontrollwirkungen von Zeitlohn, Stücklohn, Konkurrenz und Weltmarkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A1","text":"Der kooperative Arbeitsprozess macht das kombinierte Arbeitspersonal zum Träger produktiver Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A2","text":"Kapitalistisch produktiv ist nur Arbeit, die Mehrwert produziert oder der Selbstverwertung des Kapitals dient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","text":"Mehrwert besteht seiner Substanz nach in angeeigneter unbezahlter fremder Arbeitszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A4","text":"Absoluter Mehrwert entsteht durch Verlängerung des Arbeitstags über die notwendige Arbeitszeit auf Grundlage formeller Subsumtion der Arbeit unter das Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5","text":"Relativer Mehrwert entsteht durch Verkürzung der notwendigen Arbeitszeit mittels Revolutionierung des Arbeitsprozesses und setzt die formelle Subsumtion voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A6","text":"Mit ihrer gesellschaftlichen Herrschaft wird die spezifisch kapitalistische Produktionsweise zur allgemeinen Form des Produktionsprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7","text":"Die naturgebundene, historisch entwickelte Produktivität eröffnet nur disponible Zeit; erst ein gesellschaftliches Herrschaftsverhältnis verwandelt sie in Mehrarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","text":"Der Wert der Arbeitskraft wird durch den Wert ihrer historisch und gewohnheitsmäßig bestimmten Reproduktionsmittel unter Voraussetzung normaler Lebensdauer und normalen Verschleißes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A9","text":"Die Hauptanalyse der Größenwechsel setzt Warenverkauf zu Werten, eine konstante Masse notwendiger Lebensmittel, keinen Fall des Arbeitskraftpreises unter ihren Wert und die Ausklammerung von Entwicklungs- und Naturdifferenzen der Arbeitskraft voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A10","text":"Die relativen Größen von Arbeitskraftpreis und Mehrwert werden durch Länge, Intensität und Produktivität der Arbeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A11","text":"Bei konstantem Arbeitstag und konstanter Intensität erzeugt der Arbeitstag unabhängig von der Produktivität stets dasselbe Wertprodukt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","text":"Unter konstantem Arbeitstag und konstanter Intensität verändern sich Wert der Arbeitskraft und Mehrwert entgegengesetzt, sofern die Produktivitätsänderung die Reproduktionsmittel der Arbeitskraft betrifft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","text":"Eine Intensitätsänderung verändert die in gleicher Zeit verausgabte Arbeitsmenge und damit das Wertprodukt des Arbeitstags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","text":"Bei konstanter Produktivität und Intensität verändert die Länge des Arbeitstags das Wertprodukt und die Größe der Mehrarbeit, während die notwendige Arbeitszeit zunächst konstant bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15","text":"Innerhalb der durch Produktivität bestimmten Wertgrenzen vermittelt das Kräfteverhältnis zwischen Kapitaldruck und Arbeiterwiderstand den tatsächlichen Preis der Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16","text":"Der wirkliche Exploitationsgrad ist das Verhältnis von Mehrwert zu Wert der Arbeitskraft, von Mehrarbeit zu notwendiger Arbeit oder von unbezahlter zu bezahlter Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A17","text":"Der Arbeitslohn ist die verwandelte Erscheinungsform des Werts oder Preises der Arbeitskraft als Wert oder Preis der Arbeit, obwohl Arbeit selbst keinen Wert besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0125","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18","text":"Zeitlohn und Stücklohn sind metrisch verschiedene Erscheinungsformen desselben Preises der Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0189","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX1","text":"Produktive Arbeit ist nicht durch Tätigkeit, Nutzeffekt oder unmittelbares Arbeitsprodukt definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX2","text":"Produktive Arbeit ist nicht auf materielle Produktion beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX3","text":"Parasitische Aneignung durch Wucher- oder Handelskapital ohne Subsumtion des Arbeitsprozesses ist noch keine kapitalistische Produktionsweise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX4","text":"Relative Mehrwertproduktion ist keine von absoluter Mehrwertproduktion unabhängige Produktionsart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX5","text":"Natürliche Fruchtbarkeit erzeugt weder Mehrarbeit noch Mehrwert, sondern nur deren Möglichkeitsschranke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX6","text":"Der Arbeiter verkauft nicht seine Arbeit, sondern seine Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0125","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX7","text":"Nachfrage und Zufuhr erklären nicht den regulierenden Wert oder notwendigen Preis der Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0130","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0131","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX8","text":"Das Verhältnis von Mehrarbeit zum ganzen Arbeitstag oder von Mehrwert zum Wertprodukt ist nicht die Mehrwertrate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0102","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX9","text":"Der Lohn bezahlt nicht die gesamte während des Arbeitstags geleistete Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX10","text":"Der Stücklohn ist weder Bezahlung des Produkts noch Aufhebung der Abhängigkeit vom Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0190","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0194","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0197","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX11","text":"Tages-, Wochen- oder Nominallohn sind nicht mit dem Preis der Arbeit oder dem Reallohn identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0156","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0157","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0160","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX12","text":"Staat, Handel oder Theorie sind nicht bloß äußerliche Störungen einer ursprünglich harmonischen kapitalistischen Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0236","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0237","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0238","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D1","text":"Der Begriff produktiver Arbeit erweitert sich stofflich zum Gesamtarbeiter und verengt sich gesellschaftlich auf die Kapitalverwertung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A1","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D2","text":"Die Produktion relativen Mehrwerts überführt die formelle in die reelle Subsumtion, weil das Kapital nicht nur die Arbeit kommandiert, sondern ihren Prozess technisch reorganisiert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A4","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D3","text":"Sobald die spezifisch kapitalistische Produktionsweise herrscht, produzieren ihre Methoden zugleich relativen und absoluten Mehrwert; als besondere relative Methode wirkt sie nur noch an Expansions- und Innovationsrändern.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A4","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D4","text":"Produktivität bestimmt den Punkt, an dem Arbeit für andere beginnen kann, erklärt aber weder das Auftreten noch die gesellschaftliche Aneignung dieser Arbeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D5","text":"Naturbedingte und gesellschaftlich entwickelte Produktivkräfte erscheinen nach ihrer Eingliederung in den kapitalistischen Prozess als Produktivkräfte des Kapitals.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A6","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D6","text":"Bei konstantem Wertprodukt verändert eine Produktivitätsänderung notwendige Arbeit und Mehrarbeit um denselben absoluten Betrag, aber nicht im selben proportionalen Verhältnis.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A11","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D7","text":"Steigende Produktivität kann die konsumierte Gütermasse des Arbeiters erhöhen, während der relative Wert seiner Arbeitskraft sinkt und die Differenz zur Lebenslage des Kapitalisten wächst.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D8","text":"Die Produktivitätssteigerung setzt eine neue Untergrenze des Arbeitskraftwerts, bestimmt aber nicht vollständig, wie weit der Arbeitskraftpreis tatsächlich fällt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D9","text":"Steigende Intensität kann Arbeitskraftpreis und Mehrwert gleichzeitig erhöhen; kompensiert der höhere Preis den beschleunigten Verschleiß nicht, bleibt er dennoch unter dem Wert der Arbeitskraft.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D10","text":"Eine Verkürzung des Arbeitstags vermindert den Mehrwert nur unter sonst konstanten Bedingungen; eine Verlängerung kann Arbeitskraftpreis und Mehrwert gleichzeitig erhöhen und dennoch die Arbeitskraft relativ oder reproduktiv entwerten.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0077","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D11","text":"Bei gleichzeitiger Variation der drei Faktoren können absolute und proportionale Mehrwertbewegungen auseinanderfallen oder einander kompensieren.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A10","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A11","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0083","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D12","text":"Die Darstellung des Mehrwerts als Anteil am Wertprodukt unterschätzt die Exploitation, erzeugt eine falsche Höchstgrenze von hundert Prozent und ersetzt das Ausbeutungsverhältnis durch den Schein einer Produktteilung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0100","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0105","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D13","text":"Kapital ist nicht nur Kommando über Arbeit, sondern Kommando über unbezahlte Arbeit; Profit, Zins und Rente sind verwandelte Formen derselben unbezahlten Arbeitszeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D14","text":"Die Lohnform lässt den bezahlten Teil des Arbeitstags als Preis des gesamten Arbeitstags erscheinen und erzeugt dadurch Rechtsvorstellungen von Äquivalenz und Freiheit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0141","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D15","text":"Im Zeitlohn muss der Gesamtlohn vom Preis einer Arbeitszeiteinheit getrennt werden; gleichbleibender oder steigender Tageslohn ist mit fallendem Stundenpreis vereinbar.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0157","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0158","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0160","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D16","text":"Ein vom Normalarbeitstag gelöster Stundenlohn erlaubt den Wechsel zwischen Unterbeschäftigung und Überarbeit und zerstört die stabile Relation zwischen bezahlter und unbezahlter Arbeitszeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0165","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0169","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D17","text":"Der Stücklohn überträgt Qualitätskontrolle, Intensivierung und Teile der Aufsicht auf den Arbeiter und ermöglicht Unterverpachtung, Zwischenhierarchien und die Exploitation des Arbeiters durch den Arbeiter.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A2","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0200","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0205","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D18","text":"Steigende Produktivität senkt bei konstantem Tagespreis der Arbeitskraft den Stücklohn proportional zur verminderten Arbeitszeit pro Stück; der daraus entstehende Konflikt wird durch den Schein der Produktbezahlung verschärft.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A17","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0222","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0223","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0225","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D19","text":"Nationale Löhne sind erst nach Normalisierung von Arbeitstag, Intensität, Produktivität, Reproduktionskosten und Lohnform vergleichbar; höherer Geldlohn kann mit niedrigerem relativem Lohn zusammenfallen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A10","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0229","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0230","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0234","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD1","text":"Reelle Subsumtion verlagert die Reproduktion des Ausbeutungsverhältnisses von bloßer äußerer Kontrolle in Technik, Organisation und gesellschaftliche Normalität des Produktionsprozesses.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A4","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD2","text":"Äquivalententausch und Ausbeutung sind vereinbar, weil der Kapitalist den Wert der Arbeitskraft bezahlt, aber über ihre wertschaffende Funktion jenseits ihrer Reproduktionszeit verfügt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD3","text":"Produktivitätsgewinn erzeugt unter dem Kapitalverhältnis nicht notwendig freie Zeit für den Produzenten, sondern erweitert primär die vom Kapital aneigenbare Mehrarbeitszeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD4","text":"Die Lohnformen dezentralisieren das Kapitalverhältnis in Selbstkontrolle, Leistungsanreiz, Arbeiterkonkurrenz und innerbetriebliche Ausbeutungshierarchien.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D15","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D16","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0205","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0206","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0212","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD5","text":"Niedriger Arbeitspreis, Verlängerung oder Intensivierung der Arbeit und kapitalistische Konkurrenz bilden eine Rückkopplung, in der zunächst anormale Mehrarbeit in Warenpreise und Branchenstandards eingeht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D16","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0178","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0180","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD6","text":"Materielle Konsumsteigerung, höherer Nominallohn und verschärfte Exploitation können gleichzeitig auftreten; keine dieser Größen isoliert misst die Klassenrelation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD7","text":"Die nichtkapitalistische Verkürzung des gesellschaftlichen Arbeitstags setzt die allgemeine Verteilung notwendiger Arbeit voraus und verwandelt einen Teil bisheriger Mehrarbeit in reichere Reproduktion, Reservebildung und freie Tätigkeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD8","text":"Der Weltmarkt übersetzt nationale Unterschiede von Produktivität und Intensität in unterschiedliche Geldausdrücke gesellschaftlicher Arbeit, ohne daraus eine proportionale Verbesserung der Arbeiterlage folgen zu lassen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A10","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D19"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0234","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX1","text":"Vertragliche Freiwilligkeit widerlegt nicht die strukturelle Erzwingung unbezahlter Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX2","text":"Juristische Gleichheit von Käufer und Verkäufer impliziert keine Gleichheit ihrer Verfügung über das Arbeitsprodukt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0106","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0143","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX3","text":"Mehrprodukt ist keine angeborene Eigenschaft menschlicher Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX4","text":"Technischer Fortschritt verteilt seine Zeitgewinne nicht aus sich selbst zwischen Kapital und Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX5","text":"Der volle Wert der Arbeitskraft ist kein Maß für die Abwesenheit von Ausbeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX6","text":"Die Teilung des Wertprodukts in Einkommensanteile bildet den Produktionsprozess des Mehrwerts nicht adäquat ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0106","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX7","text":"Das spontane Bewusstsein von Arbeiter und Kapitalist besitzt keinen unmittelbaren Zugang zum wesentlichen Wertverhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0141","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0152","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX8","text":"Überarbeit, Unterbeschäftigung und Lohnsenkung sind keine bloßen Abweichungen außerhalb der kapitalistischen Konkurrenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0169","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0182","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX9","text":"Nationale Geldlöhne bilden keine unmittelbar homogene Vergleichsgröße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0229","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0230","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX1","text":"Innerhalb der Lohnform ist eine unmittelbare Sichtbarkeit der Teilung in bezahlte und unbezahlte Arbeit strukturell versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX2","text":"Ein ausbeutungsfreier Lohn ist innerhalb des fortbestehenden Kommandos des Kapitals über die Arbeitskraft nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX3","text":"Allgemeine freie Zeit ist unter dem Kapitalverhältnis blockiert, weil die Verkürzung notwendiger Arbeit als Erweiterung aneigenbarer Mehrarbeit fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX4","text":"Produktivität enthält keinen automatischen Übergang von Naturbeherrschung zu gesellschaftlicher Emanzipation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX5","text":"Die Kollektivität des Arbeitsprozesses erzeugt keine kollektive Verfügung über Produkt, Produktionsmittel oder Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0105","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0106","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS1","text":"T = N + S; W = V + M; T bezeichnet den Arbeitstag, N notwendige Arbeit, S Mehrarbeit, W das Wertprodukt, V den Wert der Arbeitskraft und M den Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS2","text":"Individueller Arbeitsprozess → Kooperation → Gesamtarbeiter → kapitalistisches Produktivitätskriterium → Verwertungsfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS3","text":"Verkauf der Arbeitskraft → formelle Subsumtion → T größer als N → Aneignung von S → absoluter Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS4","text":"Formelle Subsumtion → technische Umgestaltung → Produktivität steigt → N und V sinken → S und M steigen → reelle Subsumtion → relativer Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS5","text":"Naturbedingung plus historische Produktivität → disponible Zeit als Möglichkeit; gesellschaftlicher Zwang plus Eigentumsverhältnis → Mehrarbeit als Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS6","text":"Bei konstantem T und konstanter Intensität gilt: W konstant; Produktivität der Reproduktionsmittel steigt → V sinkt → M steigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS7","text":"Bei konstanter Produktivität gilt: Intensität steigt → W steigt → V und M können gleichzeitig steigen; T steigt → W und M steigen; T sinkt → M sinkt, sofern keine Gegenvariation eintritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS8","text":"M geteilt durch V = S geteilt durch N = unbezahlte Arbeit geteilt durch bezahlte Arbeit → wirklicher Exploitationsgrad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS9","text":"Wert der Arbeitskraft → Lohnform → scheinbarer Wert der Arbeit → gesamte Arbeit erscheint bezahlt → Rechts- und Freiheitsillusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0141","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS10","text":"Zeitlohn oder Stücklohn → individualisierte Leistungsmetrik → Intensivierung oder Verlängerung → erhöhte Mehrarbeit → Konkurrenzdruck → Normalisierung der Extraktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0206","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0208","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AF1","text":"Individueller Arbeitsprozess → kooperativer Gesamtarbeiter → kapitalistische Definition produktiver Arbeit → formelle Subsumtion und absoluter Mehrwert → reelle Subsumtion und relativer Mehrwert → Abgrenzung von Naturmöglichkeit und gesellschaftlicher Verwirklichung → Variationsgesetze von Länge, Intensität und Produktivität → korrekte Mehrwertrate → Inversion durch die Lohnform → operative Ausgestaltung in Zeit- und Stücklohn → Konkurrenz- und Weltmarkteffekte → Zurückweisung kapitalistischer Harmonievorstellungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0237","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME1","text":"Produktive Arbeit wird von einer stofflich-nützlichen Tätigkeit in ein gesellschaftliches Verwertungsverhältnis umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME2","text":"Absoluter und relativer Mehrwert werden von getrennten Epochenformen in voraussetzungsreiche und sich überlagernde Mechanismen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME3","text":"Natur wird vom Ursprung des Mehrwerts zur variablen Grenze notwendiger Arbeitszeit herabgestuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME4","text":"Produktivität, Intensität und Arbeitsdauer werden als nicht austauschbare Ursachen verschiedener Wertbewegungen getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME5","text":"Exploitation wird von der Verteilung des Gesamtprodukts auf das Verhältnis unbezahlter zu notwendiger Arbeit verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME6","text":"Der scheinbare Gegenstand des Lohnkaufs wechselt von Arbeit zu Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0125","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME7","text":"Rechtliche Äquivalenz und ökonomische Ausbeutung werden als gleichzeitig mögliche Ebenen desselben Austauschs kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0143","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME8","text":"Zeit- und Stücklohn erscheinen nicht mehr als neutrale Zahlungsweisen, sondern als unterschiedliche Kontroll- und Intensivierungsarchitekturen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0206","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0208","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME9","text":"Nominallohn, Reallohn, Arbeitspreis und relativer Lohn werden als eigenständige und potentiell gegenläufige Größen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0156","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0157","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0160","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0234","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME10","text":"Freie Zeit wird als gesellschaftlich verteiltes Resultat der Organisation notwendiger Arbeit und nicht als unmittelbare Wirkung technischer Produktivität bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Sichtbar sind Lohnhöhe, Arbeitsdauer, Stückzahl, Warenpreis und die scheinbare Bezahlung geleisteter Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0115","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0157","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ALT2","text":"Structural — Wirksam sind Subsumtionsform, Wert der Arbeitskraft, Teilung des Arbeitstags, technische Organisation, Konkurrenz und Aneignung unbezahlter Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Wissenschaftliche Analyse muss die spontanen Lohn-, Vertrags- und Verteilungsformen rückwärts in ihre Produktionsverhältnisse auflösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0133","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0152","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Arbeitskraft wird von ihrer aktualisierten Arbeit, Möglichkeit von Wirklichkeit und notwendige von verfügbarer sowie angeeigneter Zeit unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0125","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen zur Rekonstruktion der Bewegung von produktiver Arbeit über Mehrwertproduktion und Variationsgesetze bis zur Lohnform aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT2","text":"Der quantitative Kern ist innerhalb der ausdrücklich begrenzten Konstanz- und Wertannahmen intern kohärent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT3","text":"Der spätere Fall des Arbeitskraftpreises unter seinen Wert widerspricht dem Ausgangsmodell nicht formal, verlangt aber eine nachgetragene Begrenzung seines Geltungsbereichs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT4","text":"Der beschleunigte Verschleiß der Arbeitskraft erweitert die Wertbestimmung reproduktiv, wird jedoch nicht in eine vollständig kommensurable quantitative Regel überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0077","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT5","text":"Die Übersetzung höherer Produktivität in höhere nationale Arbeitsintensität auf dem Weltmarkt bleibt von einer nicht vollständig formalisierten Konkurrenzbedingung abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Schließung liegt in der Verbindung von Arbeitskraftverkauf, unbezahlter Mehrarbeit, korrekter Mehrwertrate und Lohninversion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT7","text":"Die Übergänge von Zwitterformen zur kapitalistischen Produktionsweise und von anormaler Mehrarbeit zum Konkurrenzstandard bleiben historisch behauptet, aber nur teilweise mechanisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0184","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT8","text":"Die besondere Angemessenheit des Stücklohns an die kapitalistische Produktion folgt aus seinen Kontrollwirkungen, nicht aus einer strikten Ausschließung des Zeitlohns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0194","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0216","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT9","text":"Die nichtkapitalistische Neuordnung notwendiger Arbeit und allgemeiner freier Zeit bleibt institutionell unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0088","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT10","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von Produktionsverhältnis über quantitative Zerlegung und Erscheinungskritik zu Lohnform, Konkurrenz und zeitlicher Alternative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T211453819115Z_6a6a8c41","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapter Five. Further Investigations into the Production of Absolute and Relative Surplus-Value.","source_sha256":"1abd72b4dbf9ee97a5ba57e2bb39807963208fe0aa783f1ddd2a34e2abc145d1","sha256":"d64c620a6ba8bef521711a90e9b79c26afdeb8d80014766145dc61ee861aad23","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:14:53.820084+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS1","text":"The text determines how productive labour, surplus-value, and wages are conceptually connected within the capitalist relation of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS2","text":"Productive labour is shifted from its material labour-result to its function for the self-valorization of capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS3","text":"The genetic movement leads from formal subsumption and absolute surplus-value, through the transformation of the labour process, to real subsumption and relative surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS4","text":"Nature and productivity are acknowledged as conditions of disposable labour-time, but excluded as causes of actual surplus-labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS5","text":"The length, intensity, and productivity of labour are decomposed as independent variables whose combinations determine the value of labour-power and surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS6","text":"The correct rate of surplus-value discloses unpaid labour; the wage form, by contrast, transforms the value of labour-power into the apparent value of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AS7","text":"The argument moves diagnostically and reconstructively from the structure of production, through quantitative laws and inversion of appearance, to the control effects of time-wages, piece-wages, competition, and the world market.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A1","text":"The cooperative labour process makes the combined labour personnel the bearer of productive labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A2","text":"Only labour that produces surplus-value or serves the self-valorization of capital is productively capitalist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","text":"In its substance, surplus-value consists of appropriated unpaid alien labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A4","text":"Absolute surplus-value arises through the prolongation of the working day beyond necessary labour-time on the basis of the formal subsumption of labour under capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5","text":"Relative surplus-value arises through the shortening of necessary labour-time by means of the revolutionization of the labour process and presupposes formal subsumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A6","text":"With its social domination, the specifically capitalist mode of production becomes the general form of the production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7","text":"Productivity bound to nature and historically developed opens up only disposable time; only a social relation of domination transforms it into surplus-labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","text":"The value of labour-power is determined by the value of its historically and customarily determined means of reproduction, on the presupposition of a normal lifespan and normal wear and tear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A9","text":"The main analysis of changes in magnitude presupposes the sale of commodities at their values, a constant mass of necessary means of subsistence, no fall of the price of labour-power below its value, and the bracketing of developmental and natural differences of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A10","text":"The relative magnitudes of the price of labour-power and surplus-value are determined by the length, intensity, and productivity of labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A11","text":"With a constant working day and constant intensity, the working day always produces the same value-product, irrespective of productivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","text":"Under a constant working day and constant intensity, the value of labour-power and surplus-value change in opposite directions, provided that the change in productivity affects the means of reproduction of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0067","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","text":"A change in intensity changes the quantity of labour expended in the same time and thereby the value-product of the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0064","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","text":"With constant productivity and intensity, the length of the working day changes the value-product and the magnitude of surplus-labour, while necessary labour-time initially remains constant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15","text":"Within the value limits determined by productivity, the relation of forces between capital's pressure and workers' resistance mediates the actual price of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16","text":"The actual degree of exploitation is the ratio of surplus-value to the value of labour-power, of surplus-labour to necessary labour, or of unpaid to paid labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A17","text":"Wages are the transformed form of appearance of the value or price of labour-power as the value or price of labour, although labour itself possesses no value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0125","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18","text":"Time-wages and piece-wages are metrically different forms of appearance of the same price of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0189","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX1","text":"Productive labour is not defined by activity, useful effect, or immediate labour-product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX2","text":"Productive labour is not confined to material production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX3","text":"Parasitic appropriation by usurer's or merchant's capital without subsumption of the labour process is not yet a capitalist mode of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX4","text":"The production of relative surplus-value is not a mode of production independent of the production of absolute surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX5","text":"Natural fertility produces neither surplus-labour nor surplus-value, but only their limit of possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX6","text":"The worker sells not his labour, but his labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0125","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX7","text":"Demand and supply do not explain the regulating value or necessary price of labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0130","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0131","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX8","text":"The ratio of surplus-labour to the entire working day, or of surplus-value to the value-product, is not the rate of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0102","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX9","text":"The wage does not pay for all labour performed during the working day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX10","text":"Piece-wages are neither payment for the product nor the abolition of dependence on capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0190","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0194","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0197","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX11","text":"Daily, weekly, or nominal wages are not identical with the price of labour or with real wages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0156","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0157","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0160","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:NX12","text":"The state, trade, or theory are not merely external disturbances of an originally harmonious capitalist order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0236","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0237","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0238","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D1","text":"The concept of productive labour expands materially to the collective worker and narrows socially to the valorization of capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A1","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D2","text":"The production of relative surplus-value transforms formal into real subsumption, because capital not only commands labour but technically reorganizes its process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A4","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D3","text":"As soon as the specifically capitalist mode of production prevails, its methods produce both relative and absolute surplus-value at once; as a particular relative method, it operates only at the margins of expansion and innovation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A4","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D4","text":"Productivity determines the point at which labour for others can begin, but explains neither the occurrence nor the social appropriation of this labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D5","text":"Productive forces conditioned by nature and socially developed productive forces appear, after their incorporation into the capitalist process, as productive forces of capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A6","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D6","text":"With a constant value-product, a change in productivity changes necessary labour and surplus-labour by the same absolute amount, but not in the same proportional relation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A11","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D7","text":"Rising productivity can increase the worker's mass of consumed goods while the relative value of his labour-power falls and the difference from the capitalist's conditions of life grows.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D8","text":"The increase in productivity establishes a new lower limit of the value of labour-power, but does not fully determine how far the price of labour-power actually falls.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0058","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D9","text":"Rising intensity can raise the price of labour-power and surplus-value simultaneously; if the higher price does not compensate for accelerated wear and tear, it nevertheless remains below the value of labour-power.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0066","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D10","text":"A shortening of the working day diminishes surplus-value only under otherwise constant conditions; a prolongation can raise the price of labour-power and surplus-value simultaneously and nevertheless devalue labour-power relatively or reproductively.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0077","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D11","text":"With simultaneous variation of the three factors, absolute and proportional movements of surplus-value can diverge or compensate one another.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A10","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A11","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0079","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0083","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D12","text":"The representation of surplus-value as a share of the value-product understates exploitation, produces a false maximum limit of one hundred percent, and replaces the relation of exploitation with the appearance of a division of the product.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0100","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0105","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0106","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D13","text":"Capital is not merely command over labour, but command over unpaid labour; profit, interest, and rent are transformed forms of the same unpaid labour-time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D14","text":"The wage form makes the paid part of the working day appear as the price of the entire working day and thereby produces juridical conceptions of equivalence and freedom.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0141","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D15","text":"In time-wages, the total wage must be distinguished from the price of a unit of labour-time; an unchanged or rising daily wage is compatible with a falling hourly price.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0157","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0158","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0160","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D16","text":"An hourly wage detached from the normal working day permits alternation between underemployment and overwork and destroys the stable relation between paid and unpaid labour-time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0165","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0169","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D17","text":"Piece-wages transfer quality control, intensification, and parts of supervision to the worker and enable subcontracting, intermediate hierarchies, and the exploitation of the worker by the worker.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A2","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0200","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0205","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D18","text":"Rising productivity lowers piece-wages, with a constant daily price of labour-power, in proportion to the reduced labour-time per piece; the conflict thereby arising is intensified by the appearance of payment for the product.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A17","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0222","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0223","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0225","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:D19","text":"National wages are comparable only after the normalization of the working day, intensity, productivity, reproduction costs, and wage form; a higher money wage can coincide with a lower relative wage.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A10","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0229","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0230","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0234","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD1","text":"Real subsumption shifts the reproduction of the relation of exploitation from mere external control into the technology, organization, and social normality of the production process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A4","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD2","text":"Exchange of equivalents and exploitation are compatible because the capitalist pays the value of labour-power but disposes of its value-creating function beyond its reproduction time.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A8","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD3","text":"Under the capital relation, gains in productivity do not necessarily produce free time for the producer, but primarily expand the surplus-labour time appropriable by capital.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A5","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD4","text":"The wage forms decentralize the capital relation into self-control, performance incentive, worker competition, and intra-enterprise hierarchies of exploitation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A18","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D15","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D16","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0205","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0206","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0212","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD5","text":"Low price of labour, prolongation or intensification of labour, and capitalist competition form a feedback loop in which initially abnormal surplus-labour enters into commodity prices and sectoral standards.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A3","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A15","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D16","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0178","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0180","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0182","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD6","text":"Material increases in consumption, higher nominal wages, and intensified exploitation can occur simultaneously; none of these magnitudes in isolation measures the class relation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A12","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0065","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0075","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD7","text":"The non-capitalist shortening of the social working day presupposes the general distribution of necessary labour and transforms part of former surplus-labour into richer reproduction, reserve formation, and free activity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A7","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A14","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0091","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SD8","text":"The world market translates national differences in productivity and intensity into differing monetary expressions of social labour, without entailing a proportional improvement in the workers' condition.","refs":["CH_V4GB_FNKW:A10","CH_V4GB_FNKW:A13","CH_V4GB_FNKW:D19"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0234","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX1","text":"Contractual voluntariness does not refute the structural compulsion of unpaid labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX2","text":"Juridical equality of buyer and seller does not imply equality of their disposal over the labour-product.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0106","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0143","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX3","text":"Surplus-product is not an innate property of human labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX4","text":"Technical progress does not itself distribute its time gains between capital and labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX5","text":"The full value of labour-power is not a measure of the absence of exploitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX6","text":"The division of the value-product into income shares does not adequately represent the production process of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0105","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0106","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX7","text":"The spontaneous consciousness of worker and capitalist has no immediate access to the essential value relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0141","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0152","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX8","text":"Overwork, underemployment, and wage reductions are not mere deviations outside capitalist competition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0169","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0182","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:DNX9","text":"National money wages do not constitute an immediately homogeneous magnitude of comparison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0229","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0230","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX1","text":"Within the wage form, the immediate visibility of the division into paid and unpaid labour is structurally blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX2","text":"A wage free of exploitation is unavailable within the persisting command of capital over labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX3","text":"General free time is blocked under the capital relation because the shortening of necessary labour functions as an expansion of appropriable surplus-labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0088","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX4","text":"Productivity contains no automatic transition from domination over nature to social emancipation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:SNX5","text":"The collectivity of the labour process does not produce collective disposal over product, means of production, or time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0105","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0106","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS1","text":"T = N + S; W = V + M; T denotes the working day, N necessary labour, S surplus-labour, W the value-product, V the value of labour-power, and M surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS2","text":"Individual labour process → cooperation → collective worker → capitalist criterion of productivity → valorization function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS3","text":"Sale of labour-power → formal subsumption → T greater than N → appropriation of S → absolute surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS4","text":"Formal subsumption → technical transformation → productivity rises → N and V fall → S and M rise → real subsumption → relative surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS5","text":"Natural condition plus historical productivity → disposable time as possibility; social compulsion plus property relation → surplus-labour as actuality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS6","text":"With constant T and constant intensity: W constant; productivity of the means of reproduction rises → V falls → M rises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS7","text":"With constant productivity: intensity rises → W rises → V and M can rise simultaneously; T rises → W and M rise; T falls → M falls, provided that no counter-variation occurs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0065","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0074","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0075","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS8","text":"M divided by V = S divided by N = unpaid labour divided by paid labour → actual degree of exploitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS9","text":"Value of labour-power → wage form → apparent value of labour → all labour appears paid → juridical and freedom illusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0136","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0141","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:FGS10","text":"Time-wages or piece-wages → individualized performance metric → intensification or prolongation → increased surplus-labour → competitive pressure → normalization of extraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0206","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0208","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:AF1","text":"Individual labour process → cooperative collective worker → capitalist definition of productive labour → formal subsumption and absolute surplus-value → real subsumption and relative surplus-value → distinction between natural possibility and social realization → laws of variation of length, intensity, and productivity → correct rate of surplus-value → inversion through the wage form → operational configuration in time-wages and piece-wages → effects of competition and the world market → rejection of conceptions of capitalist harmony.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0237","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME1","text":"Productive labour is reclassified from a materially useful activity into a social relation of valorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME2","text":"Absolute and relative surplus-value are transformed from separate epochal forms into presupposition-rich and overlapping mechanisms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME3","text":"Nature is downgraded from the origin of surplus-value to the variable limit of necessary labour-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME4","text":"Productivity, intensity, and duration of labour are separated as non-interchangeable causes of different movements of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0064","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME5","text":"Exploitation is shifted from the distribution of the total product to the ratio of unpaid to necessary labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0099","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME6","text":"The apparent object of the wage purchase shifts from labour to labour-power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0125","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME7","text":"Legal equivalence and economic exploitation are mapped as simultaneously possible levels of the same exchange.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0143","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME8","text":"Time-wages and piece-wages no longer appear as neutral modes of payment, but as different architectures of control and intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0206","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0208","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME9","text":"Nominal wages, real wages, price of labour, and relative wages become visible as independent and potentially opposing magnitudes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0156","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0157","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0160","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0234","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ME10","text":"Free time is determined as a socially distributed result of the organization of necessary labour and not as an immediate effect of technical productivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Visible are the level of wages, duration of labour, number of pieces, commodity price, and the apparent payment of labour performed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0115","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0157","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0190","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ALT2","text":"Structural — Effective are the form of subsumption, the value of labour-power, the division of the working day, technical organization, competition, and the appropriation of unpaid labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Scientific analysis must dissolve the spontaneous forms of wages, contract, and distribution backwards into their relations of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0133","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0152","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Labour-power is distinguished from its actualized labour, possibility from actuality, and necessary time from available and appropriated time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0125","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from productive labour through the production of surplus-value and laws of variation to the wage form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT2","text":"The quantitative core is internally coherent within the explicitly delimited assumptions of constancy and value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0055","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT3","text":"The later fall of the price of labour-power below its value does not formally contradict the initial model, but requires a subsequently added delimitation of its scope of validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0056","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0072","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0076","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT4","text":"The accelerated wear and tear of labour-power reproductively expands the determination of value, but is not converted into a fully commensurable quantitative rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0076","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0077","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT5","text":"The translation of higher productivity into higher national labour intensity on the world market remains dependent on a condition of competition that is not fully formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0233","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT6","text":"The strongest closure lies in the connection of the sale of labour-power, unpaid surplus-labour, the correct rate of surplus-value, and wage inversion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0109","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0110","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0111","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0112","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT7","text":"The transitions from hybrid forms to the capitalist mode of production and from abnormal surplus-labour to the standard of competition remain historically asserted, but only partially mechanized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0184","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT8","text":"The particular adequacy of piece-wages to capitalist production follows from their control effects, not from a strict exclusion of time-wages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0194","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0203","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0216","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT9","text":"The non-capitalist reorganization of necessary labour and general free time remains institutionally underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0088","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0091","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_FNKW:MRT10","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from the relation of production, through quantitative decomposition and critique of appearance, to wage form, competition, and temporal alternative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0139","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0168","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0183","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_FNKW:P0093","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_FNKW@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_FNKW:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 16","title":"Fünftes Kapitel. Weitere Untersuchungen über die Produktion des absoluten und relativen Mehrwerths.","context":"Chapter 16"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA","layer":"CH","title":"Sechstes Kapitel. Der Accumulationsprozess des Kapitals.","order":17,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_SKDA"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_SKDA@R001","sha256":"84fafe9a554ad46f8f915814171d6f2e47a989b53e6852fcbd3ef44657109ace","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS1","text":"Die Akkumulation wird als Problem der Rückverwandlung des realisierten Mehrwerts in Kapital bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS2","text":"Diese Bestimmung setzt den Verkauf der Ware und damit den Zirkulationsprozess voraus, klammert ihn aber zunächst aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS3","text":"Die unmittelbare Produktion wird als Ort der Erzeugung und ersten Aneignung des Mehrwerts isoliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS4","text":"Die Aufspaltung des Mehrwerts in Profit, Zins, Handelsgewinn und Grundrente wird als spätere Vermittlungsform behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS5","text":"Die reine Analyse der Akkumulation abstrahiert von den Zirkulations- und Verteilungsformen, um den inneren Mechanismus freizulegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS6","text":"Die Darstellung bewegt sich von der abstrakten Grundform über ihre eigene Dialektik zu den zunächst ausgeschlossenen konkreten Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A1","text":"Mehrwert wird in der Warenproduktion durch unbezahlte Arbeit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A2","text":"Der erzeugte Mehrwert ist zunächst im produzierenden Kapital und in der produzierten Ware fixiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A3","text":"Der in der Ware enthaltene Mehrwert wird erst durch ihren Verkauf realisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A4","text":"Akkumulation setzt die Realisierung des Mehrwerts und die Rückverwandlung des Geldes in Kapital voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A5","text":"Der Kapitalist ist der erste Aneigner, aber nicht notwendig der letzte Eigentümer des Mehrwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A6","text":"Der Mehrwert kann sich in verschiedene Teile spalten, die verschiedenen gesellschaftlichen Kategorien zufallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A7","text":"Die verwandelten Teile des Mehrwerts erscheinen als voneinander selbstständige Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A8","text":"Die Aufspaltung des Mehrwerts verändert nicht seine Natur oder seine notwendigen Akkumulationsbedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","text":"Die reine Analyse betrachtet die Akkumulation zunächst als Moment des unmittelbaren Produktionsprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A10","text":"Die abstrakte Darstellung setzt den Verkauf der Ware zu ihrem Wert voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A11","text":"Die abstrakte Darstellung behandelt den produzierenden Kapitalisten als Eigentümer des gesamten Mehrwerts oder als Repräsentanten seiner Teilhaber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12","text":"Die Zirkulation und die konkreten Reproduktionsbedingungen vermitteln die Grundform, sind aber für ihre vorläufige Analyse nicht konstitutiv.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A13","text":"Die Darstellung kann die ausgeschlossenen konkreten Formen später durch die Dialektik des Mechanismus wieder einführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX1","text":"Die Analyse ist nicht mit dem vollständigen Zirkulationsprozess identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX2","text":"Die Analyse behandelt nicht die realen Bedingungen der kontinuierlichen Reproduktion in ihrer konkreten Ausarbeitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX3","text":"Der produzierende Kapitalist wird zunächst nicht als bloß anteiliger Empfänger des Mehrwerts behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX4","text":"Die Analyse verweilt nicht bei den neuen Kapitalformen der Zirkulationssphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX5","text":"Die Analyse setzt zunächst von den konkreten Bedingungen der Reproduktion ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX6","text":"Profit, Zins, Handelsgewinn und Grundrente werden nicht als ursprüngliche Formen des Mehrwerts behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX7","text":"Die vermittelnde Bewegung der Zirkulation wird nicht als Bestandteil der reinen Grundform entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX8","text":"Die Zerspaltung des Mehrwerts wird nicht als Veränderung seiner grundlegenden Natur behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D1","text":"Die Realisierung des Mehrwerts ist eine notwendige Übergangsstufe zwischen Warenproduktion und Akkumulation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A2","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A3","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D2","text":"Die Akkumulation kann in ihrer Grundform als Rückverwandlung eines aus der Ware gelösten Geldbetrags in Kapital bestimmt werden.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A3","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D3","text":"Die spätere Verteilung des Mehrwerts auf verschiedene Eigentümer hebt seine gemeinsame Herkunft aus der unbezahlten Arbeit nicht auf.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A1","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A5","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A6","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D4","text":"Die erste Aneignung durch den produzierenden Kapitalisten reicht für die abstrakte Darstellung aus, obwohl sie im wirklichen Prozess durch weitere Aneignungsformen vermittelt wird.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A5","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D5","text":"Die abstrakte Akkumulationsanalyse gewinnt ihre Einfachheit durch die zeitweilige Gleichsetzung des produzierenden Kapitalisten mit dem Eigentümer des gesamten Mehrwerts.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D6","text":"Die Zirkulation kann aus der reinen Analyse ausgeschlossen werden, weil ihre Vermittlungen die Grundform verdunkeln, ohne die Akkumulationsbedingungen des Mehrwerts aufzuheben.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A8","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D7","text":"Die konkrete Reproduktion bleibt für die unmittelbare Grundanalyse unterbestimmt und wird auf eine spätere Analyse verschoben.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SD1","text":"Die Akkumulation besitzt eine einfache Produktionsform und eine komplexe Erscheinungsform, deren Differenz durch Zirkulation und Verteilung erzeugt wird.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A4","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A6","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A7","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SD2","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Aufspaltung des Mehrwerts verändert seine Eigentumsformen, nicht aber die im Produktionsprozess gesetzte Quelle seiner Akkumulationsfähigkeit.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A1","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A5","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A6","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SD3","text":"Die Abstraktion vom Zirkulationsprozess ist zugleich methodische Reduktion und sachliche Voraussetzung dafür, den unmittelbaren Produktionsmechanismus als selbstständige Grundform sichtbar zu machen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A3","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SD4","text":"Die ausgeschlossenen Vermittlungen sind nicht aufgehoben, sondern als spätere Ausformungen der bereits isolierten Grundform aufbewahrt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A7","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX1","text":"Die Akkumulation wird nicht als bloße Geldvermehrung ohne Warenverkauf und Rückverwandlung in Kapital vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX2","text":"Der Mehrwert wird nicht als vom Produktionsprozess unabhängige Einkommensquelle behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX3","text":"Die verschiedenen Revenue- und Eigentumsformen werden nicht als voneinander unabhängige Quellen des Mehrwerts zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX4","text":"Die Komplexität der Zirkulation wird nicht als Beweis dafür zugelassen, dass keine einfache Grundform der Akkumulation existiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX5","text":"Die empirische Gestalt der gesellschaftlichen Verteilung wird nicht mit der genetischen Quelle des Mehrwerts gleichgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX6","text":"Die kontinuierliche Reproduktion wird nicht vollständig aus dem unmittelbaren Produktionsprozess erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Modell, in dem die Zirkulation die ursprüngliche Quelle der Akkumulation bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Perspektive, in der die selbstständigen Formen des Mehrwerts dessen gemeinsame Produktionsgrundlage unkenntlich machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, die konkrete gesellschaftliche Reproduktion bereits auf der Ebene ihrer abstrakten Grundform vollständig zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine endgültige Trennung zwischen abstrakter Produktionsform und konkreter Zirkulationsform; ihre Verbindung wird nur aufgeschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS1","text":"Unbezahlte Arbeit → Erzeugung des Mehrwerts → Fixierung des Mehrwerts in der Ware.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS2","text":"Fixierung in der Ware → Verkauf der Ware → Realisierung des Mehrwerts in Geld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS3","text":"Realisierung in Geld → Rückverwandlung des Geldes in Kapital → Akkumulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS4","text":"Erzeugung und erste Aneignung → spätere Aufspaltung des Mehrwerts → Profit, Zins, Handelsgewinn, Grundrente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS5","text":"Aufspaltung und Zirkulationsvermittlung → Verdunkelung der Grundform → methodische Abstraktion von diesen Vermittlungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS6","text":"Abstrakte Grundform → Analyse des unmittelbaren Produktionsprozesses → spätere dialektische Rekonstruktion der konkreten Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AF1","text":"Mehrwertproduktion → Warenverkauf als Realisierungsbedingung → Rückverwandlung in Kapital → Abstraktion von Zirkulation und Verteilung → Freilegung der unmittelbaren Akkumulationsform → spätere Entfaltung der ausgeschlossenen Vermittlungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME1","text":"Akkumulation wird von einer bloßen Geldbewegung in einen Prozess der Realisierung und Rückverwandlung des Mehrwerts in Kapital umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME2","text":"Die verschiedenen Einkommens- und Eigentumsformen werden als gespaltene Erscheinungsformen eines gemeinsamen Mehrwerts klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME3","text":"Die Grenze zwischen Produktions- und Zirkulationsanalyse wird als methodische Abstraktionsgrenze sichtbar, nicht als absolute sachliche Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME4","text":"Die Komplexität der gesellschaftlichen Verteilung wird von der Analyse der ursprünglichen Akkumulationsbedingung getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME5","text":"Die spätere Behandlung konkreter Formen wird als immanente Entfaltung der abstrakten Grundform kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ware, Mehrwert, Verkauf, Geld und Rückverwandlung in Kapital bilden die unmittelbare Argumentebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ALT2","text":"Structural — Unbezahlte Arbeit, erste Aneignung, Aufspaltung des Mehrwerts und Vermittlung durch Zirkulation bilden den gesellschaftlichen Mechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Analyse gewinnt Erklärungskraft durch kontrollierte Abstraktion und verschiebt die ausgeschlossenen Vermittlungen auf spätere Darstellungsstufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Produktionsform gilt als genetische Grundform; Zirkulation, Verteilung und kontinuierliche Reproduktion erscheinen als nachfolgende, notwendige Vermittlungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Mehrwertproduktion über Realisierung zur Akkumulation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome erklären ebenfalls, weshalb die Aufspaltung des Mehrwerts seine gemeinsame Grundlage nicht verändert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die konkreten Bedingungen der kontinuierlichen Reproduktion und die Formen der Zirkulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist das System, sofern die Abstraktion vom Zirkulationsprozess als vorläufig und nicht als sachliche Aufhebung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen unbezahlter Arbeit, Mehrwertrealisierung und Rückverwandlung in Kapital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass Akkumulation die Zirkulation voraussetzt, ihre reine Analyse aber gerade von ihr absieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht zwischen der Behandlung des Kapitalisten als Eigentümer des gesamten Mehrwerts und seiner Bestimmung als bloß erster Aneigner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die späteren konkreten Formen als dialektische Entfaltung und nicht als externe Ergänzung der Grundform gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261016T211514927968Z_20e28501","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapter Six. The Accumulation Process of Capital.","source_sha256":"84fafe9a554ad46f8f915814171d6f2e47a989b53e6852fcbd3ef44657109ace","sha256":"69c4066e98e4043557d3e00585bda7d1f5cd78fd7a5e6570a75844894a27c94b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-16T21:15:14.929521+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS1","text":"Accumulation is determined as the problem of the reconversion of realized surplus-value into capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS2","text":"This determination presupposes the sale of the commodity and thus the circulation process, but initially brackets it out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS3","text":"Immediate production is isolated as the site of the generation and first appropriation of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS4","text":"The division of surplus-value into profit, interest, commercial profit, and ground rent is treated as a later form of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS5","text":"The pure analysis of accumulation abstracts from the forms of circulation and distribution in order to lay bare the inner mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AS6","text":"The presentation moves from the abstract basic form, through its own dialectic, to the concrete forms initially excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A1","text":"In commodity production, surplus-value is generated through unpaid labour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A2","text":"The surplus-value generated is initially fixed in the producing capital and in the commodity produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A3","text":"The surplus-value contained in the commodity is realized only through its sale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A4","text":"Accumulation presupposes the realization of surplus-value and the reconversion of money into capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A5","text":"The capitalist is the first appropriator, but not necessarily the last owner of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A6","text":"Surplus-value can divide into different parts that accrue to different social categories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A7","text":"The transformed parts of surplus-value appear as mutually independent forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A8","text":"The division of surplus-value does not alter its nature or its necessary conditions of accumulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","text":"The pure analysis initially considers accumulation as a moment of the immediate production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A10","text":"The abstract presentation presupposes the sale of the commodity at its value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A11","text":"The abstract presentation treats the producing capitalist as owner of the entire surplus-value or as representative of his co-sharers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12","text":"Circulation and the concrete conditions of reproduction mediate the basic form, but are not constitutive for its provisional analysis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:A13","text":"The presentation can later reintroduce the excluded concrete forms through the dialectic of the mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX1","text":"The analysis is not identical with the complete circulation process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX2","text":"The analysis does not treat the real conditions of continuous reproduction in their concrete elaboration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX3","text":"The producing capitalist is initially not treated as merely a proportionate recipient of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX4","text":"The analysis does not dwell on the new forms of capital in the sphere of circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX5","text":"The analysis initially abstracts from the concrete conditions of reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX6","text":"Profit, interest, commercial profit, and ground rent are not treated as original forms of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX7","text":"The mediating movement of circulation is not developed as a component of the pure basic form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:NX8","text":"The fragmentation of surplus-value is not treated as an alteration of its fundamental nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D1","text":"The realization of surplus-value is a necessary transitional stage between commodity production and accumulation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A2","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A3","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D2","text":"In its basic form, accumulation can be determined as the reconversion into capital of a sum of money detached from the commodity.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A3","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D3","text":"The later distribution of surplus-value among different owners does not annul its common origin in unpaid labour.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A1","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A5","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A6","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D4","text":"The first appropriation by the producing capitalist suffices for the abstract presentation, although in the real process it is mediated by further forms of appropriation.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A5","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D5","text":"The abstract analysis of accumulation gains its simplicity through the temporary equation of the producing capitalist with the owner of the entire surplus-value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D6","text":"Circulation can be excluded from the pure analysis because its mediations obscure the basic form without abolishing the conditions of accumulation of surplus-value.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A8","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:D7","text":"Concrete reproduction remains underdetermined for the immediate basic analysis and is deferred to a later analysis.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SD1","text":"Accumulation possesses a simple form of production and a complex form of appearance, whose difference is produced by circulation and distribution.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A4","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A6","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A7","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SD2","text":"The social division of surplus-value alters its forms of ownership, but not the source of its capacity for accumulation posited in the production process.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A1","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A5","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A6","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SD3","text":"Abstraction from the circulation process is at once a methodological reduction and an objective precondition for making the immediate production mechanism visible as an independent basic form.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A3","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A9","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SD4","text":"The excluded mediations are not abolished, but preserved as later elaborations of the already isolated basic form.","refs":["CH_V4GB_SKDA:A7","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A12","CH_V4GB_SKDA:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX1","text":"Accumulation is not presupposed as a mere increase of money without commodity sale and reconversion into capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX2","text":"Surplus-value is not treated as a source of income independent of the production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX3","text":"The various revenue and ownership forms are not admitted as mutually independent sources of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX4","text":"The complexity of circulation is not admitted as proof that no simple basic form of accumulation exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX5","text":"The empirical shape of social distribution is not equated with the genetic source of surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:DNX6","text":"Continuous reproduction is not fully explained from the immediate production process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a model in which circulation constitutes the original source of accumulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a perspective in which the independent forms of surplus-value render its common basis in production unrecognizable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of fully determining concrete social reproduction already at the level of its abstract basic form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a final separation between abstract form of production and concrete form of circulation; their connection is only deferred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS1","text":"Unpaid labour → generation of surplus-value → fixation of surplus-value in the commodity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS2","text":"Fixation in the commodity → sale of the commodity → realization of surplus-value in money.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS3","text":"Realization in money → reconversion of money into capital → accumulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS4","text":"Generation and first appropriation → later division of surplus-value → profit, interest, commercial profit, ground rent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS5","text":"Division and mediation through circulation → obscuring of the basic form → methodological abstraction from these mediations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:FGS6","text":"Abstract basic form → analysis of the immediate production process → later dialectical reconstruction of the concrete forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:AF1","text":"Production of surplus-value → commodity sale as condition of realization → reconversion into capital → abstraction from circulation and distribution → laying bare the immediate form of accumulation → later unfolding of the excluded mediations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME1","text":"Accumulation is remapped from a mere movement of money into a process of realization and reconversion of surplus-value into capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME2","text":"The various forms of income and ownership are classified as divided forms of appearance of a common surplus-value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME3","text":"The boundary between the analysis of production and circulation becomes visible as a boundary of methodological abstraction, not as an absolute objective separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME4","text":"The complexity of social distribution is separated from the analysis of the original condition of accumulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ME5","text":"The later treatment of concrete forms is mapped as an immanent unfolding of the abstract basic form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ALT1","text":"Surface — Commodity, surplus-value, sale, money, and reconversion into capital constitute the immediate level of argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ALT2","text":"Structural — Unpaid labour, first appropriation, division of surplus-value, and mediation through circulation constitute the social mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The analysis gains explanatory power through controlled abstraction and defers the excluded mediations to later stages of presentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The form of production is valid as the genetic basic form; circulation, distribution, and continuous reproduction appear as subsequent, necessary mediations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the production of surplus-value, through realization, to accumulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT2","text":"The axioms likewise explain why the division of surplus-value does not alter its common basis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT3","text":"The concrete conditions of continuous reproduction and the forms of circulation remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT4","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as abstraction from the circulation process is understood as provisional and not as an objective abolition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection exists between unpaid labour, the realization of surplus-value, and reconversion into capital.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT6","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that accumulation presupposes circulation, while its pure analysis abstracts precisely from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT7","text":"A further tension arises between the treatment of the capitalist as owner of the entire surplus-value and his determination as merely the first appropriator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_SKDA:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the later concrete forms count as a dialectical unfolding, and not as an external supplementation, of the basic form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_SKDA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]}],"revision":"CH_V4GB_SKDA@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_V4GB_SKDA:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 17","title":"Sechstes Kapitel. Der Accumulationsprozess des Kapitals.","context":"Chapter 17"}},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR","layer":"CH","title":"a) Einfache Reproduktion.","order":18,"parents":["RAW_V4GB_EINR"],"revision":"CH_V4GB_EINR@R001","sha256":"2691fb61a0bf9f4056c3adeadc9e824c95e4999cee72a79e779670a0e8392a2e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:AS1","text":"Der isolierte Produktionsakt erklärt nicht, wie der kapitalistische Prozess seine eigenen Voraussetzungen und Klassenträger fortlaufend erneuert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:AS2","text":"Kontinuierliche gesellschaftliche Produktion ist notwendig Reproduktion ihrer stofflichen Bedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:AS3","text":"Unter kapitalistischer Form reproduziert der Prozess den vorgeschossenen Wert als sich verwertendes Kapital; einfache Reproduktion hält dabei die Produktionsskala konstant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:AS4","text":"Das Argument verfährt temporal-rekonstruktiv, indem es vom einzelnen Austausch zur fortlaufenden Klassenbewegung und vom periodischen Vorgang zur kumulierten Wirkung übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:AS5","text":"Dieser Maßstabswechsel enthüllt den Lohn als Geldform eines vom Arbeiter bereits erzeugten und angeeigneten Produktteils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:AS6","text":"Die kumulierte Konsumtion des Mehrwerts löscht die Wertidentität des ursprünglichen Vorschusses und verwandelt jedes fortbestehende Kapital seiner Provenienz nach in kapitalisierten Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:AS7","text":"Produktion und individuelle Konsumtion reproduzieren gemeinsam die Trennung der Arbeitskraft von ihren Bedingungen und damit den Arbeiter als erneuten Verkäufer seiner Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:AS8","text":"Der Reproduktionsprozess erzeugt daher nicht nur Waren und Mehrwert, sondern das Kapitalverhältnis selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0061","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A1","text":"Jeder kontinuierliche gesellschaftliche Produktionsprozess ist zugleich Reproduktionsprozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A2","text":"Produktion auf gleichbleibender Stufenleiter setzt voraus, dass ein Teil des Produkts die verbrauchten Produktionsmittel stofflich ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","text":"In kapitalistischer Produktion ist der Arbeitsprozess dem Verwertungsprozess und die Reproduktion der Erhaltung des Werts als Kapital untergeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A4","text":"Einfache Reproduktion liegt vor, wenn der periodisch erzeugte Mehrwert konsumiert und die Produktionsskala unter sonst gleichen Bedingungen unverändert erneuert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A5","text":"Erst die Betrachtung des Prozesses in zeitlicher Kontinuität und gesellschaftlichem Klassenumfang löst die Erscheinungen des isolierten Austauschakts auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A6","text":"Der Arbeiter wird bezahlt, nachdem seine Arbeitskraft den eigenen Wert und den Mehrwert bereits in Waren erzeugt hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A7","text":"Der Geldlohn ist die verwandelte Form eines Teils des zuvor von der Arbeiterklasse erzeugten und von der Kapitalistenklasse angeeigneten Produkts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A8","text":"Variables Kapital ist die historisch besondere Erscheinungsform des von den Arbeitern selbst produzierten Subsistenz- und Arbeitsfonds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A9","text":"Bei einfacher Reproduktion eignet sich der Kapitalist periodisch Mehrwert ohne Äquivalent an und konsumiert ihn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A10","text":"Bei konstantem konsumiertem Mehrwert erreicht dessen kumulierte Summe nach einer bestimmbaren Zahl von Reproduktionsperioden den Betrag des ursprünglichen Kapitalwerts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A11","text":"Fortlaufender Wertersatz bewahrt keine individuelle Wertidentität der ursprünglichen Kapitalbestandteile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A12","text":"Die Trennung der Arbeitskraft von Produkt und objektiven Arbeitsbedingungen ist die gegebene Grundlage kapitalistischer Produktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A13","text":"Jeder Produktionszyklus verwandelt die Arbeit des Arbeiters in ein ihm fremdes Produkt, das als Kapital gegen ihn auftritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","text":"Die individuelle Konsumtion der Arbeiter reproduziert ihre Arbeitskraft und die Arbeiterklasse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A15","text":"Da die objektiven Arbeitsbedingungen dem Arbeiter entzogen bleiben, führt seine Selbsterhaltung ihn erneut als Verkäufer der Arbeitskraft auf den Markt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:A16","text":"Periodischer Selbstverkauf, Wechsel der individuellen Kapitalisten und Schwankung des Arbeitspreises vermitteln und verdecken die ökonomische Abhängigkeit des Lohnarbeiters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX1","text":"Gesellschaftliche Produktion besteht nicht aus voneinander unabhängigen Einzelakten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX2","text":"Einfache Reproduktion ist keine sozial folgenlose Wiederholung des identischen Produktionsvorgangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX3","text":"Der Arbeitslohn wird nicht aus einem vom Arbeiter unabhängig gebildeten Subsistenzfonds des Kapitalisten vorgeschossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX4","text":"Variables Kapital ist keine transhistorisch allgemeine Form des Arbeitsfonds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX5","text":"Waren- und Geldform machen die Klassentransaktion nicht transparent, sondern verkleiden sie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX6","text":"Die Konsumtion des Mehrwerts lässt den ursprünglichen Kapitalwert nicht als unveränderten Wertbestand fortbestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX7","text":"Eine mögliche ursprüngliche Eigenarbeit des Kapitalbesitzers sichert dem fortlaufend reproduzierten Kapital keine dauerhafte Herkunft aus eigener Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX8","text":"Die wiederkehrende Gegenüberstellung von Kapitalist und Arbeiter ist kein zufälliges Marktereignis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0057","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX9","text":"Die individuelle Konsumtion des Arbeiters liegt gesellschaftlich nicht außerhalb der Kapitalreproduktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX10","text":"Die reproduktive Funktion der Arbeiterkonsumtion setzt weder ihre unmittelbare Durchführung im Arbeitsprozess noch vollständige direkte Kontrolle durch den Kapitalisten voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX11","text":"Vertragsfreiheit und Wechsel des Arbeitgebers begründen keine materielle Unabhängigkeit des Lohnarbeiters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0060","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX12","text":"Der Arbeiter ist kein juristisches Eigentum des Kapitalisten, obwohl er funktional als Zubehör der Kapitalreproduktion behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:NX13","text":"Der kapitalistische Produktionsprozess erzeugt nicht nur Waren und Mehrwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0061","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D1","text":"Das gesellschaftliche Produkt teilt sich notwendig in stofflichen Ersatz der Produktionsbedingungen und konsumierbare Bestandteile.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A1","CH_V4GB_EINR:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D2","text":"Der konsumierte Mehrwert nimmt bei einfacher Reproduktion die Form periodischer Revenue des Kapitals an.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","CH_V4GB_EINR:A4","CH_V4GB_EINR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D3","text":"Die Arbeiterklasse produziert den Fonds ihrer eigenen Entlohnung, bevor dieser ihr als Lohn zufließt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A6","CH_V4GB_EINR:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D4","text":"Der Charakter des variablen Kapitals als Vorschuss aus dem eigenen Fonds des Kapitalisten erweist sich als durch Trennung und Geldform erzeugte Erscheinung.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A5","CH_V4GB_EINR:A7","CH_V4GB_EINR:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D5","text":"Nach dem Verhältnis von ursprünglichem Kapitalwert zu periodisch konsumiertem Mehrwert ist der Zeitpunkt bestimmbar, an dem die konsumierte Mehrwertsumme dem ursprünglichen Vorschuss entspricht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A9","CH_V4GB_EINR:A10","CH_V4GB_EINR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D6","text":"Jedes hinreichend lange reproduzierte Kapital wird unabhängig von seiner ursprünglichen Herkunft seiner Wertprovenienz nach zu kapitalisiertem Mehrwert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","CH_V4GB_EINR:A4","CH_V4GB_EINR:A9","CH_V4GB_EINR:A10","CH_V4GB_EINR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D7","text":"Die vorausgesetzte Trennung von Arbeitskraft und Arbeitsbedingungen wird durch jeden Zyklus als dessen eigenes Resultat erneuert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A12","CH_V4GB_EINR:A13","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D8","text":"Der Arbeiter produziert fortwährend den objektiven Reichtum als fremde Macht, während der Prozess ihn fortwährend als eigentumslosen Lohnarbeiter reproduziert.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","CH_V4GB_EINR:A12","CH_V4GB_EINR:A13","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D9","text":"Die individuelle Konsumtion der Arbeiter ist innerhalb der notwendigen Grenzen ein Moment der Reproduktion des Kapitals.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D10","text":"Die Vernichtung der Lebensmittel erhält den Arbeiter und erneuert zugleich die Notwendigkeit, seine Arbeitskraft wieder zu verkaufen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A12","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D11","text":"Die wiederholte Vertragsform erhält den Schein persönlicher Unabhängigkeit, während sie die ökonomische Hörigkeit vermittelt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A5","CH_V4GB_EINR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:D12","text":"Kapitalist und Lohnarbeiter werden als komplementäre Pole desselben Reproduktionsprozesses hervorgebracht.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","CH_V4GB_EINR:A12","CH_V4GB_EINR:A13","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15","CH_V4GB_EINR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0061","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:SD1","text":"Unveränderte Produktionsgröße ist mit einer qualitativen Veränderung der sozialen Wertprovenienz vereinbar.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A4","CH_V4GB_EINR:A9","CH_V4GB_EINR:A10","CH_V4GB_EINR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:SD2","text":"Kapitalistische Kausalität ist rekursiv: Die vorausgesetzte Trennung erzeugt einen Prozess, der diese Trennung als erneute Voraussetzung hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A12","CH_V4GB_EINR:A13","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:SD3","text":"Die mögliche Legitimität eines ursprünglichen Erwerbs verliert ihre Erklärungskraft für das fortbestehende Kapital, sobald dessen Reproduktion zeitlich aggregiert wird.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A5","CH_V4GB_EINR:A9","CH_V4GB_EINR:A10","CH_V4GB_EINR:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:SD4","text":"Die Grenze des Produktionsprozesses erweitert sich auf die Reproduktion des Lebens, ohne dass jede Lebenshandlung unmittelbar vom Kapital kommandiert werden muss.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:SD5","text":"Das Kapital delegiert die Erhaltung seines notwendigsten lebendigen Produktionsmittels an dessen Selbsterhaltungs- und Fortpflanzungstrieb.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:SD6","text":"Ausbeutung ist von der dauerhaften Bindung an einen individuellen Kapitalisten unabhängig, weil die Klassenbewegung den einzelnen Lohnherrn ersetzt.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A5","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15","CH_V4GB_EINR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0057","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0060","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:SD7","text":"Rechtliche Nicht-Eigentümerschaft an Arbeitern ist mit einem funktionalen Verfügungsanspruch über die reproduzierte Arbeiterbevölkerung vereinbar.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14","CH_V4GB_EINR:A15","CH_V4GB_EINR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:SD8","text":"Die Reproduktion erzeugt eine Subjekt-Objekt-Inversion, in der das Arbeitsprodukt als handelnde Macht und der Produzent als ihr reproduziertes Mittel erscheint.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A3","CH_V4GB_EINR:A12","CH_V4GB_EINR:A13","CH_V4GB_EINR:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:DNX1","text":"Die Erscheinungsformen von Geldvorschuss, Lohnzahlung und Einzelvertrag dürfen nicht als letzte Erklärungsebene gelten.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A5","CH_V4GB_EINR:A7","CH_V4GB_EINR:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_V4GB_EINR:DNX2","text":"Der Äquivalententausch beim Kauf der Arbeitskraft kann die gesellschaftliche Gesamttransaktion nicht als ausbeutungsfrei bestimmen.","refs":["CH_V4GB_EINR:A6","CH_V4GB_EINR:A7","CH_V4GB_EINR:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_V4GB_EINR:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_V